window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":5801,"title":"Chapter 5801: Division of Teams","paragraphs":["Chapter 5801: Division of Teams","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Just as the few were chatting, Empress Fengchen arrived at the main hall of the warship, and everyone fell silent, turning to look at her.","Empress Fengchen surveyed the crowd, took her seat at the highest position, lightly pressed her hand down, and calmly said, “No need to be restrained, I’ve just obtained the assessment criteria for this Sacred Assembly. You all can take a look and prepare yourselves mentally. Half an hour later, we will discuss the tactics for this gathering.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up, and several beams of light flew into the hands of various strong individuals.","Within those beams of light were scrolls.","When unfolded, not only were there words on top, but also demonstrations of figures.","Jian Wushuang frowned as he looked at it.","The Ancient Wood Sacred Assembly!","Assessment of the world, “Infinite Great World.”","A vast world southwest of Wanliu.","Internally, it was incredibly spacious, even larger than the Shi Kingdom.","Assessment criteria: The first four teams to reach the finish line are the victors!","“So simple?” Jian Wushuang blurted out.","As soon as these words came out, many people rolled their eyes.","At this moment, Elder Muchen came out to explain, “Wushuang, you can’t judge everything by its appearance. You may not have heard of this Infinite Great World. Even Seventh Tribulation realm wild beasts exist inside. Moreover, since the Ancient Wood Sect has set this rule, there will likely be many dangers along the way. We must not be careless!”","‘But, what’s the point of doing this?’ Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","He didn’t say it out loud.","However, Wu Li seemed to understand and added, “The dangers along the way are just a part of it. There’s probably more about opportunities. And according to the nature of the Ancient Wood Sect, this set of rules hasn’t been fully disclosed to us. There are definitely other rules that will only be revealed after we arrive. Otherwise, if we knew in advance, someone might prepare prematurely!”","This statement made Jian Wushuang somewhat agree.","Crossing the entire Infinite Great World.","The important thing was the process.","It definitely wouldn’t be so simple.","Jian Wushuang began to feel a bit excited.","Emperor, the Universe Master.","Although the path was the same, the encounters would be different.","That’s why there were places reserved for the Emperor.","Jian Wushuang was well aware of this.","Otherwise, sending the Emperor would be akin to sending him to his death.","The three great warships sailed side by side, quickly leaving the borders of Yue Kingdom.","At this moment, the Empress began explaining matters regarding the Ancient Wood Sect.","Everyone listened attentively.","“Before entering the Infinite Great World, we will divide into five teams. After entering, we must gather at the seven starting points as quickly as possible. Otherwise, we’ll lose to other forces at the starting point. To coordinate with each other, you will need to divide yourselves into teams!”","As soon as the Empress finished speaking, everyone began to make eye contact.","On Jian Wushuang’s side, the team had already formed.","Led by Elder Muchen, with Wu Li, Jiuhu, Jian Wushuang, and Jinchen.","Two Emperors.","Three Half-Step Fourth Tribulation Universe Masters.","Apart from Jiuhu, Jian Wushuang was familiar with everyone else.","As for Jiuhu, he was a Half-Step Fourth Tribulation powerhouse recruited by Wu Li and was not weak in strength.","The rest sorted themselves out.","On the Empress’s side, naturally, she was accompanied by two royal Fourth Tribulation Universe Masters.","The rest were divided into five teams.","Elder Muchen led one.","The Li Family led another.","A young prince from the Yue Kingdom led one.","The Qingyun Sect led another.","The last one was a team formed by several small families.","The tactical arrangements were superficial, merely surface division of labor.","The real tactics, perhaps, would only be revealed after they entered the Infinite Great World.","They didn’t know much about the Infinite Great World.","But the Empress surely knew more.","Jian Wushuang also learned quite a bit about the Infinite Great World from others.","The starting point and the endpoint!","From what Jian Wushuang knew, initially, they would be randomly teleported to the periphery of the Infinite Great World and would need to head to the agreed starting point on their own before finally setting off together.","Then it would be the endpoint.","Arriving at the finish line meant reaching the end of the Infinite Great World.","They were already quite close to the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Only the top four teams had the qualification to proceed to the periphery of the Wanliu Divine Tree.","This meant Jian Wushuang and Wu Li had to help the Empress secure a position within the top four.","Wu Li glanced at Jian Wushuang at this moment, nodding inwardly.","Yet, in his heart, a cold sneer echoed—not from Wu Li himself, but from a deeply ingrained presence within him.","It was the opportunity that led Wu Li to become the Universe Master.","When that voice sounded, Wu Li’s expression remained unchanged, but inwardly he asked, “Teacher, is the end of the Infinite Great World still far from the Wanliu Divine Tree?”","“Not far. Even if the Empress of Yue Kingdom fails to make it to the top four, I can still take you to the outskirts of the Wanliu Willow Divine Tree!” the mysterious voice resonated within Wu Li.","Wu Li furrowed his brows slightly before continuing, “And what about Jian Wushuang?”","“Of course, it’s killing two birds with one stone!”","The warship swayed, taking a month to exit the Sixteen Kingdoms of Qingchao.","Beyond lay the boundless chaos, an unexplored world where the Ancient Wood Sect resided.","Long before the era of the Celestial Maiden, the entire Ancient Wood Continent was shrouded in chaos.","It was the Divine Wood King who led the strong to establish the sacred land of the Ancient Wood Sect, eventually evolving into the Sixteen Kingdoms of Qingchao and various major secret realms.","Now, teams from the Sixteen Kingomds and major secret realms arrived one after another, exuding an aura as if myriad Immortals were paying homage.","The team from the Shi Kingdom was the most massive, with 100 Universe Masters in attendance.","There were even 3 Universe Masters at the Fifth Tribulation.","Then there was the Daughter Kingdom. Despite Yun Zhi ascending to the Seventh Tribulation, the Daughter Kingdom did not abstain from the Sacred Assembly.","They also sent 2 Universe Masters at the Fifth Tribulation.","Throughout various eras, the Daughter Kingdom had repeatedly claimed the position of the Holy Maiden.","This time, they came with great confidence.","Jian Wushuang, having visited the Daughter Kingdom before, had some understanding of its strength.","According to his knowledge, the Daughter Kingdom dispatched the Twin Stars this time—two Universe Masters at the Half-Step Sixth Tribulation, just slightly weaker than Fengchen.","They were the hot favorites of this Sacred Assembly.","Yongheng Kingdom had already perished, leaving behind only 15 kingdoms.","Even the Yue Kingdom couldn’t make it to the top ten, but it didn’t mean that Universe Masters from all factions were stronger than Empress Fengchen.","On the contrary, Empress Fengchen’s strength could rank within the top five among the Sixteen Kingdoms.","In this gathering, hundreds of Universe Masters at the Fifth Tribulation could all vie for the top ten positions.","Specific rankings would need to be verified in battle.","Jian Wushuang was also estimating his own position.","He didn’t care about the position of the Holy Maiden, but he must help Empress Fengchen secure a spot in the top four.","That was his bottom line.","With his current strength, he could indeed sway the general outcome of battles.","However, facing some Universe Masters at the Half-Step Sixth Tribulation, he wasn’t very confident.","His strongest trump card, the Starry Sky Chronicles, allowed him to control the Life and Death of opponents, already comparable to a Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation.","But among Universe Masters at the Fifth Tribulation, there were differences in strength."]},{"number":5802,"title":"Chapter 5802: Sixteen Kingdoms and Secret Realms","paragraphs":["Chapter 5802: Sixteen Kingdoms and Secret Realms","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Powerful enough to unleash 800,000 divine power.","Even the weak could unleash 600,000 divine power.","Both were his maximum combat capabilities.","Fortunately, he only appeared as an emperor on the surface, so no one would be wary of him.","Once he made a move, he had to seize the opportunity and attack the vital points.","On the deck of the warship.","The teams, each divided, gathered together.","Watching the scenes in the chaotic airflow.","Flashes of thunderbolts, as if the heavens and the earth were nurturing something!","This was a spectacle of all things.","Jian Wushuang understood this quite well.","The others, however, felt awe in their hearts.","“Three days away from the Ancient Wood Sect, I still have some preparations to make in my cultivation, so I won’t chat with you all!” Jiuhu said, then gestured with clasped hands and left.","Jian Wushuang looked at the figure of the other party, with no suspicions.","“Wu Li, this person’s strength is extraordinary!” Elder Muchen squinted slightly.","He could see that the strong man named Jiuhu had extremely abundant divine power within him.","Once it erupted, it would probably rise to 400,000 divine power.","This was the pinnacle of the Third Tribulation Universe Master.","Any higher would be a Fourth Tribulation powerhouse.","Wu Li said calmly, “Jiuhu’s strength is indeed good. I once joined forces with him outside the domain to kill a genius from a secret realm, and that genius was also a Fourth Tribulation Universe Master!”","“No wonder!” Muchen nodded.","Jian Wushuang’s face was dark. Killing a genius from a secret realm was something they could talk about casually. And judging from Muchen’s expression, he wasn’t surprised.","These two probably had done similar things before.","Of course, they both regarded Jian Wushuang as their own, so there was no need for concealment.","“Nephew Wushuang, this time we enter the Infinite Great World, we must be cautious of those strong men from the secret realms. They are quite crazy, basically all enemies of the Sixteen Kingdoms. Since they can’t occupy better cultivation environments, they have been eyeing the Sixteen Kingdoms!” Elder Muchen reminded on the side.","Jian Wushuang didn’t speak, merely nodded.","The other party had thick skin; there wasn’t much for him to say.","Most of the strong ones in those secret realms had been expelled from the Sixteen Kingdoms.","That’s why they held hostility.","As for counterattacking the Sixteen Kingdoms, that was somewhat impossible.","The foundation of the Sixteen Kingdoms was too strong.","The strength of the Universe Master might be evenly matched between the two sides.","But the Scattered Tribulation experts must be stronger in the Sixteen Kingdoms.","The strong ones in the secret realms hadn’t experienced many eras; their foundation couldn’t compare to the Sixteen Kingdoms.","Take the seven star sects, for example.","In the Sixteen Kingdoms, there were dozens of seven star sects.","But within the secret realms, there were no more than 10 seven star sects.","That’s the foundation.","And no Eighth Tribulation expert had appeared in the secret realms.","These were incomparable.","Jian Wushuang felt no pity for these people, but he wouldn’t antagonize them for no reason either.","That would just invite trouble upon himself.","However, he could sense a sense of superiority from Elder Muchen and Wu Li’s eyes.","It was disdain for the strong ones within the secret realms.","Three days passed.","Several people stood on the deck, occasionally seeing some warships pass by.","Various forces had gathered.","They were about to arrive at the Ancient Wood Sect.","Jian Wushuang also felt a long-standing ancient aura deep in his heart.","It was a breath that the Shi Kingdom had never shown.","Splash!","The towering bow of the warship broke through the chaotic airflow.","Gone were the yellowish mists that obscured everything, replaced by lush greenery.","What appeared before them was a vast green world.","The sky was blue, and the ground was green.","Incredibly fresh.","If one didn’t know better, they might mistake this place for a paradise. But it wasn’t.","It was close to the Ancient Wood Sect, serving as a buffer zone against the chaotic currents.","On what seemed like an ordinary grassland, suddenly, a gigantic pink beast emerged.","Its body was immense, stretching for thousands of miles.","It moved swiftly across the ground, eventually lifting its head, revealing a gaping maw with countless sharp teeth spinning within.","After glancing at the warships in the sky, it plunged back down below.","Only deep craters remained on the grassland, which quickly returned to tranquility.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t surprised.","These savage beasts probably emerged from the chaotic currents, likely only roaming around here.","Beyond lay the trump cards of the Ancient Wood Sect.","No matter how powerful, touching the Ancient Wood Sect meant death!","Unnoticed, tens of thousands of warships gathered from all directions, darkening the sky with swirling black fog.","It didn’t resemble a welcoming party of Immortals but rather an invasion of demonic forces.","If someone claimed the Ancient Wood Sect was a force of darkness, Jian Wushuang would believe it.","Across countless spaces, Jian Wushuang caught sight of a silhouette—an ominous one.","Through the Eye of the Beast God, he glimpsed a grand scene at his brow.","It was a colossal tree branch spanning several worlds, rivaling the size of a kingdom, with the Ancient Wood Sect perched atop.","Rumor had it that this branch was a fallen offshoot of the Wanliu Divine Tree. It held great significance for cultivating divine power and nurturing oneself during tribulations.","On the warships, many were visiting the Ancient Wood Sect for the first time, filled with awe.","Jian Wushuang intended to discuss this branch with Elder Muchen and others, but he noticed Princess Jinchen beside him gazing in the opposite direction.","Her brow remained furrowed as Jian Wushuang followed her gaze.","She saw familiar figures standing at the bow of the warship bearing the emblem of the Shi Kingdom.","Among them, in inconspicuous positions, were several emperors.","“Shi Jiu!”","Beside Shi Jiu stood a girl clad in fiery red armor.","Judging by her attire and the mark on her forehead, she seemed to be from the Flame God Kingdom.","Jian Wushuang didn’t recognize her.","But she could tell that Jinchen cared about this.","“Stop staring at him, will you? I’m still here!” Jian Wushuang retorted in a strange tone.","Jinchen blinked. “Sometimes I wonder if we truly united, maybe we’d forget about him.”","“Then go ahead and think about him!” Jian Wushuang rolled his eyes.","Elders Muchen and Wu Li felt somewhat awkward.","But neither of them spoke.","Wu Li knew Jian Wushuang, and this time they both had to make a run for it.","Elder Muchen, however, didn’t know.","He thought they were just bickering as a couple.","“Don’t forget, you still owe me a favor!” Jinchen reminded.","Jian Wushuang nodded, replying, “I haven’t forgotten. If you want to use that favor to have me kill the successor of the Flame God, we can discuss it!”","In the past, in the Daughter Kingdom, Queen Yun Zhi had helped him by giving him Sword Immortal Tonghe’s token.","Naturally, it was a great favor.","But this favor had to be repaid to Jinchen.","If the other party had any special requests, he didn’t mind helping out.","After all, it would be difficult to meet again in the future.","There were many favors owed, and the sooner they were repaid, the better."]},{"number":5803,"title":"Chapter 5803 Ancient Wood Holy Land","paragraphs":["5803 Ancient Wood Holy Land","Upon hearing his speculation, Jinchen took a deep breath and decided to return to the cabin.","She had long been able to communicate calmly with Jian Wushuang, but she noticed that Jian Wushuang had been increasingly indifferent towards her.","Watching Jinchen’s graceful figure depart, Jian Wushuang sighed.","Elder Mucen chuckled and patted his shoulder, saying, “Nephew Wushuang, don’t worry too much. This girl Jinchen has been spoiled since childhood, she’ll come around.”","“That’s not what I mean!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Ile harbored no dissatisfaction with Jinchen’s actions.","On the contrary, he was eager to repay the debt of gratitude as soon as possible.","After the Holy Meeting, the entire Yue Kingdom would be implicated because of him. If the Empress could become a Holy Maiden, it would be manageable.","If she couldn’t, the days ahead might be difficult.","Jian Wushuang felt somewhat guilty about this.","Unlike Wu Li, who could even downsize or abandon his family, he had never aimed to establish a foothold in Ancient Moon Spacetime.","His goal was to become the Universe Master at lightning speed.","Then, he would seek out others in the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","He already knew Hu Qing’s whereabouts.","But he couldn’t rush.","Fan Tianfeng was already preparing to return to Qishen Temple ahead of schedule and couldn’t be relied upon.","He could only seek out others.","Ile had a good relationship with Wu Zuo, but he didn’t know where he was.","There were also Zhen Wuyang, Tongtian Buddha, Dongsheng, and Wanyan who he got along well with.","As for the others, if he encountered them and could help, he would.","These people were all brought by him from Qishen Temple,","Originally, Zhen Ling intended to send him alone.","One reason was because they had high hopes for Jian Wushuang.","Secondly, it was because of Jian Wushuang’s bond with Mic Sheng.","Since they couldn’t defeat Mie Sheng, they chose to avoid confrontation for the time being.","Unexpectedly, they left the ten great. Inheritors in one go.","Among these people, perhaps some had their own agendas.","Some even harbored a certain resentment towards Jian Wushuang.","However, since they were brought to the Ancient Moon Spacetime, they had to bring them all back intact.","And there’s Hu Qing!","Even in the ruins of the Ancient Moon, he would rescue the others.","The Nine Tribulations Tower!","It was his greatest confidence now,","With Weiss’ guidance, as long as he cultivated the Utmost Freedom Intent Technique to perfection, he was basically invincible.","What was the Ancient Moon Ruins?","It was just the place where the Celestial Maiden passed away. According to Weiss, the Celestial Maiden was also his disciple.","How could Jian Wushuang lose to a dead person?","Ile would return alive.","He would kill Mie Sheng.","He would reclaim everything that belonged to the Original Universe.","He would also avenge the grandpa with goat horn’s grudge!","Jian Wushuang stood at the bow of the ship, his gaze like a giant.","The Ancient Wood Sect was getting closer and closer.","Buzz!","Countless warships suddenly stopped.","In the sky ahead, barriers appeared one after another.","Those were the formations of the Ancient Wood Sect.","Whoosh!","In the giant curtain, a figure appeared, followed by a full display of his form,","A Seventh Tribulations powerhouse.","He was also the current sect master of the Ancient Wood Sect.","It was quite a coincidence.","Jian Wushuang even recognized him.","This Seventh Tribulation powerhouse, though seemingly from the Ancient Wood Sect, had","actually joined forces with Babidi.","Who knew if Babidi would come.","Perhaps he didn’t see the opportunity here!","“Fellow Daoists, please put away your treasures and follow me into the Sacred Grounds.","Holy Land!”","Swish!!!","The warship vanished in an instant into the sky.","Countless figures stood densely in the void.","Among them were several Seventh Tribulation powerhouses.","They were all Scattered Tribulations, naturally unable to participate in the Sacred Assembly,","just here to watch.","“Haha, the Seet Master himself has come out to greet us, truly an honor for us!” Several Seventh Tribulation experts stepped forward and exchanged pleasantries with the Sect Master of the Ancient Wood Sect.","Then they all set off and entered the Sacred Grounds of the Ancient Wood.","On both sides of the barrier, the scene was the same.","But the atmosphere had undergone earth-shattering changes.","Jian Wushuang, upon entering, felt a continuous surge of Life force within the branches.","These branches came from the body of Wanliu.","Naturally, they contained immense Life force.","If they could be taken out, their value would be immeasurable.","Unfortunately, they couldn’t be taken out.","If they could, the Divine Wood King wouldn’t have been showing weakness all this time.","Jian Wushuang was somewhat interested in this ancient Divine Wood King,","Once an Eighth Tribulation powerhouse.","Although rumored to be weak.","But at its peak, it was definitely much stronger than the current Eighth Tribulation","Universe Masters.","After all, it was one of the oldest beings.","Just don’t know if there’s a chance to meet this time.","Following the Sect Master of the Ancient Wood Sect, they entered a circular arena.","The seats around could accommodate billions of people.","Upon entering this place, they were also separated in an orderly manner.","Those who entered the central square were the chosen ones for this Sacred Assembly.","A whopping 10,000 people were present.","Surprisingly, 70 percent of them hailed from the mysterious territories.","Only 30 percent represented the strong from the Sixteen Kingdoms.","The Ancient Wood Sect maintained impartiality towards both sides.","This also indicated that, among the core forces, the current sixteen kingdoms were far","inferior to the strong from the mysterious territories.","Otherwise, there wouldn’t be such a disparity.","The two sides separated, with the strong from the Sixteen Kingdoms standing on one side","and those from the mysterious territories on the other.","“Is this starting already?” Jian Wushuang felt somewhat taken aback!","He thought it seemed a bit rushed.","At least they should have been entertained properly!","He turned to look around at the seats, indeed, they had begun entertaining the watching","strong individuals.","As for themselves, they stood foolishly in the central square, waiting quietly for what was to","come.","The head of the Ancient Wood Sect and the current Holy Maiden sat side by side. “Ladies and gentlemen, today marks the opening of the sacred assembly. From this moment","forth, the rules will be known to you once you enter the Infinite Great World!”","With that, she raised her head, emitting countless tokens.","These tokens fell into the hands of the attending strong individuals.","Jian Wushuang also received one.","These tokens were highly useful, even in death, they couldn’t be lost.","After everyone carefully put them away, they waited quietly for the next arrangements.","The current. Holy Maiden of the Ancient Wood Sect was at the peak of the Sixth Tribulation,","about to transcend to the Seventh Tribulation.","Her status was as high as that of Shi Xiu from the Shi Kingdom.","Once she successfully transcended the tribulation, they would both be the leading figures","of their respective forces.","She slightly bowed, looking down at the crowd below, her voice cold, “The Sacred Assembly","of the Ancient Wood Sect begins now!” Without saying another word, the boundaries around them began to tremble.","Jian Wushuang stood in place, feeling his mind filled with immense power, his body","involuntarily sinking into darkness.","Everyone in the arena disappeared in an instant, and then in the blank space, patches of sky","appeared.","Above, cach person’s figure was displayed.","For a moment, many people stared at the figures they cared about.","At the top of the viewing platform, there was a row of great halls.","Inside sat various dignitaries.","The head of the Ancient. Wood Sect also entered this place.","Now, there were over 10 Seventh Tribulation powerhouses gathered here, but they were all","Scattered Tribulation powerhouses.","Not a single Seventh Tribulation Universe Master had come.","Originally, there weren’t many to begin with.","They were all in cultivation, unlike Scattered Tribulation cultivators who didn’t have much","need for cultivation and were thus free.","There were quite a few Seventh Tribulation Universe Masters present. Among them was Sword Immortal Tonghe, familiar to Jian Wushuang,"]},{"number":5804,"title":"Chapter 5804 The Four Great Candidates","paragraphs":["5804 The Four Great Candidates","In the Shi Kingdom, there was also a super powerhouse, ‘Shi Xiu’.","Within the Seventh Tribulation, there was also Lian Xing, which Jian Wushuang was familiar with.","This individual held significant sway, with his status being the highest in the entire hall.","Many approached him to converse.","“My fellow Daoists, how do you all view the list of candidates this time?” The head of the Ancient Wood Sect raised his hand, and a list floated in mid-air.","The names of the four candidates also appeared above.","The Seventh Tribulation ancestor from the Yuc Kingdom, upon not seeing Fengchen’s name on the list, wore a displeased expression.","However, given his strength and status were at the bottom among these people, he didn’t. say anything.","It was a Seventh Tribulation powerhouse from the Daughter Kingdom who spoke up, saying, “Just at the beginning, and already making a list. Isn’t that a bit hasty?”","“Haha, this list might have some discrepancies, but the final candidates will probably be these four!”","These were the candidates selected by the Ancient Wood Sect based on intelligence.","The position of the Iloly Maiden must be someone from the Ancient Wood Continent.","That position was the future core of the Ancient Wood Sect.","Their background must be thoroughly investigated.","If their background isn’t clear, even if their strength is formidable, they will still be deliberately made to leave by the Ancient Wood Sect.","The current list of candidates.","Three of them are experts from the secret realm, which has caused dissatisfaction among the powerhouses of the Sixteen Kingdoms.","Among the Seventh Tribulation powerhouses here, only three come from secret realms.","Nine of them are powerhouses from the Sixteen Kingdoms.","The head of the Ancient Wood Sect remained impassive, having no way to change the situation.","This list was the decision of all the elders within the sect.","In his view, I was a move to suppress the Sixteen Kingdoms.","Recently, the Shi Kingdom had been particularly arrogant.","Coupled with the emergence of a Universe Master at the Seven Tribulations from the Daughter Kingdom, if things continued like this, it wouldn’t be the Ancient Wood Sect’s","land anymore but rather subject to the dictates of those kingdoms.","This was absolutely unacceptable.","If open suppression wasn’t feasible, then manipulation behind the scenes was the way to go.","“Actually, everything depends on strength. The list doesn’t prove anything!” Liang Xing said casually.","Naturally, the strong of the Sixteen Kingdoms tended to band together. Besides the powerful from the Sixteen Kingdoms and the secret realms, there were also some formidable outsiders present.","These observers remained aloof, not speaking out.","Wherever there are internal conflicts, dissent is inevitable.","Upon hearing Liang Xing’s words, several Seven Tribulations experts from the secret realms showed no intention of refuting,","In fact, considering their strength, the experts from the secret realms had a better chance. Because this time, there were far more experts from the secret realms mobilized than from the Sixteen Kingdoms.","Universe Masters at the Fifth Tribulations outnumbered those from the Sixteen Kingdoms by more than double.","No matter how you looked at it, the final spots would lean more towards the experts from the secret realms.","“Senior Liang Xing, do you perhaps have a favored team?” asked the Holy Maiden of the Ancient Wood Sect, curious.","She noticed Liang Xing had been gazing at the sky, probably favoring a particular kingdom’s team, such as the Shi Kingdom.","However, currently, the three Universe Masters of the Shi Kingdom mobilized for this event did not exhibit outstanding strength.","Their individual combat power was inferior to that of the Yue Kingdom.","Ilope dwindled significantly.","“It’s not that, it’s just having confidence in someone!”","Lian Xing shook his head and chuckled, “I heard that this time, the Ancient Wood Sect has brought out many rare treasures in the Emperor’s assessment. I wonder if this is true?”","The head of the Ancient Wood Sect was momentarily stunned at the remark, then replied, “Indeed, that’s the case. After all, the Emperor is the hope of the future. We did bring out. quite a few rare treasures that can help them quickly advance to the Tribulation Realm!”","While the words were spoken calmly, internally, they were shocked by Lian Xing’s intelligence.","This matter was only decided yesterday.","Yet, Lian Xing already knew about it today.","It was likely that within the Ancient Wood Seet, people had already started taking sides.","This was a rather frightening development.","The core of the Ancient Wood Sect consisted of its supreme elders.","All of them were qualified experts at the Seventh Tribulation.","Although they were all Scattered Tribulation experts, the power of the Ancient Wood Sect lay in their hands.","The head of the Ancient Wood Sect was not one of the supreme elders. It was evident that","to become one, significant contributions were required.","And these supreme elders didn’t just appear out of nowhere.","These powerful individuals were the accumulation of thousands of generations within the Ancient Wood Sect.","If one traced their origins, all these experts hailed from the Sixteen Kingdoms.","It was a terrifying revelation.","Despite the overt suppression of the Sixteen Kingdoms, any slight movement would have information discreetly relayed back to them.","For the powerful figures within the secret realms to rise, it wasn’t an easy task.","The head of the Ancient Wood Sect was well aware of this.","But his heart was no longer with the Ancient Wood Sect.","He was now aligned with Babidi.","Ever since learning that Dylan had cultivated the technique created by Babidi and had reached the Seventh Tribulation, he couldn’t contain his excitement.","Perhaps Dylan could truly break through again and become an Eighth Tribulation expert. Comparing strengths of the Eighth Tribulation, the head of the Ancient Wood Sect was insignificant.","He didn’t amount to anything.","Even a half-dead Eighth Tribulation expert could control the entire Ancient Wood Sect.","If he were to cultivate Babidi’s techniques and reach the realm of Eight Tribulation, he would only be slightly weaker than the Universe Master and even stronger than the Divine","Wood King.","After some casual conversation, these super beings took their seats and began to observe the various strong individuals in the celestial screen.","Following their gazes, they saw the scene in the celestial screen.","Tens of thousands of strong individuals entered the Infinite Great World.","Those with good luck were closest to the starting point, while those with poor luck even entered some forbidden areas, currently battling with those savage beasts.","Among them was Jian Wushuang.","The Infinite Great World was entirely undeveloped and primitive.","A blade of grass was as towering as a giant tree.","A speck of dust was as monumental as a mountain.","Jian Wushuang and his companions had extremely poor luck, as they immediately entered a","forbidden area upon arrival.","In this place, a Special Life Form at the Fourth Tribulation was being held captive.","This Special Life Form was entirely silver, with a body as tough as iron, and emitted endless","divine power.","The group could only flee.","Although Jian Wushuang had the strength to deal with this savage beast, there was no need","to reveal his strength too early.","The journey had just begun.","At least wait until they reached the formal starting point before unleashing their full power.","Moreover, aside from the Special Life Form, there were no treasures in the forbidden area,","and fighting held no meaning.","He remained calm, while the others were tense.","“Wu Li, take Wushuang and Jincheng and leave first. Jiuhu and I will hold off this Special Life","Form. After an incense stick’s worth of time, we’ll meet at a canyon in the southeast direction, then head to the starting point of the boundless world!” Elder Muchen, as the team leader, quickly arranged a tactical plan.","Naturally, the priority was to protect the two Emperors first, then leave someone behind to","hold off the enemy.","If Jiuhu were to take the two Emperors and leave first, he wouldn’t feel at ease.","So, he took the initiative to stay with Jiuhu and hold off the enemy together. Wu Li glanced back and said, “Be careful. With my speed, we won’t need an incense stick’s","worth of time to create distance!”","“Got it!”","A green flame erupted from Elder Muchen’s body,"]},{"number":5805,"title":"Chapter 5805 Soul Shocking Vine","paragraphs":["5805 Soul Shocking Vine","On the side, Jiuhu didn’t say much. He was a brawler by nature, so why wait any longer? With a roar, he charged straight in.","A silver giant, wielding an ancient wooden staff, emitted a terrifying aura.","Two Half-Step Fourth Tribulation Universe Masters intercepted a Special Life Form at the Fourth Tribulation, which wasn’t too strenuous for them.","Special Life Forms were not as powerful as Universe Masters of the same level but much stronger than those of the same level in the Scattered Tribulation.","Two Half-Step Fourth Tribulation Universe Masters were equivalent to two Fourth Tribulation Scattered Tribulation experts, teaming up against a Fourth Tribulation Special Life Form.","They could fight and flee without Jian Wushuang and Jincheng, the two tag-alongs. There were no more reservations.","Boom!","Jiuhu unleashed his full strength, and with a punch, he sent the Special Life Form back millions of miles, then turned to Elder Muchen and said, “Let’s go!”","It had been almost the time it takes for an incense stick to burn; there was no need to continue fighting.","Elder Muchen nodded and turned to leave directly.","The Special Life Form had self-awareness and naturally wouldn’t let its prey escape, immediately bursting into speed to catch up.","But Elder Muchen just sneered, with a single hand gesture, the towering giant tree on the ground instantly turned into a sharp sword, then with a lift of his hand, it directly charged towards the Special Life Form,","The silver giant’s face twisted grimly as it easily crushed the blade with a casual block. “This is troublesome!” Elder Muchen frowned slightly. His speed weakened slightly, but a huge purple vine appeared behind him, then wrapped around his entire body.","Jiuhu’s eyes lit up when he saw it.","The next moment, Elder Muchen suddenly stopped his movement and reminded, “You go find Wulihui, I’ll hold it back!”","“Got it!” Jiuhu didn’t hesitate. His speed erupted once again, disappearing into the sky in an instant, leaving Elder Muchen alone.","Elder Muchen grinned, facing the crazily charging silver giant, he merely used one hand to withstand the opponent’s attack.","The purple vines on his body spread along his palm, instantly enveloping the silver giant. Unfortunately, when the vines wrapped around Elder Muchen, they became his battle","armor.","Enveloping the silver giant, that was a deadly treasure.","“Let this beast see what the true Universe Treasure can do!” Elder Muchen stretched out his hands, then forcefully clenched them, causing the silver giant to deform under the","pressure.","Elder Muchen clenched his fists, merging the divine power within him with the power of the vines, causing his divine power to skyrocket instantly from around 400,000 to 450,000, already on par with this Special Life Form at the Four Tribulations Realm,","Stronger than many scattered tribulation experts.","“Ah!!”","Terrifying red aura continuously erupted. Elder Mu Chen roared in anger. After his divine power stabilized completely, he dashed towards the bound silver giant. With just one punch, he caused the silver giant’s body to dent, and its divine power began to decline.","A single punch could harm this Special Life Form.","If they were to engage in a life-and-death battle, this Special Life Form would probably not be Elder Muchen’s match.","At this moment, on the spectator stands, since they had not yet reached the starting point, the assessment was not officially underway, so many powerful individuals seemed","somewhat listless.","But witnessing the sudden eruption of Elder Muchen, they all perked up.","“To think he has the Soul Shocking Vine. Muchen from Yue Kingdom has indeed reached the level of a true Fourth Tribulations realm expert!”","“No wonder he’s of royal descent in Yue Kingdom. If I could obtain this Soul Shocking Vine, I could also unleash such power!”","Many people showed envy towards the Soul Shocking Vine on Muchen’s body. Especially the strong individuals within the secret realm; their resources were already","scarce.","Now seeing a strong individual of royal descent from Yue Kingdom possessing the Soul Shocking Vine, they were extremely jealous.","“Hmph, it may be his for now, but it’s not guaranteed in the future. There are super strong individuals from my Giant Sea Secret Realm around him!” A powerful figure from the realm muttered with a sinister tone.","This stirred discontent among many strong figures from the Sixteen Kingdoms.","But regardless of their dissatisfaction, the fact remained true.","Elder Muchen, engaged in battle, acted ruthlessly and decisively, causing the silver giant to","retreat continuously.","His divine power dropped to around 400,000.","If the fight continued, he might very well be slain by Elder Muchen.","This particular entity wasn’t foolish; unable to gain an advantage, it could only retreat.","voluntarily.","If not for having a mission at hand, Elder Muchen wouldn’t have been so willing to let the","opponent leave.","“Beasts will be beasts!” Elder Muchen sneered coldly, retracting the Soul Shocking Vine. Just","as he was about to leave, he noticed several auras heading in his direction.","Elder Muchen’s expression turned grave.","There was an aura from a Universe Master at the Fourth Tribulation.","And two Universe Masters at the Third Tribulation.","Their divine power was around 350,000 each.","The Universe Master at the Fourth Tribulation had a divine power of 500,000.","Encountering them would not make for an easy battle.","“Go!”","Elder Muchen first concealed his aura, then burst out at the fastest speed towards the","rendezvous point.","However, just as he moved, three auras descended upon him,","The auras converged, and three burly figures stood tall in the air. The leader had the head","of a wolf and the body of a man, while the others looked almost identical, with dense blue","fur swaying in the wind.","“Tsk tsk, seems like it’s a strongman from the Kingdom of Yue. Ile has the Soul Shocking Vine!” The leader, with the head of a wolf, was a Fourth Tribulation expert. Ilowever, he was particularly interested in the Soul Shocking Vine on Elder Muchen. Because treasures like this were almost nonexistent even for Fourth Tribulation Universe","Masters in the secret realms.","If he could obtain it, this trip to the Holy Meeting would not have been in vain.","The treasures of the Sacred Assembly needed to be seized.","Even at the core of the Infinite Great World, the chance of encountering treasures was slim,","and to seize them required the prowess of a Fifth Tribulation Universe Master,","That was a matter for those of their caliber, the Fourth Tribulation powerhouses.","It was more prudent to plunder the treasures from other strongmen.","The battles among the saints were chaotic.","The forces behind them couldn’t intervene in the chaos.","That’s why these three powerhouses dared to chase down Elder Muchen relentlessly.","“Catch up to him!”","“Yes!”","Three auras tore through the sky, quickly catching up to Elder Muchen. Sensing the approaching auras, Elder Muchen had no choice but to halt his steps.","At the same time, he was also communicating with Jian Wushuang and the others through","telepathy.","Calculating his own strength and that of his companions.","Could they handle it?","This time, they were truly unlucky.","First, they encountered a Special Life Form at the Fourth Tribulation Realm, and now they","encountered a powerhouse within the secret realm.","If they were experts from the Sixteen Kingdoms, it would have been manageable. They","tended to hold back and wouldn’t act at this moment.","But unfortunately, they encountered a powerhouse from within the secret realm.","Moreover, upon seeing the opponent’s appearance, Elder Muchen’s heart sank.","“The Celestial Wolf Secret Realm!” After identifying the opponent’s identity, Elder Muchen immediately relayed this information to Wu Li.","Wu Li, who had already escaped the vicinity with Jian Wushuang and the others, had reached a valley and was currently waiting for Elder Muchen to arrive."]},{"number":5806,"title":"Chapter 5806: Celestial Wolf Tribe Expert","paragraphs":["Chapter 5806: Celestial Wolf Tribe Expert","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Unexpectedly, they received even more challenging news.","“What should we do?” Wu Li furrowed his brow.","Jian Wushuang, upon learning of it, shook his head silently.","Now was not the time to act.","They hadn’t even reached the main camp yet, so acting now meant either dealing with it discreetly without revealing their strength or abandoning Elder Muchen.","After much deliberation, Elder Muchen had been relatively kind to him, so abandoning him like this didn’t sit well.","But their current situation wasn’t truly exploring a mysterious realm; they were in the midst of the Sacred Assembnly’s assessment world.","Countless eyes from the outside world were watching.","“Imperial Uncle must be rescued. What are you hesitating for?” Princess Jinchen grew impatient.","It was one thing if it were just an Emperor like Jian Wushuang, but why were two Half-Step Fourth Tribulation Universe Masters hesitating here?","Upon hearing this, Wu Li felt awkward.","“Princess, things aren’t so simple. The other party is a Wolf King from the Celestial Wolf Secret Realm, a Half-Step Fourth Tribulation Universe Master with a divine power of up to 500,000. None of us, even if we join forces, are a match for them. Moreover, it’s not just one person; there are also two Universe Masters with a divine power of 350,000 each. Rushing over would not only fail to help Brother Muchen but also distract him!”","“Third Uncle is right, Jinchen, we can’t act recklessly in this matter!” Jian Wushuang chimed in to reassure.","Jiuhu was just a random teammate; naturally, he didn’t care much.","It would be best not to go at all.","However, Princess Jinchen paid no heed to these concerns and directly took out a communication token, starting to transmit a message to the Empress.","Seeing this, the others quickly intervened.","“Princess, we’re not refusing to rescue him. There’s no need to trouble Her Majesty!” Seeing this, Wu Li could only relent.","He knew Jian Wushuang’s strength was formidable, with at least 400,000 units of divine power.","And then there was Jiuhu, whose strength also exceeded 400,000.","With himself added, they could manage a fight.","But they had all left. What about Princess Jinchen?","The thoughts of the three were all the same.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang broke the deadlock, suggesting, “How about this? Jiuhu and I will go. Although my divine power might not be sufficient, I’m confident in my speed!”","“Then it can only be so!” Wu Li originally planned to take Jiuhu with him, but he didn’t expect Jian Wushuang to intervene. This was fine too; it would also be an opportunity to probe Jian Wushuang’s capabilities.","The reason Jian Wushuang took charge was mainly to avoid wasting time.","If they all went together later, who knows what might happen.","It’s better for him to take Jiuhu along.","Jian Wushuang’s aura surged as he calmly said, “Senior Jiuhu, let’s set off!”","Boom!","The two shot straight into the sky, heading towards the direction they had just come from.","In just a few breaths, they sensed a tremendous commotion coming from the sky ahead.","The entire sky was torn apart, and within the dark cracks, the fierce astral winds changed the color of the ground.","“Elder Muchen, we’re here!”","Swish!","Jian Wushuang and Jiuhu arrived almost simultaneously, directly blocking the two Universe Masters of the Third Tribulation Realm.","“Is it them?” Jiuhu’s gaze shifted as he saw these three formidable beings.","The strong figures of the Celestial Wolf Secret Realm also recognized Jiuhu.","Speaking of which, Jiuhu also hailed from a secret realm, just not on the Ancient Wood Continent.","He knew these powerful individuals from the Celestial Wolf Secret Realm as well.","“Tanlang, didn’t expect to see you here at the Sacred Assembly!”","Jiuhu threw a punch, directly sending one of the Third Tribulation Universe Masters flying. Then he arrived beside Elder Muchen, joining forces to resist the Fourth Tribulation powerhouse.","Tanlang was the Universe Master at the Fourth Tribulations, with a formidable divine power of up to 500,000, standing arrogantly in the void and attacking ruthlessly.","“Jiuhu, I never expected you to join the Yue Kingdom,” Tanlang replied coldly.","Seeing that both sides were acquainted, Elder Muchen spoke up, “Dao Friend, since we have not yet reached the main camp, why don’t we each retreat? There’s no need for hostility.”","At this moment, avoiding a battle was the wisest choice.","Otherwise, they would be the ones at a disadvantage.","“Haha, before seeing Jiuhu, if you had said that, I might have given your Yue Kingdom some face. But now, it’s impossible!” Tanlang turned to his two subordinates and ordered, “You two, hold off that kid with the sword on his back. Leave the rest to me!”","Although Jian Wushuang’s aura erupted, others could only perceive him as a Universe Master of the Third Tribulations. Thus, Tanlang regarded him as such, unaware that he was an Emperor.","Seeing this, Elder Muchen reminded, “Nephew Wushuang, if you’re not a match, retreat first. These beasts can’t threaten me!”","“Then stop talking nonsense!” Tanlang extended his sharp claws and launched a direct attack.","Jiuhu and Elder Muchen roared angrily, rushing forward together.","In fact, Elder Muchen’s earlier words were just polite.","He knew Jian Wushuang’s strength.","But Jiuhu was unaware.","He only knew that Jian Wushuang might be the strongest Emperor of the Ancient Wood Continent, comparable to a Universe Master.","Preparations had been made for the imminent rescue of Jian Wushuang.","Even while contending with Tanlang, their gaze remained fixed on Jian Wushuang’s safety.","They were facing two Universe Masters with divine power of 350,000 each.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void, slowly raising his hand to grasp the Wanjie Sword behind him.","At that moment, the void trembled.","The nearby battle groups slowed down.","Even Elder Muchen, knowing Jian Wushuang’s formidable strength, couldn’t help but marvel at this moment.","Jiuhu and Tanlang were stunned on the spot, momentarily forgetting they were still in combat.","The shock of Jian Wushuang drawing his sword was too great.","In the sacred grounds of the Ancient Wood Sect, the few strong observers watching Jian Wushuang remained calm.","Only Lian Xing seemed somewhat unsettled; he hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang to use the Wanjie Sword so quickly.","The Wanjie Sword was even more powerful than a Divine-tier sword blank.","To use the Wanjie Sword to kill two Wolf People with around 350,000 divine power each seemed like overkill.","Even the weakest puppets Jian Wushuang defeated before had 500,000 divine power.","Jian Wushuang could easily slay any Universe Master up to the Fourth Tribulation, regardless of their divine power.","Using the Wanjie Sword against two Universe Masters at the Third Tribulation seemed somewhat extravagant, but Jian Wushuang didn’t care.","The Wanjie Sword had yet to taste blood.","This was also an opportunity.","For two Universe Masters with 350,000 divine power each to be cut down by his Wanjie Sword was a sign of respect for them.","In the trembling void, the two wolf-head experts had no idea what kind of opponent they were facing.","“Tsk tsk, a greenhorn!” one of them with red fur around his neck sneered, launching an attack with his sharp claws directly aimed at Jian Wushuang’s face.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang drew the Wanjie Sword directly and slashed out.","The entire void fell silent.","The wolf-headed strongman with red fur didn’t even feel the power of the Wanjie Sword; his eyes lost their color.","“Fallen?” Tanlang’s expression changed drastically.","Jian Wushuang’s strength was even greater than he had imagined.","He had killed a 350,000 divine power strongman with a single sword strike."]},{"number":5807,"title":"Chapter 5807: One Slash at the Throat","paragraphs":["Chapter 5807: One Slash at the Throat","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even he couldn’t accomplish it.","This time, they had intended to snatch the opponent’s treasure, but instead, one of their own allies perished first.","What a mess!","The other Universe Master at the Third Tribulation hadn’t yet grasped what had happened, standing still, bewildered.","Jian Wushuang, however, struck once more.","Tanlang reacted this time, swiftly disappearing and reappearing beside his companion. Unable to pull them away in time, they could only viciously kick their subordinate out of the range of the sword’s slash.","Mere evasion was futile.","Especially against Jian Wushuang’s sword, which was anything but slow!","Swish!","The sword shadows twisted, still landing on the neck of that Universe Master at the Third Tribulation.","A sword to confer nobility!","A splendid bloodline burst instantly.","“You!” Tanlang was completely furious, ready to strike at Jian Wushuang.","Elder Muchen and Jiuhu also reacted, arriving beside Jian Wushuang, facing Tanlang together.","Two swords, slaying two Universe Masters at the Third Tribulation.","And they hadn’t even revealed their true divine power yet.","This left Tanlang somewhat unable to fathom Jian Wushuang.","Elder Muchen’s divine power exceeded 400,000, and Jiuhu was nearly the same.","They just lacked a special treasure like the Soul Shocking Vine.","Now, with Jian Wushuang added into the mix.","Even if Tanlang had a trick up their sleeve, they dared not linger in the fight.","Just as Elder Muchen had said.","They hadn’t reached the true starting point yet.","Why exert so much effort?","“Hmph, you got lucky this time!” Tanlang snorted coldly, then turned around and left.","Jian Wushuang and the others naturally didn’t bother to chase after him.","Thus, the Celestial Wolf Secret Realm lost two powerful individuals.","However, this kind of loss wasn’t considered too significant.","The real cruelty lay ahead.","For now, it was just a minor skirmish.","Having solved the predicament, Elder Muchen breathed a sigh of relief.","“Wushuang, your strength seems to have increased a lot!” Elder Muchen’s eyes held some envy.","An Emperor, so powerful.","As long as Jian Wushuang reached the Tribulation Realm, there was no need to suppress his realm. He could cross three tribulations in a row and become the Master of the Universe.","He could even cross four tribulations.","Throughout various eras, there were plenty of such super geniuses.","Some even crossed five tribulations in a row.","And compared to Jian Wushuang, none of the rumored Emperors could surpass him.","If Jian Wushuang could end this Sacred Assembly, obtain enough treasures, and break through the Tribulation Realm, it would be a witness to history.","Jian Wushuang’s expression remained unchanged as he calmly said, “Let’s leave quickly. We’re still some distance away from the departure point of the Infinite Great World. We can’t waste any more time here.”","“Mm!”","The three headed towards the valley where Wu Li was.","Here, everything returned to calm.","Outside.","There were still many powerful individuals observing this battle.","When they saw Jian Wushuang decisively slay two Universe Masters at the Third Tribulation, they began to investigate his identity.","“What? He’s actually an Emperor?”","Many couldn’t help but exclaim in astonishment!","An Emperor, effortlessly slew two Universe Masters.","Such an occurrence was akin to legend.","Today, they actually witnessed it with their own eyes.","“Haha, we, the pride of the Sixteen Kingdoms, are all like this. I wonder if you’re afraid or not!” a Scattered Tribulation powerhouse intentionally provoked the experts from various realms.","The observing experts split into two factions.","Only the Ancient Wood Sect’s experts watched with indifference.","They had long been aware of Jian Wushuang’s strength.","They just hadn’t extended an olive branch to recruit Jian Wushuang yet.","This time, however, presented an opportunity.","Of course, they had to wait for Jian Wushuang to come out alive.","At the edge of the Infinite Great World.","An entire mountain range served as a natural barrier for the Infinite Great World.","After meeting with Wu Li and the others, Jian Wushuang and his group began to rush at full speed. They had now reached the edge of the mountain range.","The gathering point was already very close.","Along the way, they encountered quite a bit of trouble.","They encountered many savage beasts at the Tribulation Realm, but fortunately, their strength was not strong. With only 200,000 to 3000,000 divine power, they could be easily killed with a flick of their hands.","Just as they were about to leave the mountain range, the token on Jinchen’s body suddenly reacted.","“A special mission?”","Wu Li and Elder Muchen said simultaneously.","Jian Wushuang looked puzzledly at the two, unaware of what was happening.","At this moment, Jiuhu beside him spoke up, “It seems that our luck is turning for the better. Unexpectedly, before reaching the depths of the Infinite Great World, we can receive a special mission issued by the Ancient Wood Sect!”","“Unfortunately, it’s only the Emperor’s special mission. I wonder if there will be any rewards!” Elder Muchen couldn’t help feeling regretful. If a Universe Master received a special mission, they would make a fortune.","Wu Li quickly reminded Jinchen, “Princess, quickly check how many-star mission it is!”","“Five stars!” Jin Chen was a bit confused by this, still somewhat surprised at why everyone seemed so astonished.","Hearing it was a five-star mission, everyone was completely stunned.","Wu Li couldn’t contain his excitement, “This time we’re really lucky! Even though it’s Emperor’s special mission, with five stars, the treasures we’ll get won’t be ordinary. There’s a good chance we’ll also get a pre-scouting map!”","“A pre-scouting map, what’s that?” Jian Wushuang seized on the key point, finally interjecting.","Elder Muchen then explained to him and Jinchen some of the strange assessments in the Holy Assembly.","The tokens given to them were not for communication purposes.","Their main use was to distribute tasks.","The one given to the Emperor was the Emperor’s task, which only the Emperor could complete.","And the tasks were divided into a total of six stars.","There was only one task with six stars throughout the entire assessment.","And the rewards were also the greatest.","Not only could they obtain some rare treasures, but they could also get a pre-scouting map.","The pre-scouting map represented the map route of their world.","The routes marked on it were generally safe routes.","With a secure route in hand, they could reach the finish line at the fastest speed possible.","The special missions for six-star ranks would definitely yield pre-scouting maps.","For five-star ranks, there was only a 50 percent chance of getting a pre-scouting map.","Missions were also categorized.","Special missions were issued to individuals and could also be explored with companions.","Group missions were usually randomly assigned to strong individuals in a certain area, and anyone could receive the mission.","However, group missions were too risky.","In a region, there were at least thousands of strong individuals.","A thousand people gathering together, competing at the same time.","The probability was too small.","Special missions were known only to their own people and were almost guaranteed to be completed.","“Since it’s so important, why not inform...” Princess Jinchen’s words were interrupted by Jian Wushuang beside her.","“No, since it’s the Emperor’s special mission, we can handle it ourselves. Notifying Her Majesty won’t help. Instead, it will alert the enemy. By now, Her Majesty and her entourage should have reached the assembly point. It’s crowded there, and if Her Majesty acts rashly, she will surely attract attention. It’s not worth the risk!”","Elder Muchen nodded in agreement, saying, “Nephew Jian Wushuang is right. We shouldn’t inform Her Majesty. Since it’s the Emperor’s special mission, you and Wushuang should be able to complete it!”"]},{"number":5808,"title":"Chapter 5808 Special Mission","paragraphs":["5808 Special Mission","“Haha, for Jian Wushuang, it was undoubtedly a piece of cake!” Wu Li and the Jiuhu chuckled.","Five-star mission.","It was quite challenging.","That was for others.","For Jian Wushuang, it was like a walk in the park.","“Quick, let’s check the details of the mission. We need to be fast and avoid arousing suspicion!”","Jinchen took out the token, glanced at it carefully, and replied, “It’s about a fifteen-minute","flight southwest from here. More clues will be available when we get there!”","“I see, a five-star mission is indeed extraordinary!”","“Let’s go!”","The five changed direction, originally heading north.","Now they were flying rapidly southwest.","At this point in the mountains, there weren’t many teams left; most had reached the gathering point.","Even the faster ones had entered the outskirts of the Infinite Great World.","Jian Wushuang and his team were just unlucky; otherwise, they could have set out earlier.","What they didn’t expect was that there was another team equally unlucky!","Two Universe Masters had fallen before even entering the Infinite Great World.","Now they were lagging behind many others, barely reaching the edge of the mountains. Buzz!","In the sky near the mountains, several figures appeared. Among them, a burly man with long sideburns stared ahead with torch-like eyes, puzzled, “These auras... Why are they heading in the opposite direction of the gathering point?”","“Iluh?” A blue-furred wolf-headed strongman in the team exclaimed, “These auras are so familiar. Is it the team from Yue Kingdom?”","“Is it the Yue Kingdom team that lost two Wolf Lords?” the burly man said coldly. “I don’t think much of their strength. Tanlang should reconsider!”","Tanlang’s eyes turned bloodshot, not because of any hatred towards Yue Kingdom, but because he felt uncomfortable with the burly man’s words.","Though they were both strong in the Celestial Wolf Secret Realm.","The Celestial Wolf Secret Realm had two Universe Masters at the Fifth Tribulation, both participating in this Sacred Assembly.","They each had their own followers.","But since all his companions had fallen, and he happened to encounter the other team, they decided to travel together.","“Kuilang, you should pay attention to their direction. They’re heading southwest, not towards the gathering point. Many teams have already assembled at the gathering point. and started off. If they’re going southwest now, they must have received a mission. We could take advantage of this opportunity!” Tanlang’s strength might not match Kuilang’s, but his mind was much sharper.","If Kuilang had encountered Jian Wushuang earlier, he wouldn’t have backed off; he would have definitely initiated a fight.","The other party was notorious for being a lunatic, and few dared to provoke them in the Celestial Wolf Secret Realm.","Kuilang ran his hand through his hair and laughed heartily, “You’re still somewhat useful. So, what are we waiting for? Let’s go after them!”","“Wait a moment. If we follow them now, they might notice us and leave!” Tanlang hurriedly","stopped everyone.","A group of six.","All of them were Kuilang’s men, and they didn’t listen to his advice at all.","“Hmph, timid and hesitant. Even if it’s a special mission, what can they do? Daring to kill a strong member of my Celestial Wolf Clan, they must pay the price!” Kuilang didn’t care about anything else, leading his people to chase after them directly.","Tanlang cursed inwardly; if it weren’t for being from the same clan, he would have teamed up with strong individuals from other countries to trap and kill Kuilang.","His mind was too dull.","For such an opportunity, he insisted on confronting it head-on.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang and the others were fast enough; it would take time for Kuilang","and the others to catch up.","Meanwhile, Emperor Jian Wushuang and his team had already reached the mission location.","Whoosh!","The cold wind howled.","In the southwest mountains, where snow accumulated year-round, the temperature was","extremely low.","After surveying the surroundings, the group didn’t find anything and descended directly to","the ground.","Ding!","The golden token reacted again, and everyone gathered around.","“Enter Snow Shadow Mountain!”","Everyone was stunned!","Snow Shadow Mountain? The mountain range here extended to an unknown place. Where should they look?","Just as they were at a loss, a strong gust of wind suddenly rose.","The snowstorm instantly blew towards them.","Jian Wushuang raised his hand to block the cold snow and squinted ahead.","“It’s there!” He pointed.","Everyone looked in unison.","It was exactly where the snowstorm was coming from.","A pitch-black cave entrance.","Above it, the words ‘Snow Shadow’ appeared at some point.","“Nephew Wushuang, you take Princess Jinchen in. We’ll guard this place for you!” Elder","Muchen began arranging some simple formations for occasional needs!","Jian Wushuang nodded, dispersing his divine power and directly enveloping Princess Jinchen, rushing towards the cave entrance of Snow Shadow Mountain.","The power of the snowstorm was extremely strong.","An ordinary Emperor couldn’t even enter.","Just entering Snow Shadow Mountain alone required 200,000 divine power.","If it weren’t for his divine power enveloping Jinchen, she would have been blown away long","ago.","“Directly go in?” Jian Wushuang turned to Princess Jinchen, asking if there were any other","instructions.","Princess Jinchen didn’t speak, just nodded.","Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate either, taking her directly into the pitch-black cave entrance.","Just before he entered the cave, he sensed a dangerous aura coming from afar.","But at this moment, he was already at the edge and couldn’t stop; he could only hurriedly","send a message to Wuli, asking them to be careful.","Strong individuals were approaching them. They had to complete the mission quickly.","He was truly worried that. Wuli might perish.","Without Wuli, he couldn’t even find Wanliu, let alone enter.","After dragging Jinchen into the Snow Shadow Mountain cave, that wild force finally","disappeared.","Ding!","The token cane again","“Kill the Snow Shadow Demon King!”","The content was straightforward and crude.","And so was Jian Wushuang.","Just as they entered the cave, they encountered several snow monsters, all of considerable","strength.","Each had around two hundred thousand divine powers.","An ordinary Emperor couldn’t handle them at all.","For Jian Wushuang, it was merely a matter of sword aura on the surface, yet it could","instantly kill these snow monsters.","He didn’t hesitate and, accompanied by Jincheng, he swiftly slew the snow monsters,","penetrating deep into the heart of Snow Shadow Mountain.","Meanwhile, outside Snow Shadow Mountain,","Wu Li hadn’t received any message from Jian Wushuang yet, which furrowed his brows.","Because he noticed people rushing towards their direction, and not just one.","Seven formidable individuals in total.","The weakest among them possessed 400,000 divine power.","Among them were two with over 500,000 divine power each. They must be Universe Masters at the Fourth Tribulation. When he received the message from Jian Wushuang, he was momentarily stunned, not by","the unexpected arrival of those formidable individuals, but by Jian Wushuang’s unexpected","revelation.","The news of the approaching strong individuals was conveyed to him by the entity dwelling","within him, yet Jian Wushuang seemed to be aware of it as well.","This revelation greatly shocked him!","The entity residing within him was truly remarkable.","There was no time to dwell on this further. He hastily reminded Muchen and the two","others, Jiuhu, to prepare for battle.","The next moment, a row of figures appeared above them.","“Tanlang!”","“Kuilang!”","“We’re done for!”","They were already in a state of despair, realizing that the enemies before them were far beyond their ability to contend with!"]},{"number":5809,"title":"Chapter 5809 Despair","paragraphs":["5809 Despair","Jiuhu took two steps back, already preparing to flee. Two Universe Masters at the Fourth Tribulation.","The cunning Tanlang, with a divine power of 500,000.","The fierce Kuilang, with a divine power of 530,000.","How were they supposed to fight against them?","“Hurry, inform your Empress!” Jiuhu shouted urgently.","Elder Muchen, upon seeing this, immediately sent out the message.","The Empress quickly responded.","The head of the Li family, accompanied by two Fourth Tribulation experts from the royal family, would soon arrive.","They only needed to hold out for an hour!","“An hour?”","This time frame could afford them preparations for what lay ahead.","Elder Muchen also understood this, but there was no other way.","They could only hold out.","“How long will it take?” Wu Li furrowed his brow and asked.","Elder Muchen remained silent.","The time was too long, revealing it would only lead to despair.","He had already begun preparing for what came next, which was to desperately hold the line.","At the same time, he prayed that Jian Wushuang encountered trouble in the Snow Shadow Mountain and would come out after an hour.","By then, they could head to the assembly point with the mission rewards and rendezvous with the Empress.","That was the best plan.","For just the three of them to try to hold off these people was impossible.","The Tanlang glanced down at the three below and then noticed the Snow Shadow Mountain Cave.","Without a word, he charged straight toward the cave.","But as soon as he reached the entrance, a barrier blocked his way,","“Can’t get in?” Tanlang was somewhat surprised.","Initially, he had sensed the presence of four individuals.","Because Jinchen’s strength was too weak, during their journey, Jian Wushuang had","enveloped her with divine power, so she wasn’t detected by Tanlang.","Arriving just now, the Tanlang saw only three people.","The boy carrying the sword had disappeared.","He had thought Jian Wushuang went in alone.","If that were the case, this place must be a special mission assigned by the Universe Master. According to common ssense, they all could enter.","But he couldn’t enter now.","In an instant, he understood.","No wonder these people were waiting at the entrance.","“The boy with the sword on his back is the Emperor!” Tanlang’s eyes narrowed, recalling the rumors from some time ago.","An extraordinary Emperor had appeared in Yue Kingdom, capable of erupting with 200,000 divine power.","Now it seemed not only true but even more formidable than rumored.","Muchen sneered, “You’ve discovered this!”","“In that case, you all must die!” Tanlang roared angrily, ready to attack.","But at this moment, Kuilang stepped forward, stopping Tanlang, “Don’t be hasty, Whoever goes in, the treasures that cannot be brought out will belong to me, Kuilang. And you prey are mine as well. Anyone who dares to interfere, don’t blame me for being impolite!”","Jiuhu was already petrified, not daring to move.","Faced with a vastly superior opponent, he had no confidence whatsoever.","Even Kuilang alone, the three of them combined couldn’t withstand for even the duration of an incense stick burning.","Upon hearing this, Tanlang was enraged. “Kuilang, this is not the time to play around. Deal with them quickly. They definitely have reinforcements coming this way. Don’t be careless!” “Hmph, if you’re afraid, you can leave anytime!” Kuilang sneered, “A mere Yue Kingdom, with only one Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation. The rest of the Universe Masters of the Fourth Tribulation are no match for me. I’ll kill however many come!”","The arrogant Kuilang didn’t even regard Yue Kingdom with a glance.","Tanlang was helpless alone!","But inwardly, he cursed the other’s foolishness.","Crack!","Kuilang flexed his wrist casually, saying, “The three of you, entertain me for a while!” Elder Muchen exchanged a glance with Wu Li, and they instantly understood each other.","They still had some cards up their sleeves.","Not to mention the secrets on Wu Li.","Just Muchen’s trump card, the Soul Shocking Vine, could boost his divine power to 450,000. Wu Li also had some tricks up his sleeve. If he really unleashed them, he might even surpass Elder Muchen in strength.","The two of them together might be able to withstand an hour.","The premise was that Tanlang wouldn’t intervene.","As long as no one interfered, they could hold out.","Plus, there were Jiuhu; the opponent’s strength wasn’t negligible.","With their combined four hundred thousand divine powers, they could make good use of it.","There was still hope for the three of them to survive.","But they feared Jian Wushuang suddenly appearing, with no intention to play games, and","just cutting them down.","That would be troublesome.","Right now, they could only hope Jian Wushuang would take his time.","Inside the Snow Shadow Mountain.","Jian Wushuang slaughtered snow monsters all the way, already reaching the deepest part.","He just wanted to get out quickly now.","The blood monsters he encountered along the way were getting stronger.","Until he reached the deepest part.","Ordinary snow monsters already had 250,000 divine power.","And in the depths, the aura of the Snow Monster Demon King had appeared.","With divine power reaching 300,000.","Unfortunately, before the opponent could see his face, it was instantly shattered by the","Sword Qi.","Along the way, Jinchen was mesmerized.","Any one of those snow monsters, she wouldn’t be a match for.","But under Jian Wushuang’s hand, they were like ants, easily slain.","Looking up at Jian Wushuang’s stern face, Jinchen also felt a slight stir in her heart.","It wasn’t an emotional touch.","It was admiration for the strong.","Among peers. No one dared to call themselves a genius in front of Jian Wushuang.","Nor did anyone have the qualifications.","Perhaps what her mother said was right, meeting Jian Wushuang was both luck for Yuc","Kingdom and her own.","Unfortunately, one cannot measure love with strength.","The Snow Monster Demon King was instantly slain.","Mission accomplished!","The token trembled once again.","“Talk to the Snow King!”","Jian Wushuang was surprised, “What kind of mission is this?”","As soon as he spoke, he felt a gathering force, and when he turned to look, he saw the snow","monster demon king who had been killed.","“Outsider, how dare you kill me! The bloodline in my body is from the beasts of the North","Pole Icefield. You will surely die miserably!”","Jinchen spoke up, “Snow King, you shouldn’t have been here in the first place. Blame","yourself for leaving the North Pole leefield!”","“I’ve been here for tens of thousands of epochs, and it’s you who destroyed my homeland!”","The Snow Shadow Demon King was very unwilling.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang thought of something!","A hidden mission?","The North Pole Icefield, at the northernmost part of the Infinite Great World.","To reach the destination, they needed to cross the entire North Pole Icefield.","Perhaps they could ask about the North Pole Icefield’s situation or even a map from the other party.","With a safe route, their speed would be faster.","This time, Jian Wushuang personally engaged in conversation.","And indeed, he managed to extract information about the North Pole Icefield from the","Snow Monster Demon King.","“The three leaders will not let you go. They will avenge Weilang!”","With these words, the Demon King’s soul also disappeared. On the ground, there was snowball and a piece of parchment.","Jian Wushuang was overjoyed, “It’s a map!” With a quick step, he picked up the items from the ground.","The snowball was a treasure, considered a post-natal Universe Treasure, but its power was","unknown.","He tossed it directly to Jinchen.","Then he looked at the map."]},{"number":5810,"title":"Chapter 5810 Pre-Scouting Map","paragraphs":["5810 Pre-Scouting Map","They indeed marked some routes on the map.","However, these routes were not safe passages but rather treasure routes.","The map recorded the locations of some inheritance relics.","Judging by the scale of the map, Jian Wushuang studied it for a moment and realized that this route was actually a shortcut, which was better than nothing.","This time, they truly made a profit.","“You should take this too!” Jian Wushuang didn’t claim it for himself but handed the pre-scouting map to Jinchen.","For him, the Empress becoming a candidate was the most important thing.","He didn’t care about the treasures in this place.","If there were treasures useful for the origin, he might take a closer look.","His Starry Sky Origin Source had already lit up 9,000 black holes.","To reach a complete universe, he only lacked 1,000 black holes.","The Third Tribulation Universe Master could only be considered a small universe. The Universe Master of the Fourth Tribulation could be considered a large one. Only the Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation could be considered complete. And he was about to light up a complete universe.","As long as he broke through the tribulation, he could cross five tribulations at once. Becoming the Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation.","“Let’s get out of here quickly!” The mission was completed, and it was time to leave.","Compared to the treasures obtained from the mission, he was more afraid that Wu Li would fall.","He hoped the other party had enough hidden cards.","He could tell that there were still many secrets on Wu Li.","Even if his strength was a bit weaker, he should have many lifesaving cards.","Pulling Jinchen along, with a few flashes, they arrived at the entrance of the cave.","With a flicker of their figures, the two of them left the cave at the same time.","Outside of Snow Shadow Mountain,","Kuilang stepped on the body of Elder Muchen, with one hand still holding the struggling Wu","Li.","Jiuhu, on the other hand, kept retreating out of fear, losing all will to fight.","“Is this all you’ve got?” Kuilang sneered, “With such little strength, you actually scared Tanlang into fleeing and even caused the loss of two Universe Masters. What a waste!”","Tanlang’s expression was embarrassed, but he didn’t retort.","He kept staring at the entrance of the cave.","“Hmm?” The sudden appearance of a presence made Tanlang’s expression greatly joyful.","Knowing that Jian Wushuang had come out, he ignored Kuilang and rushed straight towards the entrance of the cave, feeling elated in his heart.","Kuilang was still foolishly staring.","Compared to revenge, Tanlang was more concerned about those treasures.","In his view, Kuilang was just a fool with well-developed limbs.","As long as he seized the treasure, the credit would be his.","The deaths of two Universe Masters meant nothing!","Jian Wushuang had just come out and hadn’t yet seen the situation on the field clearly when he noticed Tanlang charging towards him.","This time, he didn’t need to endure anymore.","Before, there was no need to.","This time, the other party was coming for the treasures they had obtained.","It was bound to be a fight to the death.","If he endured again, he would have to prepare for his funeral.","“Buzz!”","The power of the Beast God erupted instantly, and his divine power soared to 500,000 in an instant.","Facing Tanlang’s claw, he caught it bare-handedly.","The power of the Beast God circulated wildly as he held onto Jinchen with one hand.","The arm of the Candle Dragon on his left hand burst out directly, blocking that claw.","“This time, I won’t hold back!” Jian Wushuang grabbed the opponent’s wolf claw and squeezed it fiercely.","A crisp sound echoed.","Tanlang was shocked and turned pale, exclaiming in astonishment and anger, “You’ve been hiding your strength?”","He hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang to be so powerful even without using his sword.","The burst of divine power just now was no weaker than his own.","Boom!","A powerful force erupted from Tanlang’s mouth as he tried to attack Jian Wushuang at close","range, but it was actually a ploy to escape.","Such tricks were no match for Jian Wushuang.","However he couldn’t be bothered to entanelo himself with the annonent","Rescuing people was the priority now.","Tanlang frowned and said coldly, “Is your sword just for deception?”","“Think whatever you want!” Jian Wushuang replied indifferently.","With one hand pulling Jinchen, he flashed directly in front of Kuilang.","Muchen, lying on the ground, saw Jian Wushuang and anxiously said, “Go quickly, you’re no match for him!”","Wu Li, being choked, couldn’t even speak.","He had wanted to explode earlier, but the presence within him reminded him that Jian Wushuang had the strength to deal with these people, so there was no need to waste his","treasures.","Initially, Wu Li didn’t believe it.","But just now, he saw Jian Wushuang easily repel Tanlang.","And he could feel Jian Wushuang’s divine power surpassing his own, reaching 500,000.","This power was already enough to contend with Kuilang.","Kuilang, however, was unconcerned. Just as he was about to speak, he couldn’t even see Jian Wushuang’s figure clearly before feeling his own arm being grabbed!","Crack!","A crisp sound rang out as Kuilang’s entire arm snapped off.","The arm, along with Wu Li, fell to the ground together.","“Ah!” Kuilang was startled.","Jian Wushuang didn’t give the opponent a chance to react. He lifted his foot and kicked","directly at Kuilang’s chest, sending him flying into the mountains behind.","He crashed through several towering peaks before finally coming to a stop. With a casual gathering of the power of All Things, Jian Wushuang infused it into Elder","Muchen’s body. Only then did Elder Muchen manage to stand up reluctantly, regaining some of his divine power.","Feeling the immense divine power emanating from Jian Wushuang, Elder Muchen was completely stunned.","“You go first, I’ll hold them back!” Ile let go of Jinchen, took a step forward, and directly stood in front of everyone.","Elder Muchen was still somewhat worried, knowing that staying here would only cause trouble for Jian Wushuang.","“Be careful, we’ll meet at the rendezvous point!” After saying this, he quickly flew northward","with Wu Li and Jinchen.","Jiuhu hurriedly followed!","Now only Jian Wushuang remained, along with the seven Universe Masters of the Celestial","Wolf Clan.","Tianlang rubbed his shattered wolf claws, veins bulging on his forehead.","Ile hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang to be so powerful.","An Emperor, reaching such strength, was something he had never heard of before.","The other five Universe Masters at the Third Tribulation also realized that they were no","match and retreated one after another.","Boom!","Kuilang, who was repelled, was missing an arm, but his divine power had not weakened. On the contrary, he became even more frenzied, directly crashing through several towering mountains and standing in front of Jian Wushuang again.","With a roar, his severed arm instantly regenerated.","Kuilang stared at Jian Wushuang, manicly saying, “You do have some skills after all!”","“Why waste words? Let’s just fight!” Jian Wushuang clenched his fist, the red aura on his","body erupting once again.","This time, he directly unleashed three times the power of the Beast God.","His divine power surged to 550,000!","Overwhelming Kuilang.","Even if several people joined forces, he could swiftly defeat them.","“550,000?” Kuilang sneered, then turned to Tianlang and said, “This person is my prey, you","can’t intervenc!”","Knowing that Jian Wushuang’s divine power was stronger than his, and being so confident,","clearly showed great confidence.","Tianlang’s brows furrowed, surprised, “Are you going to use that move now?”","“Why not!” Kuilang sneered.","*Average"]},{"number":5811,"title":"Chapter 5811 Celestial Wolf Under the Demonic Moon","paragraphs":["5811 Celestial Wolf Under the Demonic Moon","“You fool, we haven’t even reached the assembly point yet, and you want to transform? How long do you plan to let the trouble you leave behind linger? It can’t affect the grand plan of our clan!” Tanlang was getting anxious.","Kuilang’s strength ranked first among their Celestial Wolf Clan, and they couldn’t afford to waste it like this.","As soon as he finished speaking, he thought of something else. If Jian Wushuang really obtained a crucial treasure inside the Snow Shadow Mountain, perhaps they could make one last gamble.","Anyway, they would have to take risks once they entered the Infinite Great World.","“If you’re afraid, you can leave now!” Kuilang gathered energy in his hands, ignoring Tanlang.","However, Tanlang harbored malicious thoughts. If Jian Wushuang and Kuilang ended up mutually wounded, perhaps he would still have a chance to seize the credit.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t particularly interested in their conversation. When he heard about transformation, he thought of the Celestial Wolf Clan’s innate secret technique.","Under the Demonic Moon, the Celestial Wolf Clan could transform based on their bloodline, increasing their strength exponentially.","But here, there wasn’t even a moon, let alone the Demonic Moon.","Jian Wushuang looked at the aura gathering between the opponent’s hands, the kind of red divine power somewhat similar to his Beast God power.","“Could it be that the ancestor of your Celestial Wolf Clan is a natural Beast God?”","The resonance between his beastly divine weapon and theirs was probably because of this.","“A Beast God?” Kuilang’s eye sockets kept shrinking, raising his hands violently and throwing the red divine power in the sky.","Crash!","That aura, like condensed blood, turned the sky into a piece of paper.","The blood burst, and the sky instantly turned blood-red.","Kuilang looked up at the blood color in the sky, his eye sockets also turning blood-red.","The other five Universe Masters of the Third Tribulation also underwent the same change.","Their eye sockets turned red, their bodies began to expand, and in an instant, they transformed into giant monster forms tens of thousands of feet tall.","Their divine power also began to skyrocket.","Those Universe Masters of the Third Tribulation only had 350,000 divine power, but after transforming, their divine power directly reached 400,000.","He gained a whopping 50,000.","Kuilang was even more exaggerated.","His bloodline became even stronger, and the amplification of his divine power was even greater.","From 530,000, it directly surged to 600,000.","“I actually increased by so much!” Jian Wushuang was extremely surprised. He thought it would be good if he could increase by two or three tens of thousands, but he didn’t expect a direct surge of a full 70,000.","This was even more terrifying than his Beast God power.","Doubling his Beast God power only increased it by 50,000.","“Hmm?” He turned to look at Tanlang on the other side and found that the other party hadn’t transformed, apparently not allowed to join the battle.","This was just as well.","Otherwise, he would have been somewhat struggling.","Three times the Beast God power was his current limit. Using the General’s Armor would be necessary if he went beyond that.","It would be troublesome to use the General’s Armor rashly in front of outsiders who could see them fighting. It was better not to use it if possible.","Now that he had the Wanjie Sword, he could resort to it if necessary.","“You brat, prepare to die!” Kuilang stretched out his sharp claws and tore straight towards Jian Wushuang.","The terrifying power shattered the firmament.","Several spatial cracks appeared instantly, and countless astral winds converged.","Jian Wushuang had nowhere to hide, so he could only withstand it head-on.","With his arms crossed over his chest, he forcefully took the attack.","His flesh was torn countless times, and his divine power began to decline.","The difference was quite significant.","550,000 divine power against 600,000 divine power.","Although it seemed like only a difference of 50,000, in reality, it was a difference of an entire doubling of combat power.","“Beast God Domain!” Jian Wushuang also began to crupt.","Within the domain, Kuilang felt his divine power being somewhat suppressed, which surprised him.","The previously somewhat arrogant Kuilang also began to take it seriously, instructing his several subordinates behind him, “You block his retreat. I’ll attack!”","“Yes!” The five Universe Masters of the Third Tribulation directly surrounded Jian Wushuang,","Glancing around, Jian Wushuang realized that this battle could only be fought head-on.","“Then let’s start with you!” The red divine power on Jian Wushuang’s body disappeared in an instant, and his divine power also dropped to 400,000.","The several Universe Masters at the Third Tribulation surrounding Jian Wushuang were stunned.","“You surrender now, you still die!” Kuilang charged directly.","Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows twitched, and in just a moment, his aura seemed to change","entirely.","A blue aura surrounded him, erupting into countless electric arcs.","The power of the origin wasn’t violent, but it was agile and even more fierce.","Clang!","Jian Wushuang drew the Wanjie Sword directly, his figure disappearing in an instant from where he stood, much faster than before. Kuilang’s claw missed, and before he could react,","Jian Wushuang was already behind him.","With his back to his opponent, Jian Wushuang’s lips curled upward.","The strongest stays behind.","It’s more important to deal with these Universe Masters at the Third Tribulation first.","The blue sword shadows of the Wanjic Sword filled the blood-red sky.","“Die!” Jian Wushuang shouted angrily, sweeping his sword horizontally, and countless sword shadows flew out.","The Universe Masters at the Third Tribulation surrounding him were instantly sealed and","killed.","The vitality within their bodies almost disappeared in an instant.","The powerful observers watching this battle couldn’t help but inhale sharply.","That sword strike of Jian Wushuang just now indeed astonished many.","“This child absolutely has mastered the Origin Source of the universe, but has been","suppressing his realm without breakthrough!”","“Similar to that High Priest?” Many exclaimed.","“I laha, no matter how strong that I ligh Priest is, he’s only comparable to the Third Tribulation. Jian Wushuang, whether it’s divine power or Origin Source, surpasses the Third Tribulation. He can even kill those at the Fourth Tribulation!”","Many at the Seventh Tribulation also looked towards Jian Wushuang.","That one sword move of Jian Wushuang just now was too dazzling.","As Emperor, he instantly slew five Universe Masters with a divine power of 400,000.","If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they wouldn’t have believed it.","The head of the Ancient Wood Sect squinted.","The more he looked at Jian Wushuang, the more familiar he seemed. Suddenly, he","remembered something.","He had seen that blue aura before.","There was a flicker of surprise in his eyes.","“Could it be sent by Babidi?” The head of the Ancient Wood Sect felt a sinking feeling in his heart, but then he thought again, Babidi hadn’t informed him in advance. Unfortunately, he couldn’t contact Babidi proactively, otherwise he could have verified it.","If Babidi was indeed scheming against the Ancient Wood Sect, he wouldn’t have any means","to resist. Currently, only the Divine Wood King was in charge within the Ancient Wood Sect.","That Seventh Tribulation Universe Master wasn’t even on the Ancient Wood Continent.","Even if there were Seventh Tribulation Universe Masters, it wouldn’t matter. He had witnessed the strength of Chi Jiuxiao.","Much stronger than an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master, it wouldn’t make a difference","who came.","Forget about the Ancient Wood Continent, looking at the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime,","the advantage lay with Babidi.","His allegiance was neither right nor wrong.","“Let’s just wait and see!” The head of the Ancient Wood Sect swept his eyes around,","watching those powerful figures jockeying for position, with a cold snort in his heart.","Universe Masters were just temporary.","The Scattered Tribulation was for a lifetime!","Infinite Great World.","Jian Wushuang swiftly killed five Universe Masters who had transformed, not even breathing heavily, and once again drew his sword to confront Kuilang.","For a Universe Master with 400,000 divine power, killing them was utterly effortless."]},{"number":5812,"title":"Chapter 5812: Needle Against Awn","paragraphs":["Chapter 5812: Needle Against Awn","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The strongest opponent remained Kuilang.","With 600,000 divine powers, Jian Wushuang felt a certain pressure.","Though he possessed numerous trump cards, he knew now wasn’t the time to reveal them all.","He hadn’t even witnessed the Wanliu yet, let alone the Infinite Great World. Revealing his hand prematurely would be a costly mistake.","He opted to stall when possible and evade when necessary.","As an Emperor, he saw no need to play the hero in such a situation.","If he wanted recognition, he would earn it within Wanliu.","The entire Ancient Wood Continent would remember him then.","“You think killing a few weaklings makes you my equal?” Kuilang’s aura surged as he boldly intercepted Jian Wushuang’s strike, his grip on the blade fierce. “I’ll show you the strongest secret technique of the Celestial Wolf Clan!”","“You can still power up?” Jian Wushuang’s expression shifted slightly as he quickly drew the Wanjie Sword, retreating rapidly.","Beside him, Tanlang was also taken aback. Although they hailed from the same realm, they were only familiar with their own secret techniques.","True trump cards were not to be shared, even among kin or partners.","Kuilang clenched his fists, his aura erupting once more, his eyes almost bursting.","“Sky Rupture!”","Hum!","The surrounding space began to collapse.","The sheer force of his presence alone could tear space apart.","Indeed, it was a sky rupture.","While Kuilang’s divine power remained constant, the technique he employed had changed.","Jian Wushuang felt a hint of panic.","A Universe Master of the Fourth Tribulation was evidently not as straightforward to deal with as he had assumed.","With such strength, he already possessed the power of a Fifth Tribulation.","Yet, that was merely a threshold.","Just like the Emperor’s limit.","They said he had 100,000 divine power, but there were still many geniuses who could reach 150,000, even 200,000.","The Universe Master was no exception.","Kuilang’s eruption was enough to rival the Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation.","If Jian Wushuang shone too brightly, it could also cause quite a stir.","“Kid, it’s over!” Kuilang stretched out his hand, two fingers pointing upwards. A force that swept through heaven and earth instantly flattened the nearby mountains into plains.","Jian Wushuang struggled to resist with the Beast God Wings.","He knew his opponent hadn’t truly made a move yet.","The previous attack was just an appetizer.","This time, he had truly overestimated himself.","But because of the opponent’s eruption, he now felt a surge of fighting spirit boiling within him.","“Come on, let me see your true secret technique of the Celestial Wolf Clan!” Jian Wushuang flicked his robe, holding the Wanjie Sword upside down, determination gleaming in his eyes.","If it’s a battle, then let it be a battle.","Kuilang grinned, and a black force began to rise on his hands, or rather, his claws.","“Illusory Sky Transformation!” Kuilang spread his arms, his entire body submerged in the black force.","Merging with the black mist, he charged directly at Jian Wushuang.","His speed was even faster than before.","The space he passed through began to collapse directly.","He could already destroy the space of the Infinite Great World.","If it were a Fifth Tribulation powerhouse, they might have been able to damage the foundation of the Infinite Great World.","Jian Wushuang’s wings trembled behind him as he distanced himself from Kuilang, continuously unleashing the Wanjie Sword’s shadows to pull against the opponent.","However, the sharp sword shadows couldn’t shake the power on the opponent’s body.","In other words, his current primal strength was not enough to break through the defense.","“Starry Sky Chronicles!” Seeing this situation, he didn’t delay any longer and directly displayed the Starry Sky Chronicles.","A huge scroll covered the sky.","The Wanjie Sword also buzzed.","A powerful force of the Starry Sky amplified onto Jian Wushuang’s body.","“The First Sword Move!”","Jian Wushuang raised his hand, and the sword shadows of the Wanjie Sword turned into the firmament, a green sword shadow slashed out from the myriad swords.","Sword of Life!","The sword move he had once been proud of.","He didn’t believe that the opponent could still withstand this sword.","Kuilang, facing this sudden true sword move, did not dodge, treating it as an ordinary sword shadow, and raised his hand to block.","But when he touched this sword, the vitality in his body crazily reversed, and then he felt reverence for Life.","He began to tremble uncontrollably.","Seeing that this sword move had an effect, Jian Wushuang continued to slash out hundreds of sword strikes in succession.","Hundreds of Swords of Life thoroughly drained the Life power within Jian Wushuang’s body.","In the past, using one sword move would leave him exhausted. Now, using a hundred sword moves in a row had reached his limit.","For him now, Life power was more than sufficient, but the power of Death was too little.","If he were to unleash the second sword move of the Starry Sky Chronicles, ‘Death’, he could only unleash it ten times at most.","Moreover, to restore the power of Death, he would need to reverse Life, which was extremely troublesome.","But restoring Life was much simpler.","The power of All Things could be condensed at any time.","In just a breath’s time, he had recovered a bit.","The hundred Swords of Life, when used against Kuilang, even if they couldn’t kill him, could severely wound him.","Seeing Kuilang struggling, Jian Wushuang thought it might be over for him.","But Kuilang’s divine power hadn’t diminished; instead, his vitality was ebbing away.","“Get out of my way!” Kuilang roared in frustration under the harassment of the Swords of Life. Faced with the subsequent onslaught, he erupted once more.","This time, his divine power began to surge.","A terrifying aura burst forth in an instant.","Kuilang’s divine power skyrocketed to 680,000 in a blink of an eye.","This sight startled not only Jian Wushuang but also made even Tanlang retreat involuntarily.","Because he knew that if Kuilang used his secret technique now, he would lose his sanity.","The transformation of the Celestial Wolf Clan had two forms.","One was Kuilang’s current form, which could enhance his divine power. However, the drawback was that his temperament would become increasingly violent, and he couldn’t maintain it for long.","The second form also enhanced divine power, but the amplification was even stronger.","However, the drawbacks were more terrifying.","He would lose consciousness and enter a completely berserk state.","He would continue in this state until his divine power was exhausted, then fall into a deep sleep.","Tanlang understood that Kuilang, in his current state due to his first transformation, coupled with his inherently violent nature, had completely abandoned restraint, solely aiming for Jian Wushuang’s death.","For a moment, he was somewhat puzzled. After all, Jian Wushuang had initially killed his underlings, so why was Kuilang so furious?","But then he remembered something and let it go.","Kuilang’s mother was once the Holy Maiden of the Celestial Wolf Clan but had run away because of a powerful individual from the Yue Kingdom, reportedly even a patriarch of one of its clans.","So Kuilang’s extreme anger towards the strong of the Yue Kingdom was understandable.","Within the clan, Kuilang had been shunned because of this incident.","Fortunately, Kuilang had grown stronger over time, and fewer people knew about this matter.","Those who did know dared not bring it up again.","Because anyone who mentioned it would pay a hefty price.","Clutching his head with both claws, Kuilang, in his complete transformation, would endure brief torment.","It was meant to erode his consciousness.","Now, only a trace of consciousness remained in Kuilang. He shook his head frantically, and the remaining consciousness made him look towards Tanlang.","“Tan... Tanlang, don’t... forget... the promise!” Kuilang’s intermittent voice fell, and he completely entered a state of frenzy."]},{"number":5813,"title":"Chapter 5813: Three Quake Universe","paragraphs":["Chapter 5813: Three Quake Universe","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang blinked and muttered to himself, “I don’t think I have much grudge against you!”","Could it be that among the people he had just killed, there was Kuilang’s father?","Otherwise, it wouldn’t be so intense!","Upon hearing this, Tanlang’s eyes went blank for a moment, murmuring to himself, “Promise?”","It should be the oath sworn by their Celestial Wolf Clan, prioritizing the interests of the Wolf Clan above all else in the Infinite Great World.","The two of them only had this kind of relationship.","“I will keep my promise, and when necessary, I will save you once!” Tanlang this time didn’t harbor any evil intentions due to greed, but rather admired Kuilang a bit.","He would never fight so desperately.","Unless the other party threatened his life.","But such a situation was something he wouldn’t encounter, and even if he did, he would flee first.","Not like Kuilang, who insisted on fighting to the death.","“Howl!”","The sound of wolves howling echoed throughout the entire mountain range.","Kuilang completely transformed into his true form, his limbs trampling on the peaks.","Facing Jian Wushuang without fear, he charged directly.","680,000 divine power.","That’s no joke.","Even the Universe Masters of the Fifth Tribulation probably have this level.","Who could withstand this?","Show the sword!","Although Jian Wushuang wasn’t very confident, he still had to try.","“Dual Sword Slash!” The strongest two sword moves to date.","Performed together.","His figure moved like sword shadows, piercing through Kuilang’s body.","But the other party didn’t even flinch.","His divine power didn’t weaken at all.","He was simply not an opponent.","“Then I’ll have to leave!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","His fighting spirit had been ignited, only to realize that his opponent was merely a mindless beast; there was little purpose in continuing the battle. It was a complete waste of time.","“Time to go!”","He sheathed the Wanjie Sword once again, the blue aura on his body boiling up to the deep blue state once more.","Couldn’t win? He could just escape, right?","Escaping was a skill he had mastered in the Qishen Temple.","From the first time he was captured by Bai Junwang to the later battles with Shen Ling, he had been caught every time.","But then, he had an epiphany.","The strongest secret technique was always reserved for self-preservation.","Seeing Jian Wushuang attempting to flee, Tanlang couldn’t hold back any longer.","If he didn’t act now, he would let down Kuilang.","“Wanna run?” Tanlang’s soft armor burst, his figure stretching to thousands of feet as he transformed into his first form, with his divine power reaching 550,000.","He intended to stop Jian Wushuang.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t even regard him as a threat.","“One Thought Universe!”","Buzz!","An oval-shaped universe instantly descended, enveloping half of the mountain range.","Jian Wushuang’s wings merged with the One Thought Universe.","“Three Quakes Universe!” His wings trembled, and his figure disappeared instantly.","Tanlang’s claw swiped through empty air. Not only could he not see Jian Wushuang’s figure, but he also couldn’t sense his aura.","“How is this possible?”","He looked up at the sky, feeling the shift in power.","He was completely stunned.","It was the embryonic form of the universe.","The most famous feature of the Ancient Wood Continent was the divine kingdom built by the Flame God.","Though they were special beings, they originally didn’t have their own Origin Source Universe.","However, he had managed to establish a universe that was no less than that of the Universe Master’s.","Within the Flame God’s universe, he could unleash the pinnacle power of the Eight Tribulations.","However, he couldn’t carry that universe with him, just like an ordinary Universe Master.","But for special beings like him, it was enough. Without the ultimate tribulation of the universe, just the tribulation of the divine body, he could delay as long as he wished.","Those who could contain their own Origin Source Universe were genuinely the masters of the Eight Tribulation.","But Jian Wushuang’s universe, though in its infancy, boasted a foundational strength far surpassing even that of Tanlang’s Origin Source Universe.","Even the Scattered Tribulation powerhouses watching this battle were stirred.","Witnessing Jian Wushuang’s manifestation of One Thought Universe with a single thought, they couldn’t help but think of the embryonic prototype universe constructed by the Flame God.","However, the prototype universe of the Flame God was impossible to contain.","For Jian Wushuang, a mere Emperor, to be able to contain a universe was astonishing.","Although it was just a prototype, it was enough to astonish anyone.","Building a prototype universe was nothing for Jian Wushuang.","The powerhouses observing the battle also believed Jian Wushuang had that capability.","But being able to contain a universe was somewhat out of the ordinary.","Many had already set their sights on Jian Wushuang.","Containing a universe?","How did he manage it?","That was a big question.","If there was a method, it could change the current situation.","“Yue Kingdom’s royal son-in-law?”","“Interesting!”","“After the Sacred Assembly, we must win over this guy and find out how he contained the universe!”","The Scattered Tribulation powerhouses, without a universe of their own, had lost much interest in containing one.","But those masters of the Sixth Tribulation needed such a method.","If they could contain a universe, they could explore temporal secrets with their Origin Source Universes, significantly enhancing their combat capabilities.","Sixth Tribulation Universe Masters could then venture into secret realms that were only accessible to Seventh Tribulation powerhouses.","The treasures obtained and the enhancements would be transformative.","Even Sword Immortal Tonghe was tempted. He had some acquaintance with Jian Wushuang, but compared to the ability to contain a universe, that acquaintance was negligible.","Even if it meant going to his real father, he would have to ask.","The Infinite Great World.","After several breaths, Jian Wushuang unleashed the Three Quake Universe tens of thousands of times and directly left the mountain range.","He had completely arrived in the Infinite World.","At this moment, he had no idea that his manifestation of his One Thought Universe had caused such a stir, otherwise, he would definitely not have exposed himself at this moment.","This was also Kuilang’s good fortune.","In a situation where he could only fight and not escape, Jian Wushuang still managed to kill his opponent.","Once he used the armor, he could unleash five times the power of the Beast God, amplifying his divine power to 650,000.","Combined with the seven hundred thousand divine power inside the Ancient Monastery Jade Urn, it was too easy to kill Kuilang.","After collecting a notion of the universe, just as he emerged from the mountains, he happened to encounter the head of the Li family sent by the Empress.","Wu Li was there too.","Elder Muchen, due to his serious injuries, had already gone ahead to the gathering point to recuperate.","“Jian Wushuang, you actually managed to escape!” The head of the Li family was somewhat astonished.","He knew the secrets of the Celestial Wolf Clan’s techniques very well because his Dao companion was the Holy Maiden of the Celestial Wolf Clan.","According to seniority, Kuilang still had to call him godfather.","But unfortunately, this unfilial son didn’t even acknowledge his own mother.","If Jian Wushuang knew the relationship between the two, he would probably curse loudly.","“Young nephew Wushuang, you are too modest. Speed is also a great strength. This time, being able to single-handedly confront two Universe Masters of the Fourth Tribulation, your reputation will surely soar after this. Many Seventh Tribulation powerhouses are also watching!” The head of the Li family exclaimed.","That was true.","However, Jian Wushuang didn’t care about this."]},{"number":5814,"title":"Chapter 5814: Ancient River","paragraphs":["Chapter 5814: Ancient River","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Once he departed, it was only natural that he would stir up pursuit from various quarters.","“Alright, let’s go. Many teams have already set off into the Infinite Great World, and we’re among the slowest batch!”","Jian Wushuang nodded and kept pace with the others, heading towards the assembly point at full speed.","Regardless, they weren’t the slowest.","There were still powerful beings from the Celestial Wolf Clan waiting for them!","But upon reaching the assembly point, Jian Wushuang realized that the Celestial Wolf Clan’s elites had already departed.","In other words, those from the Celestial Wolf Secret Realm had voluntarily abandoned Kuilang and Tanlang.","Presumably, Tanlang had transmitted the news back to the clan.","The strongest force among the Fourth Tribulations had been crippled, and there was no need to wait any longer.","Although Tanlang was still present, using innate secret techniques, it would take some time for him to recover.","It was inevitable to abandon them.","These discarded elites would be deemed failures and teleported away.","The assembly camp.","It was just a small city hastily built around an ancient teleportation array.","By now, there weren’t many powerful beings left.","Jian Wushuang followed the head of the Li family into a large courtyard where the empress had been waiting for some time.","Elder Muchen had also returned to his peak state.","“Now that everyone is here, let’s set off!” The Empress had already examined the pre-scouting map of the North Pole Icefield.","This time, her wait had been worthwhile.","Even if they were currently behind other teams, they could still surpass them eventually.","Just as Jian Wushuang caught his breath, he followed the empress once again through the teleportation array, truly entering the outskirts of the Infinite Great World.","But this time, there was the Empress herself overseeing the operation.","There was no need for him to carry the banner of resistance anymore.","They were relatively fortunate this time, as they were transported to the banks of an ancient river.","Although the river was inhabited by many wild beasts, fortunately, this place wasn’t some ancient relic.","There weren’t many hindrances.","Even when encountering wild beasts with 500,000 divine power, the Empress could easily slay them with a flick of her wrist.","It was almost like cutting through air.","Moreover, the Empress brought out an ancient boat, and everyone boarded it while she personally took the helm, leading them smoothly.","After a journey of a hundred days, they had already reached the depths of the periphery.","This speed probably ranked within the top three.","In a little while longer, they would reach the innermost part of the Infinite Great World.","That’s the central position.","During these days, Jian Wushuang also managed to recover the Life force he had lost.","Finally catching his breath after much difficulty.","He sat on the deck, enjoying a cup of tea with great contentment.","Four experts at the Fourth Tribulation took turns monitoring the surroundings.","Even the Universe Masters at the Third Tribulation patrolled the ancient boat.","Only the Emperor was the most relaxed.","The four Emperors hardly had anything to do, except for Jian Wushuang, who was resting in the cabin.","At this moment, there was no mood for cultivation.","Not only were they traveling, but they were also awaiting news.","The assessment of the Sacred Assembly was not merely about traversing the Inifinite Great World.","They also had to undertake many tasks.","Completing these tasks would earn them special treasures, only usable by the candidates for the Holy Maiden.","Once the candidates for the Four Holy Maidens were selected,","Then the special treasures obtained by other teams would become useless.","At this point, the candidates for the Four Great Holy Maidens would spare no effort to purchase these special treasures.","It was also a way to compensate those teams that weren’t selected.","This could be considered a significant gain.","However, after such a long time, the Ancient Wood Sect still hadn’t assigned them any tasks.","It’s unclear whether it was due to their bad luck, not being assigned, or some other reason.","Nevertheless, even so, they still had an advantage.","With the advance map marking the route to the treasure trove, they could acquire quite a few treasures.","So the Empress wasn’t in a rush for the mission, just focused on hurrying along the road.","To enter the North Pole Icefield early, that’s where the battle would take place.","On the deck, the Empress stood at the bow of the ship.","After Elder Muchen made a round of inspection, he reported the situation on both sides of the ancient river to the Empress and then withdrew.","“Wushuang, you seem relaxed!” Elder Muchen came to the table, not bothering with formalities, and sat down directly, pouring himself tea and drinking.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “There’s no time for relaxation. The last battle left behind many hidden dangers, and I’ve just recovered to my peak now!”","“Indeed, speaking of the last time, I have to thank you. If it weren’t for you, I might have perished!” Elder Muchen picked up his teacup, and he and Jian Wushuang drank a toast with tea instead of wine.","Just as the two were chatting, the ancient ship began to shake.","Elder Muchen’s face instantly turned serious.","“That damned dragon, why has it suddenly returned!” Elder Muchen’s expression changed drastically when he sensed that aura.","Jian Wushuang was surprised. “Dragon? There’s a dragon in this river?”","He didn’t know anything about it.","Elder Muchen only discovered the dragon while patrolling the banks of the ancient river.","But according to his estimation, that dragon should have gone ashore to lay eggs.","Why did it suddenly come back?","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel astonished at Elder Muchen’s reaction!","From the aura, Jian Wushuang deduced that the opponent possessed at least the strength of the Fifth Tribulation.","Their divine power was no less than 600,000.","This level of strength shouldn’t pose much of a problem for the Empress!","Moreover, seeing the Empress standing so calmly at the bow of the ship, there shouldn’t be any major issues.","Jian Wushuang stood up and looked down at the surging river below, curious about the strength of the dragon.","At that moment, Wu Li rushed out of the cabin and, seeing Jian Wushuang still gazing down at the river, quickly transmitted, “Be careful, Her Majesty’s true body isn’t on the ancient ship. That dragon is a big trouble!”","“What?” Jian Wushuang looked incredulously at the Empress’s back.","Then he glanced at Wu Li, first shocked, then showing a hint of curiosity in his eyes.","The Empress’s true body wasn’t on the ancient ship.","That meant the Empress standing at the bow of the ship was just a projection.","And he had no idea about it from start to finish.","He had no idea, yet Wu Li knew.","It was quite strange.","But now wasn’t the time to dwell on that; self-preservation was paramount.","“Master Li, stabilize the ancient ship first, and everyone else, into the cabin!” Elder Muchen didn’t care about the Empress’s projection and began giving orders to everyone.","Master Li, at this moment, also understood, inwardly cursing, but still complied.","Now that everyone was on the same boat, the Empress didn’t say a word, her true body left, without any prior notice.","It was really hard to swallow.","And it seemed that only one Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation remained.","The others had all followed the Empress outside.","Jian Wushuang followed Wu Li directly into the cabin, ignoring what was happening outside.","When disaster strikes, the tall ones take the hit.","This time, he wouldn’t foolishly rush out again.","After entering the cabin, Jian Wushuang dared to communicate with Wu Li.","From him, Jian Wushuang learned about the Empress’s whereabouts.","“Stealing dragon eggs!”","“A special mission?” Jian Wushuang cautiously communicated.","Wu Li nodded.","“Whose mission?”","“Jiuhu!”"]},{"number":5815,"title":"Chapter 5815: Run, Run, Run!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5815: Run, Run, Run!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Hearing this name, Jian Wushuang understood why Wu Li knew about the Empress leaving behind a clone.","The luck of their previous team was simply extraordinary.","First, Jinchen received a special mission.","Then it was Jiuhu’s turn.","The qualification token sent by the royal family this time was indeed a huge gain.","“Sending the Emperor’s main body for a task that requires only a few stars, and bringing along several Fourth Tribulation experts!” Jian Wushuang asked curiously.","Wu Li shook his head.","He really didn’t know about this.","But if the Empress was bringing so many people, it was probably at least a four-star special mission.","Before Jiuhu left, he only informed him of this matter and didn’t say anything else.","At this critical moment, Wu Li didn’t dare to ask too much.","“It looks like we’re steadily moving into the top four this time!”","Wu Li smiled slightly and nodded.","They were both delighted that the Empress could enter the top four.","This way, they could also get close to the Wanliu Divine Tree.","“Let’s wait for now!”","While the people in the cabin were still unaware of what had happened, the ancient river outside was churning with monstrous waves.","The dragon egg was stolen, no wonder the dragon was so furious.","But this was just the beginning.","They could only hope for the Empress now.","Originally, Jian Wushuang thought that the dragon only had a divine power of 600,000.","From the current situation, he underestimated this dragon.","Just after laying eggs, it could still be so powerful.","Perhaps at its peak, it already had the strength of a Half-Step Sixth Tribulation.","Even the Empress needed to bring along several Fourth Tribulation experts to steal the dragon egg, indicating that she didn’t have much confidence alone.","Boom!","The ancient ship shook once again.","It seemed like there was something underneath the ancient ship’s bottom.","The entire ancient ship was on the verge of capsizing.","The patriarch of the Li family, who maintained the ancient ship, wore a deeply troubled expression.","He was barely holding on.","The dragon, burning its essence, aimed to destroy the ancient ship.","A few more collisions, and the ancient ship would disintegrate.","Without the support of the ancient ship, he would have to flee for his life, let alone others.","With the empress still not returning, he could only relay through voice transmission to Wu Li, indicating that he couldn’t hold on much longer and to be prepared to escape at any moment.","“Your Majesty, you need to be faster!” Elder Muchen gritted his teeth, preparing to make the final decision.","Jian Wushuang leaned against the wall, feeling somewhat strange seeing Elder Muchen in agony.","If the ancient ship couldn’t hold on, then everyone should just escape separately.","There was no need to hesitate!","The Third Tribulation Realm Universe Masters in the cabin were originally just cannon fodder, their only purpose being to try their luck and serve as tools for missions.","Even if they were to fall, Elder Muchen didn’t need to be so indecisive!","Among these Universe Masters, only a few were members of royal families.","More of them were ancestors of family forces.","Once they fell, not only would they be finished, but their families would also be doomed.","They had always courted danger for riches and honor, so they couldn’t blame anyone else.","“Wushuang, let’s escape together later. It’s better to have someone to watch each other’s back!” Wu Li calmly transmitted his voice to Jian Wushuang.","He saw the situation most clearly.","He knew they couldn’t hold on for much longer, and the Empress wouldn’t return for a while.","The dragon’s lair wasn’t far from here.","With the empress’s speed, she could quickly return.","As for why she didn’t come back to save them...","Perhaps it was because of the mission that they couldn’t return.","Or perhaps, this dragon was intentionally sent by the Empress to sacrifice them to divert its attention and accomplish the mission.","That’s why Elder Muchen’s expression was so grim.","But in order for the Yue Kingdom to advance further, they could only sacrifice them now.","“Escape!” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed as he felt the ancient ship beginning to collapse.","First, he communicated with Wu Li, then with a single hand, he directly pulled Princess Jinchen over.","But when he pulled her over, he realized she was also just a clone.","Jian Wushuang cursed inwardly, ignoring the others, he directly broke open the cabin, scanned around, and rushed towards the giant wave ahead.","Wu Li followed closely behind him.","“Wait for this old man!” Elder Muchen knew that Jian Wushuang’s strength was extraordinary, perhaps even stronger than the patriarch of the Li family, so he immediately decided to escape with Jian Wushuang.","But the others were lost.","Scattered, they didn’t even know where to flee.","Seeing no hope, the patriarch of the Li family led a strong member of his clan and also rushed towards Jian Wushuang’s direction.","At this moment, they could only face the giant wave and flee forward.","Jian Wushuang plunged into the giant wave first.","The sky was already filled with thunderstorms, making it impossible to escape through the air.","They could only depart from the riverbed.","But the dragon was also lurking there.","After the ancient ship exploded and collapsed, many Universe Masters, who hadn’t yet escaped, were turned into smoke by the dragon’s thunderstorm domain.","More than twenty Universe Masters died instantly.","Especially the other two emperors, they died a miserable death.","No one went to rescue them.","And they couldn’t be saved anyway.","Jian Wushuang led the escape, diving with Jincheng into the depths of the ancient riverbed.","Because of their quick reaction, they avoided the attack from the dragon.","Behind him, Wu Li ran even faster than the head of the Li family.","None of them were foolish; they understood the danger. Who would dare to confront it head-on at this moment? It would be suicidal.","The empress was still able to fight.","Even with a few Universe Masters of the Fourth Tribulation joining forces, there was a chance of victory.","But having only one reluctant member of the Li family wasn’t nearly enough.","Jian Wushuang could tell that the vitality of the Li family’s head was strong, and his power was not low. If he were to fight desperately, he could still sustain the ancient ship.","However, as the head of the family, he wasn’t fighting alone.","If he fell, the Li family would be finished.","The so-called ten major families of Yue Kingdom actually had weak foundations.","Like the Li family, although they had produced a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation, that ancestor had long since fallen, leaving only two Fifth Scattered Tribulation experts in the family now.","As the strongest combat force of the family, how could he dare to risk his life?","And the heads of other families had already fallen. Their families would decline as well. Relying solely on Scattered Tribulation experts couldn’t sustain a family.","Jian Wushuang naturally understood this and harbored no resentment towards anyone.","He just felt that the empress’s actions this time were somewhat excessive.","Completing a special mission was fine.","Not informing them of the reason was also acceptable.","For the sake of secrecy, for safety.","All understandable.","But why lure the dragon here?","Drawing the tiger away from the mountain?","Reluctant to part with the child, unable to catch the wolf?","This was truly harming their own children.","Princess Jincheng was still on the ancient ship.","At this moment, following Jian Wushuang, she still looked puzzled, unaware of what was happening.","She could only follow Jian Wushuang in a confused escape.","“Family?” Jian Wushuang shook his head. What was even more ridiculous was the so-called glory!","The glory of a family was linked to its strength. Without strength, even in the strongest family, you were insignificant, liable to be abandoned at any time.","Better to fight alone, unburdened."]},{"number":5816,"title":"Chapter 5816: Infighting","paragraphs":["Chapter 5816: Infighting","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Only by following this path could one become the strongest.","No wonder Ruler Yun Zhi has become the Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation Realm, while the Empress remains at the Fifth Tribulation.","That’s the difference in their ambitions.","Before becoming the Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation, or perhaps after attaining that status, Queen Yun Zhi never interfered in the affairs of the Daughter Kingdom.","It was as if being a country’s ruler was merely a formality.","She cared little for power or prestige.","Her sole focus was on cultivation.","And it led to such remarkable achievements.","Then there’s the Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation from the Ancient Wood Sect.","Even in the face of significant events like the Holy Assembly, they remained unseen.","Always adventuring in foreign realms, keeping an extremely low profile.","On the other hand, their Sect Master was quite the opposite, overly conspicuous due to being stuck at the Scattered Tribulation with no room for advancement, only a pursuit of power left.","Yet, they ended up falling into Babidi’s clutches, now turned into a puppet.","Absolutely ridiculous.","Getting stronger has no shortcuts.","Jian Wushuang had always believed this.","To become powerful, one must exert absolute effort and diligence!","Without hard work, only scheming and shortcuts, one would eventually have to pay the price.","Glancing at the bewildered Jincheng, he suddenly felt pity for him.","Despite his affluent background, he lacked true freedom.","Forced into marriage with someone he didn’t love.","And now even being used as a pawn by his own mother.","Muchen, that big fool, even deliberately kept it from him.","That’s what infuriated Jian Wushuang the most.","So much so that when it came time to escape, he didn’t even bother acknowledging him.","At least a heads-up on matters concerning life and death would have been appreciated!","They fled aimlessly, devoid of direction.","They didn’t know where to go.","Underneath this ancient river, it resembled a continent.","Numerous tribes inhabited it.","Beasts roamed freely.","The sky was barricaded by thunderstorms, and even as they delved into the river’s depths, they encountered equally formidable beasts.","They could only suppress their breath and continue to dive deeper.","“Where are we going?” Jin Chen surveyed the breathtaking scenery of the riverbed.","The more beautiful something appeared, the more danger it often concealed.","Jian Wushuang swiftly pulled Jinchen behind him and exclaimed loudly, “Be careful!”","A red tentacle shot out from the water grass, carrying a certain toxin that, if Emperor were to come into contact with it, would instantly prove fatal.","Sharp tentacles lunged towards Jian Wushuang’s chest, prompting him to roar angrily and lift the arm of the Candle Dragon, swatting away the tentacle’s attack with a single hand.","Dragging Jinchen along, they didn’t venture deeper into the riverbed but instead fled towards the chaotic pile ahead.","Now wasn’t the time to rest; the dragon might catch up at any moment.","Other savage beasts lurked here, and engaging them would only slow them down.","As they fled, Jian Wushuang reminded Wu Li not to lag behind.","The tentacle they just encountered was definitely a beast at the Fourth Tribulation.","Wu Li couldn’t afford to die!","As for the fate of Elder Muchen and the others, he couldn’t concern himself with that.","Startled by the message, Wu Li increased his speed once more.","The danger of this Sacred Assembly far exceeded his expectations.","He had initially thought that with his strength, he could easily rank in the middle and survival wouldn’t be an issue.","Yet since arriving in the Infinite Great World, whether it was encountering the Special Life Forms at the start or the strength of the Celestial Wolf Clan, he found himself outmatched.","Several times, he almost revealed his true strength.","His trump card differed from Jian Wushuang’s. Once exposed, he feared that the outside powerhouses wouldn’t sit idly by.","Even the people of the Ancient Wood Sect might make an exception and enter the Infinite Great World to hunt him down.","So, he couldn’t use it unless absolutely necessary.","For now, he just needed to follow Jian Wushuang. He acknowledged Jian Wushuang’s strength.","Apart from the Empress, Jian Wushuang was undoubtedly the strongest.","Even stronger than a Universe Master at the Fourth Tribulation.","This information was imparted to him by the mysterious figure within him.","As long as he followed Jian Wushuang, there was hope for survival.","Having chosen Jian Wushuang, he didn’t care about anything else.","Following him was the right choice.","Upon reaching the pile of rocks, Jian Wushuang hesitated for a moment before plunging in.","The stones were massive, with narrow crevices. Inside felt more like a maze.","These stones seemed to have fallen from the mountains on both sides of the ancient river. Indeed, they could block many of the colossal beasts lurking at the riverbed.","As he stepped in, Wu Li followed closely behind. Others capable of escaping also rushed in after Jian Wushuang, like headless flies. However, there weren’t many survivors left.","The Patriarch of the Li Family, along with the remnants of four Universe Masters, joined Jian Wushuang and the others.","Only nine remained, losing half of their manpower in an instant.","The blow was quite significant.","Once inside the pile of rocks, Jian Wushuang finally breathed a sigh of relief.","In a natural stalactite cave, their figure came to a halt.","It was the interior of a massive rock.","There was no water inside, incredibly smooth all around, with water droplets continuously dripping from above.","Crash!","Jian Wushuang had just steadied his figure when the water surface inside the giant rock was consecutively broken, and several figures rushed in together.","Though he ran fast, the people behind him weren’t slow either.","Because Jian Wushuang still had to think about escaping in that direction, those following him didn’t need to use their brains.","Now it seemed he had indeed chosen the right person.","Running to this place, he shouldn’t encounter that dragon anymore.","This pile of rocks wasn’t just an ordinary pile of stones.","It looked more like countless towering mountains piled together.","Breaking through that dragon wouldn’t be so easy.","“Brother Muchen, you need to explain what’s going on here,” the head of the Li family stared darkly at Elder Muchen. If it weren’t for the special nature of this place, allowing outsiders to observe their every move, he would have slaughtered Elder Muchen.","Although the head of the Li family was angry, he could still control his emotions.","After all, this time, it wasn’t their own people who died.","His clansmen had been brought out by him.","But the luck of other strong individuals wasn’t as good.","The Jiang family!","Though they didn’t have a Universe Master of the Fourth Tribulation, they had four Universe Masters of the Third Tribulation presiding over them.","This time in the Sacred Assembly, three of the Jiang family’s Four Guardians came.","But just now, two of them fell in an instant.","Jiang Zhen, the second of the Jiang family, couldn’t contain his anger, “Muchen, do you know that this time, you caused the death of my eldest brother and fourth brother? Why isn’t it you who died!”","Jiang Zhen directly rushed forward, grabbing Elder Muchen by his collar, his eyes filled with murderous intent.","Seeing this scene, Jian Wushuang sneered inwardly, having no intention of helping.","Elder Muchen deserved this.","He should have spoken earlier.","If he had spoken earlier, not so many people would have died.","Now, half of them were dead in an instant.","The remaining people could only survive in this stalactite cave.","“Jiang Zhen, don’t forget the agreement. Coming to the Sacred Assembly is to assist Her Majesty the Empress. Do you think only your Jiang family lost people?” Elder Muchen retorted, pushing Jiang Zhen away.","In reality, he himself felt that what the Empress did this time was somewhat excessive.","It chilled the hearts of everyone."]},{"number":5817,"title":"Chapter 5817: Pushing the Blame","paragraphs":["Chapter 5817: Pushing the Blame","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Since ancient times, imperial emperors have been the most ruthless.","To the Empress, wiping out family influences entirely was for the best. That’s how imperial power could remain secure.","But Muchen was just a lazy prince, albeit an elder of the seven star sect, and his heart wasn’t hardened enough.","Though he put on a tough front, there was some guilt festering deep within.","“Brother Li Sheng, at this point, it’s not about decisions. I didn’t expect that dragon to suddenly attack the ancient ship. The Emperor didn’t inform anyone before leaving, there must have been hidden reasons!” Elder Muchen explained reluctantly.","But the head of the Li family wasn’t easily fooled. He retorted coldly, “So many people died, and you’re just brushing it off with ‘at this point’?”","At this moment, even the Universe Master of the Qingyun Sect wasn’t siding with Muchen.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang pulled Jinchen aside.","Wu Li had long since distanced himself, ignoring Muchen.","At this moment, Muchen found himself isolated by everyone.","Though he couldn’t act directly.","But they couldn’t just keep hiding here. When they left, someone had to lead the way.","Some threats needed to be faced.","With his tough fa?ade crumbling, Muchen sighed, “Everyone, we haven’t even entered the inner circle yet. We can’t fight amongst ourselves!”","“Muchen, we’re not making things difficult for you. Since it’s the Emperor’s wish, why don’t you lead us to find her now, reunite with her, and then continue on the journey? What do you think?” Li Sheng spread his hands, seemingly opening up the discussion, but in reality, he was putting Muchen in a difficult spot.","Find the Empress?","Where to even start?","Muchen clearly had no idea.","“Dao Friends, what was our original intention?”","Muchen began to change the subject, continuing, “We are here for the glory of Yue Kingdom. This action by the Emperor is crucial. What we need to do now is support her. Once the Emperor becomes the Holy Maiden, I don’t think I need to explain the benefits to you, right?”","On the side, Jiang Zhen couldn’t help but sneer when he heard this. “You’ve got some nerve. All the benefits go to your royal family first. I won’t say much about that. But you want us to take the fall. How do you explain that?”","“Opportunities always require sacrificing some individuals! Since all of you are still alive and well, we must continue to fight!” Muchen tried to blur the issue, but the more he spoke, the more absurd it became.","Jiang Zhen’s eyes twitched with anger as he cursed, “Then why don’t you go die?”","Seeing everyone bickering, Princess Jincheng stepped forward.","“Elders, may I have a word?” Jincheng’s eyes were resolute as she stared at everyone.","Jian Wushuang wanted to intervene but it was too late.","Her interference would only breed animosity.","It would be better to say nothing.","This matter was originally Muchen’s problem.","It’s better to let Muchen take the blame alone.","As long as the Empress returns, everything will no longer be a problem.","Do these people dare to question the Empress?","Now that Jincheng has stepped forward, drawing attention to herself, all eyes are on her.","“I would have forgotten about you both if you hadn’t spoken up!” Jiang Zhen turned to Jian Wushuang, ignoring Jincheng.","Jian Wushuang sighed inwardly, trouble follows where the wind blows.","If he didn’t know Jincheng’s character, he might have suspected this fool of scheming against him.","Pointing at Jian Wushuang, Jiang Zhen spoke, “When we were escaping, you were the fastest, and you came straight to this pile of rocks. Did you already know about this?”","With these words, Li Sheng also looked over.","Muchen remained silent as if he were dead, not speaking.","“Uncle Jiang, I didn’t even know about the ambush, let alone...” Jinchen’s words were cut off by Jiang Zhen.","Jiang Zhen shouted, “You little girl, you have no right to speak here. If you don’t give me an explanation today, don’t blame me for turning hostile!”","He didn’t dare to act against Muchen, but he wouldn’t hesitate to act against Jian Wushuang?","If they didn’t do something today, wouldn’t they become mere cannon fodder?","Allowing the royal family to oppress them in the future.","“Enough!” Jian Wushuang could feel the heat of the situation about to engulf him, so he had to step forward to take charge.","His aura shook, a hidden force erupted. In this narrow space, his divine power burst forth briefly, forcing the crowd back several steps.","A crimson divine power surrounded Jian Wushuang’s body, and the Beast God mark on his forehead became even more dazzling.","“You want explanations? Go ask Her Majesty. What’s the point of all this bickering?” His voice resonated with a deep, commanding tone, weighing heavily on everyone’s chest.","Jiang Zhen had heard about Jian Wushuang’s immense strength long before, but witnessing it firsthand was another matter entirely. Now, seeing Jian Wushuang’s power surpass even Li Sheng’s, he found himself unable to voice his thoughts.","Seeing Jiang Zhen silent, Jian Wushuang turned his gaze towards Li Sheng, his eyes flashing with killing intent.","Li Sheng stood his ground, feeling the threat emanating from Jian Wushuang. He knew that one more word out of place would provoke Jian Wushuang into action.","Survival was paramount at the moment. Initially, he had thought to leverage this situation to investigate the matters of the royal family. But now, with the Empress absent, a mere Emperor like Jian Wushuang could still intimidate them.","“Alright, since everything’s settled, listen to what I have to say!” Jian Wushuang withdrew his Beast God power, casually finding a rock to sit on. He spoke calmly, “Right now, our priority is to rendezvous with the Emperor. The Ancient River is teeming with countless savage beasts, many at the level of the Fourth Tribulation Realm. It’s not something we can easily traverse.”","Mu Chen, seeing Jian Wushuang handle both Li Sheng and Jiang Zhen, cleared his throat and chimed in, “Nephew Wushuang is right. Meeting with Her Majesty is paramount!”","“Don’t you know where Her Majesty is?” Jian Wushuang didn’t bother to hide his displeasure this time. Being abandoned earlier and the deliberate concealment of the Empress’s whereabouts on the ancient ship had left him feeling deceived.","He hadn’t settled scores over this matter yet!","Li Sheng and Jiang Zhen noticed a rift between Jian Wushuang and Muchen. They couldn’t discern if it was genuine or a facade.","If it was genuine, then Muchen might be the sole bearer of the truth.","“I’ve tried, but I can’t reach my mother!” Jinchen exclaimed anxiously.","At these words, everyone took a deep breath.","They couldn’t even contact their own kin.","How were they supposed to find her?","Jian Wushuang knew the Empress was probably on a special mission. It was normal not to reach her now.","All they could do was wait.","Wait for the Empress to complete her special mission and come back to them.","But they didn’t know how long this wait would be.","When he completed the Emperor’s mission initially, it only took him the time to burn an incense stick.","If it weren’t for the complicated task, a simple battle might not have even taken that long.","And it was a five-star mission.","Even the mission Jiuhu received, a universe-level four-star, would likely take a long time.","Especially with the Empress intentionally diverting the attention of the dragon.","The task was definitely not simple."]},{"number":5818,"title":"Chapter 5818 Conversion Pill","paragraphs":["Chapter 5818 Conversion Pill","The time needed, perhaps short if only a few days, but even a hundred years wouldn’t be surprising.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t afford to wait for a hundred years.","A hundred years might not count as time in the outside world.","But here, in this place, a hundred years could mean encountering countless savage beasts.","Even the stalactite caves here weren’t absolutely safe.","If they encountered a savage beast attack, they would have to flee like headless flies.","And that dragon was still eyeing them!","It could find them at any moment.","In the past, he thought he could face the Fifth Tribulations with a single battle.","But here, it was the Infinite Great World.","Whether it was the Universe Master or these savage beasts.","None of them were simple.","And everyone had their own hidden cards.","Not just him.","Others too.","And the savage beasts as well.","He couldn’t judge the strength of his opponents based on common standards anymore.","Just like Kuilang, he initially thought the opponent’s strength was at most 600,000.","But in the end, at the cost of losing his sanity, he burst out with 680,000 divine power, and that was just a Universe Master at the Fourth Tribulation.","As for a Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation, let alone mentioning.","Even the top Universe Masters at the Fifth Tribulations had a minimum of 600,000 divine power, and with just a casual burst, they could exceed 700,000.","Take that dragon for example.","Although it didn’t have the power of the Origin Source Universe, its bloodline power was extremely strong, possibly descended from a true dragon.","Even the Empress feared enough to lead it away.","With just them, a bunch of insignificant beings, if they were really caught by the dragon, they probably wouldn’t even know how they died.","This place was still too close to where the ancient ship was destroyed.","And the aura of these human strongmen was very conspicuous at the bottom of the ancient river.","The riverbed was filled with the aura of savage beasts, even if they hid well, they would still be discovered.","Jian Wushuang was confident in his ability to deceive others, but not everyone shared his skill. Instead of waiting to be cornered, he believed in taking proactive measures.","That was his plan.","“The supreme secret technique of the Transformation Dao!” Jian Wushuang began to calculate in his mind.","Regardless of others, he had to ensure the safety of Wu Li and Jinchen at least.","He had promised Queen Yun Zhi to protect her. This was his chance to repay the favor.","Although Wu Li was more crucial, the other party also held significant secrets. Jian Wushuang could feel the vitality emanating from Wu Li, which had only grown stronger since entering the Infinite Great World.","That power didn’t belong to him. It was someone else’s secret, and he dared not inquire further.","He could only prepare for contingencies.","“Afterlife Conversion Pill!” After a long silence, he uttered the name.","It was a secret technique of the Transformation Dao, spoken of in legends from the Moro Spacetime.","He had heard of it from the inheritance of the First True King.","His own Transformation Dao had evolved from the Eternal Variations of the Three Kings, with some modifications to become the Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Now, he aimed to reverse the Transformation Dao and turn it into a pill formula.","By refining the Afterlife Conversion Pill, others could conceal their human aura and blend in underwater.","However, it would take time.","Originally a legendary secret technique of the Transformation Dao, mastering it would require time.","Moreover, he needed to reverse the technique into a pill formula and then refine it into a pill, which would take a full cycle—ten days at the earliest.","If the Empress responded in ten days, it would be ideal.","It was his way of being prepared for any outcome.","If there was still no word from the Empress by then, they would proceed with refining the conversion pill, and everyone would transform into demons together.","Only this way could he survive.","Jian Wushuang laid out the entire situation.","He didn’t care if these people opposed it or had any opinions.","After all, he wasn’t prepared to refine for these people anyway.","“Transformation Pill?”","Li Sheng furrowed his brow slightly, asking cautiously, “Friend Wushuang, if one were to undergo transformation, can they revert back?”","Turning into a demon.","This was something many people found hard to accept.","Jian Wushuang didn’t conceal anything either, and replied directly, “The possibility is very low, but even if you transform into demons, your Origin Source Universe won’t change, and your divine power might even enhance because of it.”","“How confident are you?” Li Sheng gritted his teeth, as if he had made a decision.","Compared to his own life, becoming a demon didn’t matter.","After all, their strength wouldn’t change.","“Not even thirty percent!” Jian Wushuang extended three fingers, then continued, “I still need a lot of materials from savage beasts, preferably ancient savage beasts at the level of the Fourth Tribulation realm!”","Before the pill formula was calculated, he had already arranged the task of gathering materials.","Upon hearing this, they were astonished. “Only thirty percent?”","“Hmph, even that thirty percent depends on whether the materials from savage beasts are up to par. If the materials are too poor, there’s no hope for that thirty percent. I need time to prepare the pill formula now. You all have only ten days. If you don’t have enough materials, then you’ll all be in deep trouble!” Jian Wushuang half-threatened.","It’s not surprising he’s ruthless.","It’s just that his abilities are limited.","And there’s Elder Muchen, that big unreliable guy.","If he had been informed earlier about the Empress’s movements, he could have prepared in advance.","Wu Li also had questions; the Empress had fled without informing him.","Now, with only them remaining, they could only fend for themselves.","“I’ll figure something out about the materials,” Li Sheng finally compromised.","He had two younger members of his family behind him, the hope of their lineage.","Glancing back at the two inexperienced juniors behind him, Li Sheng’s tone softened as he continued, “I can’t handle the materials alone; I need others to cooperate.”","“Of course, besides Princess Jinchen, you can choose whoever you want,” Jian Wushuang generously declared, waving his hand and handing over the authority to Li Sheng.","Surveying the rest, Li Sheng concluded, “Wu Li, Muchen, Jiang Zhen, and this friend from Qingyun Sect, come with me!”","The remaining four included two Universe Masters from the Li family, aside from Jian Wushuang and Princess Jinchen.","Upon hearing that the patriarch wouldn’t take them, the two Li family juniors, a boy and a girl, couldn’t help but step forward, but words failed them at the last moment.","They had been too well protected in Yue Kingdom; even during the Emperor’s reign, they had the protection of the Scattered Tribulation experts from the family during their ventures outside.","Now, facing absolute suppression, they had no confidence whatsoever.","Their divine powers were both under 400,000; their ability to preserve themselves in the depths of the Ancient River was too weak.","If they were to go out, they might not survive three days.","Li Sheng glanced at them, a rare warmth appearing in his eyes, as he calmly said, “Don’t worry, stay here and assist Wushuang’s friend. Follow their lead.”","It was a skillful way of putting it.","To Jian Wushuang, the two Universe Masters left behind were no better than the soldiers at the bottom of the river; keeping them here would only be a burden.","Initially, he had thought of reducing the manpower during this trip for materials.","That way, he could better manage these people and stall for time while waiting for the Empress.","The Infinite Great World was nothing but a colossal arena."]},{"number":5819,"title":"Chapter 5819 Successive Deaths","paragraphs":["Chapter 5819 Successive Deaths","Not only did they have to contend with various forces, but they also had to contend with the native powerhouses within the boundless world.","Those ancient beasts, Special Life Forms, and even some ruins and forbidden areas posed great dangers.","In such a world, to stay ahead, they needed to push themselves to the limit.","Those with weak strength would promptly give up when faced with danger.","Bringing the Emperor along was just to make up the numbers.","If they were lucky, they might receive a mission.","For example, Jinchen had received a five-star mission.","Even if he fell this time, it wouldn’t be a loss.","Although Jian Wushuang didn’t agree in his heart, faced with reality, he had to accept it.","Even he himself had tacitly accepted the law of survival of the fittest.","No one wanted to be a burden.","Everyone wanted to be carefree.","“Alright, you’d better kill three ancient beasts at the level of Fourth Tribulation within ten days, or a hundred ancient beasts at the level of Third Tribulation. Make sure to collect all the materials needed for the transformation pill, don’t even miss their fur and skin!” Jian Wushuang actually didn’t know the recipe for the conversion pill, but just to be safe, he instructed them to collect all the materials.","When he refined them later, he would use what he needed, and what he didn’t need would be fine, anyway, he wasn’t the one going to kill those ancient beasts.","Li Sheng didn’t say much, just nodded.","The others took a deep breath, then one by one jumped into the water pool.","Jiang Zhen also showed some understanding of the situation and didn’t say much, obediently following Li Sheng.","The five set off together.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged, closing his eyes.","In the Origin Source Starry Sky.","Floating in his own universe, feeling extremely comfortable.","“Ancient Evolution!”","He clenched his fists, continuously stimulating his origin!","“Ah!!!” The powerful starry sky energy instantly covered his whole body.","His strength increased several times over.","“Phew!”","The greatness of Eternal Ancient Transformation lay in the power of the Starry Sky.","The transformation technique was only an auxiliary function.","If he used the power of All Things to perform the Eternal Ancient Transformation.","It was not much different from the Eternal Ancient Transformation; the amplified power had its limits.","The key to the Eternal Ancient Transformation lay in the power of the Starry Sky.","But what was the key to this transformation?","Jian Wushuang retracted the Eternal Transformation and, after returning to normal, began to peruse some of the secret techniques related to the previous transformation.","It seemed leisurely, but it was quite challenging.","Ten days was too short.","He had to hurry.","This place could be discovered at any time.","While he was in seclusion, a bloody battle erupted deep in the Ancient River.","Li Sheng led his men from the west bank of the Gu River to the east bank, even spilling onto the shores.","This massacre quickly attracted several beasts of the fourth tribulation level.","Originally, their plan was to quickly kill hundreds of Third Tribulation level beasts.","That was quite simple for them.","They just feared provoking those ancient Fourth Tribulation level beasts.","The Third Tribulation level beasts at the bottom of the river were actually not very powerful.","Their divine power was only a little over 300,000.","Elder Muchen and Wu Li could easily kill them with a flick of their hands.","Even dealing with these beasts together was more than enough.","But that was single combat.","They were not facing one or two, but dozens surrounding them.","Although Li Sheng was powerful, he couldn’t take advantage of dozens of beasts at the same time.","After a day, they only managed to kill a dozen or so.","And they even provoked several Fourth Tribulation beasts.","Just as they were preparing for a desperate fight.","Thunderclouds appeared overhead.","“It’s a dragon! As per the original plan, scatter and flee!” They had anticipated encountering a dragon long ago, but they hadn’t expected it so soon.","The five of them scattered and fled.","The domain of the dragon had just arrived, and before the real body of the dragon arrived, they had vanished.","But as long as they were in this domain, they couldn’t escape the dragon’s pursuit.","“You damned human cultivators, you shall all die!” The real form of the dragon descended, immediately targeting Li Sheng, who was the fastest to flee.","The massive dragon tail swept directly towards Li Sheng.","Fortunately, Li Sheng was fast enough to dodge it smoothly.","The dragon tail struck the stone wall of the riverbed, directly shattering the mountain.","Many unlucky beasts were instantly obliterated.","“You can’t escape!” The dragon transformed into a human form, its speed increased, and it rushed to the nearest Universe Master of the Qingyun Sect. With one claw, it crushed the opponent’s Origin Source.","A fifth tribulation realm powerhouse killing those of the Third Tribulation was like adults bullying children.","There were no secret techniques involved, just simple and brutal, one-hit kills.","It was like when Jian Wushuang used the Wanjie Sword to kill those Third Tribulation Universe Masters.","Feeling the fall of his comrades, Li Sheng’s face turned ashen, his heart filled with despair.","However, there was no time for him to dwell on it. He seized the opportunity and unleashed his divine power, exerting all his strength to break out of the domain.","Others, too, showed no mercy at this moment, bursting forth with all their might to break free from the domain.","Exhausting nearly 30 percent of his divine power in the process, he desperately escaped, but his own combat strength plummeted to its lowest.","Just as he broke out of the domain, he encountered a savage beast at the Fourth Tribulation.","Despair etched across his face, he roared in anger, “Even if I fall, I refuse to perish at the hands of you beasts!”","“Ah!!!!”","With clenched fists, he ignited all his divine power.","His entire being transformed into a blazing sun, unleashing boundless divine power.","The savage beast at the Fourth Tribulation hastily retreated, cursing angrily, “I haven’t even made a move yet, why are you in such a hurry!”","Yet, he too met his demise.","Little did he expect that he would choose to self-destruct before his death.","His death inadvertently bought some time for the others.","Taking advantage of the situation, Muchen made his way ashore, disappearing into the jungle of the mountains.","Jian Wushuang’s plan was too idealistic.","Or perhaps, they had underestimated the situation.","In the span of a day, among the five of them, two had perished.","Muchen fled far away ashore.","Wu Li’s whereabouts were unknown amidst the chaos.","Only Li Sheng, dragging his heavily injured body, returned to the chaotic pile of rocks.","Spurt!","As soon as he surfaced from the water, Li Sheng spat out a mouthful of blood from his chest.","He collapsed in a heap, directly onto the ground.","Jinchen was startled and quickly stood up.","The two Universe Masters from the Li family hurriedly stepped forward to examine the injuries of their ancestor.","Jian Wushuang remained unfazed, continuing to search for information on the formula for the Conversion Pill.","It was Wu Li’s absence that troubled him. He tried to contact him through voice transmission, but to no avail.","Fortunately, he could still sense the karmic presence of the other party; they probably hadn’t died yet.","In hindsight, he shouldn’t have let Wu Li go.","Things were getting worse now.","The Sacred Assembly was even more dangerous than he had imagined.","Actually, they didn’t need to be this exhausted.","If the Empress were here, within this ancient river, as long as there were no Sixth Tribulation savage beasts or Special Life Forms, they could almost walk sideways.","But unfortunately, the Empress had abandoned them halfway.","“Sigh!” Jian Wushuang sighed, opening his eyes and glancing at Li Sheng’s injuries. He gathered a trace of life force in his palm, hesitated for a moment, then gave up.","He couldn’t save people.","If the Life force were discovered by powerful observers from the outside world, it would be over."]},{"number":5820,"title":"Chapter 5820: Personally Taking Action","paragraphs":["Chapter 5820: Personally Taking Action","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Only a few paid attention to Jian Wushuang and his companions now; the gaze of the formidable was mostly fixed on the Shi Kingdom’s contingent.","On the outskirts of the Infinite Great World, where danger was sparse, his few battles had garnered some attention.","However, with all teams now entering the periphery of the Infinite Great World, and even venturing deeper into it, battles at the level of Fifth Tribulation had occurred hundreds of times.","There were hardly any who still cared about the exploits of an Emperor.","But the lack of attention on Jian Wushuang didn’t mean that no one was interested in others from the Yue Kingdom.","Take the Empress, for instance!","“That Empress of the Yue Kingdom is quite ruthless, abandoning even her own daughter and brother!” Many powerful beings kept a watchful eye on the Empress of the Yue Kingdom.","Being a popular candidate naturally drew considerable attention.","In the radiance of the Empress, Jian Wushuang seemed somewhat insignificant.","The Empress was truly dazzling now, secluded within a special hidden realm. It was a special mission entrusted to her by Jiuhu, of cosmic level danger.","Even with the Empress’s immense strength, caution was paramount.","Moreover, this time, she faced a task equivalent to five stars.","Once accomplished, her place among the top four would be secured, the prerequisite for contending for the final position of the Holy Maiden.","For this position, Empress Fengchen had prepared for countless epochs.","As her peers advanced to the level of Seventh Tribulation Universe Masters, she remained merely a Fifth Tribulation Universe Master.","Such a gap in strength was unbearable to someone with such strong pride.","This time, not only did she aim to become the Holy Maiden, but she also intended to make a breakthrough to the Sixth Tribulation level in the eyes of countless others.","By then, her name would resound throughout the Ancient Wood Continent, elevating the status of the Yue Kingdom to new heights.","This was not only her wish but also the expectation of the ancestors within the royal family.","For how many years had it been since the Yue Kingdom produced a Sixth Tribulations Universe Master?","“This time, it must be seized.”","Now, it seemed that the Empress had indeed seized it.","In that secret realm, she first stole the dragon egg, and then used it to lure out a Special Life Form.","That was the core of this mission.","Almost every special task could involve a bunch of strong individuals.","Her task was not to kill that Special Life Form, but to help the other seek revenge.","To assist the other in unifying that secret realm.","This difficulty was significant.","It wasn’t as simple as killing one or two Fifth Tribulation savage beasts.","It was about waging war in this secret realm for a period of time.","It might waste time, but once the mission was completed, she would obtain the pioneer map and the treasure of becoming a Holy Maiden.","These were worth her effort.","She just hadn’t expected how miserable those abandoned people would be now.","Li Sheng fell into a deep sleep.","Although he had special treasures, it would still take some time for him to recover.","Fortunately, when he returned, he brought materials from dozens of savage beasts.","These materials provided Jian Wushuang with an opportunity to practice.","Although the alchemy method was not perfect, he could still try to practice.","He didn’t expect to succeed in one try.","He couldn’t be too impatient.","Otherwise, all previous efforts would be in vain.","“You two, don’t just stand around. Help me suck out the demonic energy from those materials!” Jian Wushuang commanded the remaining two Universe Masters.","He alone was a bit overwhelmed.","Jinchen could only hurry to assist, unable to help much.","Several days passed.","He failed several times in succession.","The only successful attempt had the opposite effect of what he had expected from the medicine.","It turned the savage beasts into human medicines.","He could only start over.","But now the materials were running low.","Sending those two Universe Masters forward would be sending them to their deaths.","This time he had to go himself.","“You two stay here and wait. I’ll set up a barrier. Once touched, I’ll receive a message and rush back immediately. Don’t go out, if Wu Li comes back, tell him not to come in first, wait for me underwater!” Jian Wushuang instructed, then plunged into the pool.","Below the water pool, navigating through the jumble of rocks, he eventually reached the depths of the riverbed.","To be on the safe side, he didn’t stray too far.","He could only hunt some wild beasts in the vicinity.","That dragon should have gone far away.","But he couldn’t afford to be too careless.","The dragon’s speed was fast; even if it was far from him, it could quickly find him.","However, his divine power was different from others’.","He could completely restrain it.","This way, the dragon wouldn’t detect him.","Quickly searching for targets, because of his experience in refining pills, he knew which kind of wild beasts were more suitable.","“Let’s start with you!”","Jian Wushuang suppressed his breath, turning himself into a blue stream of air, drifting towards a strange-looking beast hidden in the distant water grass.","This savage beast had a divine power of up to 400,000, nearly breaking through to the Fourth Tribulation realm.","Its intelligence was no different from that of ordinary people.","But facing Jian Wushuang, it didn’t sense any danger at all.","Jian Wushuang silently appeared behind it.","Swish!","In an instant, his breath soared to 500,000, his hand forming a blade, and with a single slash, he directly split the strange savage beast into two halves, its Origin Source and divine power instantly weakening.","It died without knowing who struck it.","It could be considered a peaceful end.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand, collected the remains of the savage beast, and once again transformed his figure into a stream of air, searching for the next target.","According to his plan, gathering ten heads would be enough.","With another ten savage beasts, he could almost refine the conversion pill.","As long as he had the transformation pill, he would take Jinchen and leave this place.","He just didn’t know where Wu Li had gone.","But as long as the other party wasn’t dead, he could find him.","Guided by karma, the other party wasn’t too far from him.","As for the missing Muchen, he could sense that the other party should be on the riverbank, but his breath was continuously weakening, sometimes present, sometimes not. There was a high probability that he was trapped in some ruins.","Whether he could survive depended on his own luck.","He hadn’t intended to rescue them.","After the way they had betrayed him this time, Elder Muchen thought they deserved their fate, even if it meant his own death.","It was a perfect opportunity to offer himself up to the Yue Kingdom.","Deep in the valley far from the riverbank, Elder Muchen found himself truly trapped within an ancient relic.","Venturing into this place recklessly, he suddenly found himself unable to leave.","Furthermore, his divine power was cut off, leaving him utterly powerless.","Here, he was as if calling upon the heavens with no response, invoking the earth with no answer.","He could only grit his teeth and continue forward.","Initially, he had hoped to test his luck.","If, by chance, there were no dangers in the valley, he could safely endure until the Empress returned.","But luck wasn’t on his side. He hadn’t gone far before stumbling upon an ancient relic of a sect.","Though only remnants of its formations remained, with his meager strength, he couldn’t hope to break through.","Instead, he found himself sinking deeper and deeper.","Stopping was out of the question, yet he couldn’t resign himself to this fate. He wanted to take one more gamble."]},{"number":5821,"title":"Chapter 5821: Pathetic and Lamentable","paragraphs":["Chapter 5821: Pathetic and Lamentable","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Unfortunately, his luck took a turn for the worse as he once again misjudged the direction, stumbling into a crevice that devoured him whole, leaving no trace behind, except for his demise.","The Wood King from the Yue Kingdom vanished from then on.","The Yue Kingdom’s ranks dwindled once more.","Meanwhile, both the outer and inner teams within the Infinite Great World continued to diminish.","Several Universe Masters of the Fourth Tribulation fell.","The tasks assigned by the Ancient Wood Sect this time were unusually numerous.","Many people spared no effort in their endeavors.","Naturally, casualties were abundant.","However, no Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation had yet fallen.","There were few dangers in the outer regions that could threaten Universe Masters of the Fifth Tribulation.","As for the Sixth Tribulation level of savage beasts, there were probably none in the outer regions, perhaps a few in the inner regions, but the chance of encountering them was even lower than becoming a Sixth Tribulation being.","In the core region, there might be quite a few Sixth Tribulation savage beasts.","But nearing the end, no one would venture around aimlessly; they would all be focused on reaching the finish line.","Their opportunities lay in the outer and inner regions.","In the core zone, even a slight misstep could lead to the downfall of a Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation.","No one dared to linger.","Everyone pressed forward with all their might.","Many found themselves trapped in dire situations.","Just like Jian Wushuang and his companions, caught between a rock and a hard place.","Beneath the river’s surface, amidst the chaotic water grass, numerous aquatic serpents writhed, their powers insignificant, their divine strength not even reaching 10,000.","Yet, despite their feebleness, as long as they were savage beasts, they could survive underwater.","Among these serpents, there was a current of air, constantly swirling.","“I can’t believe it didn’t take the bait!”","Jian Wushuang sighed, deciding to give up.","Among the aquatic serpents, there was a Fourth Tribulation savage beast, with divine strength of around 500,000.","He had initially intended to lure the opponent into his trap using those serpents.","However, the savage beast paid no attention whatsoever.","A direct confrontation was possible, and he had the capability to kill the savage beast, but it would consume a considerable amount of time.","By the time he finished, the dragon would likely find him, and escape would be difficult.","Now he had collected materials from over a dozen wild beasts. It was probably enough.","He was ready to return to the rubble heap, refine the Conversion Pills, and then quickly leave this riverbank with Jinchen, the farther, the better.","That dragon snake would probably set its sights on the rubble heap soon.","Escaping alone posed no problem for him, but bringing Jincheng along would be tricky.","Plus, he still had to find Wu Li.","Without Wu Li, he couldn’t activate the Wanyan formation.","He regretted not stopping Wu Li from going.","Now he was in quite a passive situation.","Dodging past the wild beasts overhead, Jian Wushuang’s figure trembled, and with just a few breaths, he traversed space and returned to the rubble heap.","After twisting and turning through the cracks in the rocks, he entered a stalactite cave through a hole.","Splash!","The sound of breaking the water’s surface nearly startled the two Li family Universe Masters into action.","But upon seeing it was Jian Wushuang, they breathed a sigh of relief.","Seeing him return, Li Sheng, who was cross-legged recovering his power, also opened his eyes.","“It seems your recovery is going well!” Jian Wushuang said.","Li Sheng smiled awkwardly. At the Sacred Assembly, who wouldn’t have some treasures to restore their divine power?","This time, he had almost exhausted all his treasures trying to recover from his injuries. Yet, he still couldn’t reach his peak.","“Friend Wushuang, how are your preparations?” Li Sheng’s tone was flat, not daring to be presumptuous anymore.","Now, he could barely protect himself, let alone look after the two juniors of his family.","He couldn’t afford to offend Jian Wushuang. They were now relying entirely on Jian Wushuang to refine the pills and ensure their safety here while waiting for news from the Empress.","Jian Wushuang casually found a flat place to sit cross-legged and said calmly, “The materials are enough. Let’s see how lucky we are this time!”","With the materials obtained this time, he could try twice more. If the third attempt succeeded, then everyone would get a Conversion Pill!. Of course, he didn’t need one.","There were still four others here, plus Wu Li.","He had to refine five of them.","In the order he intended to preserve, the first was Wuli, and only then Jinchen.","The rest were not prioritized; he would decide based on his preference.","Li Sheng’s eyes held a world-weariness, reminiscing that just a few days ago, he was full of spirit, but now he appeared so battered.","All those familiar faces, one by one, had fallen.","Compared to them, the Lee family’s plight was even worse.","Of the Four Great Titans, only three had arrived.","All had fallen.","In the end, all the struggles led to nothing but downfall.","Only those stronger could protect themselves.","If blame were to be assigned, it would be to his own lack of strength!","Now his greatest aspiration was not to contend, but to preserve the hope of his family.","“Then, I’ll trouble Daoist Jian Wushuang. If I succeed, my Li family will surely offer gratitude and pay a visit!”","Li Sheng lowered his stance to the utmost.","He hoped Jian Wushuang could succeed in refining!","Jinchen’s strength was meager, unaware of what was happening outside. Yet, she could surmise that those who had left might never return.","Then there were the two Universe Masters of the Li family.","Both were prodigies, but in the face of true opportunity, their family provided no shelter.","They were left out in the cold.","Ridiculous, pitiful!","Lamentable!","Jian Wushuang paid no attention to them, starting to refine the conversion pill alone.","At his level, alchemy required a pill furnace.","All he needed to do was to refine the materials and throw them into the Origin Source; there was nothing stronger than the Origin Source.","The first attempt.","He needed to harmonize the Yin and Yang.","Just like merging water and fire origins.","But the difference between humans and savage beasts was not comparable to water and fire.","He had experimented numerous times with death and life.","Combining the human race with savage beasts wasn’t particularly difficult for him.","It was the details that proved trickier; a slight mistake could mean starting over from scratch.","If only the external pressure wasn’t so intense.","He could have easily conducted over ten thousand experiments.","With enough practice, he could ensure success every time.","But now, time and circumstances didn’t afford him that luxury!","He had to complete it as quickly as possible.","“Failure!”","The first failure didn’t surprise him!","It was expected.","For one of the crucial steps in refining the transformation pill, he needed at least three attempts.","The first failure was acceptable.","But he wouldn’t allow a second.","He refused to believe that luck could be so bad as to fail twice out of three.","The second attempt succeeded as expected.","He continued refining.","All the way to the final step.","Choosing one out of nine.","According to his experience, he could eliminate the six least probable paths.","Leaving him with three choices.","However, this time the probability of the three choices was only 10 percent.","Because it was also possible that he had eliminated the nine paths.","That was the most difficult part.","But he only had one more chance to try.","“I cannot fail!”","Unfortunately, some things often didn’t go as planned.","And he failed again.","Watching half of the materials go to waste.","Even if he succeeded on the third attempt, it wouldn’t be enough for their group.","But now there was no other way.","They could only grit their teeth and continue.","If necessary, they would have to venture outside and slaughter some savage beasts."]},{"number":5822,"title":"Chapter 5822: Conversion Pill","paragraphs":["Chapter 5822: Conversion Pill","Taking advantage of the fact that the dragon had not yet searched this place, he still had some time.","“This is the last chance!”","He threw all the materials into the Origin Source in a backward motion, refining step by step.","It went extremely smoothly, and now it was the crucial final step.","This time, he couldn’t afford to fail.","After a long preparation, he finally made the ultimate decision.","The blue Origin Source swayed for a moment and began to condense into pills.","Success or failure depended on their efficacy.","Buzz!","A demonic aura surged, and Jian Wushuang’s face lit up with joy.","“It worked!”","Several pills floated in the Origin Source Starry Sky, and he grabbed them all at once. Whoosh!","His consciousness returned to his true self, and he stood up directly.","“Phew!” He let out a sigh of relief.","This time he had finally succeeded.","Although there were only four pills, as long as he had the formula and successfully refined pills, he could refine them again.","There were also exactly four people here.","Originally, he intended to leave one for Wu Li, but since he couldn’t find him for a while, he could only give them to the others first. He could refine one for Wu Li when he found him later.","It was a trivial matter.","“Each person gets one, take it!” Jian Wushuang handed out pills to everyone.","Jinchen held the somewhat hot pill, hesitating, “After the transformation, can’t we turn back to humans?”","But Li Sheng, as always, was decisive, without hesitation.","He hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang to give each of them a pill, and without hesitation, they all swallowed it.","As the pill entered their bodies, their essences began to change shortly after.","The power of their Origin Source didn’t diminish, but its upper limit decreased.","However, their divine power continued to grow stronger.","Sharp antennae sprouted from Li Cheng’s body.","The row of antennae on his back seemed to be those of an ancient dragon.","Among the materials used to refine the pills was the Origin Source of an ancient dragon.","And there were also mermaid components.","Li Cheng had a strong yang energy, so he transformed into an ancient dragon.","“My divine power has increased by over 20,000!” Li Cheng rejoiced. He hadn’t expected such a significant enhancement, and his injuries had also improved.","It was a pleasant surprise.","After his transformation, he looked at the two younger members of his family and nodded, indicating that they could also transform.","Jian Wushuang was relatively satisfied with the pills he had refined for himself. As for Jinchen’s issue, he hadn’t considered it.","Reversing the human tribe’s transformation again would be quite troublesome.","Moreover, to refine pills for transforming back into humans, materials from strong members of the human tribe would be required.","After a moment’s pause, he answered, “There will be a solution once we’re out. If not, I’ll reverse the transformation again and refine transformation pills for you to become human. But by then, you’ll have to ask Her Majesty to find the materials for me!”","Reversing the pill formula, even just for experimentation, required a considerable amount of materials, likely needing many Universe Masters.","Luckily, Jinchen was an Emperor. However, even as an Emperor, she still needed to kill many powerful human Emperors.","Killing wild beasts was manageable; they were naturally opposed.","Killing them didn’t incur any karma.","But slaughtering the weak would generate karma.","Initially, he didn’t care about karma because of his karmic tribulation. Besides, he was already ill, so one more affliction didn’t matter.","Now that the karmic tribulation was over, he didn’t want to engage in such actions anymore.","When he wiped out the Chen family, it was because the family itself had significant karma, which led to their demise.","Not only did he escape the binding of karma, but he also gained the protection of moral righteousness.","Exterminate evil!","It had its benefits, and it was a long-term investment.","Committing evil!","It only brought temporary gains, not lasting.","Unless one could redeem themselves halfway.","Of course, to Jian Wushuang, regardless of which path one took, it was all for self-interest.","No one cared about ants.","That was the essence.","Jinchen didn’t understand the intricacies; she believed that even if he could transform into a human, there was no need for hesitation.","The transformation began.","Eventually, all four of them completed the transformation.","Li Cheng became an ancient dragon.","Jinchen turned into a mermaid.","The other two members of the Li family transformed into a pair of Yakshas.","Jian Wushuang was quite satisfied. With a swift change in form, he transformed using his Origin Source into a masked black-armored demonic cultivator, much like the Great Xia from","Qishen Temple.","Just like before in Qishen Temple.","Although his appearance still resembled that of a human, his actions and the aura emanating","from him had nothing to do with humanity.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s transformation, it was as if he had become a different person.","The others were somewhat curious, but they didn’t dare to ask too much. “Alright, let’s go now. Leave this place!” Jian Wushuang took the lead and jumped into the","water pool, with the others following suit.","He led the way, with Li Cheng bringing up the rear.","The two Universe Masters from the Li family protected Jin Chen on both sides.","They traveled through the chaotic rocks, swaggering through the riverbed.","Li Cheng, who was at the back, looked around and asked, “Friend Wushuang, do you have a","plan? Where will our next stop be?”","Speaking of their destination, even Jian Wushuang himself didn’t know.","He was following the route to find Wu Li based on causality.","But he couldn’t tell these people.","“I haven’t decided yet, but there are many wild beasts in the riverbed. They should also be divided into tribes and forces. Since we have transformed into demons, let’s go meet those demonic forces. We might even get some unexpected gains!”","Jian Wushuang was still somewhat hopeful.","Unlike these people who were scared silly, thinking only of saving their lives.","There were so many opportunities in the Sacred Assembly. He still had some distance to go","before achieving universal perfection. Looking at the pieces on the chessboard, he could devour all that he could. He didn’t have the strength to devour the rest.","He could only search for Origin Source treasures.","This place was a good spot.","The Origin Source of wild beasts was very fragile, and there were probably many Origin Source","treasures in the riverbed.","He could take this opportunity to search for some.","Upon hearing this, Li Cheng sighed inwardly, feeling that he was getting old.","The younger generation of strong cultivators still thought about opportunities even in","desperate situations, while he only wanted to save his life.","The strength was displayed just like that.","The landscape gradually shrank.","After leaving the chaotic stone pile, the group traveled for about a day.","They finally left the area of the water grass river.","At this point, they arrived at a huge trench at the bottom of the river.","This trench was like a mountain range on the ground.","Without hesitation, Jian Wushuang plunged in.","Along the way, they encountered many savage beasts. However, when those savage beasts saw them, they kept their distance.","Even savage beasts at the Fourth Tribulation realm dared not approach.","This was related to the aura emanating from him.","Among their group, Li Sheng had the highest realm,","The Universe Master at the Fourth Tribulation.","But now, he was using the Origin Source of the Beast God, so he appeared to be at the","Tribulation Realm.","Moreover, although the Origin Source within the Beast God Weapon had not reached its peak,","it had also reached the peak of the Fourth Tribulation.","When those savage beasts saw him, they thought he was a descendant of the Beast God and at","the peak of the Fourth Tribulation.","So they didn’t keep their distance. Descendants of the Beast God were noble beings wherever they went.","Jian Wushuang only exerted twice the power of the Beast God, and he could maintain this","state all the time.","Plus the Origin Source of the Beast God.","He was indeed a descendant of the Beast God.","However, the fact that these savage beasts dared not approach him was also a problem.","He couldn’t find an entry point."]},{"number":5823,"title":"Chapter 5823: Deep Gully at the Bottom of the River","paragraphs":["Chapter 5823: Deep Gully at the Bottom of the River","“Can’t just wander around randomly!”","The guidance of karma was somewhat vague after all.","Wu Li was most likely in this deep ravine.","It’s also unclear how the other party managed to escape initially.","For now, the only option is to go in first and then figure things out.","Within the vast mountain range at the bottom of the river, there were countless savage beasts.","There were also many treasures.","Some treasures, which those savage beasts didn’t care for, were quite useful for Jian Wushuang.","Along the way, he picked up many treasures that enhanced his Origin Source.","The Origin Source contained within them was extremely rich.","Even outside, they would be considered good treasures.","Li Sheng was somewhat amazed to see his approach.","Although his strength was comparable to the peak of the Fourth Tribulation, he was picking up trash that Li Sheng wouldn’t even glance at.","For powerful cultivators who cultivate divine power, those treasures that enhance Origin Source might be considered treasures if they are particularly special, but the ones Jian Wushuang picked up wouldn’t even catch the eye of someone at the Third Tribulation!","Jian Wushuang didn’t care about others’ gazes, walking and stopping from time to time, picking up many treasures that enhanced his Origin Source.","Enough to condense a black hole.","Since he could pick them up easily, why not!","He was getting closer and closer to the completion of the universe.","Once the universe was complete, he would only need to condense the real universe.","Before condensing the universe, he still needed to break through the Tribulation Realm.","He needed to sense where his own tribulation was.","This requires a considerable amount of external force and his own comprehension.","It’s something that can’t be forced.","He needs to comprehend it amidst crisis.","Right now, a crisis is indeed approaching.","In the outskirts of the mountain range, within a narrow crevice, a great battle was unfolding. Leading each side were formidable experts at the Fourth Tribulation, accompanied by over a hundred beasts of the Third Tribulation.","Within the cramped confines of the crevice, the earth shook with their clashes.","Jian Wushuang and his companions watched nearby.","“Let’s move on. These beasts seem to be fighting over some treasure!”","Li Sheng’s eyes were sharp, discerning a faint halo beneath the crevice along with a distinct aura of power. It must be a valuable treasure.","Others might not have noticed it, but Jian Wushuang paid only slight attention to the treasure below the crevice.","It seemed to be an artifact for enhancing divine power, undoubtedly valuable to the beasts.","But to him, it was mere rubbish.","What he cared about was the conflict itself.","The two opposing experts, both in human form and not yet unleashing their true power, seemed far from engaging in a fight to the death.","It was different for the solitary beasts.","It was highly probable that the battling experts represented two different factions.","If he were to intervene now, Jian Wushuang could blend into one of the beast factions, making","it easier to search for Wu Li in the future.","Now he had to consider how to utilize this conflict to gain the trust of the other party.","Firstly, his background.","The ancient river was extremely wide, traversing the entire periphery.","Its source led straight to the core of the inner circle.","The forces there must be complex and intertwined.","Concealing his identity wasn’t a problem; he could easily fabricate a false one.","With the primordial beast Origin Source they all possessed, the other side wouldn’t suspect them of being human.","After much thought, Jian Wushuang took notice.","Turning to look at Li Sheng and the others, he calmly asked, “Are you all ready?”","Li Sheng hesitated upon hearing this. Just as he was about to speak, something dawned on him, and he quickly pulled Jinchen and the others back.","“Are you out of your mind!”","He thought Jian Wushuang had gone mad, rushing to snatch treasures from those primordial beasts.","It wasn’t entirely his fault for jumping to conclusions.","Jian Wushuang had already released his aura.","“Hah!”","Jian Wushuang shouted, his divine power surging directly to 550,000.","With a flash, he darted into the crevice of the mountains.","The sudden burst not only startled Li Sheng and the others but also froze the primordial beasts still engaged in combat.","Faced with the sudden appearance of this mysterious powerhouse, they all halted their","actions.","Jian Wushuang was enveloped in a crimson aura, the power of the Beast God.","The purest innate power of the Beast God.","This aura suppressed all the primordial beasts.","Taking advantage of this opportunity, he scanned the primordial beasts with a glance.","Since none of them had unleashed their true forms, they all appeared humanoid, albeit with","wildly diverse appearances, resembling humans only in form.","The leading figures on both sides were peak-level experts of the Fourth Tribulation, with","divine power exceeding 500,000.","Similar to the Tanlang back then.","However, the Celestial Wolf Tribe did not belong to the category of savage beasts.","They all claimed to be descendants of noble Beast Gods.","Jian Wushuang was the same now.","Erupting with a divine power of 550,000, he directly suppressed the two of them.","At the same time, he also noticed that both of the Fourth Tribulation peak experts had a","badge hanging on their chests.","The shapes of the badges were different.","It seemed to be a distinction between two forces.","One of the Fourth Tribulations experts, with a fish head and human body, frowned when he","saw Jian Wushuang suddenly appear.","He could tell that Jian Wushuang’s aura was very special, his strength was even stronger than his own, and he was not someone to be trifled with.","“Allow me to interrupt your enjoyment. The treasure below this place is very important to me.","I didn’t travel thousands of miles just for this treasure. Please give me some face!”","Jian Wushuang clasped his fists towards the leaders of both sides.","This surprised the leading experts on both sides.","However, they were all wary of this suddenly emerging powerful figure.","Both sides were forces of savage beasts in the mountains.","Although they were in a hostile relationship, they knew each other at least.","Suddenly seeing a stranger at the Fourth Tribulations, they couldn’t help but feel suspicious.","And as soon as he arrived, he directly named the treasure below.","That was going too far.","After fighting for so long, they couldn’t just hand it over!","Even if they sensed that Jian Wushuang’s aura was extraordinary, he might be a descendant of","a Beast God with extremely strong power, they wouldn’t let him off easily.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang had already made it clear that he was not a local expert.","There was even less need to worry.","With so many of them, they wouldn’t let an outsider snatch it away!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes shifted, and he was also clear about this.","He wanted it just like this.","First, getting both sides to stand on the same line, solidifying the impression of his identity","as a formidable outsider would be enough.","Next, it was about undermining these people from within.","“Are you out of your mind, sir? You say jump, and we’re supposed to ask how high? Who do","you think we are?” scoffed the Fourth Tribulation powerhouse with a fish-like head and humanoid body, displaying extreme disdain.","He didn’t care where this mysterious outsider in front of him came from, nor did he care how","formidable their background might be.","This place was their territory. Obtaining treasures wouldn’t be so easy.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang didn’t get angry. Instead, a hint of joy welled up in his","heart.","“Haha, my apologies for the abruptness!” he calmly retrieved 10,000 primordial stones from","his mustard seed pouch and said nonchalantly, “These are treasures I obtained a few days ago by slaying a human powerhouse. I heard they were bred from the source universe of human powerhouses. I’m willing to exchange these for the treasures you have below!”","Primordial stones!","He still had millions of primordial stones on him.","These were essential for both human powerhouses and these savage beasts, as well as other","special beings."]},{"number":5824,"title":"Chapter 5824: Kababon","paragraphs":["Chapter 5824: Kababon","The Infinite Great World not only amplified divine power but also restored one’s Origin Source.","For these people and beasts of the wilderness, it was also a rare treasure.","In the past, there had been strong individuals who ventured into the Infinite Great World, but never as many as after the opening of the Sacred Assembly.","Moreover, those were ancient events.","Local strongmen who could produce primordial stones in this place were few and far between.","Perhaps some of them had already been used up.","Even the Fourth Tribulation powerhouse with a fish head and human body had only heard rumors about primordial stones.","This was their first encounter with one.","Feeling the unique aura emanating from the primordial stone, their minds trembled.","He had heard that these primordial stones, needed by the Universe Master of the human race, took a long time to form.","The other party offered ten thousand pieces in one go, which was definitely a generous offer. He was about to agree immediately.","But before he could speak, Jian Wushuang spoke up.","“Since you both saw it first, then split this ten thousand primordial stones between yourselves!”","With these words, the Fourth Tribulation powerhouse with a fish head and human body furrowed his brow and turned to look at the serpent-headed powerhouse who had previously contested with him for the treasure of this place.","For them, the primordial stones were even more important than the treasures below.","How could they possibly agree to split them?","For the treasures below, they were willing to fight each other to the death.","Not to mention these primordial stones.","But neither of them were fools.","What if they ended up both injured in a fight, and then got ambushed by mysterious individuals?","For a moment, both sides were deadlocked once again.","Jian Wushuang remained unchanged in expression, just as he had imagined.","“Since neither of you have any objections, I’ll just take this treasure!”","With those words, he waved his hand, unleashing a burst of powerful divine force that directly sucked the treasure emitting a dazzling light from the crevice into his hand.","After carefully weighing it and delving into its Origin Source with his Thought power, he discovered it was a kind of inner core left behind by a desolate beast of the plant and wood variety after its demise.","Essentially, it was a small sphere formed by the condensation and contraction of its Origin Source after falling.","Internally, however, it contained a complete Universe Origin Source, and it was a Universe Origin Source of four or more tribulations.","Its value was not insignificant.","This was a Universe Origin Source with roots, unlike the original Origin Source of All Things. The Origin Source of All Things was condensed by the Lord of All Things and was rootless water.","But within this inner core lay the purest Origin Source of the desolate beast.","Although it didn’t offer much assistance to his Starry Sky Origin Source, he didn’t disdain it.","Yet, it held great utility for the origin within his Beast God Weapon.","It could completely elevate the origin within the Beast God Weapon by a notch.","10,000 primordial stones wasn’t a bad deal.","After collecting the treasure, Jian Wushuang turned around to leave.","However, the fish-headed beast and the snake-headed beast simultaneously blocked his way.","Jian Wushuang frowned and spoke, “Gentlemen, isn’t this a bit uncalled for?” “Dao Friend, you’ve misunderstood!” The fish-headed man smiled obsequiously. The snake-headed strongman also revealed a kind smile, attempting to get closer. But Jian Wushuang kept retreating, looking wary as he said, “And why is that?” “Well, you see, Dao Friend, do you still have those primordial stones on you? I’m willing to pay a high price for them!” The fish-headed strongman eagerly offered.","The strong with the snake head, unwilling to be outdone, quickly said, “I am willing to double the price!”","The two of them, thus, began to argue again.","Jian Wushuang, seeing this, hurriedly stepped forward to mediate, saying, “Gentlemen, indeed, I still have some primordial stones on me, but the treasures I need require delving deeper into these mountains. I’m afraid...”","“Don’t worry, although I can’t produce it, but my king at home can definitely bring it out!” The strong with the fish head knew what Jian Wushuang wanted to say, obviously thinking that the two of them were not worthy and couldn’t produce such treasures.","But their king definitely had the treasure Jian Wushuang needed.","And there were many more.","The mountains here stretched to the inner circle of the Infinite Great World, countless strong beings.","But when it comes to who is the strongest, that is definitely their king.","The treasures are the same.","Upon hearing the word “king”, the strong with the snake head fell silent.","The force he belonged to was established by a Special Life Form at the Fifth Tribulation, and its heritage couldn’t be compared to the king mentioned by the strong with the fish head.","Because that king was a genuine Sixth Tribulations realm strong being.","“Sly Snake, stop arguing with me. You can’t beat me. I’m willing to split these ten thousand primordial stones with you. It’s also because I have some respect for you. Don’t make trouble","for yourself!”","The sudden toughness of the strong with the fish head surprised Jian Wushuang.","The strong with the snake head snorted coldly, casually taking half of the primordial stones into his hand, and snorted, “Kababon, don’t get cocky. We’ll have plenty of time to settle this","in the future!”","Leaving behind a harsh remark, he hurriedly left with his men.","But the fish-headed Kababon was very pleased, saying, “Umm, Sly Snake, you’re somewhat sensible. Among the forces in this mountain range, no one can compete with the force behind","our king!”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang asked with a surprised expression, “I wonder, who is the king you speak of, my friend? Is it one of the Sacred Lords among the savage beasts?”","Among the super strong beasts, especially the self-proclaimed Sacred Lords, it was","somewhat of a jargon.","Upon hearing this, Kababon hurriedly waved his hand, saying, “No, no, my lord, he despises","those mundane titles. You can address him as the King of Rivers!”","“The King of Rivers?” Jian Wushuang deliberately widened his eyes.","When he collected materials from savage beasts, he had once probed the souls of some Third","Tribulation realm savage beasts.","In the memories of those savage beasts, there was the title of the King of Rivers.","However, he didn’t know the exact identity of the other party.","Perhaps those savage beasts had only heard of it.","“Yes, the king of this Roman River!” Kababon was proud of this, then he especially carefully","said to Jian Wushuang, “Also, my lord, our king is the only Sixth Tribulation realm powerhouse in the entire Roman River, having crossed the divine tribulation six times!”","“Goodness!” This time Jian Wushuang was truly shocked!","He hadn’t expected that there would be a Sixth Tribulation realm powerhouse in this ancient","river.","Now he was somewhat regretful.","Originally, he took out the primordial stones just to attract the other party’s attention.","And then infiltrate their ranks.","This way, he could openly go deep into the mountains.","Now knowing that there was an old monster of the sixth-tribulation realm inside, he was","somewhat afraid.","“But you don’t need to be afraid. Our king is the most merciful. As long as you have primordial stones, the king can exchange treasures with you. He will never bully the weak with his strength. If you don’t believe it, you can inquire around!” Kababon assured, patting his chest.","Although savage beasts were not inferior to humans in intelligence, their bold nature was","much stronger than that of humans.","Jian Wushuang could only choose to believe now.","“Then I will trouble the king’s cave!” Jian Wushuang said politely.","“No problem!” Kababon replied.","After confirming, Jian Wushuang turned to greet Li Sheng, who was hiding in the distance,","signaling them to come over.","Li Sheng, from afar, saw everything.","He knew what Jian Wushuang was going to do.","Originally, he thought this plan was okay.","But when he heard about the Sixth Tribulation realm, he regretted it.","They had just escaped from the clutches of a Fifth Tribulation realm dragon, and now they","were going into the lion’s den."]},{"number":5825,"title":"Chapter 5825: King of the River","paragraphs":["Chapter 5825: King of the River","The former situation was manageable; once the Empress returned, she could handle that unruly dragon. However, a Sixth Tribulation realm savage beast, even with the Empress’s return, wouldn’t yield an inch of advantage.","That was sealing one’s own fate!","Now, following Jian Wushuang was the only option, albeit reluctantly.","They came along unwillingly.","Jian Wushuang beckoned and smiled, “Brother Kababon, these are my subordinates, their strength is decent, right?”","“Not bad!” Kababon replied, showing a smile to everyone and warmly greeted them.","Jian Wushuang rubbed his hands, “Shall we set off then?”","“No problem!”","Kababon dispersed his subordinates, leaving only a few peak Third Tribulation realm savage beasts to accompany them. With Jian Wushuang’s group, they flew towards the depths of the mountain range.","On the way, Jian Wushuang was told about many treasures and dangers within the mountains.","At the same time, they discussed the forces within this riverbed mountain range.","There were three major forces in total.","One was the Azure Water Serpent Mansion.","It was the force where Sly Snake from earlier belonged.","The master of the mansion was a peak Fifth Tribulation realm powerhouse.","Conflict between the two factions was frequent.","However, they dared not escalate things.","After all, a Sixth Tribulation realm force, if truly engaged in battle, would have no rivals.","Apart from the Azure Water Serpent Mansion, there was another force, also established by a Fifth Tribulation realm powerhouse, but it was not in the Southern Mountain Range; rather, it was near the northern waters close of the Infinite Great World.","They generally didn’t interact, so there wasn’t much introduction about them.","The story mainly revolves around the forces established by the River King.","“Weilong Mountain!”","A superpower constructed by beings of a Special Life Form at the level of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","Originally, Jian Wushuang thought that this River King was a savage beast, but he didn’t expect it to be a Special Life Form.","That made its combat power even more formidable. Its divine power was probably close to breaking the million mark.","Standing behind him, Li Sheng felt a chill run down his spine.","A million divine power was suffocating for them.","The River King, also known as ‘Tamu King’, had a giant nine-eyed sky toad as its true form. But Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but sneer inwardly, “Just a big toad, isn’t it?”","As a Sixth Tribulation realm powerhouse, he had seen much more. There was no need to fear!","He comforted himself inwardly.","Indeed, he had seen a lot.","He had encountered Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation and even had close encounters with super-beings at the Half-Step Ninth Tribulation realm.","Facing those kinds of powerhouses was the real suffocating experience.","On the other hand, the so-called ‘god’, Weiss!","He didn’t feel any oppression from the opponent.","It was just a tense feeling during the battle.","Among the strong individuals he encountered through Babidi, the weakest were at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Not only did it broaden his horizons, but it also maximized his ability to withstand pressure.","Weilong Mountain!","Let’s go and challenge this Weilong Mountain.","Besides Tamu King, there were also three Law Kings in Weilong Mountain.","They were all top-level experts at the level of the Fifth Tribulation realm.","Among the ranks of the Fourth Tribulation realm, there were many strong individuals, numbering up to a hundred.","However, only eight of them could become guardians.","Kababon was one of them, ranking as the eighth.","His strength peaked at the Fourth Tribulation realm, even in his current contracted form, he possessed the power of 500,000 divine power.","If he were to fully unleash his true form, he could reach up to 550,000 divine power.","Such strength placed him among the top-tier warriors even among the Fourth Tribulation realm masters of the human race.","Jian Wushuang, in his current state, possessed a divine power of 550,000, not to mention his status as a descendant of the Beast God.","Others speculated that if he were to unleash his true form, he might possess 600,000 divine power.","The reason why savage beasts usually maintained a humanoid form was not just to mimic the human race, but also because they found that condensing their divine bodies could conserve","divine power.","Maintaining their true forms consumed too much energy.","It was more efficient to condense their divine bodies into the smallest humanoid form","possible, saving a considerable amount of divine power.","Savage beasts might seem carefree on the surface, but their internal conflicts were no less intense than those of the human race.","With every blink of their eyes, they were ready to fight for opportunities.","It was almost a skirmish every three days and a major battle every ten days.","However, despite their seemingly aggressive nature, they were quite conservative in actual combat.","In the recent skirmish, for instance, none of them resorted to unleashing their true forms. They knew when to draw the line.","This observation surprised Jian Wushuang. Throughout their conversation, he had developed","a fondness for Kababon.","Despite belonging to different races, they shared a mutual respect, which left Jian Wushuang","impressed.","“Here we are!”","Kababon’s pace slowed as he came to a halt.","Before them loomed a majestic mountain peak.","In this mountain range, it definitely ranked in the top three.","From its summit, one could overlook all the other mountains.","“Weilong Mountain!” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself, then turned to ask, “Kababon,","does Weilong Mountain really have dragons?”","Kababon chuckled upon hearing the question.","“Brother, you’ve guessed right. Weilong Mountain indeed has dragons, but they’re not real dragons. The divine bodies of real dragons are comparable to those of Beast Gods. It’s extremely difficult to reach the Tribulation Realm. There isn’t a single true dragon in the","entire Roman River!”","“In that case, what about Weilong Mountain?” Jian Wushuang pointed to the peak.","Only then did Kababon explain, “While there are no true dragons, there are still dragon-like creatures known as scaled dragon. Weilong Mountain was once inhabited by a black scaled dragon. After it was defeated by our king and submitted under his rule, the king found the name quite imposing and decided to keep it!”","“A black scaled dragon?” Jian Wushuang furrowed his brow, thinking to himself, “What a","small world!”","Li Sheng’s expression also darkened.","They had been relentlessly pursued by a Jiaolong, forced to transform into savage beasts.","Could the black scaled dragon of Weilong Mountain be the same one they encountered?","If so, it would just go to show how unpredictable life can be! Most likely, the powerful spectators outside would marvel at their experiences.","Fortunately, they had all transformed their essences, so even if they encountered it, it","wouldn’t matter much.","Kababon led them to the foot of the mountain.","Upon seeing Kababon, the savage beast guarding the mountain gate showed utmost respect.","“The lord guardian has returned!”","“Hmm, has anything significant happened on the mountain recently?” Kababon casually","inquired.","The gatekeeper beast shook his head, replying, “Thanks to the efforts of the guardian lord expanding our territory, the mountain gate remains safe!”","“Here’s your reward!” Kababon casually tossed out some treasures, giving them to the two","gatekeeper beasts.","They were overjoyed.","Seeing unfamiliar faces, though they didn’t recognize them, they felt the overwhelming divine power, even stronger than Kababon’s, and quickly saluted respectfully.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang signaled to Li Sheng.","Li Sheng had no choice but to follow suit, taking out some treasures from his mustard seed","bag and tossing them to the two beasts.","“Forget about them, let’s go in!” Kababon appreciated Jian Wushuang’s approach.","However, Li Sheng felt it unnecessary.","Since rewards were given, why not give them personally rather than making him pay for it?","The impression of Jian Wushuang being stingy was etched into his mind.","From the moment they entered the mountains, he had been constantly picking up scraps.","And now, he was being miserly.","Jian Wushuang didn’t care about others’ opinions of him.","All he knew was that this time, he had exerted a lot of effort to protect these few people.","If they had to give up some treasures, so be it!","Following Kababon, they ascended Weilong Mountain."]},{"number":5826,"title":"Chapter 5826: I Am Hu Biao","paragraphs":["Chapter 5826: I Am Hu Biao","In the forecourt, Kababon had already relayed the message to Tamu King, and now the king awaited Jian Wushuang in the main hall.","“By the way, I haven’t asked my brother’s name yet, so I can report to the king later!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate, answering directly, “I am Hu Biao, from the south bank of the Roman River!”","Kababon chuckled, “Brother Hu, please wait a moment. I’ll go in and report to the king!”","With that, he entered the main hall, leaving Jian Wushuang and his companions outside. Turning to the solemn-faced Li Sheng, Jian Wushuang conveyed through a message, “Just use your own names, say you’re my subordinates, nothing more. I’ve already transmitted the basic information about the south bank to your tokens, take a quick look!”","Although their auras were all those of savage beasts, for safety’s sake, they still needed to brush up on their knowledge of the Infinite Great World and the discourse commonly used among savage beasts. Otherwise, they might arouse suspicion.","Upon hearing this, Li Sheng and the others quickly checked their tokens.","Jian Wushuang glanced at Jinchen.","She was only an Emperor, but her beauty was unparalleled.","Even though she had turned into a mermaid, her face remained that of a normal human, unchanged from before, except for her feet, which had become fish tails.","“Take this!” Jian Wushuang handed her a mask.","Jinchen, puzzled, asked, “What’s this for?”","“Don’t think, just put it on!” Jian Wushuang sensed Kababon’s approach and hurriedly urged her.","Without further hesitation, Jinchen quickly put on the mask.","Swish!","Though the contours of her face remained unchanged, there was now a black fish scale on her left cheek.","She couldn’t believe it as she touched her face, feeling a sense of despair creeping in.","First, she had turned into a wild beast, and now there was a fish scale on her face.","She was on the brink of collapse.","The Sacred Assembly!","Or rather, it felt like a purgatory.","The weak struggled while the strong vied for dominance.","Suddenly, she felt a strong desire to go back.","Back to Yue Kingdom.","She wanted to go to the Daughter Kingdom even more.","No wonder Queen Yun Zhi had advised her against attending the Sacred Assembly.","Everything had its reasons.","Her mother’s sudden departure, the fall of the elders.","The blows to her were too much.","Jian Wushuang glanced over, though it pained him somewhat, he had no other choice.","The reason why the Empress was the Empress was probably because the trials she endured were far more terrifying than now.","At least now Jian Wushuang was there to protect Jinchen.","She hoped the other party could make it through.","If one lacked a firm will and only sought a life of wealth and luxury,","it would be better to seek refuge with Queen Yun Zhi.","Following Empress Fengchen, even her own daughter, wouldn’t have an easy time.","The Empress would only become stricter towards Jian Wushuang.","The greater the expectations, the greater the disappointment.","The Empress’s expectation was that after she became a Holy Maiden, Jinchen would be able to take her place.","As long as Jinchen broke through to the Tribulation Realm, rapidly reached the Third Tribulation, then mastered the universe, inherited the throne, she would also have that qualification.","And with the Empress’s blessing, securing the throne would not be difficult.","This was the Empress’s expectation for Jinchen.","If the Empress saw Jinchen’s current state, she might be disappointed.","Perhaps Jian Wushuang was also taken into account.","Jian Wushuang felt that he could also help Jinchen.","But Jian Wushuang was not someone to be underestimated.","Staying in Yue Kingdom for long was impossible.","After this Sacred Meeting, he would probably leave.","Jinchen had to face everything alone.","“Ah!” Jian Wushuang concealed his sigh and turned his head towards the hall.","The heart of a strong one must be resolute.","They must face the path that the strong must walk.","Greenhouses have flowers, but no thorns!","“Please, Hu Biao!” a loud voice sounded in the hall, and Babidi also stepped forward, making","a gesture of invitation.","Jian Wushuang nodded and turned to Li Sheng behind him, saying, “You wait here, I’ll go in","alone!”","It was an invitation to him, bringing more people wouldn’t be appropriate.","This was a courtesy visit.","Not just a casual call.","Stepping forward, as he entered the hall, he felt a sense of oppression.","He retracted his telekinetic force, refraining from probing, as it would be impolite.","He could only glance around with his eyes before taking another step forward.","At a rough estimate, there were hundreds of powerful individuals in this hall.","Even the weakest emitted the aura of the Third Tribulation, and the aura of those at the Fourth Tribulation was considerable.","And there were also two mighty individuals at the Fifth Tribulation.","Seated on high thrones on both sides.","In the central position, there was the king of the River of Roman, ‘Tamu’.","Walking to the center of the hall, Jian Wushuang bowed and performed the highest courtesy","among savage beasts.","“Kid, on the south bank of the Roman River, Hu Biao from Wanda Mountain pays respects to","the Great King!”","As soon as his words fell, a peak powerhouse at the fourth tribulation next to him spoke up, “Mount Wanda? Never heard of it!”","“Such a nameless mountain, how dare it compare to the Weilong Mountain!” Jian Wushuang","lifted his head, facing the inquirer directly, his tone resolute this time.","There was no hint of reverence towards the strong.","In this world of savage beasts, strength was the only currency.","For the powerful, one should show respect.","For equals in strength, regardless of status, they were treated as such.","“So are you here at the Roman River to pay respects to the mountain or to seek","companionship?” Another voice came from Jian Wushuang’s right.","Turning to look, there stood a colossal lava beast, its head adorned with fragments of rocks, towering to hundreds of feet in height.","Not a savage beast, but a special being, with a divine power slightly stronger than his own.","“I’m here to pay respects to the mountain, not to seek companionship!” Jian Wushuang","replied succinctly.","Clack!","On the highest throne in the upper left corner, there was the sound of knocking, and the Law","King of the Fifth Tribulation spoke up.","“I’ve heard you possess primordial stones, obtained by killing a passerby. Whose sacred","possessions did you rob?”","Getting straight to the point, the Law King’s words eased Jian Wushuang’s tension.","It was indeed because of the primordial stones that he had the chance to pay respects to the","mountain.","But his real purpose was not to exchange the stones for treasures.","It was to secure a foothold in the Weilong Mountain.","From then on, he would have a guarantee.","He had thought about it; he might have to stay in the Roman River for a while.","Avoiding trouble wasn’t an option, especially when he had to find Wu Li.","And he was accompanied by some people.","It wasn’t convenient at all; he had no choice but to enter a major power first.","It was a safer approach.","Using the primordial stones as a reason to enter the Weilong Mountain to exchange for","treasures.","Even if it meant bullying the weak with the strong, he would do it.","The loss was negligible.","His strength was enough, coupled with the power of the Beast God.","Those savage beasts still regarded him highly.","Otherwise, they would have just robbed him without so much fuss.","Jian Wushuang raised his head proudly and replied loudly, “I robbed cultivators and killed","outsiders!” Finishing his words, he directly took out more than 60,000 primordial stones.","They were scattered, deliberately making it seem like that was all he had. These savage beasts were knowledgeable about cultivators and knew the significance of the","primordial stones.","Jian Wushuang’s visible combat strength could, at most, kill some cultivators at the Fourth","Tribulation.","The number of primordial stones he obtained was about this much; any more would raise","suspicion.","Seeing the primordial stones, the eyes of many powerful savage beasts widened, even the Law","Kings on both sides stood up.","Only Tamu King remained unmoved."]},{"number":5827,"title":"Chapter 5827: Joining","paragraphs":["Chapter 5827: Joining","Everything was laid out; now they just awaited the word from Tamu King.","“Hehe, you youngsters are quite straightforward, which fits my taste!” Tamu King rocked his hefty body and stood up.","As he spoke, his bloodthirsty mouth gaped wide open.","A few strands of flesh whiskers hung from the corners of his mouth.","“Speak up, what treasures do you want to exchange!”","With a wave of his large hand, the savage beasts that had surrounded them all sat down.","Jian Wushuang’s face lit up, and he said, “Great King of the River, I want...”","He directly listed a long string of treasure names, expressing his great demands.","And these treasures were all within this mountain range.","Although the primordial stones were precious, there were only tens of thousands of them, clearly not enough for exchange.","After hearing this, the King of the River burst into laughter!","“You’re quite greedy. With so few primordial stones, yet you want so many treasures. Do you have the guts to make this deal?”","At this point, Kababon was also a bit flustered. At first, he thought Jian Wushuang was quite savvy, but now, speaking to the king in such an arrogant manner, it was like asking a lion for its paw.","The other savage beasts also thought Jian Wushuang had gone mad.","Don’t they realize where they are?","Such exorbitant demands.","Aren’t they afraid of consequences?","Jian Wushuang squinted around, feeling quite nervous inside. After taking a deep breath, he continued, “Indeed, these primordial stones are not enough for exchange, but I truly need those treasures.”","He appeared genuinely troubled.","The King of the River, seeing this, understood Jian Wushuang’s intentions after a slight pondering.","A Special Life Form at the Sixth Tribulation wouldn’t be a fool.","After briefly sorting out Jian Wushuang’s background, he understood what he was seeking.","This mountain range was almost entirely controlled by the Weilong Mountain.","And the treasures Jian Wushuang needed were all within this mountain range.","Since there weren’t enough primordial stones for exchange, they could only join forces.","But this sentence must be spoken by the King of the River himself.","Jian Wushuang’s intentions were crystal clear as he spoke.","All he needed was a nod from the other party, and he could smoothly transition, making them allies.","With his divine power of 550,000 and Beast God bloodline, he only fell short compared to the savage beasts of the Fifth Tribulation realm within this mountain range.","Entering the Weilong Mountain was indeed a qualification he possessed.","But he lacked the proper credentials.","However, the primordial stone served as a decent token.","Upon understanding this, the River King couldn’t help but feel disdainful.","He had no use for these primordial stones.","For a Special Life Form of the Sixth Tribulation realm without its own constructed universe, why bother with these primordial stones when there were plenty of treasures to enhance divine power?","It all boiled down to one’s cultivation level.","But for this junior, Jian Wushuang, he had some expectations.","Bold, powerful, strategic.","He was indeed worth taking in.","With just a glance, he conveyed his intentions to Kababon, who escorted Jian Wushuang up the mountain.","Kababon’s heart leaped with joy as he stepped forward.","“If Brother Hu needs these treasures, and they happen to be in the vicinity of my Weilong Mountain, why not accompany us? Instead of enduring hardships along the way, you can settle in our Weilong Mountain, have a place to stay, and freely search for the treasures you need. What’s there not to like?”","Jian Wushuang initially revealed a hint of joy, but then his expression turned serious as he spoke, “I am weak in strength. I fear I may not catch the eye of the esteemed seniors. I think...”","“What’s there to ponder? With your strength, Brother Hu, even if you join our Weilong Mountain, is enough to serve as a guardian. I suggest you follow behind me and become the ninth guardian of Weilong Mountain. How about that?”","Kababon interrupted, scanning the other savage beasts before continuing, “Anyone","dissatisfied can come out and spar with Brother Hu, if you dare.”","Except for Tamu King and a few Law Kings, the remaining eight Guardians were all peak","Fourth Tribulations experts with divine power exceeding 500,000.","Jian Wushuang’s divine power reached 550,000, and he hadn’t even revealed his true form yet.","Naturally, these people were somewhat wary.","Even the Fourth Tribulations savage beasts who weren’t Guardians mostly had divine power in the 400,000 range.","Even if they revealed their true forms, it would be difficult for their divine power to soar to","500,000.","For a moment, no one dared to step forward.","Seeing no one speaking up, Kababon respectfully bowed towards Tamu King, who was sitting","at the head, and spoke, “Great King, I, Kababon, would like to recommend Brother Hu Biao. I","hope the Great King will accept!”","Jian Wushuang also bowed, indicating his agreement.","They had come here for this moment-to join the Weilong Mountain and establish a foothold.","Then they could proceed to search for Wu Li’s whereabouts under the guise of seeking","treasures.","At the same time, they could also await the Empress.","If the Empress returned, Jian Wushuang could leave without any loss.","Even these primordial stones could be presented as a gift to Tamu King.","The atmosphere in the hall quieted down. Tamu King swayed his bulky body, stroked his beard, and finally spoke, “I declare that today, Weilong Mountain shall add another","Guardian!”","As his voice fell, Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief.","Even the savage beasts in the hall looked at him with kind eyes.","Kababon, in particular, hugged Jian Wushuang’s shoulder, excitedly exclaiming, “Brother Hu, from now on, you’re one of us! Finally, I have someone younger than me. I’ll be the 8th, you’ll be the 9th. From now on, you’re Old Nine!”","“Thank you, Brother Kababon, for the recommendation!” Jian Wushuang said politely, then turned to Tamu King with solemnity, “Thank you, Your Majesty, for accepting me.” Tamu King waved his hand dismissively, saying, “Alright, by joining Weilong Mountain, you’ve added a great warrior to our ranks. I see the bloodline of a Beast God in you. Work hard and step into the Fifth Tribulation realm soon!”","That was quite a high appraisal.","Jian Wushuang seemed to have favorable impressions from everyone he encountered.","Whether it was Ruler Yun Zhi, Sword Immortal Tonghe, or any of the top Divine Craftsmen from the Ancient Wood Continent, they all had high hopes for him.","Even a Special Life Form held such expectations for him.","Although they were of different races, Jian Wushuang still felt a warmth in his heart.","During this period, he was just lodging temporarily, so it was best to avoid conflicts if","possible.","His joining caused a brief stir in Weilong Mountain.","That evening, a grand feast was held.","Fortunately, there were no humans around, or he wouldn’t have been able to enjoy it.","After the festivities, Kababon personally found him a cave dwelling, providing some stability.","Once the other party was seen off, Jian Wushuang finally breathed a sigh of relief.","Though the cave dwelling was somewhat rudimentary in its furnishings, it contained a considerable amount of divine power.","Just as he began to relax, Li Sheng hurriedly approached from outside the cave, saying, “My","lord, someone has come to pay their respects!”","Jian Wushuang was momentarily surprised. He had just seen off Kababon, and he didn’t know","many people here.","Who could be coming to pay their respects all of a sudden?","After quickly tidying up his appearance, Jian Wushuang stepped out.","“Lady Du!” Seeing the visitor, his expression remained unchanged, but his heart sank.","During the joining banquet, he had heard someone mention this Lady Du."]},{"number":5828,"title":"Chapter 5828: Sudden Rage","paragraphs":["Chapter 5828: Sudden Rage","The second in command among the Eight Guardians was exceptionally powerful. Possessing a divine strength of 550,000 even in humanoid form.","Skilled in the use of poison, she wielded methods as elusive as her nature.","Even the Law King of Weilong Mountain treated her with utmost courtesy.","Characters like Kababon couldn’t distance themselves fast enough upon encountering this Lady Du.","Her name alone was enough to inspire fear; meeting her in person naturally induced some panic.","Though they had already met at the banquet, the crowd then had diluted any apprehension.","Meeting privately now naturally stirred some nerves.","Nevertheless, Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth and welcomed her into the cave.","Lady Du, originally a thousand-eyed viper, was heavily poisoned.","In human form, she still retained her black snake-scaled armor, which wrapped around her graceful figure.","Though not as striking as Jincheng in appearance, she exuded a chilling allure, not the icy elegance of an empress but a coldness that sent shivers down one’s spine.","“How’s little brother adjusting here? If there’s anything uncomfortable, feel free to tell your sister!” Lady Du entered the cave, casting a glance around, but her eyes were fixed on Jinchen in the corner, emitting a sinister aura.","This gaze made Jinchen uneasy, forcing her to avoid eye contact.","Jian Wushuang pondered the intentions behind her sudden concern.","Such care from her was indeed puzzling.","What game was she playing?","He had no dealings with Lady Du, so her concern surely harbored ulterior motives.","Motioning for Jinchen to prepare some tea and seating Lady Du, Jian Wushuang spoke, “The King has treated me well, and Kababon has been kind. There’s no need for the lady’s concern!”","Jinchen swayed her fishtail and drifted over slowly, carefully placing the tea down. Just as she was about to leave, Lady Du grabbed her hand suddenly.","The sudden move startled Jinchen. She tried to pull her hand away but found herself unable to move at all.","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened. He reached out and placed his hand on theirs, saying, “Madam, feel free to speak your mind.”","As soon as he spoke, a dark red Beast God’s power erupted from his palm, directly breaking Jinchen free from the restraint.","Lady Du sighed regretfully, “Such a beautiful jade-like hand, what a waste!”","She then lifted her gaze to Jinchen’s face, shamelessly appraising her.","Jian Wushuang finally understood. It seemed the other party wasn’t here for him at all!","He had initially thought it was his appearance that attracted them, but it turned out to be Jinchen.","But Jinchen was merely an Emperor.","What could they see in her?","Her appearance?","Jian Wushuang swallowed hard, surprised by this newfound interest.","If it were anyone else, he could make a decision, but Jinchen couldn’t afford to have any trouble.","Otherwise, it would be a grave offense.","Lady Du made her intentions clear, directly saying, “Brother Hu Biao, your maid is quite good. How about letting her be with me? I have quite a few treasures you might need!” Just as he suspected!","And they indeed wanted to exchange for treasures.","A maid of an Emperor.","In this world of survival of the fittest, an Emperor not even considered an ant.","With his current status, he had no reason to refuse.","But he had no choice.","Electric arcs flickered in his eyes.","Jinchen was trembling with fear by his side.","But Lady Du, sitting beside him, seemed to like what she saw more and more. Suddenly, she said, “This little maid is still a virgin, truly a fine specimen!”","“Haha!” Jian Wushuang lifted his teacup, downed it in one gulp, and laughed heartily along.","Jinchen panicked, and so did the others, including Li Sheng.","Seeing Jian Wushuang now, they realized he had completely forgotten who he was, turning into a wild beast.","Jian Wushuang held a teacup, his smile fading into a cold expression.","Crack!","The teacup shattered in his grip.","His aura surged suddenly, the wings on his back spreading wide, his divine power instantly reaching 550,000.","“Lady Du, do you think I’m easy to bully? I just arrived at Weilong Mountain and you’re already trying to snatch my personal maid!”","Jian Wushuang’s anger flared as he spoke, itching to strike immediately.","Lady Du hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang to be so furious.","Wasn’t it just a servant at the Emperor level?","With a flick of her hand, countless people rushed forward to serve as maids for him.","Why be so fixated on one?","Jian Wushuang’s outburst immediately drew the attention of powerful beings outside the","cave.","Kababon, not far away, charged in directly.","But upon seeing Lady Du, his previous confidence vanished in an instant.","Then, he forced a smile and ingratiatingly said, “Hey, I was wondering why Ninth Brother’s","cave was so lively. Turns out, Second Sister is here!”","Appearing to enter with a flattering smile, he naturally positioned himself on Jian","Wushuang’s side.","“Bighead Fish, you better not meddle in today’s affairs, or I’ll use you to make fish head soup!” Lady Du shouted angrily, black lines appearing on her cheeks, spreading across half","her face.","The snake spit out from her mouth was terrifying.","Jian Wushuang was not one to tolerate such behavior.","He roared in anger, his Candle Dragon Wings wrapping around his body before violently","unfurling once more.","With his wings spread out again, he fully transformed into the Candle Dragon.","A dragon roar shook the heavens and the earth.","This was the true Beast God.","Raising his Candle Dragon Arm slowly, Jian Wushuang spoke coldly, “Old Witch, if you seek a","battle today, I will accompany you to the end. If you dare not, then get out of here!”","The Skysight Heavenly Chessboard gradually rose within his Starry Sky Origin Source.","The armor had unknowingly spread throughout his entire body.","The power of the Beast God surged once again.","The threefold power of the Beast God had now become fourfold.","His divine power reached a staggering 600,000.","Lady Du was also taken aback.","She hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang to be so powerful.","If he revealed his true form and unleashed his strongest divine power, it would probably","exceed 600,000.","Lady Du knew her own strength. Even if she revealed her true form as a viper, she didn’t think","she would be Jian Wushuang’s match.","As for using poison, she could clearly see the special dark red armor on Jian Wushuang’s body.","In a real fight, she wouldn’t stand a chance.","But if she just left like this, where would she put her face?","Kababon also realized this.","He quickly intervened, saying, “Brother Hu, calm down. We are all allies here, why make","things so embarrassing!”","Although he said so, he also had grievances against Lady Du.","He knew Jian Wushuang was brought here by him, yet she still came to cause trouble.","If she wanted to cause trouble, she could have chosen another day.","Jian Wushuang had just joined, and she came to provoke him, which was unacceptable.","Even if Tamu King were here, Lady Du would still be in the wrong.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang’s current burst of divine power was much stronger than Lady Du’s,","reaching 600,000.","Strength was the ultimate truth.","“Brother Ba, there’s no need to say more. I can see that this old witch is here to cause trouble.","She came up here just to snatch my maid, isn’t that humiliating me?!” Jian Wushuang’s aura shook once again, his face grimacing."]},{"number":5829,"title":"Chapter 5829: I’ll Let You Walk Aboard","paragraphs":["Chapter 5829: I’ll Let You Walk Aboard","The Eye of the Candle Dragon shone brightly.","If he truly wanted to, he could severely injure his opponent in just three moves.","Seeing that she couldn’t gain any advantage, Lady Du snorted coldly and could only leave.","But she couldn’t swallow this anger. Just before leaving, she suddenly turned around and spat out venom.","The direction she aimed for was where Jinchen was.","A mere Emperor couldn’t withstand such venom.","As long as a trace touched her, there would be no hope of survival.","This time, Jian Wushuang was thoroughly enraged.","Before, it was a deliberate rage.","This time, he was truly furious. His wings flapped, and he instantly appeared in front of Jinchen. Lifting the arm of the Candle Dragon, he immediately blocked the venom.","A beam of light shot out from the Candle Dragon’s Eye, completely neutralizing the venom. “Old witch, if I don’t make you leave this cave standing upright today, I, Hu Biao, will commit crimes!” Jian Wushuang roared in anger, clenched his fist, lifted off the ground, and rushed out fiercely.","Lady Du managed to hold her ground with some tricks, but in a direct confrontation with Jian Wushuang, she had no advantage at all.","She could only try to hide.","Jian Wushuang had never encountered an opposition in terms of speed. Just as Lady Du was about to dodge, he predicted her move and kicked her hard in the face.","Sending her out of the cave in a horizontal position.","With her face hitting the ground, she slid for hundreds of miles before stopping.","Jian Wushuang walked to the entrance of the cave, ready to continue his attack.","Kababon intercepted them, incessantly advising, “Brother Hu, absolutely not, this woman has a connection with Sangmo, the Law King. We can’t lay a hand on her!”","Only then did Li Sheng and the others realize the situation and quickly stepped forward to persuade.","Now that things had just settled down, it was better not to stir up trouble. Jian Wushuang really wanted to go after them and give them another beating. He might not be able to defeat others, but he sure as hell could defeat a snake.","It just so happened that he was craving wine that was made with snake gallbladder.","Standing at the entrance of the cave, after uttering a few harsh words, he finally calmed down.","Lady Du took advantage of the situation to slip away.","After returning to the cave mansion, Kababon followed in.","“Brother Hu, you’re really hiding your power well. With such divine power, you could definitely rank second among the guardians, much stronger than that old woman!”","Jian Wushuang stabilized his divine power at 550,000 again. Hearing that he could only be second with this level of power, he was somewhat puzzled. “Could it be that the Whale Shark Guardian’s divine power exceeds 600,000?”","The Whale Shark Guardian ranked first among the guardians of Weilong Mountain.","It was rumored that he was a strong figure from the same era as the Tamu King. Although just","a guardian, his status was supreme, and he rarely ventured out.","His strength was exceptionally formidable.","He was already able to contend with the Fifth Tribulation realm.","Kababon lowered his voice and explained, “The Whale Shark Guardian’s normal divine power","is already at 630,000. Although I haven’t seen his true form, according to many people’s speculations, the Whale Shark Guardian’s full power might reach 700,000!”","“700,000!” Jian Wushuang’s face trembled.","Not only him, but even Li Sheng and others standing beside him were all looking at each other.","700,000 divine power was already the divine power of a Fifth Tribulation expert.","Even a Fourth Tribulation Universe Master in their own universe would find it difficult to erupt with such divine power.","A wild beast actually possessed such formidable divine power; it definitely harbored some undisclosed secrets!","He also made a mental note of this figure.","“Brother Hu, sorry to interrupt, but this time you offended that woman. Be careful from now on. Behind her stands a mage, Sangmo, who used to be the dragon at Weilong Mountain. But he’s not there now; I heard he went to the east coast to lay eggs and may not be back for a while. But you still need to be cautious!”","Jian Wushuang nodded in gratitude, noticing that Kababon clearly had something else to say but didn’t interrupt.","“I was actually planning to visit again after some time, but who would’ve thought that woman would suddenly provoke you, Brother Hu. So, I thought I’d take this opportunity to talk to you about something!” Kababon paused for a moment, then continued, “There are three Law Kings at Weilong Mountain, apart from Sangmo. You’ve seen the other two today. There are nine guardians; except for the Whale Shark Guardian who doesn’t care about external matters, most of the other guardians follow the three Law Kings. You might not know about this!”","Jian Wushuang finally understood that the other party was drawing him into the discussion! Pretending to be confused, he said, “Apart from Sangmo, there are also Mofu and Qian Xiang. They are all Law Kings. I wonder, Brother Kababon, which Law King do you serve under?”","“Brother Hu, I am currently under the command of Mofu King!” Kababon continued, “This time, I also wanted you to join under King Fu. Rest assured, any treasures you need, as long as they appear, we’ll all help you find them, and the amount to be handed over can also be reduced, so you can gather the necessary treasures faster!”","Jian Wushuang finally understood the benefits of joining such a small faction.","Being in Weilong Mountain, if they collectively moved to seize treasures, the lion’s share would have to be handed over.","They could only keep a small portion for themselves.","If they were to pledge allegiance to Mofu, they could avoid handing over as much in the","future.","It would also allow them to stick together.","Where there were strong individuals, there would be conflicts.","Even after entering Weilong Mountain, there were various smaller factions.","To thrive, one had to pick sides early.","By offending Lady Du this time, he essentially offended King Sangmo.","He was left with only two choices.","In his opinion, the strength of King Qian Xiang was the greatest, while Mofu King seemed","somewhat weaker.","Perhaps comparable to Guardian Whale Shark.","If he had to choose, he would definitely choose the stronger one.","But he didn’t know the other party.","On the other hand, Mofu King had extended an olive branch to him first, and Kababon was also","there to introduce him.","It seemed to be the most suitable faction for him.","After a moment’s pause, he directly agreed.","Kababon laughed heartily, “Brother Hu is indeed straightforward.”","He liked Jian Wushuang’s straightforward tone, without any beating around the bush.","The simpler the matter, the better, and it saved him from wasting words.","Anyway, he found Jian Wushuang more and more pleasing to the eye.","Jian Wushuang smiled awkwardly and chatted with the other party for a while before Kababon","bid farewell and left.","After everything was settled, he finally breathed a sigh of relief.","But there were still plenty of things to deal with in Weilong Mountain.","Beasts were not like humans.","They were cautious in the face of powerful forces.","Even the solitary beasts in the mountains would fight back when faced with Weilong","Mountain’s beasts.","There were battles almost every day.","In the days that followed, he was constantly busy.","Not only did he have to find Wu Li, but he also had to lead his people to seize territory.","After a brief reorganization, everyone finally felt secure enough to retreat for a day.","Each of them regained some energy.","Jian Wushuang calculated the current manpower.","Only Li Neng seemed reliable.","The others had no hope. And he had to let Li Sheng protect Jinchen; he might get his hands dirty.","After three days of rest, Kababon came knocking again.","Within the influence of Weilong Mountain, two unfamiliar Fourth Tribulation Special Life","Forms appeared, not only competing for treasures with Weilong Mountain’s strong ones but","also killing many of them."]},{"number":5830,"title":"Chapter 5830: Kababon’s Senior Brother","paragraphs":["Chapter 5830: Kababon’s Senior Brother","Such matters could not be tolerated.","The Mofu King immediately arranged for Kababon and Jian Wushuang to set out together to intercept the enemy.","They each brought their own people along.","Jian Wushuang was not at ease leaving Jinchen and the others at Weilong Mountain, so he took them with him.","However, he hadn’t yet recruited any powerful beasts under his command, which made his group seem somewhat lacking in diversity.","Fortunately, Kababon had quite a few underlings.","There were over a dozen beasts at the Fourth Tribulation level, each with a divine power of around 450,000, making them elites among the Fourth Tribulation level.","“Let’s go!”","Jian Wushuang and Kababon, accompanied by hundreds of powerful beasts, headed straight for the area where the incident had occurred.","As they departed, on a certain peak of Weilong Mountain, a blue-skinned beast with a grinning face emerged from a cave.","“Hu Biao!” His eyes were extremely sharp.","He was the first guardian of Weilong Mountain, the Whale Shark King.","Although he was at the Fourth Tribulation level, he dared to call himself a king, indicating his formidable strength.","He could hold his own against the Law King and even gain the upper hand when facing the weakest Mofu King.","However, he never sought alliances and always practiced alone.","Now, he found himself interested in Jian Wushuang.","Standing outside his cave, another figure emerged from within, none other than the Law King, Mofu.","“Brother Whale Shark, this Hu Biao seems reliable to me. We can include him in our plan!” Although Mofu King was a Fifth Tribulation level powerhouse, comparable in strength to the Whale Shark King, he was quite courteous to him.","It seemed the two of them were plotting something together.","Whale Shark King didn’t turn around, his eyes deep in thought.","After a long moment, he spoke, “Let’s wait a bit longer. There’s no rush for that matter. The cultivator who entered is quite weak. Even if he discovers our secret, it doesn’t matter much. A mere human cultivator, can he ruin our plans?”","“Haha, my bad for being too cautious!” Mofu King chuckled awkwardly, choosing not to speak further.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang and his group, who had already set off, were quite fortunate. In a canyon within a mountain range, they stumbled upon the two unfamiliar Special Life Forms at the Fourth Tribulation who had killed the powerful beings of Weilong Mountain.","Moreover, they happened to block the enemy’s path.","“Tsk tsk, two ignorant beings dare to cause trouble at Weilong Mountain. Capture them all for me!” Kababon gestured, and several experts at the Fourth Tribulations moved into action.","They didn’t give the other side a chance to speak. Less talk and more action. Speaking too much might not make the other side submit, but with enough fists, you could make them yield.","Or take their last breath.","The opponents were just two ordinary beings at the Fourth Tribulation realm, not requiring Jian Wushuang to personally intervene.","However, Jian Wushuang felt these two savage beasts were not so simple.","“Brother Ba, be careful, something feels off!” Jian Wushuang surveyed the surroundings, feeling it was too quiet.","Meanwhile, the two savage beasts on the other side remained calm, facing multiple enemies without panic.","At this moment, Kababon also realized that, although he didn’t sense any ambush by strong foes, there was something suspicious about this place.","It was too quiet.","And those two Special Life Forms at the Fourth Tribulation showed no signs of panic, instead wearing smug expressions on their faces.","“Come back quickly!”","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened, and he hastily shouted.","Unfortunately, it was already too late.","Six Fourth Tribulation realm savage beasts had just approached the two Special Life Forms when a huge net fell from the sky.","Looking back, they saw nine Special Life Forms of the Fourth Tribulation had appeared, led by a silver-bodied Special Life Form, unique in its flawless structure and terrifying divine","power.","The leader was exceptionally horrifying in strength, with the others possessing around 500,000 units of divine power each.","They had been set up this time.","Jian Wushuang sensed the danger and quickly transmitted a message to Li Sheng, urging him to protect their own people.","“It’s you!”","Kababon turned around, ignoring his subordinates trapped in the giant net, and focused on the silver-bodied Special Life Form leading the group.","The silver-bodied Special Life Form had black rings around its eyes, and its mouth was filled","with sharp teeth when it spoke.","“Fishhead, I told you I’d come back, and here I am! How’s that for keeping my word!”","Kababon clenched his fist, his eyes twitching.","He did indeed know the other party.","And they were once close as brothers.","Bound by life and death.","But alas!","Due to a disagreement, they had taken different paths.","Jian Wushuang also noticed the unusual relationship between the two and refrained from","acting for the moment.","However, he could tell that the other party meant harm.","“Now that you’re back, that’s good!” Kababon said indifferently.","The silver-bodied Special Life Form waved his hand, pointing to his subordinates, “What do","you think of my men? They’re quite formidable, aren’t they?”","“Not bad, they’re all very powerful!” Kababon understood the other’s implication-that he wanted to prove he had chosen the right path and was doing well.","“Haha, good brother, it’s been too long!” The silver Special Life Form walked forward alone.","Kababon remained unmoved, his voice suddenly changing tone as he spoke, “Master is already dead, and Master’s wife is no longer here. You shouldn’t have come back.”","“It seems you still don’t welcome me!” The silver Special Life Form stopped in his tracks.","Jian Wushuang was a bit confused.","He hadn’t expected this to involve the grudges of two generations.","Kababon chuckled bitterly at Jian Wushuang’s confusion and said, “Brother Hu, excuse me.","This is my senior brother, Pang Yun!”","Jian Wushuang just nodded without speaking.","Since it was someone else’s personal grudge, it was best not to get involved.","Pang Yun gestured with his finger, beckoning a subordinate who brought out a box.","Opening it casually, Pang Yun commanded, “I didn’t come back for anything else this time. I heard there’s a treasure on Weilong Mountain. Please plant this Death Calculation Grass there. It’s that simple. Junior Brother, you won’t refuse, will you?”","“Death Calculation Grass?” Jian Wushuang had never heard of such a treasure before.","He didn’t pay much attention to it.","But Kababon shook his head, his voice low, “Senior Brother, you can’t threaten me anymore. I","won’t do anything for you.”","Pang Yun paused for a moment, then couldn’t help but burst into laughter.","“Don’t you think you’re the guardian of Weilong Mountain and forget what you are?” He","pointed at Kababon, his laughter fading into seriousness, then he said sternly, “Don’t forget,","you killed Master, you betrayed the sect. You’ll never wash off the stain for the rest of your","life!”","Upon hearing such explosive news, everyone was stunned.","Jian Wushuang hadn’t expected it either.","Looking at the seemingly honest Kababon, he couldn’t believe he had committed such","treachery against his master and sect.","Looks can be deceiving.","The same goes for savage beasts.","But he felt things weren’t so simple, and he didn’t jump to conclusions.","He just waited for the situation to unfold.","Betraying the master and the sect was a serious accusation.","Once it spread, Weilong Mountain would probably expel Kababon.","In the world of savage beasts, although chaotic, respect for teachers and principles was even","stricter than among humans."]},{"number":5831,"title":"Chapter 5831: Personal Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 5831: Personal Battle","Not respecting one’s teacher would result in being looked down upon wherever one goes. If the incident with Kababon is true, then there’s no point in staying here anymore.","Everyone on Weilong Mountain is waiting for Kababon’s explanation.","Jian Wushuang adjusts his breathing, as if listening to a story.","“It’s not my fault that Master died!” Kababon shakes his head, his aura surging, and his body starting to grow larger.","He’s about to transform into his true form!","“Master!” Kababon’s face twists with anger, then he shouts, “Master’s wife said that his death has nothing to do with me!”","Buzz!","Kababon completely transforms into his true form, his divine power skyrocketing to 550,000.","Swinging his huge head, he charges directly at his senior brother, Pang Yun.","“You’re the real culprit behind Master’s death!” Kababon’s voice resounds like thunder.","At this moment, Pang Yun waves his hand to signal his subordinates to step back. His figure also begins to rise, transforming into a towering divine being, blocking Kababon’s massive fish head with one hand.","With the other hand clenched into a fist, he fiercely strikes out.","The burst of divine power clearly overwhelms Kababon.","“You beast, today I’ll make the truth about our sect clear!” Pang Yun seems to be holding the moral high ground.","The battle between the two senior brothers is about to erupt.","No one intervenes in the fight between Kababon and Pang Yun.","But Jian Wushuang can see that Kababon is no match.","Yet he can’t act recklessly.","He can only watch Pang Yun’s subordinates, standing still.","It’s called a fight, but in reality, it’s just Kababon being beaten unilaterally.","At this rate, Kababon will inevitably be killed.","However, Jian Wushuang can’t just stand by and watch Kababon die.","Here’s the translation:","How was he going to report back like this?","Pang Yun said that Kababon deceived his masters and annihilated his ancestors. Could it be true?","There was no evidence whatsoever; it was utterly ridiculous.","Once a crisis arose, Jian Wushuang would still intervene.","The aerial combat was fiercely intense.","Kababon’s true form was a colossal philosopher salmon, tough-skinned and resilient against blows.","Even after enduring a joss stick’s worth of attacks, his divine power remained undiminished. Pang Yun was a Special Life Form, the darling of All Things, and his divine power was extremely resilient.","Neither of them had any major issues.","“Pang Yun, in today’s battle, I will settle our life and death with you. I dare not forget what happened a hundred thousand epochs ago!” Kababon’s figure swayed, and his divine power unexpectedly increased again.","Seeing this, Pang Yun wasn’t surprised; he coldly said, “You finally show the skills our master taught you. Let me, your Senior Brother, see if you’ve improved over the years!”","Both of them erupted with divine power, reaching around 570,000.","This time, Pang Yun was somewhat astonished; he hadn’t expected Kababon’s divine power","to be on par with his own, making it difficult for him to accept for a moment.","Nevertheless, he still had the upper hand; even with equal divine power, his advantage as a special life form remained.","Boom!","They clashed once again, but this time, they truly went all out.","Their divine power had reached its peak, and each collision shook the earth and moved mountains.","Jian Wushuang was also extremely surprised.","He hadn’t expected Kababon to conceal his true strength so well.","Usually, he seemed like a kindly old man, but now he was displaying battle prowess that could rank in the top five among the guardians.","Perhaps those guardians all had hidden cards that hadn’t been revealed yet.","Once they exerted their full power, each one would likely be extraordinary.","This made Jian Wushuang feel awe.","One must not be careless with these savage beasts.","Boom!","The two clashed again, and Pang Yun was sent flying hundreds of miles by the head of Kababon. His divine body began to crack.","“You!” Pang Yun hadn’t expected Kababon to actually injure him.","He couldn’t accept it.","Kababon, who had always been beneath his feet, actually managed to harm him.","“I’ll kill you!”","Pang Yun formed hand seals, and a huge palm print directly covered the valley.","Clearly, he was using his strongest secret technique.","At this moment, Kababon turned to the crowd and said, “You guys, escape quickly. Run as far","as you can, don’t mind me!”","“If you can’t hold on, send a message to me!” Jian Wushuang called out to the others to","retreat.","However, Kababon was extremely confident and resolute, saying, “This time, I will definitely","defeat him!”","With that, he rushed towards the huge palm print.","Jian Wushuang led the crowd to watch the valley.","Looking at the palm print descending from the sky, she felt somewhat worried.","The power of that palm print had reached 600,000 divine power.","That was the power of 600,000 divine power expert’s casual strike.","If he could exert four times the power of the Beast God, he could easily break through it.","With four times the power of the Beast God, his divine power could also erupt to 600,000. But Kababon had already reached his limit, with only 570,000 divine power.","It was somewhat unlikely for him to block it.","If he died under this palm print, it would be very unworthy.","“You guys wait here, I’ll go take a look!” Jian Wushuang’s figure flashed, and she directly","entered the gorge.","Kababon noticed Jian Wushuang had returned but didn’t say much.","He knew Jian Wushuang’s divine power was 600,000, so resisting this palm print shouldn’t be","a problem.","And he could temporarily possess 600,000 divine power as well.","“Ah!”","Kababon roared angrily, “Ha!”","His divine power soared directly to 600,000.","A clear sky pillar broke through the palm print and rushed towards Pang Yun.","“Impossible!” Pang Yun roared in frustration.","But his figure gradually disintegrated into powder within the beam of light, while Kababon, having overexerted his divine power, transformed back into his human form and fell from the","sky.","Jian Wushuang, still reeling from the impact of their recent clash, reacted swiftly and caught","Kababon as he fell.","“You win!”","Kababon’s eyes welled with tears.","“My master died because of me, my master’s wife left because of me, my Senior Brother also","because of me...”","Seeing the sorrow in his eyes, Jian Wushuang remained silent.","It was Pang Yun’s subordinates who dared to approach at this moment.","“Brothers, this big fish has been severely injured. It’s our perfect chance to avenge our Sacred","Lord. Let’s go!” they exclaimed.","With just a glance, Jian Wushuang intimidated those who sought to take advantage of the","situation, freezing them in place.","“Get lost!”","He had no intention of resorting to violence now.","Otherwise, none of these Special Life Forms would escape.","Feeling the immense divine power emanating from Jian Wushuang, those Special Life Forms","were petrified.","Their fighting spirit instantly crumbled, and they scattered in retreat.","“Give them a way out!” Kababon shook his head.","Struggling to stand, he gazed at the ravaged valley with drooping eyelids.","This battle not only exhausted all his strength but also shattered his state of mind.","On the other hand, Jian Wushuang, this time around, did nothing.","He simply watched the spectacle unfold.","“Leave!” Kababon regained some of his strength and led the others back, despondent.","Though they had emerged victorious, there was no joy to be found.","Later, on the road, Jian Wushuang learned about the enmity between the two.","100,000 eras ago.","Pang Yun’s master had set out to find a treasure for his disciple as he aimed to break through","the Fourth Tribulation. However, they were ambushed by vipers, and the master was fatally poisoned.","As a result, Pang Yun missed his perfect breakthrough opportunity, and his strength","plummeted drastically.","Instead of reaching the Fourth Tribulation realm, he fell from the pinnacle of the Third Tribulation realm to a mere ordinary level of the Third Tribulation realm."]},{"number":5832,"title":"Chapter 5832: The past of Kababon","paragraphs":["Chapter 5832: The past of Kababon","In a fit of anger, he left the sect.","During his absence, bumping and rushing, Kababon tried to remove the venom of the viper for his master.","He had to rely on his own divine power to cleanse the toxins within his master’s body.","Everything seemed to be progressing in a positive direction.","But one failed attempt to detoxify resulted in his master’s illness worsening and eventually leading to his demise.","And at this moment, Pang Yun returned.","He had reached the Fourth Tribulation and brought many treasures back to make amends to his master.","But it was too late; his master was gone.","The two martial brothers shifted blame onto each other, neither willing to bear the burden of responsibility for their master’s death.","Eventually, they engaged in a fierce fight.","Naturally, he was no match and nearly lost his life to Pang Yun.","Fortunately, their martial sister intervened and stopped Pang Yun.","Kababon fled to the Roman River.","However, unable to let go of his master’s death, he made determined efforts and broke through to the Fourth Tribulation.","Upon his return, he challenged Pang Yun again, only to suffer defeat once more.","This time, he completely lost his mind.","Believing that as long as he was inferior to his martial brother, it meant he was responsible for his master’s death.","He relentlessly pursued their martial sister, demanding her testimony.","But then he discovered the affair between their martial sister and martial brother.","Consumed by rage, he used this knowledge to blackmail their martial sister.","In the end, she left.","With no one left to testify for him, he gradually let go.","Returning to the Roman River, he joined the Weilong Mountain.","30,000 years ago, he encountered his martial brother again, marking their final peaceful conversation.","Pang Yun threatened him to steal treasures from Weilong Mountain.","He did it.","His senior brother left with the treasure.","To avoid further threats, he began practicing forbidden techniques.","That’s why he could instantly boost his divine power.","He had been waiting for this day.","To prove himself, to rid himself of inner demons.","After hearing the whole story, Jian Wushuang didn’t pass judgment, only feeling that some things might be destined.","There’s no right or wrong.","Their master’s fate was just regrettable.","Even when he returned to Weilong Mountain, Jian Wushuang was still reminiscing about the ancient beasts in the underwater world.","The essence of All Things.","All Things!","Jian Wushuang’s gaze was steady as he sat cross-legged on the mat in the cave, closing his eyes.","In the Origin Source Starry Sky.","All Things rose.","He also entered a state of cultivation.","This incident also caused quite a stir on Weilong Mountain.","There were congratulations for Kababon’s triumph, but also jealousy trying to tarnish his","success.","But Kababon seemed indifferent.","Just like before.","But every time, he was inseparable from Jian Wushuang.","The two of them went out together with their subordinates, patrolling or killing some foreign beasts, fighting for treasures.","Time kept passing by.","In the blink of an eye, a hundred years had passed.","These days in the underwater mountains were considered peaceful.","There hadn’t been any battles that posed a threat to life.","Jian Wushuang continued his search for Wu Li without pause, but there had been no news whatsoever.","This situation was driving him close to madness.","And there was still no word from the Empress either.","A century had passed, and even for missions as significant as those of the five stars, they","should have been completed by now, unless they had met their demise within.","The longer he waited, the more attached he grew to Weilong Mountain.","However, even during these days, unrest simmered behind the mountain’s facade.","A force was slowly gathering within Weilong Mountain.","The Whale Shark Guardian began to appear more frequently during patrols and skirmishes.","Many times, he was seen alongside Jian Wushuang.","The two became familiar with each other.","To Jian Wushuang, the Whale Shark Guardian seemed to be someone with deep scheming, but their interaction was relatively amicable.","On this particular day, the Four Great Guardians returned from their external expedition.","Mofu King personally hosted a feast and invited the Four Great Guardians to join him.","Along with the Whale Shark, Kababon, and Jian Wushuang, there was another Guardian, Ju","Nian Guardian, who wasn’t very familiar to Jian Wushuang.","However, aside from Ju Nian, Jian Wushuang was acquainted with the other two Guardians, so","there was no reason to refuse.","They all went together to Mofu King’s cave to reminisce and relax.","As they toasted and drank, the day passed quickly.","They say beasts love wine, and this day proved it right!","Jian Wushuang was also quite pleased. Despite not finding Wu Li and not receiving any word from the Empress, the time spent on Weilong Mountain had been the happiest since he arrived in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","It seemed like within the Qishen Temple, he had never felt this relaxed before.","Looking back at Qishen Temple, it started with the brutal trials, crawling out of piles of dead","bodies with Hu Qing.","Witnessing Hu Qing’s rise, receiving special care from Zhen Ling, and gaining the pinnacle","martial arts skill that everyone envied.","Then, the time spent refining his body on Demon Sound Mountain with Shan Jun, although difficult, was comparatively happier.","Everything started to feel more pressurizing after being taken away by Bai Junwang.","Even though Bai Junwang didn’t say anything to him, he didn’t like the feeling of being led by","fate.","Later, Bai Junwang fell in the Three Kings Court, which greatly struck him with loneliness and","despair.","Watching his former friend succeed in the Dao, while he could only stand in the distance like a","lackey, offering silent blessings.","Fortunately, he met Teacher Xuan Yi again later, finding his own direction.","It’s not about one city or one place.","Restoring his identity as an Inheritor, causing chaos at Yuanyang Lake, and scheming against","the divine beings with Wu Zuo.","But damn it, in the end, he still lost to the divine beings.","Thinking back to the days in Qishen Temple.","He had also grown a lot.","No matter where he was, it seemed like he could find the right path.","It’s the same when he arrived in Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Fighting for more powerful strength.","They still needed him to guard the future of Qishen Temple.","The secrets on Teacher Xuan Yi’s body were still waiting for him to uncover.","Happiness always seems fleeting, he couldn’t fall into his comfort zone.","Weilong Mountain was quickly becoming his comfort zone now. Especially seeing Li Sheng flirting with a snake girl while holding a wine glass.","Jian Wushuang’s face turned dark.","Perhaps in the first few years, everyone was too suppressed.","Now, after a brief release, one by one, they all took over Weilong Mountain.","This place is good, but they shouldn’t forget why they came here!","After three rounds of drinks, everyone leaned sideways on the soft animal skins, boasting","about their achievements this time.","The lean and short catfish spirit nodded and said, “Brothers, if it weren’t for you guys holding","me back, I could have torn that damn centipede apart!”","“You’re just bragging; I saw you getting tied up and beaten by the centipede!” Kababon retorted at this moment, causing everyone to burst into laughter.","Mofu King treated them all equally and didn’t show off just because of his strength.","On the contrary, the Whale Shark King always seemed troubled, with a face full of worry.","Although Jian Wushuang kept chatting, he often observed the others.","Wanting to see what tricks they were up to.","Following their lead, he said, pretending to be drunk, “Brother Whale Shark, we’re all so","happy today, why do you still look so troubled? Is something bothering you?” Jian Wushuang deliberately pretended to be drunk and continued, “If there’s anything, just say it. We’re all brothers here; when you speak it out, it’s no longer a problem.”"]},{"number":5833,"title":"Chapter 5833: Blessed Land","paragraphs":["Chapter 5833: Blessed Land","“Sure, go ahead. Whatever it is, speak freely. We’re all allies here today. If anything is bothering you, Brother Whale Shark, I can’t promise anything, but near Weilong Mountain, there’s hardly anything we can’t handle,” Mofu King adjusted himself and inquired.","In the presence of Kababon and Whale Shark...","“Drink!” Whale Shark King didn’t respond immediately. Instead, he raised his glass, disregarding everyone, took a gulp, wiped the wine from the corner of his mouth, and let out a hearty exclamation.","After finishing his drink, his face immediately turned serious. He sighed, then glanced at everyone.","Feeling that he had set the atmosphere just right, he finally spoke up.","Jian Wushuang listened carefully, his eyes showing color halfway through.","Suddenly, he was pulled back to reality.","It turned out that Whale Shark had a secret territory near Weilong Mountain, but a century ago, an unwelcome guest had arrived unexpectedly.","This guest had set up a barrier in his territory, preventing him from entering.","Although Jian Wushuang had joined relatively late, he had heard some rumors about this secret territory.","He didn’t think much of it at first.","But hearing that someone had occupied it a century ago and set up a barrier...","It was a mysterious powerhouse.","A century ago!","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath.","This made him want to confront Wu Li.","Wu Li had disappeared into the depths of these mountains a century ago.","The cause and effect were right here, but they couldn’t locate Wu Li’s whereabouts.","He even suspected that the other party might have perished.","Now, hearing about Whale Shark’s situation, he couldn’t help but wonder if that mysterious powerhouse might be Wu Li.","But then he thought again, Whale Shark had over 600,000 divine power, even approaching 700,000.","Yet, he couldn’t break through this mysterious person’s barrier.","Based on strength alone, it didn’t seem like Wu Li.","Jian Wushuang knew Wu Li’s strength best, at the peak of 450,000, similar to Muchen.","To withstand King Whale Shark, the divine power would have to be at least 600,000 or 700,000.","This seemed exaggerated.","Even if Wu Li concealed much, he couldn’t possibly be that powerful!","The other party’s awareness of the secret of Wanliu’s activation might not be simple.","Regardless, he had to go and see if it was Wu Li.","So, without waiting for the Whale Shark King to finish, he readily agreed.","One person couldn’t break the barrier there, so mentioning it now meant they needed their help.","Together they would break the barrier.","Of course, there were benefits to it.","They could share the blessed land.","In the past, he wouldn’t have been interested in the blessed land; finding Wu Li was enough.","But since witnessing the terrifying power of the Whale Shark King, he felt it was necessary.","Perhaps it was truly a rare treasure.","It might be very useful to him.","What he lacked now were some original treasures to quickly bring his own Origin Source to perfection in the universe.","Preparing for the next tribulation.","Perfection in the universe was almost equivalent to the Fifth Tribulation.","Once he broke through the tribulation, he could even cross five tribulations at once.","A perfect universe had immense power.","And his universe sea contained the power of the Starry Sky, making it even stronger.","The pressure of crossing tribulations would be much less.","His own divine power was strong enough, and he could handle matters related to tribulations.","The efforts of the Emperor would show advantages in the tribulation realm.","The right path was very important.","Jian Wushuang was very satisfied with his foundation.","When he reached the Universe Master, it would be another period of eruption.","Now, apart from his Origin Source, everything else had been elevated to the limit level,","unable to be further improved.","Since entering the Ancient Moon Spacetime, he had only improved his divine power a bit, with","no other significant changes.","This would change once he became the Universe Master.","Once he became the Universe Master, he would soon be able to return home.","After making an agreement with the Whale Shark King, the five of them would set off","together.","The time was set for half a month later.","During these days, they wouldn’t go out again.","They needed to prepare well.","Although he could guess that it was very likely Wu Li inside, others didn’t know!","They all thought there was a monster hidden inside.","Actually, it was not the case.","The Whale Shark King and Mofu King obviously knew more.","The Catfish East and the Rushing Tyrant knew nothing.","They were likely to be deceived.","He had been getting along well with them these days, and if he had the ability, he would lend","a hand.","Returning to the cave with Li Sheng and others.","Jinchen had completely adapted to the role of a servant girl now.","Seeing Jian Wushuang and Li Sheng return, the others quickly prepared some tea and fruits.","Li Sheng casually lay on the stone bed, suddenly sober, and remarked, “Jian Wushuang, you don’t really believe in that Whale Shark King’s words, do you?”","Jian Wushuang felt relieved to hear a coherent sentence from him.","“I always feel that guy is unreliable. It’s better to be closer to Mofu King. He promised me that after this success, he’ll give me that maid!”","Upon hearing the last sentence, Jian Wushuang sprayed the water he just drank all over.","Wiping his mouth, he scolded, “Lord Li, are you planning to take a concubine here?”","“Do you treat Weilong Mountain as your home?”","Even the two young disciples from the Li family felt their ancestor’s behavior was","embarrassing.","Li Sheng sounded somewhat aggrieved, “The Empress has abandoned us. We have to move forward. It’s been over a hundred years. Even if her only task is to give birth, she could have filled a basket by now. When will it end?”","This remark made Jinchen’s expression difficult; the thought of their mother saddened him","deeply.","The past century felt like an eternity, not because of suffering, but because there was always something to do.","It wasn’t like in Yue Kingdom where one could casually enter seclusion for a million years.","Things were more casual there.","Even with Jian Wushuang’s protection, there were still tasks to fulfill here, lest suspicions","arise.","Everyone was the same.","They did what they needed to do.","“No need to wait. Maybe in half a month, we’ll have to leave!” Jian Wushuang declared.","Li Sheng exclaimed, “Is there any news about Her Majesty?”","“No!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","“Then where are we going?” Li Sheng asked, somewhat disappointed.","“To where we should go!”","Living people couldn’t be stopped by urine.","Since the Empress hadn’t contacted them, they would move forward on their own.","After all, they were now in the guise of wild beasts.","Perhaps others could reach the finish line faster.","Upon hearing this, they fell silent.","For fifteen days of leisure, Li Sheng had been pondering his own Origin Source.","Over the past century, he had obtained many treasures of Origin Source, almost all of them","picked up for free.","They threw everything into the primordial universe.","The number of black holes in the universe had reached nine thousand nine hundred.","Only a hundred black holes were left.","Ten thousand black holes were the limit of the universe.","It was also the perfection of the universe.","The beginning of All Things!","This was also the beginning of the universe.","The universe was just a shell.","Inside, there had to be everything.","There had to be light!","There had to be darkness!","There had to be life and death as well.","That would be a complete universe.","But all of that had to wait until he became the Universe Master.","For now, the key was to first elevate the Origin Source of the universe to perfection."]},{"number":5834,"title":"Chapter 5834: Storm","paragraphs":["Chapter 5834: Storm","Just one step away.","The treasure was no longer necessary; what was needed were some special opportunities.","Like the bat territory mentioned by the Whale Shark King.","Perhaps, his opportunity lay there.","It would also be a chance to confirm whether the mysterious strong figure hiding inside was Wu Li.","Killing two birds with one stone.","Fifteen days passed in the blink of an eye.","The day of assembly arrived, with the Bat King personally leading the team under the guise of inspection, they left Weilong Mountain.","This time, Jian Wushuang brought everyone along, ready to flee if necessary.","If he wanted to find Wu Li, there was no need to stay in Weilong Mountain.","When the time came, he would follow Wu Li and plan the Wanliu.","The Empress’s path was blocked, so they would take another route.","He refused to believe that Wu Li had no other preparations.","For this sacred meeting, Wu Li had probably planned for a long time.","But he lacked sufficient bargaining chips.","Opening Wanliu required the power of Life!","Wu Li probably didn’t have much.","Everything depended on him.","After leaving Weilong Mountain, Jian Wushuang had a lot on his mind, distracted for a moment, he failed to notice that someone was already watching him from behind.","The gaze was narrow and ancient.","From the main peak of Weilong Mountain.","King of the River.","Tamu!","Tamu King watched each and every one of them.","Hundreds of people in total.","“Whale Shark, it seems you’re still unwilling!” Tamu King sneered inwardly, “Even if you reach the Fifth Tribulation Realm, you’re still under my pressure. I want to see what you’re","hiding!”","The demonic bats and whale sharks leading the group were unaware that their plan had been exposed.","Any sanctuary, as long as it had a guardian, would have hidden treasures.","Except for Jian Wushuang.","Because he joined the group relatively late.","This was a well-known secret, and even Tamu King turned a blind eye most of the time.","But anything that could threaten him, he could see clearly.","“Sang Mo, weren’t you always looking for the human cultivator who stole your dragon egg?” Tamu King pulled out a communication stone and continued, “I found him for you, he’s right here...”","Tamu King even revealed the location of the sanctuary hidden by Whale Shark King.","Far upstream, Sangmo was still frantically searching for Jian Wushuang and the others. Upon receiving Tamu King’s message, he immediately set off for the mountains under the river gorge.","Besides Sangmo, there was also an ancient boat heading towards the mountains under the river gorge.","It was a group of human cultivators.","And it was the Shi Kingdom team that Jian Wushuang was quite familiar with.","This time, it was truly bustling.","People gathered from all directions.","There would definitely be a storm brewing.","The first to arrive at the location of the sanctuary was Jian Wushuang and his group.","Outside the sanctuary, Jian Wushuang didn’t feel anything special.","If he could perceive it, then this place wouldn’t be considered a rare sanctuary.","Whale Shark King took out a token and opened the sanctuary, and everyone leaped inside.","“This is the outskirts of the sanctuary, that guy is inside!” Whale Shark King led the way with everyone following.","Upon entering the sanctuary, Jian Wushuang immediately sensed a peculiar aura.","That aura?","Jian Wushuang frowned. But deep down, he shouted!","“The power of Life!”","He could hardly believe it.","There was actually the power of Life here.","If the human cultivators were to find out, they would probably all rush here.","“Wait a minute!” Jian Wushuang felt something was amiss.","The powerful observers from outside could see them.","That meant the Ancient Wood Sect had completely controlled the entire Infinite Great World.","If there were truly the power of Life here, they would have likely been plundered long ago.","Why would it be their turn?","But there truly was the power of Life here.","He wielded the power of Life, how could he not know?","So, there was only one possibility left.","This blessed land had been isolated.","Isolated beyond the boundaries of the Infinite Great World.","That’s why the Ancient Wood Sect’s experts couldn’t detect it.","This speculation could explain everything.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t believe that the Ancient Wood Sect would be so generous as to leave","life forces here.","After all, the Ancient Wood Sect was now the one in dire need of Life forces.","The true king, “Tamu King,” was on the verge of death.","He couldn’t even produce the Life force the other party needed.","After becoming the Universe Master, perhaps he could restore vitality to the Eight","Tribulation.","But now, even if he were drained dry, he couldn’t help the Eight Tribulation realm experts.","There was a fundamental difference between the Seven Tribulation and the Eight Tribulation.","There were many Seven Tribulation experts in the Ancient Wood Continent.","But Eight Tribulation experts could be counted on one hand.","The former Qishen fell at the Eighth Tribulation.","Any expert who could transcend the Eighth Tribulation was undoubtedly unique.","During his time as a Dao Lord, he could restore the Origin Source and vitality of Six","Tribulation experts.","As Emperor, he could restore the Seven Tribulation.","But to restore the Eight Tribulation, even low-level Universe Masters couldn’t do it.","He only had the strength and foundation when he reached the Fifth Tribulation.","Eight Tribulation experts could reverse the rules and incorporate their own universe into their","bodies.","This was going against the grain of the rules.","The Eighth Tribulation was already the pinnacle of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","It wasn’t as simple as they had thought.","Deep within the blessed land, the closer he got to the core, Jian Wushuang felt the immense","power of ancient Life force.","Life had its variations.","For instance, the Life force he condensed was acquired, while the Life force here was innate.","In other words, it was the Life force from some unknown powerful being leaking out.","This reminded him of Wanliu.","The branches of Wanliu contained a similar Life force.","“Could Wanliu be hidden inside?” He shook his head afterwards; if that were true, it would be","too unrealistic.","It was highly probable that these were branches left behind by Wanliu.","If it truly were Wanliu, it would possess a vitality even greater than this.","It would surpass even Wanliu that Eight Tribulation experts couldn’t break.","It would be a super relic comparable to the Ancient Moon Ruins. Some experts speculated that if Wanliu could be activated, the Ancient Wood Continent would","instantly become one of the top three in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","It would only be surpassed by the Black and White Heavens.","It’s easy to imagine how crucial the treasures and opportunities within the Wanliu are for the","entire Ancient Wood Continent.","Clearing his mind, Jian Wushuang approached, but as he touched the barrier, he was promptly","repelled.","He staggered back several steps before steadying himself.","“This barrier is indeed extraordinary!” His current divine power hovered around 550,000, yet","it was still not enough to breach it.","To enter, would one need a million units of divine power?","Even if they all joined forces, he doubted they could break through.","Whale Shark King must know this well; he wouldn’t have brought them here without some","assurance!","There must be a way.","Mofu King spoke up at this moment, “Whale Shark, stop teasing us and reveal your plan!”","“Alright, I’ll be direct. I possess a treasure that can significantly amplify divine power. However, it requires 800,000 units, a feat I cannot achieve alone. But together, we can inject","our divine power into it. Once it reaches 800,000, this artifact will activate, unleashing 900,000 or even a million units of divine power!”"]},{"number":5835,"title":"Chapter 5835: Special Treasure","paragraphs":["Chapter 5835: Special Treasure","After the Whale Shark King finished speaking, everyone except Mofu King was stunned. Entering with 800,000 divine power and coming out with 900,000?","That was too miraculous.","Even Jian Wushuang had never heard of such a thing.","Li Sheng, who had a broad knowledge, was also taken aback.","“Such a miraculous treasure actually exists?” Kababon exclaimed in astonishment.","Whale Shark King chuckled, “It’s also thanks to my good luck. I obtained it by chance. However, this treasure can only be used once. Once used, it will be damaged. I once got a weakened version of it, and after using it once, its internal source disappeared.”","“No wonder, if it could be used continuously, the value of this treasure...” Jian Wushuang shook his head, marveling at the existence of this treasure.","Truly, there was no end to the wonders.","If such a treasure could be continuously used, needless to say, everyone could understand.","It would be a top treasure comparable to the innate Universe Treasures.","Similar to the Beast God on Jian Wushuang’s body.","His Beast God Weapon, regardless of the stage, was the strongest treasure that boosted his strength.","Back then, in the Moro Spacetime, Qishen had slain all nine Beast Gods.","He refined nine Beast God Weapons.","His Candle Dragon was just one of them.","Back then, the Qishen’s luck was also good.","They grew fast enough.","He surpassed everyone in one fell swoop, slaying the nine Beast Gods and even refining the divine weapons of the Beast Gods.","When it came to the Mrop Spacetime, the treasures there were even more abundant than in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, especially in terms of quality.","They were innate Universe Treasures, abundant enough for even the Emperor to use.","Among them were Temporal Treasures as well.","He felt that the Qishen Temple possessed not just one Temporal Treasure, but possibly more.","The Qishen Temple itself was likely a Temporal Treasure.","Initially, Qishen only refined the Origin Source inside, which could be considered an improvement on the original Temporal Treasure.","Furthermore, the universe sea within the Qishen Temple was also controlled by Zhen Ling using Temporal Treasures.","This time, Fan Tianfeng, accompanied by the Flame God and several Seven Tribulations realm Scattered Tribulation experts, went to the Qishen Temple for the Temporal Treasure.","When such a treasure appeared, even Eighth Tribulations realm experts would come out to seize it.","...","Meanwhile, on the side of Whale Shark King, they had already brought out that treasure. The crowd gathered around.","Their subordinates were all outside the formation set up by Whale Shark King.","The two juniors from the Li family, along with Jinchen, were also outside.","Only Li Sheng had come in.","Li Sheng’s strength was not weaker than that of a guardian, he just hadn’t ascended yet.","But his status was similar to that of a guardian, so he came in.","Having one more person meant an additional assurance.","In total, there were six people, and even the weakest among them had a divine power of over 500,000.","Once they all erupted with their full power, converging into one force and infusing their divine power into this treasure, as long as they reached a total of 800,000, they could unleash a divine power of 900,000.","With a divine power of 900,000, only Tamu King himself could wield such strength.","By the standards set in the past, 300,000 was the threshold for the Third Tribulation, while 400,000 was for the Fourth Tribulation.","600,000 marked the threshold for the Fifth Tribulation.","The disparity between the Fourth and Fifth Tribulation was significant.","And the gap between the Fifth and Sixth Tribulation was even greater.","The Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation realm were not inferior to the Scattered Tribulation of the Seventh Tribulation.","In other words, they could unleash a million units of divine power.","At that level, surpassing a realm was much more difficult than it is now.","Even if Tamu King did not possess the power of his original universe, his explosive divine power still reached 900,000.","In other words, the combined divine power of him and his companions could unleash attacks at the level of the Sixth Tribulation.","“Everyone, let’s begin!” Whale Shark King took the lead in elevating his aura.","Starting from a baseline of 600,000, the Whale Shark King’s power surged directly to","680,000.","Transforming into their true forms, Whale Shark and Mofu spread their wings, their divine power reaching 700,000.","Jian Wushuang and the others didn’t hold back either.","They all unleashed their peak powers.","Of course, Jian Wushuang only unleashed 600,000, not reaching his limit.","He always felt that both the Whale Shark King and Mofu King were not good characters.","He needed to keep a trick up his sleeve.","The six of them leaped high into the air, floating halfway up, their hands gathering power towards the treasure below, injecting a large amount of divine power into it.","Hum!","Twelve beams of light converged into the treasure.","The power of the treasure gradually increased from the beginning.","The treasure already contained 700,000 units of divine power.","Now they only needed to add another 100,000.","However, this 100,000 divine power required at least three individuals with 700,000 divine","power to inject.","Of the six, only two barely reached 700,000.","Whale Shark King once again raised his divine power, reaching over 680,000.","Jian Wushuang could tell that the opponent had not yet exerted their full strength.","The peak should have around seven hundred thousand.","The remaining four, barely constituted a force equivalent to 700,000 divine powers.","The boundless divine power took a full 15 minutes to gather.","Yet, the divine power within that treasure only increased to about 780,000.","Still lacking 20,000.","“Everyone, just a little more effort, let’s go!” Whale Shark King took out several divine power","fruits and tossed them to the group.","As they released their divine power, their divine bodies had already begun to weaken.","They were all waiting for Whale Shark King to produce treasures to restore them.","Seeing the divine power fruits, everyone didn’t hesitate to grab them and swallow them","whole.","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang was shocked by the potency of the fruit, as it erupted with about 500,000","divine powers when swallowed.","Restoring him to his peak state.","The beams of light emitted from his hands enlarged once again.","The divine power within the treasure instantly surged by 10,000.","However, the further they progressed, the more difficult it became.","From 780,000 to 790,000 divine powers.","After reaching 790,000, it only increased by about 1,000 each time.","After nine consecutive attempts, they were stuck at 799,000 divine powers.","Whale Shark King once again produced divine power fruits.","The group erupted once more.","This time, each time could only increase by 100. Jian Wushuang frowned, finding it somewhat exaggerated.","Even if condensing divine power in the later stages would be slow.","It couldn’t possibly be this slow, right?","The treasure was indeed special, but not so special as to be this difficult during the charging","phase.","He had seen plenty of treasures before.","He had even seen two Temporal Treasures. But this treasure before them, not only was activating it special, even advancing through the","stages was so cumbersome and difficult, it raised suspicions. There must be some reason they","didn’t know.","Whale Shark King probably hadn’t told them the truth.","There was definitely concealment.","The divine power of the six individuals was once again depleted by more than half, only able","to maintain their original selves, when the treasure was finally complete.","Eight hundred thousand divine powers.","“We did it!” Whale Shark King’s face lit up with joy, then he turned to look at Mofu King.","Now their divine powers were all very weak.","If someone were to suddenly attack at this moment, it would be...","Jian Wushuang had just begun to suspect when a terrifying aura rose behind him.","It was the Whale Shark King!","But in an instant, Whale Shark King restored his divine power to six hundred thousand.","He had first come behind Jian Wushuang intending to deal with him.","But Jian Wushuang had his own countermeasures.","How could he foolishly be unprepared?","His divine power surged directly to the peak six hundred thousand. Without waiting for the opponent to make a move, he suddenly turned around, clasped his","hands together, and struck out with a seal, directly sending the Whale Shark King flying."]},{"number":5836,"title":"Chapter 5836: Changing Face","paragraphs":["Chapter 5836: Changing Face","But over there, Nianyu Dong didn’t have any backup plan. He was directly enveloped by the wings of Mofu King and completely swallowed.","Kababon, the bighead fish, was utterly terrified.","He never imagined that his backer would suddenly turn against them.","He stood frozen in place.","At this moment, Li Sheng also regained his senses, the origin in his body circulating, restoring his divine power almost completely.","After all, with the Origin Source Universe, recovery was much faster than pure ancient beasts.","Li Sheng, who had overdrawn his Origin Source to recover, immediately stepped back to avoid Mofu King’s sneak attack.","“Let’s deal with Kababon first!” the Whale Shark King, who had been pushed back, reminded.","They were also very shocked to find out that Jian Wushuang and Li Sheng both had hidden strengths.","It wouldn’t be easy to deal with them later.","Originally, his plan was to fill the treasure with divine power and then kill the others. As for the barrier of the blessed land, they didn’t want to waste this treasure to break it open.","Instead, they wanted to invite Tamu King to decipher it.","Then they would use this treasure to ambush Tamu King.","The plan was calculated accurately.","And if this treasure was truly activated, it wouldn’t just unleash 900,000 divine power, but a full million divine power.","Enough to kill the Tamu King.","This was their true plan.","But they hadn’t expected that Jian Wushuang and Li Sheng had been hiding something.","They could only deal with the others first before negotiating with Jian Wushuang and the rest.","Kababon’s divine power had reached its weakest point, and he had no ability to retaliate against Mofu King.","He could only stand foolishly in place.","The Mofu King extended a finger, unleashing a black light.","This black light contained six hundred thousand divine powers, enough to kill Kababon.","Jian Wushuang’s Candle Dragon Wings suddenly trembled, appearing beside Kababon in an instant. With a kick, he sent Kababon flying, dodging the black light.","“What are you standing there for? Run!” Seeing Kababon still not reacting, he quickly reminded him.","In these days, Kababon had been quite considerate towards him, always lending a hand when needed.","“I won’t forget your kindness. Wait for me, I’ll go find the king!”","Kababon transformed into his true form, swaying his body, and burst out with incredible speed, attempting to flee the sanctuary.","But before reaching the exit, a dragon’s roar echoed.","Soon after, a massive black dragon rushed in.","With a single sweep of its tail, it sent Kababon flying back.","“Where are the human cultivators?” The dragon was none other than Law King Sangmo from Weilong Mountain.","He directly transformed into his true form and swiftly arrived at the scene.","His blood-red eyes fixed on the group.","Struggling to get up from the ground, Kababon could no longer maintain his true form, reverting back to human form. Seeing Law King Sangmo, he shouted for help, “Law King Sangmo, you’ve arrived just in time. Mofu King and the Whale Shark King have betrayed us, please kill them!”","“Hmm?” Sangmo was momentarily stunned.","But then he could not help but burst into laughter.","He had just slaughtered a group of beasts from Weilong Mountain outside. His actions now weren’t much different from betrayal.","After all, Tamu King had snatched his territory. He never had any good feelings towards the people of Weilong Mountain.","It was just a matter of resigning from his position.","Seeing the infighting within Weilong Mountain, he couldn’t help but laugh. How could he possibly lend a hand?","“Sangmo, your timing couldn’t be better. Why don’t we join forces to kill these few riffraff, then go deal with Weilong Mountain? The three of us brothers can rule together, why bother caring about that toad’s face anymore!” The Whale Shark King knew that today’s events had definitely been exposed; he could only stabilize the situation first.","But his tricks could only fool Kababon and the others.","Sangmo was an old monster who had lived for goodness knows how many years, how could he believe such nonsense?","“Whale Shark, I’ve long seen through your treachery. I thought you would wait until the Fifth Tribulation realm to rebel, but I didn’t expect you to dare to attract the attention of the old toad in the Fourth Tribulation realm. Truly admirable!”","Sangmo had no interest in Weilong Mountain, nor did he care about the Whale Shark King’s plan.","Right now, he only wanted to find the humans who stole the dragon eggs and kill them all to ease his anger.","Those dragon eggs had been nurtured for who knows how many years, only to be stolen by","someone.","Even their lair on the shore was wiped out.","If he didn’t avenge this, he might as well not live.","“Your plans, I don’t care about. Right now, all I want to know is if there are any human cultivators hidden inside this barrier!” With that said, he raised his hand to attack the barrier.","After birthing the dragon egg, his divine power experienced a brief weakness, but now it had returned to its peak.","He possessed a formidable divine power of a full 720,000.","A punch landed on the barrier, yet it remained unchanged.","“Don’t waste your effort; you can’t break it!” The Whale Shark King shook his head.","He also wanted to break the barrier.","But he needed the assistance of Tamu King’s divine power.","The mysterious strong individual hidden inside wasn’t exceedingly powerful.","It was just that the barrier was too special.","But Sangmo couldn’t care less. He sensed a trace of Life force inside; there was definitely","something hidden within.","“What do we do now?” Mofu King couldn’t decide.","Jian Wushuang was in the same predicament.","Kababon and Li Sheng were both waiting for Jian Wushuang to speak.","Given Jian Wushuang’s character, he should have left this kind of situation long ago.","But he couldn’t just let go of the Life force inside.","And the person hidden inside was likely Wu Li.","Wu Li still carried that wooden sword crafted from the Wanliu willow branches.","If they just left like this and the barrier was broken, Wu Li would be in trouble.","“This isn’t right!” Jian Wushuang suddenly realized something.","Jinchen was still outside.","But Sangmo said to kill everyone outside.","“This is bad!”","Li Sheng also realized.","He quickly took out a token with several sound transmissions on it.","“Danger, danger, danger!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t care about the others anymore; he turned around and tried to leave.","“Where do you think you’re going?” Whale Shark King wanted to intercept at this moment.","He was also afraid that Jian Wushuang would return to Weilong Mountain and inform Tamu King of what happened here.","With both having 600,000 divine power, Whale Shark King could hold him back.","With a flutter of wings behind him, Jian Wushuang dodged the attack.","Heading towards the entrance, he flew.","Taking out the token from his sleeve, there was no plea for help above.","A chill ran down his spine.","Jinchen was merely an Emperor, albeit strong, at best comparable to a Second Tribulation","realm expert.","Sangmo, however, was a Fifth Tribulation realm expert, capable of extinguishing Jinchen","with a mere breath.","This place isolated causality, to the extent that even the people of the Ancient Wood Sect","couldn’t peer into it.","He couldn’t sense Jinchen’s aura due to the isolation of causality.","He could only leave first, using causality to probe Jinchen’s aura.","Just as he reached the entrance, his figure froze.","An ancient aura swept over.","A bow of an ancient boat appeared at the entrance, followed by a terrifying aura that directly","shattered the entrance.","The entire warship entered this paradise.","“Human cultivator!”","King Whale Shark and Mofu King’s expressions changed drastically upon sensing the","incoming aura.","Within this vast aura, there were two universe masters at the Fifth Tribulation realm.","There were even a hundred Fourth Tribulation realm Universe Masters within this massive","aura."]},{"number":5837,"title":"Chapter 5837: Shi Kingdom’s Experts Arrive","paragraphs":["Chapter 5837: Shi Kingdom’s Experts Arrive","And each of them was tremendously powerful, far beyond ordinary savage beasts. Even the weakest among them could rival the guardians of Weilong Mountain.","They all began with a divine power of 500,000.","The key were those two Universe Masters at the peak of the Fifth Tribulations realm.","Both were at the pinnacle of the Fifth Tribulations realm.","They were not comparable to half-hearted beings like the Mofu King.","Originally a bit crazy, Sangmo, upon seeing so many human cultivators, felt his eyes narrow.","Now it wasn’t about revenge anymore, it was about whether they could make it out alive. Kababon’s face also showed despair.","In a fight between savage beasts, there would be no possibility of survival.","But when encountering human cultivators, only death awaited.","Li Sheng was also taken aback.","Then he suddenly realized that he was also a human.","But now, in this ghostly appearance, neither human nor ghost, how could he face anyone?","When Jian Wushuang, who had been pushed back, lifted his head, his brows relaxed.","Because he sensed Jinchen’s aura, right here on this ancient ship.","It seemed he was still alive.","That was enough.","Returning to Li Sheng and Kababon’s side, he whispered, “Don’t rush to take action, there’s still a chance!”","This sentence was said to Kababon.","And also to Li Sheng.","In the current situation.","When human cultivators descended, the first targets to deal with were Mofu King and Sangmo.","They had nothing to do with them.","Moreover, this place was isolated.","For the human team to accurately find this place, there must be a special mission. Buzz!","As the ancient ship landed and stabilized, a large flag fluttered.","Everyone also saw the flag clearly.","“Shi Kingdom!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes twitched.","He never thought it would be such a coincidence, to encounter the team from the Shi Kingdom.","Enemies meet on a narrow road.","Offending Shi Jiu was a small matter, but in the Shi Kingdom, he had also offended some powerful Shi Clan members.","They might even be on this ship.","If he showed himself, not only would the other party not give face, they might even give him trouble.","However, Jinchen had already boarded the large ship of the Shi Kingdom, unaware of the situation.","The ship came to a halt.","Countless auras rose from the deck.","Two Universe Masters at the Fifth Tribulation realm of the Shi Kingdom, one male and one female, stood at the forefront.","And Jinchen prostrated himself before them.","Shi Jiu also knelt beside him.","“Elder, Jinchen had no other choice but to transform into a savage beast. Please spare him!” Shi Jiu knelt on the ground, pleading bitterly.","The female expert at the Fifth Tribulation realm of the Shi Kingdom frowned and said coldly, “Shi Jiu, don’t forget, she is a married woman. By protecting her like this, you’re disgracing the face of our Shi Kingdom. Since she has abandoned her human identity, she’s no different from a savage beast!”","Another Fifth Tribulation realm expert from the side stepped in to mediate.","After all, Shi Jiu was Shi Xiu’s grandson.","Some face had to be given.","“Jing Lian, let’s prioritize the mission. Why bother with the grievances between these juniors? Let’s quickly investigate the situation here and report back to the Ancient Wood Sect. Our mission will be considered complete then!”","Jing Lian snorted coldly, ignoring Shi Jiu, and said indifferently, “Shi San, I’ll give you this face, but don’t forget, in the Infinite Great World, everything must listen to me!”","Her words were extremely domineering.","Shi San felt somewhat dissatisfied deep down.","This Jing Lian woman was just a guest of the Shi Kingdom.","If it weren’t for the Shi Kingdom’s support, she wouldn’t even have had the chance to compete for the position of Saintess in the Holy Meeting; she might have died outside long","ago.","She was originally a foster daughter of an elder of the Shi Kingdom.","But now she dared to suppress the descendants of the Shi Kingdom’s sects.","Naturally, there was some dissatisfaction.","But for the greater plan, he could only endure.","Waving his hand to signal Shi Jiu to quickly take Jinchen away, he didn’t say anything more.","The mission of the Shi Kingdom’s team this time was quite simple!","It was to investigate the situation here.","Because after Jian Wushuang and his group entered, everything was cut off.","The Ancient Wood Sect felt something was amiss, so they sent the nearest Shi Kingdom team","to investigate.","When the two Fifth Tribulation realm Universe Masters of the Shi Kingdom investigated, they were startled.","As for Mofu King and Sangmo, they were utterly disregarded.","Once the investigation was done, it was convenient to kill them off.","But this investigation left them dumbfounded.","“It’s the power of Life!” Jing Lian’s face showed shock.","But Shi San was overjoyed.","The power of life is like icing on the cake for the Universe Master.","But for those undergoing tribulation, it’s like a timely help in adversity.","The Shi Kingdom had quite a few strong dispersal tribulation experts.","If they could seize the power of Life here, then this Sacred Assembly, even if not chosen as the Holy Maiden, would not have been in vain.","“Let’s kill these small fries first!”","Shi San and Jing Lian acted together.","“Shi Tian, take people to deal with those Fourth Tribulation realm savage beasts, leave these two to us!” Jing Lian directly ordered everyone, each to their own tasks.","Jian Wushuang secretly felt something was wrong, so he retreated with Kababon and Li","Sheng.","“Uh-oh, they found the power of Life!”","He originally thought the other party wouldn’t be so sensitive, but they still discovered it.","Then they definitely won’t hold back and will surely slaughter all the savage beasts here.","“Jian Wushuang, should we proactively reveal our identities?” Li Sheng began to fear.","But Kababon couldn’t quite understand Li Sheng’s words!","Jian Wushuang shook his head and looked at Li Sheng.","“This place hides great secrets, they won’t let us go, have you forgotten about the experts of","the Celestial Wolf Clan?”","When they first entered, their biggest opponents were even among their companions.","Now, exposing their identities will only lead to a quicker death.","Not revealing their identities was crucial; at least they could align themselves with the side of","the savage beasts, leveraging the power of Mofu King and the Whale Shark King.","If they were exposed, both sides would hunt them down.","Well, at least none of those at the Fifth Tribulations realm pursued them.","Just some Universe Masters at the Fourth Tribulations realm came.","Those, they could handle.","Li Sheng also realized that they could only rely on themselves at this point.","“Brother Kababon, have you asked the Emperor for help?” Jian Wushuang thought of the","River King at this moment.","A Special Life Form at the Sixth Tribulations realm.","If they could involve that one too.","Then this battle would become lively. They, as insignificant as they were, could also take advantage of the chaos.","Kababon swallowed hard, murmuring, “I’ve sent the message, but there’s been no reply!”","“Send another message, tell him there’s Life force here, and there are Fifth Tribulations realm cultivators of the human race. Tell him to hurry over, or else the treasures will all be snatched by human cultivators!”","As long as there were enough benefits, no River King could sit still.","With his strength, it was difficult for him to perish within the Infinite Great World.","A Special Life Form at the Sixth Tribulations realm.","No different from a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation realm.","Just lacking their own Dao Arena.","Those at the Fifth Tribulations realm were the same; who could bring their own universe","here?","That’s the advantage.","The human race couldn’t threaten Tamu.","Once he arrived, even if he couldn’t sweep the entire area, he could repel the Shi Kingdom’s","troops.","As for Jinchen, there was a high probability she reconciled with Shi Jiu.","Following the Shi Kingdom’s troops was much better than following him. With him, there’s a high probability they’d still wander."]},{"number":5838,"title":"Chapter 5838: Last-Hit Expert, Kababon","paragraphs":["Chapter 5838: Last-Hit Expert, Kababon","As long as the Empress didn’t come out, they would be on tenterhooks.","Moreover, after he found Wu Li, he would definitely not stay here and would continue to move forward.","At that time, it would be more dangerous.","Jin Chen was different from Li Sheng.","Their strength was also different.","If Li Sheng died, he wouldn’t even bat an eye. However, if Jinchen died, how would he explain it to the empress and Queen Yun Zhi?","Although there was a high chance that he would no longer have anything to do with the Yue Kingdom.","However, Queen Yun Zhi was a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation realm, so they might have more interactions in the future.","He couldn’t offend or disappoint her.","Now, Jinchen had reunited with her little man, and the two of them were living a shameless life.","Jian Wushuang was also freed.","He had no scruples.","He spread his wings and spiraled into the sky.","His divine power directly increased to 650,000.","The Fourth Tribulation experts of the Shi Kingdom were stunned.","“Tsk tsk, you think you can catch me?” Jian Wushuang’s Candle Dragon Claw rose slightly.","It exploded with godly power that shook the world and forced dozens of Universe Masters at the Fourth Tribulation realm back.","Shi Tian, who was leading the group, could not help but vomit blood. He had suffered quite a few injuries.","Perhaps it was because Li Sheng had turned into a desolate beast, but his attacks were especially ruthless. He took the opportunity to attack.","Kababon’s divine power had yet to recover, so he could only watch the two of them kill in all directions.","“Brother Hu, I don’t want to say this, but how much strength have you been hiding?” Kababon was dumbfounded.","Seeing that the usually wretched Li Sheng was able to kill in all directions, he felt a little itchy. He rushed forward and casually grabbed a heavily injured Shi Kingdom expert to deal damage.","Mofu King was delighted when he saw that Jian Wushuang was almost done fighting before they started.","“Whale Shark, don’t use that move yet. Maybe we still have a chance!”","Three against two!","The advantage lay in the desolate beasts.","The Whale Shark King could also be considered a Fifth Tribulation realm expert.","They all had a backup plan. The divine power they had just consumed had all been recovered now.","Kababon looked around and finally understood.","Everyone had a backup plan.","Anyone could quickly recover to their peak.","Only he himself was nothing.","However, when he thought of Nianyu Dong, who had already fallen, he still had someone to die with.","“Hah!” Whale Shark King and Mofu King burst out at the same time, rushing over to face the strongest Jing Lian.","The remaining Shi San is naturally given to Sangmo.","The two sides instantly engaged in battle.","Trembling ripples erupted, enough to shatter a Third Tribulation realm expert.","Jian Wushuang was not idle either.","After all, there were a hundred Fourth Tribulation realm experts in the Shi Kingdom’s team.","Other than some who had to protect the Emperor, all of them were mobilized to attack Jian Wushuang and the others.","Shi Tian burned his divine power and shouted angrily,” Attack together! Kill that big-headed fish first!”","It was one thing to be beaten up by Jian Wushuang.","That fat-headed fish actually dared to hit him when he was down.","Taking advantage of his weakened divine power, he came up to attack.","He even specialized in slapping faces.","You can’t stand it!","Jian Wushuang’s divine power was as high as 650,000, and none of the Universe Masters at the Fourth Tribulation Realm were his match.","Five times the Beast God Power, he could be considered to have used it to the extreme.","He wore the Candle Dragon Inner Armor and the General’s Armor together.","He directly ignored their attacks and single-handedly took on a hundred people.","Every universe master in the fourth tribulation realm was able to get close to him.","The strongest Shi Tian only had 600,000 Divine Power. Even if he burned his Divine Power, he was not as powerful as Jian Wushuang.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang’s divine power was almost unlimited.","Given enough time, all 100 Universe Masters at the Fourth Tribulation realm would have died.","However, these people had also learned to be smart.","They began to take turns fighting.","Moreover, they would split up to deal with Li Sheng and Kababon.","In this way, Jian Wushuang would be cautious.","Li Sheng and Kababon were chased by more than ten Universe Masters at the Fourth","Tribulation stage.","The key was that Kababon’s divine power had yet to recover.","Even if he revealed his true form, he wouldn’t be able to resist so many Universe Masters.","“Brother Kababon, quickly eat this fruit!” Li Sheng took out a fruit of divine power from his","mustard seed.","“Brother Li, you’ve hidden your strength well!” Kababon was overjoyed and said excitedly.","“Haha, my divine power recovers quickly, so I can’t bear to eat it!”","The two of them could still laugh when they were being chased.","Jian Wushuang felt that the two of them were too ambitious.","“You guys find a chance to go out first. Don’t worry about me!” He turned to remind the two.","It would be best if they could leave first.","Anyway, he couldn’t help much here.","It would be best if he escaped back to Weilong Mountain.","That place was at least safe.","No matter how powerful the human team was, they would not be foolish enough to go to the","nest of a Sixth Tribulation realm Special Life Form.","He punched back the Universe Masters who were rushing at him, and then he stopped the Universe Masters who were chasing after Li Sheng.","“Stop chasing, your opponent is me!”","Jian Wushuang floated in the air and exerted force with his Candle Dragon Arm, causing the","wings on his back to shake open instantly.","The dozen or so Universe Masters who were chasing after them all retreated.","“Get into formation and kill them!” Shi Tian was anxious!","The nine Universe Masters at the Fourth Tribulation realm had already formed their","formation and rushed forward.","Nine battle formations were gathered one after another.","The headless and faceless man held the supreme treasure in both hands and rushed toward","Jian Wushuang.","“For real!”","Jian Wushuang frowned.","When the arrays were combined, each array formation had 600,000 Divine Power.","Including Shi Tian, there were ten super experts with 600,000 divine power.","Even though his divine power was 650,000, it was still a little strenuous.","It was difficult for two fists to fight against four hands.","Now, he could not use the Candle Dragon Wings to force them back.","They could only fight close to each other.","In the battle, he was attacked from both sides.","600,000 divine power landed on his body. Even if it was weakened a lot, it would still hurt.","Boom!","Jian Wushuang relied on his speed to dodge the attack of one battle formation, but the next","battle formation rushed over.","He did not have much time to react.","Shi Tian held a war hammer in his hand and stood at the periphery, waiting for an opportunity","to move.","Jian Wushuang tore the sky with his claw and repelled four battle formations. He then turned around and faced the other battle formations.","However, just as he turned around, a figure appeared behind him.","Shi Tian!","He had been looking for this opportunity for a long time.","Seeing that Jian Wushuang was distracted, he immediately rushed forward, raised his war","hammer, and smashed it on Jian Wushuang’s head.","Boom!","The huge blow sent Jian Wushuang flying from the sky to the ground of the blessed land.","This commotion was not small.","Mofu king also noticed it.","He had thought that he would have a chance if it was three against two, but he realized that he","was far from being a match for them.","Whale Shark and Mofu were suppressed by Jing Lian even though they joined forces. Sangmo was not any better. He did not even have the ability to fight back after being beaten","by Shi San.","Now, he realized that Jian Wushuang’s side could not hold on any longer.","They were completely panicking.","However, they still had a trump card.","That supreme treasure that was already filled with divine power.","If it was used on the other party, it could definitely kill them instantly.","However, this treasure was meant for King Tamu.","If he used it now...","The plan was completely ruined."]},{"number":5839,"title":"Chapter 5839: Killing Intent Rising","paragraphs":["Chapter 5839: Killing Intent Rising","They actually did not have any conflict of interest with the human team.","If he really couldn’t do it, he would just slip away first.","That treasure must not be used unless it was absolutely necessary.","However, the situation was getting worse and worse. They had to consider escaping.","Li Sheng and Kababon slowed down when they saw Jian Wushuang being shot down.","“Do you think Brother Hu can withstand it?” Kababon asked worriedly.","“He should be able to,” Li Sheng blinked and said vaguely.","Shi Kingdom warship.","several Quadruple Tribulation realm experts were watching the battle from above the deck.","In addition to Quadruple Tribulation realm experts, there were also many Triple Tribulation realm experts and several emperors, including Shi Jiu and Jinchen.","Jinchen did not reveal Jian Wushuang’s identity.","Seeing Jian Wushuang being ambushed by Shi Tian, her heart sank.","The reason she had been able to survive all these years was because of Jian Wushuang.","Even if she had many opinions about Jian Wushuang, she could still distinguish between what was important and what was not.","Seeing Jian Wushuang being besieged, she was also worried.","Being ambushed now, her strength had weakened.","She couldn’t bear to watch anymore and revealed Jian Wushuang’s identity to Shi Jiu.","“What? That’s Jian Wushuang!” Shi Jiu exclaimed in shock.","Jinchen nodded.","She didn’t understand why Jian Wushuang didn’t reveal her identity and instead fought against the strong warriors of the Shi Kingdom.","Wouldn’t it be better to reveal it?","But Shi Jiu understood.","If they revealed it, they would likely face attacks from all sides.","So they couldn’t say it.","When he was defeated by Jian Wushuang, he still had confidence in catching up to her.","But when he knew that Jian Wushuang, as an emperor, was facing a hundred Quadruple Tribulation realm experts, that confidence was completely shattered.","He would never be able to surpass her in his lifetime.","To him, Jian Wushuang was not just an opponent, but an enemy.","However!","This opponent was worthy of respect.","He couldn’t forget how Jian Wushuang had given him the fruit to restore his divine power.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang had been protecting Jinchen all along, a fact he could discern.","Therefore, he decided to assist Jian Wushuang.","Seeking help from the ancestors.","“Hmm?” Shi San, who was ruthlessly attacking Sangmo, paused when he received a transmission from Shi Jiu.","He turned his head towards Jian Wushuang’s direction.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang was slammed into the ground.","The nine great formations rushed forward, leaving Jian Wushuang no chance to catch his breath.","They intended to deliver a fatal blow.","Stone Tian took the opportunity to hammer Jian Wushuang relentlessly.","The protective feathers of the Candle Dragon Wings managed to block most of the attacks.","Yet, Jian Wushuang was still shaken, coughing up blood.","The recent blow had even blurred Jian Wushuang’s consciousness.","With a groan, Jian Wushuang finally regained consciousness, bloodshot eyes brimming with","anger.","He had initially held back, but these people were relentless in their desire to see him dead. He couldn’t allow this to continue.","“Get lost!”","A strong surge of energy repelled the encircling formations, and Jian Wushuang’s wings trembled as he soared into the sky once more.","You’ve provoked me!”","Sensing someone charging from behind, he struck back with a claw, tearing through the formations.","Blood stained the claws of the Candle Dragon.","Watching all this from afar, Shi San’s eyes flickered.","Then, he glanced in the direction of the warship.","Shi Jiu!","Ranked in the top three among the contemporary emperors of Shi Kingdom.","He was also Shi Xiu’s grandson.","His future was limitless.","Unfortunately, he had fallen for the princess of Yue Nation.","Someone who could have easily satisfied him.","But then Jian Wushuang appeared out of nowhere, disrupting everything.","It further plunged Shi Jiu into a period of desolation.","Later, after Jinchen and Jian Wushuang’s grand wedding, Shi Jiu finally managed to come to terms with it. He once again unleashed his potential, surpassing numerous geniuses and emerging as the rising star of the future Universe Master of the Shi Kingdom.","Seeing Jinchen again, his resolve visibly weakened.","Witnessing Jian Wushuang’s formidable strength only added to his dismay, feeling","inadequate compared to Jinchen once more. This was not the demeanor Shi San expected from","Shi Jiu.","He considered letting Jian Wushuang go.","He hesitated.","But!","For the sake of the family’s prodigies.","He couldn’t let go.","Shi Jiu hadn’t anticipated that his good intentions would incite the ancestral elders of the","family to harbor murderous intent towards Jian Wushuang.","With a glint of coldness in his eyes, Shi San transmitted to Shi Tian, “Quickly kill this person","and then come to help me deal with this dragon!”","“Yes!” Shi Tian swung his war hammer and began instructing the nine great battle","formations, preparing to combine once more.","The nine great battle formations converged.","Jian Wushuang was momentarily stunned, thinking they were about to attack together again!","But he realized the nine great battle formations were actually beginning to merge.","Slowly, they coalesced into a super formation.","And the leader of this super formation was Shi Tian.","“You beast, prepare to meet your end!” The formation emitted a cacophony of voices,","extremely awe-inspiring.","One hand wielded the war hammer, the other shattered defenses.","Divine power reached a staggering seven hundred thousand.","Jian Wushuang felt an immense pressure.","With just divine power alone, he stood no chance.","His divine power began to decline gradually.","600,000.","500,000.","400,000.","Once it stabilized.","Jian Wushuang tore off his disguise, revealing his true appearance.","Dressed in a black robe, he carried an ancient blue divine sword on his back.","His long hair billowed, partially obscuring his sword gaze.","The super formation also came to a halt.","At this point, some had already recognized Jian Wushuang’s identity.","“What do we do?” Everyone paused.","Originally, they were hunting a savage beast.","Now they realized that savage beast was Jian Wushuang.","For a moment, they found it hard to accept.","How could they continue this fight?","Why even fight at all?","But Shi Tian didn’t care about such thoughts. He shouted loudly, “It’s just an illusion created","by this beast, don’t let it cloud your judgment!”","Jian Wushuang’s presence was revealed, everyone saw it.","Shi San noticed it too.","But no one intervened.","Their silence was tacit agreement.","After all, this was the Infinite Great World.","If someone died, there was no one to blame but themselves.","Seeing Jian Wushuang exposed, Lisheng felt like Jian Wushuang was ready to negotiate.","But what followed was just as Jian Wushuang had warned him.","The strong of Shi Kingdom wouldn’t hold back.","They wouldn’t spare them just because they were of the same race.","In the outside world, disputes didn’t spare kinship.","On the contrary, the greatest enemies of the human race were often their own kind.","Those special beings had never considered sparing them.","It was always the human race invading the domains of those Special Life Forms that led to","hostility. Kababon, upon seeing Jian Wushuang’s true identity, hesitated for a moment, but he chose to believe Shi Tian’s words.","In his eyes, Jian Wushuang was just a savage beast.","No different from him.","They were brothers of a kind.","Otherwise, why would Jian Wushuang save him?","“It’s all fake!” Kababon muttered to himself, his speed increasing once again as he tried to","leave this place quickly, to return to Weilong Mountain and bring the King, to sweep away","everything.","On the deck of the warship, Shi Jiu’s gaze gradually dimmed.","He sensed the killing intent.","His fists clenched tight.","But he couldn’t change anything.","He lacked the strength, and his remaining identity couldn’t stop the Patriarch.","Jinchen’s eyes turned red, unable to look anymore.","Mofu King and the others were also shocked by Jian Wushuang’s identity. However, Sangmo noticed that Jian Wushuang’s aura was somewhat similar to the aura of the strong individual who had attacked the warship before."]},{"number":5840,"title":"Chapter 5840: Fallen Kababon","paragraphs":["Chapter 5840: Fallen Kababon","Anger surged in his eyes, yet he couldn’t break free.","Otherwise, he would have to resort to devouring Jian Wushuang alive.","Amidst the countless gazes, Jian Wushuang remained silent, refusing to beg for mercy.","Jian Wushuang revealed his true form.","Contrary to what these people thought, he didn’t intend to seek reconciliation by relying on his identity as a member of the human race.","Things had escalated to this point in the fight.","There was no reason for peace talks.","By revealing his true form, he naturally intended to wield the Wanjie Sword.","Clang!","At this moment, silence spoke louder than words.","The moment he drew the Wanjie Sword, it represented his course of action.","He was ready to continue the battle!","“Dual Sword Slice!”","Jian Wushuang’s hands crossed.","One hand symbolized Life, the other Death.","Black and white swords.","Soaring into the sky.","Straight into the formation below.","The Starry Sky chart hovered in the air.","Since his divine power couldn’t match up, he relied on his origin to defeat the opponent.","“Bring it on!” Shi Tian wielded his war hammer, mocking, “Watch as I crush your skull!”","With that, he swung the hammer, meeting Jian Wushuang head-on.","Buzz!","The sword clashed with the hammer, producing a deafening sound.","Clang!","Jian Wushuang’s figure pierced through the formation, his hands trembling uncontrollably. Snap!","The Wanjie Sword fell from his grasp.","The recent clash had numbed his hand, and his divine body was trembling.","Only his Origin Source remained resilient.","The power of the starry sky filled his entire body.","The ancient transformation had never weakened.","But he couldn’t hold onto his own sword.","In that one strike, he lost.","“Is that all?” Shi Tian manipulated the formation, turning around to taunt, “How do you expect to defeat me?”","With a divine power of 700,000.","Incredibly formidable.","At the pinnacle of the Fifth Tribulation realm.","Jian Wushuang was truly no match.","He had almost exhausted all his resources.","Even his current One Thought Universe was only useful for escape, unable to subdue the opponent.","Jian Wushuang’s armor enhancement wasn’t enough.","Now, he was left with his last resort.","As for his Ancient Monastery Jade Urn, it only contained 700,000 divine power.","Even if he used it, he couldn’t defeat the opponent.","After all, the opponent already possessed 700,000 divine power.","Moreover, he didn’t want to rely on the Ancient Monastery Jade Urn to defeat the opponent.","He wanted to defeat his opponent with his true strength.","Buzz!","Stabilizing his wrist, a burst of Thought power erupted from his palm, retrieving the falling Wanjie Sword back into his hand.","As long as he held the sword, he had absolute confidence.","Even if the opponent had 700,000 divine powers.","He still had confidence.","The first two sword moves of the Starry Sky Chronicles.","He had already comprehended them perfectly.","The power of Death, he had indeed learned a lot from Mie Sheng.","And Life could also be reversed into Death.","It could help him comprehend the true meaning of Death.","So, what remained was integration.","Just like the fusion of divine power and Origin Source.","Both were extremely difficult.","The Super Ancient Transformation required him to become the Master of the Universe in","order to have hope of creating it.","The third sword move of the Starry Sky Chronicles was the same.","It required him to reach the realm of the Universe Master.","The combination of Death and Life.","The Reincarnation Sword!","Jian Wushuang closed his eyes, facing the onslaught of battle once again, he split the","mountain with one sword.","After another round of combat, he could barely hold his ground.","But he was still at a disadvantage, not a match at all.","Sword!","Representing slaughter and sharpness.","Encountering the war hammer.","Perfectly countered.","One force broke all laws.","No matter how powerful his swordsmanship was.","Without sufficient strength, it was useless.","Jian Wushuang’s hand gripping the sword shattered, along with his arm.","If only his divine power could merge with the ancient variations, he wouldn’t be this fragile.","But using divine power meant he couldn’t unleash the power of the starry sky.","“Damn it!” Jian Wushuang clenched the sword, still unwilling to accept it.","He lunged forward again.","With each collision, his flesh and divine power shattered.","Soon, there was no intact part on his body.","Even though he recovered quickly, the opponent’s hammer strikes were faster.","There was no flesh left on his arms.","His fingers snapped one by one.","Yet he still held onto the sword, never letting go.","Persist!","Be resolute!","Jian Wushuang relied on these two points to reach this day.","The powerful beings of the Fifth Tribulations in the distance all paused.","They wanted to see how this legendary Emperor would fall.","The Whale Shark and Mofu met each other’s eyes, naturally replenishing their divine power.","But Sangmo didn’t think so.","Jian Wushuang must die.","And he must die by his hand.","“Humankind, you should die by my hands!” Sangmo’s true dragon form rushed out while Shi","San was distracted, heading straight for Jian Wushuang.","Shi San had intended to intercept, but he realized the opponent was targeting Jian Wushuang.","He sent a random message to Shi Tian.","“Let the wild beast kill him, no need to dirty your own hands!”","Jinchen was still watching from the warship.","If the Shi Kingdom killed Jian Wushuang, it might provoke resentment from the Yue","Kingdom.","Although she didn’t care.","But to eliminate a scourge with the help of others, that was the best outcome.","Shi Tian controlled the battle formation, pounding Jian Wushuang with each blow, not yet","satisfied.","But upon hearing the patriarch’s command, he had to stop.","“Kid, I don’t even need to kill you myself, seems like you have quite a few enemies!” Shi Tian","sneered coldly and stepped back.","And at this moment, Sang Mo also charged forward.","Li Sheng and Kababon, who were about to escape, saw Jian Wushuang about to fall and","stopped their movements.","Kababon didn’t deceive himself either.","The Hu Biao he knew was indeed a human.","There was no time to call Tamu King now. Even if Tamu King came, he couldn’t save Jian Wushuang.","“Brother Li, go and save yourself!” Kababon said, then turned and rushed towards Jian","Wushuang.","Li Cheng shouted anxiously, “You foolish fish, are you going to your death?”","He couldn’t understand why Kababon, a savage beast, would go to rescue Jian Wushuang.","But they had a friendship of a hundred years.","Was it really necessary?","Leaving him alone standing at the entrance of the cave, neither leaving nor staying.","His thoughts twisted.","He thought of what he had to protect.","The backbone of the family had collapsed.","The Li family only had him, the Universe Master, left.","He couldn’t go to his death.","With this in mind, he dashed out of the sanctuary without looking back.","Kababon, on the other hand, exerted all his strength, rushing from the entrance of Life to the","entrance of Death.","Originally, he could have chosen to escape.","But he couldn’t bear to see someone who saved him go to their death.","His master had died like this, and his master’s wife had also left.","His martial brother even died by his hand.","He didn’t want to live in guilt anymore.","“Hu, my friend, I’m here to help you!” His true form shaking its chubby body, rushed towards","Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang heard the shout and instinctively turned to look.","Randomly, he angrily shouted, “Go away!”","“You dead fish, you’ve come just in time!” Shi Tian’s face lit up.","When they hadn’t formed a formation, this fat fish had often beaten him.","Now was the chance for revenge.","Lifting his war hammer, he blocked Kababon’s path.","Boom!","The war hammer struck Kababon’s fish head.","Even though his skull was tough, it couldn’t withstand the force of 700,000 divine power in","one blow.","Kababon was immediately dazed.","His vision began to blur.","Shi Tian lifted the war hammer again and struck down once more, causing Kababon’s huge","fish head to cave in completely.","“Such a big fish head, yet so fragile under the hammer!” Shi Tian hadn’t had enough, but his","opponent couldn’t hold on any longer.","With extreme disappointment, he kicked Kababon’s spine, scattering his true form all over. The huge fish head fell right in front of Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":5841,"title":"Chapter 5841: Super Eternal Ancient Transformation","paragraphs":["Chapter 5841: Super Eternal Ancient Transformation","Kababon’s vision blurred, and the last thing he saw was the true face of Jian Wushuang. Blood trickled from the corner of his mouth.","Using the last shreds of consciousness in his mind, he muttered to Jian Wushuang, “So... Brother Hu... looks like this, huh!”","“Better... looking than... me!”","Jian Wushuang reached out, intending to transfer the power of Life to him, but found it was too late.","His eyes began to dim.","The blue flames of Starry Sky power surged continuously.","His divine body started to loosen.","Constantly trembling.","Jian Wushuang lowered his head, gritting his teeth as he growled deep in his throat, “You shouldn’t have come back!”","He couldn’t die.","He still had the One Thought Universe, capable of unleashing the Three Quakes Shuttle.","Capable of escaping.","But Kababon didn’t know.","He thought Jian Wushuang was in dire straits.","Sang Mm who rushed over, didn’t change his mind because of Kababon’s fall, still preparing to attack Jian Wushuang.","Seeing the giant fish head, Shi Tian felt somewhat uncomfortable. He operated the battle formation to descend from the sky, fiercely crushing the fish head with the formation’s knee.","The blood inside the fish head splashed all over Jian Wushuang’s face.","Jian Wushuang’s pupils contracted, a wave of rage erupting from the depths of his heart.","At this moment, he completely erupted.","His divine power surged along with his Origin Source.","The blue aura on his body soared into the sky.","“Ah!!!!”","Jian Wushuang clenched his fists, and with a burst of power, directly repelled Sangmo and Shi Tian in front of him.","Buzz!!!!","At this moment, he underwent a qualitative change.","The blue aura on his body condensed into substance.","His divine power overflowed, merging with the power of the Starry Sky.","This was the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!","His divine power and origin directly surged fifty times.","His divine power, originally at a constant level of four hundred thousand, increased by 50 times in combat power.","Now it was 800,000 divine power.","Equivalent to doubling his divine power.","And his Origin Source also doubled.","An already complete universe suddenly overlapped with two universes.","He now wielded the Starry Sky Chronicles with more power than ever before.","Killing those at the Fifth Tribulation realm seemed almost effortless for him.","“Is this the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation?” Jian Wushuang, deep within his palm, gathered an aura, feeling incredulous.","He grew stronger, yet there was no joy in it.","Instead, anger surged through his entire being.","Sangmo noticed a change in Jian Wushuang’s aura and thought it was just a momentary burst.","He lunged forward, jaws wide open, aiming to swallow Jian Wushuang whole.","The gaping maw headed straight for Jian Wushuang.","Without even turning his head, Jian Wushuang simply raised his hand and flung Sangmo out a hundred miles away, crashing against the barrier of the core of that sanctuary.","Sangmo, rubbing his sore jaw, could hardly believe Jian Wushuang’s strength.","The sensation he felt when he had just made contact with Jian Wushuang, he had experienced it before.","But that time, it was facing Tamu King at the Sixth Tribulation realm.","Shi San and the others who witnessed this scene from afar were all dumbfounded.","“How is this possible?” Shi San exclaimed.","The Jian Lian Demoness had no idea who Jian Wushuang was, as she had been in seclusion preparing for the Sacred Assembly and was ignorant of such matters.","She couldn’t care less about Jian Wushuang.","But Shi San knew that Jian Wushuang was merely an Emperor.","Previously, reaching the threshold of the Fifth Tribulation realm was thought to be the limit.","Yet now, with just a single blow, Sangmo was gravely injured.","He couldn’t even achieve that!","The Mofu King and Whale Shark revealed expressions of joy, hastily communicating with Sangmo, advising him not to provoke Jian Wushuang again, as they might end up joining forces with him later.","But they didn’t know that Jian Wushuang, as he was now, didn’t need any allies.","He could take them all down single-handedly.","Those on the warship were also astonished by Jian Wushuang’s outburst.","Shi Jiu was gaping, unsure of what to say at this moment.","Deep down, he felt the foolishness of the ancestors.","And their narrow-mindedness!","Shi Tian was now somewhat panicked, exclaiming, “How can you be so powerful?”","“Because, standing before you is the one and only, Super Jian Wushuang!” Jian Wushuang’s voice barely faded as he disappeared before Shi Tian’s eyes with a swift movement.","Shi Tian’s eyes and psychic power both tried to capture Jian Wushuang’s figure, only to find that Jian Wushuang had truly vanished before him.","“Fool, I’m above your head!” Jian Wushuang had already collected the Wanjie Sword,","considering it unworthy of such rubbish.","With the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, even the most basic power amounted to","800,000 divine power.","Below the Sixth Tribulation realm, there were hardly any opponents.","With arms crossed over his chest, he disdainfully stared down at the opponent.","Shi Tian quickly looked up, wanting to take the initiative.","However, Jian Wushuang suddenly descended, forcefully stomping on the battle formation","operated by Shi Tian.","He directly stomped Shi Tian into the ground, then spat out and taunted, “Where’s your high","and mighty demeanor?”","“And what about your strength?”","Shi Tian struggled to free himself from Jian Wushuang’s foot, but just as he managed to get","up from the ground, Jian Wushuang raised his leg and delivered a knee kick, sending Shi Tian flying hundreds of miles away, just like Sangmo.","Both crashed into the barrier.","However, Sangmo and the others stayed aside, not daring to step forward again.","Shi Tian, on the other hand, was extremely resentful and roared, “Jian Wushuang, you damn","son-in-law, I’ll make you pay with your life!”","Shi Tian went crazy, swinging his war hammer and charging.","Jian Wushuang merely used a finger to block the once unbeatable war hammer.","Under the war hammer, he had suffered greatly.","And this war hammer even killed Kababon!","Shi Tian couldn’t believe that his war hammer couldn’t even budge Jian Wushuang.","He raised it again and fiercely smashed it towards Jian Wushuang.","Repeatedly, he struck tens of thousands of times.","Yet Jian Wushuang blocked them all with just one finger.","At the final strike, Jian Wushuang directly grabbed the war hammer with his hand.","This war hammer was a treasure of the Fourth Tribulation Realm, extremely tough.","Jian Wushuang gripped the war hammer, making it impossible for Shi Tian to pull it out, then","The angrily shouted, “Ah!!!”","The war hammer in his hand began to crack.","“Shatter for me!”","Once again, he exerted force, and he crushed the Fourth Tribulation realm level war hammer.","This time, Shi Tian was completely panicked.","Even the treasured weapon was crushed by Jian Wushuang. His operated battle formation became somewhat unstable. He staggered back two steps, pointing at Jian Wushuang and said, “You... how...”","He was so scared that he even spoke.","Jian Wushuang lunged forward, raising his hand to punch directly at the chest of the battle","formation.","The battle formation, with seven hundred thousand divine powers, instantly collapsed.","As the battle formation disintegrated, the hundred Fourth Tribulation realm experts, including Shi Tian, all spat blood and fell to the ground.","They were completely powerless.","Jian Wushuang walked slowly forward, stepping on Shi Tian’s cheek with one foot, looking down at him, mocking, “Weren’t you quite powerful just now? What happened now?” Spitting towards his face, Jian Wushuang wiped his mouth with disdain, “You’re just trash!”","After saying that, he was ready to deal with Shi Tian.","Consider it avenging Kababon.","And all those in the battle formation would have to die.","On the other side, Shi San and the others. Seeing that things had developed beyond control, Shi San could no longer stand by. His figure","flashed, and he appeared in front of Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":5842,"title":"Chapter 5842: Identity Theft","paragraphs":["Chapter 5842: Identity Theft","“I didn’t expect it, Jian Wushuang, you truly are unparalleled. It seems everything earlier was just a misunderstanding!” Shi San stepped forward as the peacemaker.","Seeing their ancestor arrive, Shi Tian quickly cried for help, “Ancestor, save me!”","Facing death, the fear coursing through him made him tremble.","Shi San’s appearance was his lifeline, something he naturally clung to.","To Shi Tian, Shi San was a lifeline, but to Jian Wushuang, he was nothing.","Even if the Emperor himself came today, Jian Wushuang would still kill Shi Tian.","Hearing Shi San’s words, he nearly laughed, his gaze icy as he stared at him, mocking, “Have your eyesight gotten so bad that you can’t even recognize your own grandfather?”","He showed no mercy, it was clear to him that the old man had recognized him earlier, yet still allowed Shi Tian to attack, likely under orders.","And now he was pretending to be a good person?","He’d deal with him later.","Shi San, however, didn’t get angry at this.","Meanwhile, the Jing Lian Demoness flew over.","Shi Tian was the direct descendant of her foster father, so naturally, he had to protect him.","“Shi San, why waste words with him? He dared to provoke my Shi Kingdom, just kill him!” Jing Lian Demoness, though not of royal blood, had the arrogance of royalty.","Might makes right.","Because the Shi Kingdom was the strongest.","Such thinking was most advantageous to them.","Shi San frowned at her words, silently cursing her for not seeing the situation clearly.","There were still three savage beasts on the field.","Once they started, Jian Wushuang would team up with the other side.","Then they would be in trouble.","At that point, they wouldn’t even be able to complete their special mission, let alone save their lives.","Upon arriving at this place, they had to assess the benefits carefully.","Harnessing the power of Life was the top priority.","Initially, killing Jian Wushuang, a seemingly insignificant figure, wouldn’t provoke the Yue Kingdom.","However, this insignificant figure unexpectedly unleashed the power of a significant figure. That changed everything.","“Wushuang Daoist, please don’t take offense, Jing Lian has always been like this!” After saying this, he turned towards the direction of the warship and waved, indicating for Shi Jiu to bring Jinchen over.","Jian Wushuang understood his meaning. Before Shi Jiu could bring Jinchen, he exerted force under his feet, crushing Shi Tian’s head into a pulp.","Vanishing along with his Origin Source!","Jing Lian’s eyes revealed a murderous intent, seemingly ready to strike directly.","But at this moment, the Whale Shark King and the Mofu King flew over, pretending to be confused: “What’s this? Bullying Weilong Mountain because there’s no one around?”","For a moment, both sides were at a standstill.","However, Shi San had an absolute bargaining chip.","But he found Shi Jiu unexpectedly not listening to him.","Originally, according to his plan, even if Shi Tian died, it wouldn’t matter.","Consider it venting for Jian Wushuang.","Then let Shi Jiu bring Jinchen over, express remorse, and appeal emotionally.","Just to gloss over this matter.","But now, at this moment, Shi Jiu was ignoring him outright.","On the warship, Jinchen remained silent.","Shi Jiu refused to look at any of the patriarchs or listen to their words.","At this moment, he couldn’t use Jincheng to threaten Jian Wushuang, and he knew it.","He didn’t believe that Patriarch Shi San would kill him over this matter.","His grandfather was Shi Xiu.","Although not as high in seniority as Patriarch Shi San, his strength was sufficient.","Among the Shi Clan’s ranks, no one dared to threaten him.","This time, he would definitely protect Jinchen.","This was the opportunity Jian Wushuang had given him.","Naturally, he had to seize it.","Jinchen had also told him that Jian Wushuang’s marriage into the family was because of a slot","in the Sacred Assembly, and she would leave on her own accord later.","The two would still be together.","He wouldn’t betray the vows they made at the Sea of Vows over such trivial matters.","But his actions made Shi San feel like a clown, his face flushed with urgency.","“Jian Wushuang, you must think this through. You are the son-in-law of the Yue Kingdom,","you are of the human race, how dare you travel with savage beasts!”","Shi San, frustrated, could only resort to threatening Jian Wushuang with his lineage.","But Jian Wushuang was no longer threatened by such things.","He looked around at the powerful members of the Shi Kingdom lying on the ground.","“When I was attacked by human cultivators, no one stood up for me. Instead, a savage beast rushed in to help me!”","He raised the arm of the Candle Dragon, palm facing upward, and said coldly, “To me, you are enemies, and he is my friend. If enemies kill my friend, I will seek revenge!”","“Hah!”","The claws of the Candle Dragon burst forth with countless streams of light soaring into the","sky, randomly dispersing in the air and crashing to the ground.","Shisan also became furious and attempted to stop Jian Wushuang with Jing Lian.","But they felt attacks from above.","They could only retreat and dodge.","But the Fourth Tribulation experts lying on the ground couldn’t escape.","They turned into dust, one by one.","Jian Wushuang lowered his arm, looked up at the sky, and silently said, “Rest in peace!”","A mourning sentence!","The anger inside him dissipated.","At this moment, he also felt an unprecedented sense of oppression.","That was because his strength couldn’t support it.","Only the Universe Master could withstand the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","His current strength was still too weak.","Not enough to bear it.","In his current state, he could only hold out for the time it takes an incense stick to burn before","The runs out of breath.","The battle had to be resolved quickly.","The Shiguo had lost a hundred elites in this battle and would surely not let him off.","Even if he managed to escape, they would hunt him down.","But he wouldn’t care about that then.","Anyway, he would be hunted down this time.","One more or one less wouldn’t matter.","It didn’t matter anymore.","Shisan’s anger surged, but reason overcame his rage.","He couldn’t act.","If he did, Jian Wushuang and the savage beast would only escape.","Not only would the mission be in vain, but he would also lose the power of Life.","But now, there were no factors left to break the deadlock.","Even Jing Lian Demoness was shocked by Jian Wushuang’s strength, which surpassed her own","complete Fifth Tribulation realm.","With a divine power of 800,000, he already possessed the battle power of a Scattered Sixth","Tribulation.","Despite continuously trying to win over Jian Wushuang, both Whale Shark King and the Mofu","King were deeply wary of his strength.","At this moment, neither dared to take the initiative.","Jian Wushuang was the only one who could break the stalemate, whoever he chose to assist","would win.","However, Jian Wushuang never intended to help either side.","If time wasn’t limited, he would have wanted to kill them all.","The desire to kill was still very strong within him.","Fortunately, his anger subsided, otherwise he might have actually done it.","The debt of revenge had been repaid; he had no need for such meaningless battles anymore.","Now, he had only one goal.","That was to break through the barrier surrounding the core of the sanctuary.","To see if the mysterious person inside was Wu Li.","That would put his mind at ease.","If not, he would leave.","If it was, he would take Wu Li with him.","Either way, he didn’t want to stay in this place any longer.","Whoosh!","Just when everyone was waiting for him to make a move, Jian Wushuang voluntarily left the","battlefield and headed straight for the barrier.","Upon realizing Jian Wushuang’s target, Whale Shark King roared in anger, “How dare you!”","His secrets were still hidden there. If Jian Wushuang were to break through, it would be over. At this moment, he couldn’t care less, his figure trembling."]},{"number":5843,"title":"Chapter 5843: Let Go","paragraphs":["Chapter 5843: Let Go","The entire sanctuary began to tremble.","A rumble!","A huge totem appeared on the ground.","Shi San and Jing Lian were startled, quickly retreating.","It was already suspicious that a Fourth Tribulation realm could unleash 700,000 divine powers.","Sure enough, there was a hidden move.","Even Mofu King hadn’t expected Whale Shark to be this powerful.","The moment the totem appeared, Whale Shark’s divine power had reached 750,000.","Boom!","The ground began to crack.","Whale Shark transformed into its true form, leaping into the ground like a whale diving into water, causing splashes.","Mofu King was stunned.","Whale Shark actually entered the ground, and they couldn’t even sense its presence anymore.","But the totem on the ground kept rotating.","Then he felt a terrifying aura rising from the ground beneath his feet and quickly retreated. Boom!","After a loud noise, the gigantic Whale Shark burst out from the ground.","Then it transformed back into human form again, but this time Whale Shark’s divine power had directly reached 800,000.","Trembling, Mofu King said, “Fourth Tribulation realm, you’ve already reached the Fourth Tribulation realm!”","He couldn’t believe it. Whale Shark King had been suppressing his own strength all along. Whale Shark’s actions were conspicuous, catching the attention of Jian Wushuang.","He hadn’t expected Whale Shark King to conceal himself so deeply.","With originally 800,000 divine power, he still insisted on dragging them to enhance that treasure.","Moreover, rumors had always circulated about his great ambition on Weilong Mountain. Now it seemed that everything before had been a disguise.","It was a kind of feigned weakness.","This display of weakness was far more cunning than when he revealed his Fourth Tribulation realm while acting subdued.","He feared that once he exposed himself as a Fifth Tribulations realm cultivator, the Tamu King would kill him.","And now, he had just revealed it.","It was all because he needed to break through this barrier.","Inside, there probably hid enormous secrets.","The more so, the more he wanted to go in and take a look.","After the Whale Shark King displayed his full power, he sneered coldly, “None of you will leave today, all of you shall die!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he waved his hand and summoned that treasure which could unleash power to the extreme.","Pointing downwards, he instantly cast his spell.","Mofu King felt despair.","He knew well that this thing possessed the power of a million gods.","At such close range, even if it didn’t hit him directly, he would be shaken to death.","Feeling a fatal crisis, Shi San grabbed Jing Lian, the Yao girl, and fled.","Even the people on the warship didn’t care anymore.","Jian Wushuang hurriedly shouted, “Take her away quickly!”","His speed was too slow now, he could only inform Shi Jiu to take Jinchen and flee.","As for himself, he was not afraid at all.","The Candle Dragon Wings enveloped his whole body.","Unfortunately, he had already reached the state of overload when he used the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, and his divine power was no longer at its peak but in an overloaded state.","Even with his armor, he couldn’t use the power of the Beast God anymore.","Using it again would be out of the question.","800,000, doubling the power of the Beast God would bring him to the threshold of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","That would be too terrifying.","However, facing a strike of a million divine powers now, he wasn’t in much danger.","With his divine power and the condensation of his Origin Source, plus the enhancement of his","life force, he was more than capable of dealing with it.","And he still had the Three Quake Universe to completely avoid the core attack.","It’s just that the fluctuations of the attack couldn’t harm him.","But others were miserable.","Even someone like Shi San, a top-tier Fifth Tribulations realm expert, would find it hard to","withstand.","Boom!","The treasure in the hands of the Whale Shark King began to erupt.","On the warship, Shi Jiu had long since pulled Jinchen away and escaped.","Although the warship was very close to the entrance of the cave.","But the powerful force erupted too quickly.","It was almost impossible for the two of them to escape completely.","Even though Shi Jiu had used the life-saving treasure his grandfather had given him, his speed was comparable to the peak of the Fourth Tribulations realm, but it was still powerless.","“Chen’er, you must stay alive!” Shi Jiu gazed at Jinchen tenderly, then pushed all the power","within him into Jinchen.","Jinchen couldn’t accept it and shouted, “No!”","The Empress had also given her a treasure to escape, but it proved useless along the way as","Jian Wushuang had protected her well.","However, fate can be unpredictable.","Outside the blessed land, she was attacked by Sangmo.","Using the treasure her mother had given her, she narrowly escaped death.","Coincidentally, she encountered the Shi Kingdom’s team.","They saved her life.","At the same time, she saw Shi Jiu again.","Both were filled with countless joys.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang had told her that after this Sacred Assembly, he would leave Yue","Kingdom and never return.","If her mother could become the Holy Maiden, it would be when she ascended to the throne.","Then she could openly be with Shi Jiu.","Never did she expect that just when everything seemed to be going well, there would be such a","sudden separation.","It was truly difficult for her to accept.","That force enveloped her, accompanied by endless power, and threw her out of the blessed","land.","While Shi Jiu, forever parted from her, stood at the edge of the blessed land’s entrance.","In the sea of fire, half of his body turned into bones, while the other half, staring in the direction of Jian Wushuang, self-mockingly said, “Jian Wushuang, in the end, I still have to","rely on you!”","Crash!","In an instant, the other half of his body also turned into bones, ultimately crumbling into","powder.","Jian Wushuang seemed to hear a voice of reliance, but he was completely focused on avoiding","the core attack.","He didn’t expect the Whale Shark King to be so crazy, swaying left and right, insisting on","staring at him.","Fortunately, he didn’t go to save Jinchen, or else his guilt would be even greater.","“Die!!” The Whale Shark King laughed wildly.","This time, Mofo King was truly dead.","Shi San and the Jing Lian Demoness desperately escaped.","At the entrance, they saw Jinchen with vacant eyes.","“Where’s Shi Jiu?” Shi San, upon seeing Jinchen, thought of Shi Jiu.","In his view, the most likely to escape was Shi Jiu, because Shi Jiu had the life-saving treasure","given by Shi Xiu.","After scanning around and not finding Shi Jiu, he looked at Jinchen’s eyes again.","Shi San understood.","“What a disaster!” He sighed.","The pride of the Shi Kingdom’s generation was gone.","Even many Fourth Tribulation Universe Masters were lost.","They came in good shape.","Hundreds of strong individuals.","Now, only he and Jing Lian were left alive.","However, he didn’t give up.","Even if he couldn’t help Jing Lian become a candidate for the Holy Maiden, he still needed to","obtain the power of Life inside.","Only by obtaining that power of Life could he return to the royal family this time without","punishment.","After all, all the people he brought had perished, something that had never happened in so","many generations.","If the team had been annihilated, it would have been understandable.","But not the Shi Kingdom.","Although their team wasn’t the strongest, it had the most people.","This annihilation hurt the Shi Kingdom deeply.","Jing Lian was also furious.","Her candidate for Holy Maiden was gone.","With so many strong individuals lost this time, when she returned to Yue Kingdom, she","wouldn’t receive any good treatment.","All her previous efforts were wasted!","Jing Lian was truly furious, turning to Jinchen and saying fiercely, “It’s all because of you, this","jinx! Why don’t you just die!”","“You’re the one who should die!” Jing Lian Demoness, unable to contain her anger, directed","all her fury at Jinchen."]},{"number":5844,"title":"Chapter 5844: Mysterious Treant","paragraphs":["Chapter 5844: Mysterious Treant","Jinchen stood still, her eyes flickering. Her heart had died within her.","All that remained now was an empty shell.","“You’re right!” She gave a brief smile to Jing Lian and then flew into the entrance of the blessed land, leaping into the sea of fire.","Shi San wanted to stop her but couldn’t make it in time.","All he could do was cover his face and say, “Ah, why bother!”","The flames inside the blessed land burned for a full stick of incense before finally disappearing completely.","Whale Shark King casually threw away the shattered treasures in his hand.","Meanwhile, the barrier at the core of the blessed land had already begun to crack.","This made his eyes shimmer.","He flew over.","But in the next moment, he was kicked into the ground by Jian Wushuang, who descended from the sky.","Jian Wushuang dared not linger because he could no longer sustain the super ancient transformation. Seizing the last breath of time, he flashed his figure.","Directly reestablishing the barrier.","Using his last breath, he directly broke through a hole in the cracked barrier.","The hole was small and weak.","And his figure directly transformed into a wisp of mist, entering the barrier at the last moment.","Whale Shark King, who had risen to his feet, saw Jian Wushuang go in and followed suit. However, he crashed into the barrier and couldn’t get in at all.","“How is this possible!” He couldn’t understand. If Jian Wushuang could get in, why couldn’t he?","Furious, he continuously bombarded the barrier.","Whenever a small round hole appeared in the barrier, his attempt to enter was thwarted.","He simply couldn’t get in.","But he watched Jian Wushuang charge in.","He didn’t know that the barrier was actually alive.","More precisely, it was manipulated by someone.","Whoever the person inside wanted to let in, could enter.","Conversely, no one could break through.","Just now, with a million divine powers, only some cracks appeared in the barrier.","Even Tamu Wang at the Sixth Tribulation realm couldn’t break it.","And Tamu King did come this time.","Shi San entered in front of Jing Lian.","And Tamu King followed suit.","“Haha, it seems I missed a good show!” Tamu King grinned at everyone.","The mantis stalks the cicada, unaware of the oriole behind!","No matter how deeply Whale Shark King hid, he still lost completely this time.","Shi San and Jing Lian’s faces changed drastically.","“The King of the Roman River!” The two of them were somewhat desperate this time.","All the misfortunes of the Shi Kingdom this time had fallen upon them.","A powerful expert of the Sixth Tribulations realm appeared.","Both of them knew it was over.","Just as they were preparing to escape.","Whale Shark King, however, transmitted a message: “Cooperate!”","A simple word gave them hope once again.","Escape was definitely impossible.","King Tamu stood at the exit; there was no way to flee.","But when he heard that the Whale Shark King wanted to cooperate.","So, the three of them joining forces had a chance against a Sixth Tribulation realm expert.","And this chance was significant.","The cunning Whale Shark King didn’t waste time trying to reconcile with Tamu King.","Because he knew best that reconciliation between them was impossible.","Once he reached the Fifth Tribulation realm, Tamu would kill him.","He could only cooperate with human cultivators and figure out another plan.","Four individuals, two factions.","Battle!","Commence!","The battles within the sanctuary ensued one after another.","While within the sanctuary’s core barrier,","there was an unusual calm.","Upon Jian Wushuang’s entry, the state of extreme ancient transformation vanished.","His body relaxed, nearly stumbling.","Fortunately, someone caught him.","Looking up, he found himself supported by a treant covered in green leaves.","“Who are you?” Jian Wushuang was greatly surprised.","Sensing the immense Life force emanating from the treant, he understood.","A warmth enveloped him.","It was the treant’s gift of Life force.","“Wu Li is in seclusion; you shall wait here with me until he returns!” After helping Jian Wushuang regain his strength, the treant led him towards a cave ahead.","The outer gate of the cave was a cliff.","On the edge of the cliff stood a pavilion caught in the wind.","Jian Wushuang followed the treant into the pavilion.","Yet, he couldn’t shake off his puzzlement.","Glancing around, he noticed the spirits of grass and trees scattered around the walls outside","the cave.","Seeing this, he was startled.","He thought he had returned to Qishen Temple.","“Do you recognize them?” The treant handed Jian Wushuang a cup of tea and casually asked.","Jian Wushuang nodded, then picked up the teacup. The tea leaves floating on top looked","remarkably similar to the treant.","Despite several attempts, he couldn’t bring himself to take a sip.","So, he spoke, “I’ve seen them before!”","He couldn’t sense the treant’s strength.","Thus, he lowered his status and asked again, “Senior, who are you?”","Since the other party knew Wu Li, it was highly likely that they were one of Wu Li’s hidden","powers.","This tactic of hosting powerful beings within oneself was something Jian Wushuang had","encountered several times.","The most recent one was Bai Junwang residing within him.","And now, there was another within him.","But this one claimed to be a god.","Jian Wushuang simply ignored them.","Because it was too uninteresting.","Seeing Wu Li possess such unique powers, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel envious of","the guidance it provided from deep within.","It seems the secret of entering Wanliu was brought up by this senior.","So, he didn’t need to introduce himself.","The other party might be even more familiar with him than Wu Li.","“I am just a nobody. Even if I say my name, you wouldn’t recognize it. How about you tell me about yourself? You seem to be knowledgeable about the Spirits of Grass and Wood. Have you perhaps entered the Divine Tree of Wanliu?” The treant directly spoke straightforwardly. Although Jian Wushuang was somewhat surprised by the directness of the other party, he also","liked this approach.","He calmly said the most impolite words.","This was the best way.","He didn’t feel any threat from the other party.","So, he honestly replied, “I have never been to Wanliu, but I have entered a certain secret","realm. This secret realm is very mysterious. It is not in Ancient Moon Spacetime but in the distant downstream of the river of time. In that secret realm, there is a Forest of Eternal Secrets, and there are Spirits of Grass and Wood inside. However, I did not obtain them. I only encountered them once in an auction.”","He still remembered that time, the auction.","And it was said that the spirit of plants and trees was bought by Hu Qing and ended up in the","hands of Jiang Shang.","And Jiang Shang later exploded in strength, surpassing Long Yi at one point.","His body also contained acquired Life force.","So, he had a deep impression of the Spirit of Grass and Wood.","“The downstream of the river of time!” The treant sipped his tea delicately and said calmly,","“That makes sense. Wanliu was brought up from the lower reaches of the river of time.","Passing through the downstream, perhaps there are some remnants.”","Actually, to be precise, it’s not the lower reaches.","It’s the middle reaches.","The Forest of Eternal Secrets was originally in the Moro Spacetime.","Hearing the treant’s words, Jian Wushuang thought of Mie Sheng again.","If the Forest of Myriad Treasures is related to Wanliu.","Then Mie Sheng must know.","He just didn’t understand why Mie Sheng insisted on targeting him!","Wanliu also possessed Life force, and it was even stronger than him.","It’s also innate Life force.","Wouldn’t it be better to devour Wanliu?","He suddenly remembered something.","When he first entered Ancient Moon Spacetime, he was intercepted by a Celestial Maiden."]},{"number":5845,"title":"Chapter 5845: Jiang Shang, the Celestial Maiden?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5845: Jiang Shang, the Celestial Maiden?","It must be the Celestial Maiden from Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Mie Sheng couldn’t enter, so he targeted him.","The Celestial Maiden is at the Ninth Tribulation realm, even if Mie Sheng came from the Starry Sky, at his peak, he probably wouldn’t be much different from the Celestial Maiden.","Moreover, Wanliu himself is powerful enough.","Even the Universe Master at the Eighth Tribulation realm couldn’t enter.","If Mie Sheng came, he might not be able to defeat Wanliu.","Not to mention the current Mie Sheng.","Let alone Jiang Shang.","The other party was calculated by Mie Sheng.","There may be a plan against Wanliu.","It’s a backup plan.","With this in mind, Jian Wushuang spoke up, “Senior, can the spirit of plants and trees replace the Origin Source of cultivators and transform into the Origin Source of Life?”","He wanted to verify this matter.","Jiang Shang’s Origin Source Spirit is the Spirit of Grass and WoodR.","“How is that possible!” The treant laughed and shook his head upon hearing his words. But just as he spoke, he thought of someone and said, “In Ancient Moon Spacetime, there was indeed someone who did it, but that person has already fallen and become a god. Mortals cannot achieve it.”","“Falling and becoming a god?” Jian Wushuang suddenly felt like the other person had drunk too much tea.","How could one say such a thing?","But he still guessed, “Is it that Celestial Maiden?”","“Yes!” The tree person nodded.","“Other than her, no one else can do it?”","The tree person firmly shook his head, “No one else can do it, that’s what I said!”","“Who are you!” Jian Wushuang didn’t say this sentence out loud!","He asked again, “Then if someone really did it, why?”","He was sure that Jiang Shang had definitely reached that point.","Could it be that Jiang Shang is the Celestial Maiden?","With this thought, he suddenly stood up.","There is really such a possibility.","Jiang Shang might really be the reincarnation of the Celestial Maiden, or a manifestation.","He had thought for a long time before entering Ancient Moon Spacetime.","In such a powerful spacetime.","How could a mere spirit open a spacetime tunnel?","If the tunnel were so easy to open, Ancient Moon Spacetime would have unified the Middle and Lower Realms long ago.","And Fan Tianfeng wouldn’t have to fly back with people all the way.","Wouldn’t it be easier for the Flame God to open a spacetime tunnel to Qishen Temple? Why bother.","Even if you don’t know the location of Qishen Temple, you can open a downstream location first, saving a lot of time.","At first, he thought it was Zhen Ling using the Temporal Treasure.","But later, he discovered that the Temporal Treasure was not that simple.","Zhen Ling, that old man, he knew nothing about spacetime.","He’s just a wandering spirit.","Inherited some Qishen Temple obsession and memories.","How could he possibly activate the Temporal Treasure to open a spacetime tunnel?","There must be the guidance of the Celestial Maiden among them.","After they entered the Ancient Moon Spacetime, the heavenly woman, in order to prevent Mie Sheng from sneaking in, checked each of them one by one.","Then they were all sent into some big families.","At first, he entered the Wu Family.","Actually, for an emperor to enter a family of tribulation realm, it’s already a big opportunity.","It’s just that this emperor is a bit extraordinary.","As for being so unlucky after reincarnation, it’s probably also the intention of the Celestial","Maiden.","Who made him offend Jiang Shang.","While Fan Tianfeng’s reincarnation is perfect.","Under the command of the strongest in the Ancient Wood Continent.","Not everyone has this kind of luck.","Hu Qing entered the Ancient Moon Ruins.","It’s also the intention of the Celestial Maiden.","And if Hu Qing doesn’t let him go to the Ancient Moon Ruins, it’s probably because the","Celestial Maiden is also there!","I bet the others are doing well now.","This time, he finally figured it out completely.","But what followed was another big dilemma.","If Jiang Shang is indeed the Celestial Maiden.","Then what does she seek?","She wouldn’t be after Zhen Ling, that old man, would she?","Even if the Qishen Temple has a couple of Temporal Treasures, they wouldn’t allow a powerful figure of the Ninth Tribulations realm to come and reincarnate.","There must be reasons behind this that he doesn’t know.","Perhaps it’s related to Mie Sheng.","Thinking of this, he completely collapsed.","The Treeman poured tea thoughtfully and asked, “Do you think any of the celestial maidens","have fallen?”","Jian Wushuang was momentarily taken aback by the question.","Frowning, he didn’t know how to respond.","Perhaps one had fallen.","Or perhaps none had.","Maybe they were just living in another form.","If the Qishen Temple could arrange things, so could the Celestial Maiden.","“Everything is subject to fate. Some things need not be taken seriously,” the treant said","calmly.","His calm demeanor made Jian Wushuang suspect that this guy might also be a god!","Weiss was calm towards him.","No matter what tricks he displayed, no matter how stunning, even if he used the treasures of spacetime, Weiss still looked at him calmly.","But there was one thing: the treant’s aura was not completely undetectable like Weiss’.","There was still some gap.","Even if he wasn’t a god, the other party was definitely a strong one above the Seventh","Tribulation realm.","Just surviving in a different guise for now.","He didn’t directly inquire about the other’s identity, as that would be too impolite.","Since he didn’t speak, there was no need to ask.","They would talk when Wuli came out.","The two waited quietly for Wuli to come out of seclusion.","This wait lasted a day.","Anyway, Jian Wushuang wasn’t in a hurry, it was a good time to restore his strength.","Wuli had been here for about 100 years already.","It shouldn’t take much longer.","But after Wuli emerged from seclusion, how strong would he be ?","It wasn’t out of fear, but because there might be some big secret in this cave.","They were eager to get in.","Those outside still didn’t know that the peaches had been plucked.","Jian Wushuang didn’t mind.","This time, he was fortunate because his anger allowed him to forcefully unleash the Super","Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Boosting his normal combat power by 50 times.","And it wasn’t even perfected yet.","If it were the complete Super Ancient Transformation, it would definitely be even stronger","than it is now.","However, he couldn’t dare to ask for more now.","The current Super Eternal Ancient Transformation was already sufficient.","With 800,000 divine power and the limit of the Origin Source Universe, whether using divine","power or the Origin Source, it was enough to suppress any Fifth Tribulation realm.","He could even contend against a Sixth Tribulation realm expert.","Now, in the outside world, there happened to be a Sixth Tribulation realm.","Tamu King!","Facing three opponents, he suppressed them and beat down the three Fifth Tribulation","experts.","These three Fifth Tribulation realm opponents were extraordinary.","The strongest among them, Whale Shark King, revealed his strongest strength, which could already rival Jian Wushuang when he unleashed the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Jingl Lan Demoness also possessed over 750,000 divine power.","Shi San wasn’t much weaker.","But even with these three strong Fifth Tribulation realm experts, facing Tamu King, they still","didn’t have much ability to fight back.","At the peak, Tamu King had 900,000 divine power.","He possessed the top combat power among Sixth Tribulation realms.","However, this battle had little to do with Jian Wushuang anymore.","He had already prepared to wait here.","Wu Li would not emerge from seclusion so quickly.","It might take hundreds of years.","By that time, the outcome would have been decided in the outside world.","Jian Wushuang took the opportunity to begin studying how to use the Super Eternal Ancient","Transformation.","He soared in anger, instantly ascending.","But now, when he calmed down, he couldn’t transform anymore.","No matter what he did, he couldn’t unleash the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation again."]},{"number":5846,"title":"Chapter 5846: Wu Li Exits Seclusion","paragraphs":["Chapter 5846: Wu Li Exits Seclusion","This gave him a massive headache.","Without the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, he couldn’t handle even the most ordinary Fifth Tribulations realm experts.","After pondering for a long time, he finally figured it out.","The reason he couldn’t unleash it was because he was no longer the Universe Master.","He had known this for a long time.","He just wasn’t clear about the reason behind it.","Now, after trying it once, he completely understood his current situation.","As the Emperor, he was like a fruit fallen from a tree.","And the master of the universe was like a fruit growing on the tree.","The latter had roots.","Using the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation relied on the foundation of the Origin Source Universe.","The former, however, had no such support.","After understanding the reason, he began to look for a solution.","In the end, he managed to figure it out.","As long as he gathered Qi for the time of an incense stick before each Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, using Qi as the core, transforming into the universe, then performing the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, it would succeed in one go.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang began to continuously attempt it within the Origin Source Universe.","First, he performed the Ancient Transformation.","Then he gathered Qi.","When the Qi reached its peak, his eyes changed, and he angrily shouted!","“Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","“Ah!!!!”","He clenched his fists, and a burst of qi erupted from his body.","The aura on his body instantly began to change.","Buzz!","After a buzzing sound, he transformed into the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation once again.","This time, he finally had time to carefully feel this power.","Continuously throwing punches, feeling the divine power surging within his body.","800,000 divine power.","Each punch was enough to kill a Fourth Tribulations realm strongman.","This was a qualitative change in strength.","His divine power had increased 50 times more than usual.","After becoming familiar with his divine power, he began to sense the Origin Source within himself.","The power of the Starry Sky had also increased fiftyfold.","Now, his Starry Sky Chronicles, whether it was the first sword move Life, or the second sword move, Death, could slay experts of the Fifth Tribulations realm and even contend with those of the Sixtj Tribulation realm.","However, the pressure was overwhelming.","He could only endure for the time it took an incense stick to burn.","The first time he unleashed it was unique; only then could he withstand it for so long.","Now, it seemed that the time spent gathering energy for an incense stick’s duration resulted in the pinnacle of power for an incense stick’s worth.","Still, having something was better than nothing.","Even when he reached the level of Universe Master, it wouldn’t be effortless to wield.","Just because he hadn’t fully mastered it now didn’t mean he couldn’t in the future.","The Eternal Ancient Transformation and the Starry Sky Chronicles were the pinnacle secrets he had created based on the power of the Starry Sky.","It was also the strongest secret technique of his lifetime, albeit still in its early stages.","There would be continuous improvements in the future.","The Super Eternal Ancient Transformation was like the Starry Sky Chronicles.","The Starry Sky Chronicles comprised nine sword moves.","Currently, he had created five sword mopves and mastered two: Life and Death.","The third sword move was ‘Reincarnation’.","The fourth sword move was ‘Spacetime’.","And the fifth sword move was ‘Spacetime Reincarnation’.","According to his calculations, he needed to reach the level of Fifth Tribulations realm, achieve the perfection of the universe, witness the birth of Life, and see Life reach Death before he could comprehend the Reincarnation Sword.","Just the Reincarnation Sword alone was so troublesome.","Not to mention the combination of the power of Life and Death into the cycle of","Reincarnation, which would be even more difficult than it is now.","As for the subsequent sword move, Spacetime, it was much simpler.","Just like Life and Death, at the same level, he could wield these two swords.","But for the subsequent Spacetime Reincarnation Sword, he would need to reach the level of Seventh Tribulations realm, or even Eighth Tribulations realm, before he could unleash it.","This was his clear recognition of the five swords moves","Following them was the sixth sword move.","He only sensed a glimpse of its future power.","Could barely fathom it.","All he knew was, if he could unleash the sixth sword move.","He could challenge the three ancient beings among the Nine Great Spacetimes.","That’s why it was called “A Match for the Ancient”.","As for the subsequent seven, eight, and nine.","He didn’t even have the qualification to look at these three sword moves.","Forget about reaching the realm of Universe Master.","Or striving for Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, which seemed more promising.","Eternal Ancient Transformation, Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Both were ways to rapidly enhance one’s strength in normal times.","This made his demands on himself in normal state even stricter.","The stronger the normal state, the stronger he became after performing the Super Eternal","Ancient Transformation.","It’s just that his divine power now couldn’t be raised anymore.","Otherwise, he’d end up becoming obese from overeating.","The bones of Dong Jun were still within him.","By the time he reached the realm of Universe Master, underwent five tribulations at once, and","directly became a Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation.","Then he would devour the entire skeleton of Dong Jun.","His divine power in the normal state would surpass a million.","By then, not to mention the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Even with the power of the Beast God, he could probably contend with someone in the","Seventh Tribulation realm.","It’s just that he still couldn’t see through the bones of Dong Jun.","Nor did he know how much it could enhance.","Anyway, a million was the baseline.","He was unsure of the upper limit.","Nor did he know if he could swallow it all in one go when he reached the Fifth Tribulations","realm.","Even if he couldn’t swallow it all, he would swallow until he couldn’t bear it.","This demonstrates the benefits of having a strong physical body.","The former Shan Jun was truly his good teacher.","He also had his own persistence and efforts.","Nothing was in vain.","He summarized his strength and realm once again.","At present, the only hurdle left was to achieve the perfection of the universe.","Once he attained the complete state or perfection of the universe, he would be ready to break","through the Tribulation Realm.","But he couldn’t sense where his Tribulation was located.","Initially, he thought it might be within the Wanliu Willow Divine Tree.","However, judging from the current situation, perhaps the Tribulation wasn’t there!","It might be within the Infinite Great World instead.","The earlier he broke through, the more advantageous it would be for him.","Yet, he wasn’t overly concerned.","“Phew!”","He spent another day in the Origin Source World.","Returning to his true self, he stood up and stretched lazily.","Looking into the distance, all he saw were endless mountain peaks.","Each one seemed like a towering expert.","Buzz!","A surge of energy rushed from behind.","Jian Wushuang’s face lit up, turning to look.","The gates of the cave were wide open, and Wu Li stood outside, looking considerably younger.","Moreover, his aura was a hundred times stronger than before.","He had actually broken through to the Fourth Tribulation realm.","And not just any Fourth Tribulation realm.","He had reached the peak immediately upon breaking through.","“I didn’t expect you to progress so quickly!” The treant was the first to rise and looked","towards Wu Li.","Jian Wushuang opened his mouth, but his tone shifted, congratulating, “Congratulations,","Brother Wu Li!”","Seeing him here was evidently surprising to Wu Li, but he didn’t ask much.","Instead, he walked towards the treant.","Clap!","With great enthusiasm, Wu Li immediately knelt down.","“Disciple has not disappointed the expectations of the teacher and has already broken","through to the peak of the Fourth Tribulation realm!”","Teacher?","There was an imperceptible gleam in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","It seemed his guess was correct.","This treant had an unusual relationship with Wu Li.","Moreover, his understanding of the Wanliu Willow surpassed that of ordinary people.","Although his understanding of the Wanliu Willow was solely from Wu Li, for such a long time, he hadn’t heard about the Wanliu Willow from anyone else.","It could also be seen that very few people knew the secret of the Wanliu Willow.","This Treeman, being able to harbor the spirit of plants and trees, was definitely extraordinary.","The spirit of plants and trees only acknowledged a Celestial Maiden as its master. This requirement meant that for others, it was impossible to surpass the divine wisdom."]},{"number":5847,"title":"Chapter 5847: The Core Secret of the Blessed Land","paragraphs":["Chapter 5847: The Core Secret of the Blessed Land","The treants, capable of sheltering, significantly lowered the threshold.","But even so, it was still extremely difficult.","“Alright, since you’ve successfully broken through, there’s no need for us to guard you here anymore!” The treant finished speaking and nodded at Jian Wushuang, saying, “Young friend, we, the Wanliu Willow Divine Trees, bid you farewell!”","Jian Wushuang returned the gesture with a bow. “Certainly!”","It seemed that the treant had great confidence in the two of them!","Believing that they would surely enter the Wanliu Willows.","Swish!","Several figures disappeared and entered into Wu Li’s body.","Wu Li stood up, arms outstretched to welcome them.","After they gathered together, he breathed a sigh of relief before turning to Jian Wushuang.","“Friend Wushuang, it seems the battle outside is fierce. Have the others all perished?” Wu Li could now sense the fighting outside, so it wasn’t surprising to him.","And now, he was the only one who had arrived here.","It was easy for him to imagine the fate of the others.","“Except for Li Sheng, they should all have perished!” Jian Wushuang sighed.","Jinchen was also dead.","He died behind Shi Jiu.","Both perished.","The two juniors from the Li family had long since perished.","Only he remained in this place.","As for Li Sheng, he might have taken the opportunity to escape and might still be alive.","After all, he had already converted to the Monster Clan.","“Good riddance!” Wu Li couldn’t help but smile.","He couldn’t forget his own past hardships.","Being chased by Sangmo.","Being chased by countless savage beasts.","If it weren’t for the teacher sacrificing the origin to save him, he would have fallen long ago.","But, his luck was extraordinary!","He unexpectedly found this place.","Coming here not only allowed him to evade the pursuit of Sangmo but also led to his unexpected discovery of a treasure.","Initially, just by sensing its aura, he thought it was a treasure containing the power of Life.","However, upon closer inspection, he discovered that it was actually the root of the Wanliu Tree.","Wu Li didn’t keep it a secret and directly revealed it.","The root of the Wanliu Tree.","Although it was only a small piece, it held infinite value.","The Wanjie Tree not only contained life but also divine power and Origin Source.","It was truly a natural treasure, akin to the innate divine beasts.","“Let’s go inside and take a look!” Wu Li led Jian Wushuang into the cave.","Seeing is believing.","Jian Wushuang examined it up close and even touched it with his hand, realizing the uniqueness of the root.","However, the Life force above had dissipated, and the root had become somewhat withered.","“To think that such a treasure exists in this world, it’s truly unbelievable!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with astonishment.","The Wanliu Divine Tree.","It truly deserved to be called a divine tree.","Wu Li pointed to the root and said, “When I broke through, I used most of it. What’s left is for you, my friend!”","So generous?","Jian Wushuang looked at Wu Li in astonishment, unable to believe it.","“In fact, it’s like this. I can’t take this root with me. I’ve reached the peak, transcending the Fifth Tribulation. I’m not confident anymore, and the power within this root isn’t enough. Leaving it here benefits others!” Wu Li explained.","Hearing Wu Li’s explanation, Jian Wushuang nodded slowly.","“In that case, I won’t stand on ceremony!” The life force and divine power within this root","had disappeared.","But it still contained the power of Origin Source.","What he lacked now was the power of Origin Source.","Once he devoured the power of Origin Source above, he would be able to quickly reach the perfect state of the universe.","Although this time he was scavenging behind Wu Li, it was worth it.","Even if it gave him divine power and life force, it wouldn’t be of any use.","As good as treasures were, they also had to match one’s needs.","The people of Shi Kingdom were fighting, nearly leading to their extinction.","Whale Shark King plotted, finally resorting to his strongest card in desperation.","Tamu King intended to take advantage of the situation, but ended up being blocked outside, failing to seize the opportunity for himself.","He too desired it.","And nearly met his demise in the process.","This led to the death of Kababon as well.","Jinchen also perished along with Shi Jiu.","All for the sake of this tree root.","This time, he obtained everything he desired.","The opportunity that Whale Shark King gained was all because of this tree root.","The fact that the other party didn’t take it away also made sense.","Coming to this place, one was to find Wu Li.","And now, he had found him, with Wu Li unexpectedly giving him another great gift in return.","For a moment, it seemed like he had won again.","Yet, there were some gaps by his side now.","“Brother Wushuang, absorb it quickly. I’ll guard you from outside. The power used in the","barrier is the divine power within this tree root. Now that the root can’t replenish the outer barrier anymore, those people probably won’t be able to hold out for much longer before breaking in!” After explaining, Wu Li left the cave.","Meanwhile, the outer barrier had begun to loosen.","Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate, immediately taking action.","He devoured all the Origin Source within the tree root into his body.","A tremendous power of origin, still containing life, merged perfectly with his own Origin","Source.","The absorption speed was also quite fast.","Within the Origin Source Starry Sky.","A light spot completely blossomed!","The origin universe, “Perfection!”","Ten thousand black holes linked together into countless exquisite lines.","At the same time, new universe secrets were born together.","One in each direction: east, west, south, and north.","At the center of the universe lay the cosmic sea.","At this moment, the cosmic sea continued to rise, with a celestial island descending onto its","surface.","Another secret realm descended.","From then on, the ten thousand black holes and the five major universe secrets thoroughly","stabilized the universe.","This was the completion of the universe.","However, it was still in the stage of gestation.","Only when it reached the Tribulation Realm could this perfect universe become real.","Jian Wushuang gazed at his vast universe, feeling a mixture of emotions within him.","Once a mere aspiration, now a tangible reality.","Everything had come with immense difficulty.","Swish!","He stepped into his universe, ascending to the peak of the Tianqing Secret Realm.","In an instant, a pavilion materialized in the breeze.","In his universe, whatever he desired would manifest.","Standing within the pavilion, he felt the power of All Things surging through him.","It was a marvelous sensation.","To cultivate oneself was akin to the evolution of a universe.","“From now on, this is my world!” Jian Wushuang’s lips curved into a smile, a newfound sense","of belonging washing over him in this moment.","This was his future abode.","In the blink of an eye, the Heavenly Chessboard appeared in the center of the pavilion, where","he sat cross-legged, observing the Origin Source within the chess pieces.","Beside him, an incense burner emanated an intoxicating fragrance, inducing unparalleled","comfort.","On a nearby table lay a nine-layered tower.","The Nine Tribulations Tower!","Above the pavilion’s dome, his divine beast soldiers hovered.","The Wanjie Sword lay casually beside them.","Almost all of his treasures were gathered here.","With no artifacts on him, Jian Wushuang felt at ease, leisurely sipping his tea.","Just as he relaxed, a figure flew out from the Nine Tribulations Tower.","It was Weiss, wielding a scepter, unexpectedly emerging and marveling at the surrounding clouds, “What a solid foundation for the universe!”","From this place, one could gaze upon the Starry Sky, where four sword moves were visible.","“You managed to come out?” Jian Wushuang jumped in surprise, hastily standing up.","Weiss chuckled, covering his mouth, “I’m a god, nothing can bind me!”","This remark earned Weiss an eye roll from Jian Wushuang.","Gods and ghosts all day long. Truly laughable."]},{"number":5848,"title":"Chapter 5848: Perfect Universe!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5848: Perfect Universe!","Does the god still need disciples?","“It’s really comfortable here. From now on, this is where I’ll stay!” Weiss waved his staff and erected a magnificent castle outside the Windriding Pavilion.","Jian Wushuang was thoroughly shocked this time!","This was his universe, yet someone could still freely create things in it.","The sense of security instantly collapsed.","Weiss stared at the castle, feeling somewhat dissatisfied, and then opened up some jungles and grasslands around it.","“Still lacking something...” Weiss smoothed his wrinkled brow, thinking of something, and chuckled, “It’s missing life!”","With a gesture, various animals appeared.","“Perfect!” Weiss raised his hands, very satisfied with the home he had built for himself.","Jian Wushuang, however, was so shocked that he couldn’t close his mouth.","Looking at the Windriding Pavilion he had built and then at the castle Weiss had constructed, anyone unaware would think that Weiss was the master of the universe.","Just as he was gnashing his teeth in frustration, he suddenly remembered something.","Life, Weiss had just mentioned.","A word spoken, and life could be created in his universe.","This was indeed something a god could do, although he had always felt the other party’s claims of being a god were unreliable.","But the other party could indeed accomplish it.","In his universe, he should also be a god.","And could also create life.","He wielded the power of Life.","Perhaps not now, but once the universe completely solidified, he could probably create life.","In addition to the Special Life Form born of the universe, he could also create other ethnic groups.","Creating ethnic groups was related to one’s own divine body.","The more powerful the divine body, the stronger the ethnic groups created.","Some ethnic groups were born with 10,000 divine power.","Or like the strongest race in the Starry Sky, the “Giant God Race!”","Born as the Universe Masters.","Human race had to undergo three tribulations to be able to become Universe Masters.","The Giant God Race had it from birth.","“Creator!” Jian Wushuang’s gaze concentrated.","Looking at Weiss!","Perhaps there really were gods in the Starry Sky.","And he was their creator.","Creating the existence of the Starry Sky.","What Weiss just did, perhaps, was to make it clear to him that there are always greater beings beyond oneself!","By a window of the castle, Weiss glanced at Jian Wushuang, a smile playing on his lips. “Cultivation, if it’s endless, then there must be someone creating the endless existence!” With the Wanjie Sword on his back, Jian Wushuang left the Windriding Pavilion. Neither the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard nor the Nine Tribulations Tower were needed now.","There was no need to constantly carry the Beast God Weapon either; they would come when needed with just a thought.","As for the armor inside the chessboard, it was the same.","This comfort zone had been shattered by Weiss.","Now he had to face reality head-on.","Inside the cave!","The tree roots had completely disappeared.","All absorbed by him, transformed into Origin Source energy.","He didn’t think he absorbed more than Wu Li.","A piece of root from the Wanliu Willow Divine Tree contained too much energy.","What he absorbed was just a thousandth of it.","Wu Li probably didn’t absorb much either.","Whoever took the roots got the lion’s share.","The identity of that person was not simple.","But Wu Li never explained, and he didn’t want to ask too much either.","After leaving the cave, he saw the battered barrier.","“Old friend Wushuang, you’re quite fast!” Wu Li was somewhat surprised; he hadn’t expected","him to emerge so quickly.","There was still a lot of power within the tree roots. Even if he were to absorb it, it would take several years.","Yet Jian Wushuang had managed to sort everything out in just two days.","“It’s just luck, and besides, this isn’t a place for cultivation. Let’s hurry and leave!”","Wu Li nodded, “Agreed!”","Casually severing the barrier’s power, without the divine power transmission, it became a consumable barrier.","“It seems that some means are still needed. Since Wushuang just came out, let me handle it!”","Wu Li’s tone was full of confidence.","He was also a master of the sword.","With a single hand, he conjured a three-foot wooden sword.","“Wanxiang!”","His figure flashed to the top of the barrier, and with a horizontal slash, he directly cut a gap in","the barrier.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes twitched.","Just now, that one sword strike already had sixty-five thousand variations.","He didn’t believe that this was Wu Li’s full strength.","There’s probably more hidden.","Just this one sword strike is comparable to his peak state, when he had five times","amplification of power from the Beast God.","If Wu Li doesn’t use the Super Ancient Transformation, he’s already capable of beating him.","And to use the Super Ancient Transformation, he needs to gather energy in advance, with a","time limit.","In a real one-on-one fight, there’s simply no opportunity to gather energy.","“Let’s go!” Wu Li turned his head and nodded to him, indicating that they could leave.","Jian Wushuang didn’t think too much about it and flashed along with him.","In an instant, the two of them were outside the barrier.","Two days were enough for Tamu King and the others to determine the winner.","The side that probably won is now waiting for them.","Perhaps they were injured and had to leave.","But when he came out, he felt the imbalance of three divine powers.","“What?” Jian Wushuang widened his eyes, seeing three people still alive inside the blessed","land, and they were still fighting.","He was familiar with these three people as well.","Tamu King!","A Special Life Form at the Sixth Tribulation realm.","Whale Shark King!","At the Fifth Tribulation realm, with a divine power of 800,000, a strong individual with deep","scheming and strength.","Shi San!","A famous strongman at the Fifth Tribulation realm in the Shi Kingdom.","The other Fifth Tribulation realm strongman of the Shi Kingdom, Jing Lian, is already","missing.","There’s a high probability she’s fallen.","Wu Li, unlike the treant, can’t secretly observe the outside through the barrier.","He doesn’t know these people at all.","Jian Wushuang explained carefully, and Wu Li’s expression changed drastically.","Wu Li is indeed very powerful now, with a peak combat power of 700,000, he should have it.","But hearing about the Sixth Tribulation realm still scared him.","“Don’t worry, look at them, all seriously injured now. No matter whom we help, we can all","escape unscathed!” Jian Wushuang said casually.","Wu Li paused for a moment before conveying, “Wushuang, could it be that you have a grudge against those savage beasts? If so, why not team up with that powerful individual from the","Shi Kingdom and kill these two savage beasts!”","“No, no, I have no grudge with that toad, but I do have significant enmity with Shi San!” Jian Wushuang didn’t convey this telepathically, but rather said it aloud.","At this moment, Tamu King also spotted the two of them.","“Hu Biao!”","“Jian Wushuang!”","Yet, these two names belonged to the same person.","Both Whale Shark King and Shi San were delighted to see Jian Wushuang.","They also noticed a formidable unfamiliar strong individual.","Jian Wushuang was surprised, “Even after I’ve transformed into a human form, you can still","recognize me!”","Seeing him appear, the three of them each stepped back.","Currently, the situation was two against one.","Originally, it should have been Whale Shark and Shi San against Tamu King.","However, it now turned into Tamu King and Shi San against Whale Shark.","It seemed that a lot had happened here in the past two days. However, the divine power left among the three of them was all less than 700,000.","Wu Li alone could take care of all these people."]},{"number":5849,"title":"Chapter 5849: The End of the Shi Kingdom","paragraphs":["Chapter 5849: The End of the Shi Kingdom","“Jian Wushuang, you’re still alive, that’s great!” Shi San’s face lit up with joy, then he continued, “Let’s join forces and kill those two beasts, avenging the others!”","Tamu King wasn’t surprised by Shi San’s betrayal. Over the past couple of days, Shi San had made enemies with almost everyone.","He had been living on the run.","Even the Jian Lian Demoness had been killed by him.","Whale Shark King’s divine power surged, his voice cold, “Things have come to this point, yet you all are still so foolish!”","“Oh!” Jian Wushuang descended slowly, speaking, “Whale Shark King, it seems you’re prepared to fall!”","Now he didn’t need to cooperate with anyone to slay all three of them.","After all, this place was a dead end, with no one around to witness.","But that would be too dull.","Whale Shark King’s expression darkened. If it weren’t for Jian Wushuang’s sudden appearance, he would have had the ability to kill Shi San and then deal with Tamu King. But now, Jian Wushuang’s appearance had disrupted his plans.","Now he truly found himself at a dead end.","Compared to him, Tamu King and Shi San were even more severely injured, with no way out.","“Since you’ve given up hope, I’ll give you a chance!” Jian Wushuang pointed his finger, indicating Shi San.","Shi San was startled, then his face lit up again, saying, “Jian Wushuang, I knew you would act for the greater good of the human race...”","Before he could finish, Jian Wushuang’s divine power erupted violently, a stream of light directly injuring Shi San, shattering his divine body.","“Now I’ll give you a chance. Whoever kills Shi San first is eligible to live!” Jian Wushuang pointed to Shi San lying on the ground.","He could have killed Shi San himself, but that wouldn’t ease his resentment.","Blame it all on this old bastard.","Otherwise, so many people wouldn’t have died.","If he hadn’t allowed Shi Tian to kill him back then, he wouldn’t spare him now.","Wu Li stood aside, not intervening.","He could see that this strongman from the Shi Kingdom must have offended Jian Wushuang, or else things wouldn’t have turned out so badly.","Whale Shark King and Tamu King paused for a moment, then rushed to attack one after the other.","Only one could survive.","When Whale Shark King heard this, he didn’t intend to attack Shi San but instead fixed his gaze on Tamu King.","And Tamu King, still foolishly charged toward Shi San.","Shi San knew it was over this time, ranting wildly at Jian Wushuang, his divine body bursting with a strong light as he chose to self-destruct.","Even facing death, he didn’t want to be killed by the Whale Shark King or the Tamu King.","It wasn’t about pride in his human identity.","He simply didn’t want anyone to survive.","Tamu King was the closest, already heavily wounded, and this latest impact further depleted his divine power, leaving him with less than 600,000.","Just as he braced against this surge, intending to turn and ask Jian Wushuang how to deal with it, he hadn’t expected Whale Shark King to be behind him.","The moment he noticed Whale Shark King, his chest caved in.","“You!” Tamu King roared, attempting to retaliate, only to find he couldn’t muster any divine power.","Whale Shark King pulled back his fist, leaping up and slashing down with a single-handed chop, directly cleaving off the Tamu King’s massive head.","A dark green liquid sprayed out, marking the fall of Tamu King, the king of the Roman River.","And Whale Shark King also collapsed from exhaustion, having just burned through his remaining divine power.","Now, he was completely powerless.","He lay on the ground, casting a sidelong glance at Jian Wushuang, devoid of any joy, instead expressing sorrow, “I know you won’t spare me, but I’ve already won. Tamu King is dead, so I’ve won!”","“You’re wrong. I never intended to trouble you. But I made a promise, and the savage beasts outside won’t abide otherwise!” Jian Wushuang sneered.","Whale Shark King’s cunning ran deep.","If the opponent were human, they would certainly be dealt with mercilessly.","But being a savage beast, and one from the Infinite Great World at that, changed things.","They might never leave this place alive.","Unless they reached the Seventh Tribulation realm, joined the Ancient Wood Faction, and became mounts for some top-tier experts or acted as enforcers.","Only then could they venture outside.","But reaching the Seventh Tribulation realm was no easy feat.","There probably weren’t even any Seventh Tribulation realm existences in the current Infinite Great World.","“Wait for me!” Jian Wushuang didn’t bother with the fallen Whale Shark King but instead instructed Wu Li and the others to wait.","He took out an incense burner from his mustard seed and lit three sticks in the center of then blessed land.","It was a simple act of offering.","However, he hadn’t brought any paper money, as respectable people didn’t carry such things","around.","Fortunately, he had some talismans, as well as some pill recipes or formation diagrams.","These things were of little use to him.","But outside, they were worth millions of universe crystals.","Not to mention the Emperor, even weaker Tribulation experts would go to great lengths to","snatch them.","Comparatively, primordial stones could only be condensed by the Universe Master.","Universe crystals were different, almost everyone could condense them, and everyone needed","them.","Yet, all these treasures were being burned by Jian Wushuang as if they were just paper money.","Wu Li stood aside, feeling a bit distressed.","Perhaps his strength had increased too quickly, and he hadn’t yet adapted to the aura of a peak Fourth Tribulation expert.","For the Fourth Tribulation, primordial stones were needed; otherwise, what would he use to face the Fifth Tribulation?","“Rest in peace,” Jian Wushuang sighed, looking up at the entrance of the blessed land, and with a single hand, he gathered qi to directly widen the gap.","Although this place had lost its Life force, it was still considered a superior blessed land.","With one strike, he broke through the barrier here and left with Wu Li.","Only the exhausted Whale Shark King was left behind.","But outside, there were many savage beasts. Seeing the commotion here, they began to","approach. Whale Shark King struggled to stand up, his throat hoarse as he muttered, “I cannot die!”","However, facing those courageous savage beasts who had already entered the blessed land at the Third Tribulation level, he was powerless to fight back.","Amidst the siege of countless savage beasts, Whale Shark King’s eyes dimmed.","Even in death, he did not give up on self-destructing.","Above the Roman River.","Jian Wushuang and Wu Li broke through the surface of the water together, arriving in the sky.","At this moment, the outside experts also noticed the two of them.","The entire team from the Shi Kingdom had disappeared, shocking everyone.","No one knew where the team from the Shi Kingdom had gone.","In secret, the Ancient Wood Sect dispatched a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation realm","to sneak into the Infinite Great World, entering the mountains beneath the Roman River to","find that blessed land.","However, it had already been overrun by countless savage beasts, making it too noisy to even attempt time reversal.","The disappearance of the Shi Kingdom’s team had become a legend.","By this time, numerous other teams had followed the river or the mountains, reaching the","inner regions of the Infinite Great World.","Ironically, the inner regions were even safer than the outer ones.","The inner regions were like a vast primitive continent.","With few remnants of civilization, there were naturally no restrictions.","The safer the place, the more savage beasts there were.","Just like the relatively secure bottom of the Roman River, where a Sixth Tribulation realm","powerhouse resided.","Any team encountering them risked annihilation.","Just like the Shi Kingdom, unlucky enough to be wiped out."]},{"number":5850,"title":"Chapter 5850: Dragon God Continent","paragraphs":["Chapter 5850: Dragon God Continent","Jian Wushuang and Wu Li were lagging far behind in their journey.","Their strengths were formidable, and they encountered few dangers along the Roman River.","As soon as they emerged, they received a transmission from the Empress.","Surprisingly, they had not received the message while in the blessed land and only discovered it upon exiting.","The Empress had already reached the inner perimeter.","With a goal in mind, they continued on their way, intending to meet the Empress in the inner perimeter.","In the brief transmission, Jian Wushuang edited out some of the details and sent the message to the Empress.","Her response was a simple “Hmm!”","There was no further elaboration.","Jian Wushuang and Wu Li cursed vehemently together.","Her daughter was dead, yet there was no emotional expression from her-how ruthless!","Following such a person would lead nowhere.","Fortunately, their plan involved the Wanliu.","Their relationship with the Empress could be considered a form of cooperation.","By helping each other attain the position of Holy Maiden, they would then have no further dealings.","“Let’s focus on reaching the inner perimeter first!”","Jian Wushuang enveloped Wu Li in his Origin Source and swiftly traversed space using the Three Quake Universe technique.","The speed was astonishing, leaving Wu Li speechless. Even a Fifth Tribulation realm expert couldn’t catch up to them.","Their journey continued without conversation or interference.","In just ten days, they arrived at the inner perimeter continent.","“The Dragon God Continent!”","Jian Wushuang chuckled as he read the introduction on the token, speculating, “Could this ancient land harbor Tribulation realm true dragons?”","“It’s unlikely,” Wu Li shook his head. “True dragons at the cosmic level are as rare as Beast Gods. Once they appear, the Ancient Wood Sect will capture them. Their entire bodies are treasures, and the Ancient Wood Sect won’t let them slip away.”","As they landed on the ground, they felt the gravity, which was extraordinary.","It was a wild and ancient land.","Even the gravity here was a hundred times stronger than the outside world.","Ordinary beings would find it incredibly difficult to survive.","Without the ability to reproduce, ordinary tribes would be born as mere mortals, unable to endure such gravity.","The population thriving in this place seemed extraordinary.","Both of them dared not to fly recklessly high in the sky anymore.","Instead, they flew close to the ground, moving extremely slowly.","Just two days into their journey, they encountered a Special Life Form of rock type at the level of Fifth Tribulations.","Fortunately, it showed no hostility towards them, just gave them a glance, then dragged its huge body away.","The savage world was full of wonders, things they hadn’t seen outside.","A single blooming flower could wipe out an entire tribe of savage beasts.","After blooming, it grew rapidly, turning into an ordinary appearance, probably attracting the next tribe.","This place was extremely comfortable, suitable for reproduction.","Out of curiosity, Jian Wushuang and Wu Li picked some flowers.","As a result, they attracted a flower demon at the level of Fifth Tribulations.","As soon as they detected its aura, Jian Wushuang immediately pulled Wu Li and unleashed the Three Quake Universe, swiftly leaving that precious place.","After escaping, cold sweat dripped down their backs.","A Fifth Tribulation strong being was right beside them, yet they hadn’t noticed. It was terrifying.","“How far are we from Her Majesty?” Wu Li began to feel afraid.","Although his divine power had increased to over 600,000, reaching the peak where he could burst out with 700,000 divine power, facing a Fifth Tribulations being was still challenging.","Jian Wushuang took out a token and, following the simple map given by the Empress, estimated they were still a year away from the other side if they used the Three Quake Universe.","Roughly, they could find the Empress’s approximate location in about a month.","However, constantly using the Three Quake Universe would attract the attention of many savage beasts.","In the savage ancient land, there were countless savage beasts, even at the level of Six Tribulations.","If they attracted the attention of a Sixth Tribulations savage beast, it would be disastrous.","The Origin Source used by the Three Quake Universe was incredibly powerful.","By then, they would be considered strong beings of the same level.","Sixth Tribulations savage beasts definitely wouldn’t want a human Sixth Tribulations strong being to appear in their territory.","They would certainly intervene.","Once discovered, there would be no escape.","In the Roman River, Jian Wushuang knew that the only Sixth Tribulations strong being had","already fallen.","That’s why he dared to keep using the Three Quake Universe.","But in the Dragon God Continent, he wouldn’t dare to play like this unless faced with danger.","“Fly slowly, it’s just a year, and we’ll be safe once we meet Her Majesty!” Jian Wushuang","reassured.","But as soon as he finished speaking, he sensed a familiar aura.","That aura, it seemed like Li Sheng.","He was pleasantly surprised, didn’t expect Li Sheng to still be alive.","And he was very close to his location.","If it wasn’t too much trouble, he could bring the other person along.","After informing Wu Li of this matter, Wu Li naturally did not object.","One more person meant one more hope.","In case the other person received a special mission, then they would hit the jackpot.","Without hesitation, the two followed the causal aura directly.","But as Jian Wushuang approached closer and closer, he felt an overwhelming aura that","couldn’t be crossed.","He was scared and stopped directly.","Wu Li, seeing this, paused as well. At first, he didn’t understand, but the tree person inside","him reminded him.","“Such a terrifying aura!”","Jian Wushuang nodded in agreement, saying, “That aura is definitely not something we can","provoke. There are many strong beings around that aura, at least three of them at the Fifth Tribulation realm. The owner of the terrifying aura is at least at the Sixth Tribulation realm, even more terrifying than the aura of Tamu King!”","And Li Sheng was at the core of that aura.","How could the two dare to approach?","“We are no match for them. But Li Sheng’s aura has been stable, he should be with the owner","of the terrifying aura, seems like he found a powerful backer!”","Now that Li Sheng had transformed into a savage beast, naturally, he was traveling with","them.","Perhaps they shouldn’t have appeared.","The two restrained their auras.","For safety’s sake, Jian Wushuang wrapped his aura around Wu Li’s body, then they both restrained their auras, cutting off Thought power detection.","Now that his universe was perfect, he could wrap up the auras of other people as well.","But at most, only two people.","Wu Li was quite surprised by this, didn’t expect Jian Wushuang to have such a trick.","Coupled with their speed.","It was a double lifesaving trump card.","No wonder an Emperor could become so powerful.","Inwardly sighing, even the tree person had a high opinion of Jian Wushuang.","“Be careful, once we’ve created some distance, we’ll leave at full speed!” Jian Wushuang","reminded, afraid that the terrifying aura would notice them.","Little did Jian Wushuang know, the owner of that terrifying aura had already sensed the two","of them.","It was just too lazy to deal with them.","On a small island in the center of a distant lake, a one-sided massacre was unfolding.","Among the executioners was Li Sheng, once a formidable figure of the human race.","Once the head of the Li family in the Yue Kingdom, he had now become a lackey of the savage","beasts. However, the slaughter was directed towards these very beasts, which relieved Li Sheng of any burden on his conscience.","His actions were swift, precise, and steady.","“I’ll say it again, hand over that red sphere, or you’ll all die!” Li Sheng’s face twisted into a grimace as he grabbed one of the humanoid savage beasts he had defeated at his feet.","The island in the middle of the lake, once inhabited by the Polunga Clan, was now strewn with bodies, victims of the ruthless massacre."]},{"number":5851,"title":"Chapter 5851: Polunga Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 5851: Polunga Clan","The Polunga Clan was the foremost tribe in the Dragon God Continent.","They were numerous, spanning across the entire continent, and their strength was","formidable.","Within the clan, there were two main types of individuals: those inclined towards combat and those towards wisdom.","The combatants were akin to special beings, even stronger than some, with talents and reserves that could dominate the continent.","The wise ones, on the other hand, were extraordinary, each a master of esoteric arts such as puppetry, alchemy, divine forging, and formations.","But now, the strong members of the Polunga Clan in this area were being systematically slaughtered.","Even the formidable warriors among them were no match for their assailants.","In this tribe, there had once been a powerful Polunga expert at the Fifth Tribulations realm, but they had been besieged and killed by three Fifth Tribulations realm savage beasts.","The remaining members of the tribe were significantly weaker.","Li Sheng alone had taken care of most of them.","The ground was littered with the bodies of Polunga Clan members, their uniformly green skin and antennae on their humanoid foreheads marking their distinctiveness.","They were known as the descendants of the Dragon God according to legend, a rumor derived from the transformations of the Polunga Clan’s strong members.","In the days of the Emperor, Polunga Clan members could transform into dragons, but after reaching the Tribulation Realm, they could no longer do so.","According to the conjecture of the experts from the Ancient Wood Sect, it was because their bloodline power couldn’t withstand it.","Only Polunga Clan members with pure bloodline power could transform into dragons at the Tribulation Realm, becoming true dragon experts.","Yet, throughout the Dragon God Continent, only the ancient Dragon God had achieved this. And this Dragon God had already fallen.","Many human experts outside believed that the Dragon God was killed by the Ancient Wood Sect.","However, the strong of the Dragon God Continent believed that the Dragon God had not been defeated by humans.","That’s because the Dragon God had the strength of a Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm, making him invincible in the entire Infinite Great World.","The invaders from beyond the heavens had been repelled several times.","Both sides had their own versions of events, and no one knew for sure what was true.","Such matters were difficult to verify and had become relegated to legend.","But now, there were strong individuals who insisted on probing into this matter further. Buzz!","A humming sound echoed, and Li Sheng quickly dropped the Polunga clan member, turning respectfully, “Lord Gula, please give me some time, I will make them talk!”","“Oh, it seems you have quite the patience!” Gula was extremely thin, with spiral horns on either side of his head, purple lips, a swaying tail, sitting on a floating throne, appearing very indifferent.","But his aura was terrifying.","Making everyone submit to him.","Even his three subordinates at the Fifth Tribulation realm stood obediently behind him, like servants.","If Jian Wushuang saw Gula’s face, he would definitely be startled.","Gula’s appearance was exactly the same as Gu Sha Jian Wushuang defeated on the Grave God Mountain.","This meant Gula was of the Frost Demon Clan.","A group that once dominated an era in the Moro Spacetime.","But now appeared here.","And now, Gula hadn’t transformed, yet his divine power was already one million.","At the peak of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","The threshold of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Throughout the Dragon God Continent, even across the Infinite Great World, he was probably the strongest existence.","The Frost Demon Clan could transform.","If he transformed, his combat power would probably reach the level of the Seventh","Tribulation realm.","Such terrifying strength, even with the entire human team, wouldn’t be enough to offer a challenge.","When Li Sheng first emerged from the bottom of the Roman River, he ran towards the shore, feeling like a wild beast, able to stroll on land at will.","But unexpectedly, he stumbled upon a restriction.","Accidentally discovering a ruin, he cleaned out all the treasures inside but found himself unable to leave.","Just when he was in a dilemma, he stumbled upon a teleportation array, transporting him to","this place.","Coincidentally encountering Gula.","Although his divine power had reached 600,000 through that ruin, it was nothing in front of Gula, he couldn’t even move a muscle.","Immediately, he chose to join forces with him.","Gula had been searching for the Polunga clan’s legacy treasure, the ‘Dragon Ball’, to verify the","fall of the Dragon God.","Now Gula had already obtained two.","In the Dragon God Continent, the core tribes of the Polunga clan had nine.","In other words, there were nine Dragon Balls.","As long as all nine Dragon Balls were gathered, Gula could find out the secret of the Dragon","God’s fall.","Of course, the secret was just a product of curiosity.","The real reason behind all this was the dragon god’s legacy.","The dragon god had once plundered treasures from the entire Infinite Great World.","Dragons loved treasures, especially the rare ones!","They cherished collecting treasures above all else.","Gura sought after these treasures.","To him, the Infinite Great World posed no threat.","Only the extraterrestrial visitors did.","Those strong individuals from the human race were his true adversaries.","With the Dragon God’s treasures in his possession, he could rely on them to enhance his","divine power once more, thus escaping the Infinite Great World.","He wouldn’t be bound by the human race anymore.","He had glimpsed the prosperity of the outside world from the minds of those strong","individuals of the human race.","That was where the true strong thrived.","Indeed, the Ancient Wood Continent had many formidable beings from other races.","But these beings weren’t considered savage beasts outside.","They were just like the Celestial Wolves.","Celestial Wolves!","Ultimately, they were savage beasts too.","However, because of the words ‘Celestial Wolf’ and the Celestial Wolf Secret Realm, they transformed into the native powerhouses of the Ancient Wood Continent.","Just like the human race, they could also cultivate within the Ancient Wood Sect.","However, most other savage beasts were still struggling within some primitive worlds.","And most of these primitive worlds were suppressed by the Ancient Wood Sect.","The Infinite Great World was one such place.","It was just relatively close to the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Of course, in terms of overall strength, it was much stronger than those ordinary primitive","continents.","The other savage beasts were clueless about these matters.","Even Li Sheng was unaware of why Gula was seeking these Dragon Balls.","“You damned invaders! I, a mighty member of the Polunga Clan, will never let you go","unpunished!”","A Polunga elder rushed towards Gula, prepared to self-destruct in a bid to take him down. Unfortunately, this elder’s strength was lacking, with only 500,000 divine power. With a swift movement, Li Sheng positioned himself directly in front of Gula, sealing the elder with hand gestures, rendering him unable to self-destruct.","“Forget it. Since you won’t talk, I’ll just kill you all and find out myself!”","Gula yawned, bored, lounging on the throne. With a casual wave, he dispatched his","subordinates behind him, preparing to advance and exterminate all the members of the","Polunga Clan.","Observing this, Li Sheng wasted no time.","He promptly subdued and killed the sealed Polunga elder before striding purposefully into the tribe’s midst, beginning the slaughter of the remaining Polunga people.","Passing by an elliptical stone hut, he noticed a Polunga child, small in stature with a smooth","head.","“I almost forgot, you still have intelligent members in your tribe!” Li Sheng sneered coldly before entering the hut.","Upon entering, his eyes lit up at the sight of a red spherical object hanging in the room. Excited, he disregarded the Polunga child and prepared to rush out to call for assistance."]},{"number":5852,"title":"Chapter 5852: Group Mission","paragraphs":["Chapter 5852: Group Mission","Just as he turned around, two figures intercepted Li Sheng directly.","“You!” Li Sheng almost shouted when he saw the two figures.","One of them, carrying a divine sword on his back, kicked Li Sheng in the face, sending him crashing through the stone house, rendering him unconscious.","Seeing this, Gula’s subordinates hurried over.","“It should be this small sphere as stated in the mission!” exclaimed one person, grabbing the floating sphere in the air with joy.","Trying to collect the sphere into their storage space, they found it impossible to do so.","Just as Li Sheng was kicked away.","Through the hole broken in the stone house, the figure of Jian Wushuang, carrying the divine sword on his back, was revealed.","And the other person needed no introduction; it was Wu Li.","Originally, they both were ready to leave, but they received a special mission.","This mission was extremely special, not only a group task but also exceeding the rules of the seven stars.","Mission objective: Collect nine inheritance Dragon Balls of the Polunga Clan!","Seemingly simple, but after a little understanding of the Polunga Clan, they were stunned.","The Polunga Clan had several Sixth Tribulation realm experts.","It was impossible to snatch it.","In their opinion, it was better to first find the Empress and then discuss a plan.","But when they sensed Li Sheng’s burst of aura, they also sensed the aura of the Polunga Clan.","So they decided to come and take a look.","As a result, they happened to encounter the slaughter by these people.","Their courage grew as they hid their breath amidst the chaos and infiltrated the tribe.","They wanted to take advantage of the confusion.","Unexpectedly, they were discovered.","Thanks to Li Sheng’s guidance.","Following the other party into this stone house, they originally intended to ask Li Sheng about the situation here!","But then they discovered the dragon balls.","They didn’t know which faction the people outside belonged to.","But they were definitely not from the outside team.","Yet, they were also searching for the dragon balls.","They didn’t care much and immediately attacked Li Sheng.","There were a total of nine Dragon Balls.","Now that they had one, their task was essentially completed.","As long as they found the Empress and handed over this Dragon Ball, they would be free of any further obligations.","With so many teams around, obtaining one Dragon Ball counted as success.","Since it was a group task, they couldn’t rely on one person to collect all nine.","However, they needed to escape this place first.","The terrifying powerhouse was still outside.","If they were discovered, there would be no escape.","“Let me try!” Jian Wushuang hurried over and tried to collect the Dragon Ball into his origin, but he couldn’t do it.","At this moment, he remembered outside the tribe, next to the terrifying aura, there was a guy covered in spikes, holding two identical balls.","It seemed they couldn’t be contained, so they had to be carried.","Jian Wushuang grabbed the Dragon Ball with one hand, unable to care much, and could only carry it for now.","“Forget it, let’s go first!”","Wu Li just wanted to follow Jian Wushuang, but he was reminded again from within, making him pause and look at the Polunga child.","“Bring him along, he looks pitiful!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang almost cursed.","At this point, he couldn’t even protect himself, yet he had to care for a child from another","race.","But after a moment’s thought, Wu Li wasn’t the kind of person to show undue kindness, so there must be some reason for this.","Immediately, he used divine power to envelop the Polunga child and then broke through the ground, creating a passage straight down.","This passage led to a vast lake.","Once underwater, Jian Wushuang’s speed increased.","He was also conveniently hiding the presence of two people, avoiding detection from","outsiders.","Originally, he intended to take Li Sheng with him.","But seeing how well Li Sheng was blending in, perhaps leaving him with that terrifying powerhouse would be more suitable.","The other person had two Dragon Balls in hand.","They had to be careful.","Consider them as planted spies.","Inside the tribe on the small island.","Li Sheng was kicked away and dashed back as if possessed.","To his dismay, he found no one there, not even the children from the Polunga Clan.","He glanced back at the hole in the ground.","Cursing under his breath, he muttered, “Damn Jian Wushuang, you didn’t even take me with","you!”","He then reached for the token, intending to send a message to Jian Wushuang.","But when he took out the token, he was astonished to find two messages.","The first one: “Special group mission, seven stars. Find the Dragon Clan!”","The second one was a transmission from Jian Wushuang.","“Stay where you are, don’t come!”","Now he understood.","He understood why Jian Wushuang kicked him and didn’t take him along.","He was being sent as a spy!","Thankfully, Jian Wushuang was smart enough to think of it, making him, the esteemed leader of the Yue Kingdom’s first family after the royal family, become a spy.","And there was no benefit in it yet.","But he still had to do it.","Sensing something approaching from outside, he quickly sealed the entrance to the cave and","collected all the tokens.","Then, he destroyed the entire stone house.","Boom!","The stone house below turned into ruins, and he was already in the air, cursing, “Damn","Polunga people, daring to ambush me!”","This performance made many of Gulah’s subordinates who had gathered around retreat.","“Brother Li Sheng, don’t be angry, come help me!” a plea came from afar.","Li Sheng’s expression softened, and he chuckled, “Watch me!”","Boom boom!","Deep in the lake that surrounded the island.","Jian Wushuang had already brought Wu Li and the Polunga child to the edge of the lake.","Splash!","Emerging from the water, he turned around to see billowing black smoke behind him.","The Polunga Clan’s settlement there had been completely destroyed.","When the Polunga child saw this, tears welled up in his eyes.","He was a wise member of the Polunga Clan, knowing that saying anything now was useless.","Jian Wushuang just glanced at him and said, “Let’s go, let’s find a safe place first!”","With two people in tow, they flew close to the ground.","After half a day’s journey, he directly displayed the Three Quake Universe, quickly teleporting","hundreds of times, and finally stopped in a canyon.","This place was teeming with beasts of the Tribulation realm.","It was a medium-sized tribe.","But the strongest among them was only at the level of Fourth Tribulation.","Taking advantage of the cover provided by this tribe, they reached the depths of the canyon.","Buzz!","Opening a cave with a flick of his hand, Jian Wushuang led them into it.","“Let’s rest for a while!”","Traveling wasn’t tiring.","But the cautious feeling wore Jian Wushuang out mentally and physically.","Wu Li took the Dragon Ball from him and began examining it.","The Polunga Clan boy beside them didn’t utter a word.","Jian Wushuang casually sat on a rock, replenishing some mental strength.","He also glanced at the Dragon Ball.","“So, have you noticed any problems?” He hadn’t carefully examined the Dragon Ball along","the way.","Only three hexagonal stars were engraved on the Dragon Ball.","There was nothing else particularly special about it.","After studying it for a while, Wu Li also gave up. “No, I can’t see anything!”"]},{"number":5853,"title":"Chapter 5853: Dragon Ball","paragraphs":["Chapter 5853: Dragon Ball","As he spoke, he placed the Dragon Ball on the ground and plopped down on it.","A child from the Polunga Clan couldn’t hold back anymore and rushed forward, delivering a swift kick to the Dragon Ball beneath Wu Li’s buttocks.","Plop!","Wu Li, caught off guard, landed squarely on the ground.","Seeing this scene, Jian Wushuang nearly burst into laughter.","The child from the Polunga Clan hurried to retrieve the rolling Dragon Ball.","Jian Wushuang remained calm, watching as the child from the Polunga Clan picked up the Dragon Ball.","“This is our clan’s sacred treasure. Although you saved me, you cannot desecrate our sacred object!” The child from the Polunga Clan carefully held the Dragon Ball, looking towards Jian Wushuang.","He was exceptionally clever, aware that Jian Wushuang was the strongest individual there.","He paid no attention to Wu Li.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly, taking the initiative to apologize, “I’m sorry on behalf of my friend. We sincerely apologize to you!”","“I don’t blame you, and I also want to thank you for saving me!”","At this moment, Wu Li stood up from the ground, dusted off his backside, and looked at the child from the Polunga Clan, smiling, “Kid, what’s your name?”","“Danbao!”","Sensing the intelligence emanating from the child, Jian Wushuang felt that this youngster had great potential.","He showed no fear in front of them, answering questions fluidly, without collapsing due to the deaths of his people.","His eyes brimmed with wisdom.","“Danbao, let me ask you, why did those people massacre your tribe?” Jian Wushuang inquired.","Danbao lowered his head this time, tears welling up in his eyes at the thought of his entire tribe perishing.","“They came to plunder our clan’s sacred treasure, this Dragon Ball!” After uttering these words, he looked up at Jian Wushuang and questioned, “Are you outsiders?”","Upon hearing this, Wu Li was astonished and hurriedly asked, “How did you know we’re not locals?”","“Because our clan’s ancestral memories contain information about your human race!”","Danbao’s response furrowed Jian Wushuang’s brows.","It seemed to match the rumors.","“Now that you know, we won’t hide it from you. We saved you this time because of this Dragon Ball. We need to borrow it for a while!” Jian Wushuang chose not to conceal the truth; this child was too clever to deceive.","Upon hearing this, Danbao obediently handed over the Dragon Ball and said, “I know what you’re going to do, but please don’t harm the people of the Polunga Clan!”","“I promise you, I won’t!” Jian Wushuang took the Dragon Ball, readily agreeing.","He didn’t need to compete for more Dragon Balls, as one was sufficient.","The rest were irrelevant to him. Even if he acquired more, they would all be for the Empress. Yet, the Empress had abandoned them.","Now, he and Wu Li could still think for her, which was already considerate enough.","He must have owed her too much in his past life; otherwise, he wouldn’t have ended up being her son-in-law.","This Dragon Ball was a bargaining chip, and there were only nine in total. One was enough.","Next, they needed to find the Empress.","Initially, she had been indifferent.","When he and Wu Li had just arrived at the Dragon God Continent, the Empress had only given them a position and ignored them thereafter.","Now, upon hearing about the acquisition of the Dragon Ball, she directly informed them to wait in place.","In a day, the Empress would arrive at this location.","This also surprised Jian Wushuang with her speed.","He had exerted all his efforts for a month.","The Empress only needed a day.","“Sixth Tribulation realm!” Jian Wushuang figured out something.","What task could possibly require a hundred years?","Wu Li had spent a hundred years passing through one tribulation.","Then, the Empress might have also broken through.","It was very likely she was in the Sixth Tribulation realm now.","That explained her speed.","Thinking of this, he breathed a sigh of relief.","If the Empress had indeed broken through, then this time would be truly stable.","The Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","Her divine power was probably close to a million now.","This was not something to be trifled with.","When Wu Li heard his speculation, his eyes brightened.","“At least we don’t have to be afraid anymore!”","Just as the two relaxed, they sensed a strong aura coming from afar.","Fear flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes as he warned, “Not good, it’s some terrifying","powerhouse!”","Divine power instantly enveloped Wu Li and Danbao.","He also held his breath.","Wu Li cautiously speculated, “Could it be that idiot Li Sheng has betrayed us?”","“It shouldn’t be!” Jian Wushuang restrained his telepathy, unable to sense that aura.","But he felt it was unlikely.","Li Sheng had no reason to betray him.","Betraying him wouldn’t benefit Li Sheng in any way.","On the contrary, cooperating with him would bring significant advantages.","That presence moved slowly, not like someone chasing them, but rather like someone on a","journey.","A powerful aura swept over them, causing Jian Wushuang to finally breathe a sigh of relief. “That person, he’s too terrifying, could he be a Seven Tribulations realm expert?” Wu Li panted heavily, his face incredulous.","At this moment, Danbao took out a crystal ball and spoke up, “You’re probably talking about","him!”","Jian Wushuang and Wu Li both looked at the crystal ball.","“What the heck?”","Seeing that familiar face, Jian Wushuang thought he had traveled back to the Qishen Temple.","The face was exactly like the ancient temple he had once destroyed.","The ancient temple, freezing demon clan.","Back when he had just succeeded in the Dao Merge, Zhen Ling had arranged for him to practice against them on the Grave God Mountain.","He had learned a lot about the Frost Demon Clan back then.","These dominant clans from the ancient times of the Moro Spacetime.","He had thought they only existed in Moro Spacetime, or perhaps there were some remnants in","the Qishen Temple.","He hadn’t expected to encounter them on a desolate continent in the Ancient Moon","Spacetime.","“It must be!” Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth, staring at that face.","Wu Li exclaimed, “Do you know him?”","“No, I know his clan!” Jian Wushuang shook his head, then continued, “This is the Frost","Demon Clan, a peak clan with extremely powerful divine power. Most importantly, they don’t reveal their peak state, but suppress their own strength to the weakest state.”","The earlier words didn’t concern Wu Li.","He wouldn’t reveal his peak state to others either, but when he heard the last part, he froze,","trembling as he said, “The weakest state, one million divine power?”","If that was their weakest state, wouldn’t their peak state be godlike?","Jian Wushuang didn’t know about the others, but the Ancient Temple had been able to","increase from 100,000 to 180,000.","That wasn’t just a doubling.","“Gula!” Danbao said his name, then continued, “I’ve already passed on Gula’s information to","the Holy Land. Even if he’s powerful, the Holy Land’s super warriors will defeat him!” Wu Li almost laughed out loud, feeling that this kid, despite being bright, was still naive.","He didn’t understand what a million divine power represented.","That was the ticket for a Seven Tribulations realm expert.","It was also a sign of a leap in combat power."]},{"number":5854,"title":"Chapter 5854: A Small Punishment","paragraphs":["Chapter 5854: A Small Punishment","Danbao saw the disdain in the eyes of the two, but he didn’t bother to argue. He simply relayed the information from this place back to the Qishen Temple.","The Holy Land of the Polunga Clan had three Fifth Tribulation realm powerhouses mobilized and were heading towards this place.","It would take just a quarter of an hour to arrive.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang and Wu Li were still foolishly boasting about the Frost Demon Clan.","“It’s not an exaggeration. If this Gula reaches its peak state, its divine power is estimated to be over a million!” Jian Wushuang bragged.","“Can that increase by 300,000?” Wu Li asked.","“If you haven’t encountered it, you wouldn’t know!” Jian Wushuang continued boasting. “Back in the day, when I was... when I was battling in the Outer Domain, I encountered a Frost Demon Clan.”","“The Outer Domain?”","“Battling?” Wu Li, knowing Jian Wushuang was a reincarnated individual, raised an eyebrow, questioning, “Wushuang, I thought you were quite young back then, how did you end up fighting in the Outer Domain?”","Initially, Wu Li was the one who provided information about the Outer Domain to Jian Wushuang.","He couldn’t fathom how Jian Wushuang could have battled in the Outer Domain while knowing nothing about them.","That’s where people went to fight in the most remote corners!","Seeing the disbelief on Wu Li’s face, Jian Wushuang grew agitated and exclaimed, “Don’t doubt me! Back then, I, alone, led tens of thousands of Emperors. Although I was young, my strength...”","On this point, Wu Li had great trust.","Jian Wushuang’s experiences might be questionable, but his strength was undeniable!","It could be expressed in a single word.","“In that battle, I fought against that Frost Demon Clan for a month before determining the outcome. It’s still fresh in my memory!” Jian Wushuang boasted, hands behind his back, elevating his own experiences.","Which was somewhat true.","Although there was a bit of exaggeration.","But when he was truly an emperor, he did slay a Fifth Tribulation realm Frost Demon Clan powerhouse.","Wu Li nodded and said, “Wushuang, since you have experience, I’m not worried. When the Emperor arrives, why don’t we take care of that Frost Demon Clan? They supposedly have two Dragon Balls!”","“Oh, that...” Jian Wushuang paused. He was merely talking big.","They couldn’t really go against Gula.","The old temple back then, with its weaker strength, they could bully a bit.","But now, Gula was at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Without transforming, he could easily deal with the two of them.","Adding the Empress didn’t make much difference.","Even if they transformed, all the teams combined wouldn’t be enough to offer as sacrifices. Dealing with Gula wasn’t worth it.","“I think it’s better to forget it. One Dragon Ball is sufficient, and besides, His Majesty just had","a breakthrough. He might not be accustomed to divine power yet. It’s not the right time to act!”","As they chatted, Gula had already left.","They didn’t pay much attention to the outside world.","It wasn’t until they noticed three grim-faced members of the Polunga Clan standing at the entrance that they both swallowed nervously.","At this moment, Danbao ran over and spoke rapidly in the language of the Polunga Clan to the three.","Jian Wushuang and Wu Li were frozen in place, afraid to move.","Three Fifth Tribulation experts.","The weakest of them had a divine power of 700,000.","And there were three of them.","They had already given up on escaping.","Wu Li, being a smooth operator, reacted relatively quickly.","He casually took out several scrolls, carrying a tea tray as he approached to ingratiate himself.","“Danbao, my little friend, I’m not criticizing you, but when your big shot comes, shouldn’t there be a heads-up? Look how chilly it is here, there isn’t even a place to sit!” He blurted out before realizing he had just sat on the inheritance artifact of the host, feeling a bit awkward. For a moment, he didn’t know what else to say, so he glanced at Jian Wushuang for support. Jian Wushuang nodded in agreement, saying, “Indeed, it’s quite chilly, ridiculously so!” Among the three Polunga Clan experts, the one in the middle, the most burly figure, strode up to Wu Li.","Wu Li’s slender frame made him look like a little chick.","“Have some tea!” Wu Li smiled and offered the tea cup.","Smack!","The burly Polunga expert kicked Wu Li in the face, sending him flying several yards.","Wu Li’s body crashed into the stone wall before falling down.","“This is the punishment for disrespecting our Polunga Clan’s sacred object!”","Jian Wushuang initially thought of using the Three Quake Universe with Wu Li, but seeing that the opponent had just acted without using divine power, and Wu Li was uninjured, he calmed","down.","The burly figure turned to Jian Wushuang, placing a hand over his chest and bowing, “I, Zack of the Polunga Clan, thank you for saving Danbao!”","“You’re welcome!” Jian Wushuang replied politely, walking over slowly and handing over the Dragon Ball he had been holding.","At this moment, he couldn’t afford to lend it anymore.","Lending it again would result in the same fate as Wu Li.","Wu Li got up from the ground with a dark expression on his face.","At this moment, Danbao rushed over and bowed to Jian Wushuang, thanking him. Then he explained, “Benefactor, it’s not our strongmen who are troubling you. Nowadays, three of our Polunga Clan’s core tribes have been destroyed. Since you are so familiar with Gula, please come with me to our sacred land and inform our clan’s elders of what you know. We will lend you the Dragon Ball at that time!”","“Of course!” Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile.","Then he transmitted his voice to Wu Li, “Let’s go!”","There was no other choice now; they could only go and see.","The Empress would arrive here in less than a day.","Judging from Danbao’s attitude, there shouldn’t be any danger.","Moreover, they had heard that the strongmen of the Polunga Clan were not belligerent.","But there was one thing Jian Wushuang was very worried about.","He was afraid that the human teams would go to seize the Dragon Ball, creating a bad","impression for the humans.","“Please!” Zack waved his hand, and a flying carpet appeared. Jian Wushuang and Wu Li","jumped onto it together.","Buzz!","The divine power surged above the magic carpet.","Swish!","In an instant, they arrived in the sky outside.","Then they headed northward.","“This direction?” Jian Wushuang pointed and reminded, “Everyone, as I said before, this","direction is not good!”","Gula had just gone in this direction, and the speed wasn’t fast either.","At this speed, they would probably catch up to Gula in no time.","That would be dangerous.","Although Danbao had been with them all along, he was not a combatant from the Polunga","Clan, so he couldn’t sense Gula’s powerful aura.","“Benefactor, rest assured, Zack is very strong. In the last clan competition, he ranked in the","top ten. Even if he encounters Gula, he won’t be afraid!” Danbao had confidence in Zack.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t think so.","The intelligent Polunga Clan members were idiots when it came to combat power.","They simply didn’t understand.","At this moment, Zack also looked over and said, “Benefactor, how powerful was the strongman who destroyed my Polunga Clan?”"]},{"number":5855,"title":"Chapter 5855: Are You Afraid?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5855: Are You Afraid?","“Starting at a million!” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","Hearing the mention of a million divine power, Zack quickly shouted, “Turn around, turn around quickly!”","The Polunga Clan adept operating the flying carpet promptly halted.","“Zack, that location is where Elder Jones’ tribe is!” Jian Wushuang realized.","Oh no!","Now Jian Wushuang understood.","Gula must be heading to another tribe nearby.","Zack, the strongest warrior of Elder Jones’ tribe, had only been practicing in the Holy Land all this time.","Now, upon hearing that Gula was heading towards their tribe, he became anxious.","“You two take Danbao and the benefactor to detour to the Holy Land. I’ll go back alone to support Elder Jones!”","Zack didn’t falter this time, even with Gula possessing a million divine powers.","That’s the spirit of the Polunga warriors.","Always holding the greatest kindness towards their tribe and people.","They would never abandon a fellow tribesman.","Just like when they went to rescue Danbao.","Sending three Fifth Tribulation realm warriors just for a child had nothing to do with inheriting sacred artifacts.","Agreeing to lend Jian Wushuang the artifact was also genuine.","Because the sacred artifact wasn’t really that useful, just used to pay homage to the great dragon god.","“I’ll go with you. Elder Jones is too old, and his divine power has declined significantly. You alone won’t be much help!” Another Polunga adept volunteered for battle.","Jian Wushuang suggested at this moment, “Even if you both go, it won’t be of any use. It’s better to let the strong ones in the Holy Land support us now!”","He had heard from the elixir that Zack was only ranked tenth, yet he was already so powerful. So, if they gathered the remaining strong ones, there might really be hope to defeat Gula. “The nearest Elder Westmo has already set out with his men from here!” Danbao had long been in contact with elders from various tribes.","Jian Wushuang also gave the elixir a praising glance for its quick thinking.","Indeed, it was intelligent, much faster in reaction than these few blockheads.","“Let’s go now!”","Zack and the other Polunga adept immediately increased their speed, flying swiftly towards Gula’s direction.","Leaving behind only one Polunga adept, the weakest in strength.","At this moment, Wu Li transmitted, “Brother Wushuang, why don’t we just take him down together!”","“Stop!” Jian Wushuang gently shook his head.","He now realized that the Polunga Clan harbored no hostility towards the human race.","It was better to go with the flow instead of always trying to outdo others.","At this moment, Danbao utilized the crystal ball in his hand to continuously relay messages.","Seeing the other party so busy, he had originally wanted to inquire about the Polunga Holy Land, but now he felt embarrassed to disturb them.","After Zack and his group left, everyone rushed for a quarter of an hour to detour towards the Holy Land.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged, quietly waiting.","But at this moment, he sensed a powerful aura approaching.","This aura was very familiar.","Among them was the aura of Li Sheng.","It startled him.","Just as he was about to remind whoever controlled the flying carpet of the Polunga clan, Li Sheng had already sent him a voice transmission.","“Gula is not here. What’s the situation on your end? Why are you mixing with the Polunga people?”","Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief upon seeing the message.","As long as Gula was not here, it was fine.","But he didn’t know why Li Sheng and his group had come here.","Before he could remind any Polunga strongman, the other party had already sensed the aura themselves, but they stopped on their own accord.","There was no intention to evade.","“They are Gula’s subordinates!” Jian Wushuang remarked at this moment.","At the same time, he directly communicated with Li Sheng, asking about their intentions.","This group was responsible for finding the location of the Polunga Holy Land.","The Polunga tribe was easy to find.","But the Holy Land was not something an ordinary person could easily come across.","With Gula holding the upper hand, none of the Polunga tribes could stand in their way; they","could be eliminated one by one.","But the Holy Land was not that easy to locate.","So, they dispatched their subordinates to find it.","They chanced upon Jian Wushuang and his companions.","Leading them was a Fifth Tribulation realm expert, accompanied by seven or eight Fourth Tribulation realm cultivators.","Fortunately, the aura of that Fifth Tribulation realm expert wasn’t as overwhelming as Jian Wushuang had anticipated.","The Polunga Clan cultivator probably halted begrudgingly for this reason, perhaps seeking vengeance for his people.","Jian Wushuang also began to gear up, telling Wu Li beside him, “You go assist this fellow","Daoist later, leave the rest to me.”","“Me?” Wu Li pointed at himself.","Danbao understood now, as enemies approached, he pleaded for the two to act.","“What, are you scared now?” Jian Wushuang feigned surprise.","They had just been boasting a moment ago.","If they backed down now, it would be quite embarrassing.","Danbao was still here!","Wu Li also discerned the distribution of strength within that aura, shrugged indifferently,","“Why would I be? I just think this Polunga fellow can handle them alone. It’s been a while","since I’ve fought, might as well use these people as practice!”","“Weren’t you just beaten up earlier?” Jian Wushuang muttered quietly, his Beast God Weapon","already manifesting around him.","A mighty dragon roar echoed.","Different from the Polunga Clan’s true dragon.","He was the Candle Dragon.","Swish! Swish!","Dozens of figures instantly appeared before Jian Wushuang and his group.","“The narrow path of enemies!” Leading them was a handsome young man with long purple","hair, his eyes sizing them up without restraint.","When he spotted the Dragon Ball, his expression turned to shock.","“A","“A Dragon Ball, you actually have a Dragon Ball!”","The Fifth Tribulation realm expert from the Polunga Clan sneered, “What, you want it?”","Danbao whispered a reminder, “Jiada, their divine power is very formidable!”","Through the crystal ball, he could see that Gula’s underlings possessed incredibly potent","divine power.","Much stronger than Jiada.","“No problem, leave it to me!” Wu Li stepped forward at this moment, patting the round and smooth head of Danbao, and drew out a three-foot sword directly.","Jian Wushuang’s divine power also surged to its peak. He immediately used three times the power of the Beast God, with a divine power of 550,000.","Dealing with those at the Fourth Tribulation realm, it was more than sufficient.","As for anyone at the Fifth Tribulation realm, they would have to deal with Wu Li.","“Let’s do it!” Wu Li’s expression turned serious as he bellowed.","The others didn’t waste any time with more words.","Jiada especially didn’t want to waste words with these killers who had slaughtered his people;","The charged straight at them.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, didn’t move. He had to protect Danbao.","Of course, there was also the Dragon Ball.","In the crowd, he immediately spotted Li Sheng, nodded at him, and signaled for him to come","over and act with him.","Li Sheng cooperated well.","Immediately, he shouted loudly, “General Sabo, I’ll go snatch the Dragon Ball, the rest of you","assist General Sabo!”","Sabo’s purple hair fluttered as he calmly said, “You go stop the one with the sword on his back from escaping, I’ll deal with these two small fries quickly.”"]},{"number":5856,"title":"Chapter 5856: The Strongest Swordsman of the Human Race!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5856: The Strongest Swordsman of the Human Race!","“Affirmative!” Li Sheng’s face brightened as he immediately rushed towards Jian Wushuang. Jian Wushuang deliberately feigned weakness, not allowing more people to join their battle group.","Sabo faced off against Jiada, two Fifth Tribulation realm powerhouses, each with over 700,000 divine power.","Wu Li suggested they all attack together.","Jian Wushuang decided to turn around halfway and deal with those at the Fourth Tribulation realm.","He let Jiada handle Sabo alone.","Jian Wushuang didn’t mind.","Upon approaching, he found that Sabo’s strength was just so-so.","Slightly stronger than Jiada, but not by much.","It wouldn’t be too late to help after Wu Li dealt with those at the Fourth Tribulation realm.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang chatted with Li Sheng.","Though he did not hold back, his actions were just to coordinate.","From Li Sheng, he also understood Gula’s intentions.","It coincided perfectly with the group task issued by the Ancient Wood Sect.","Both tasks involved collecting Dragon Balls.","At this rate, the human race team would sooner or later confront Gula.","With this in mind, Jian Wushuang’s heart sank.","He hadn’t thought about this before.","Fost Demon Clan.","One million divine powers.","And he hadn’t even transformed yet.","Cooperation probably had little hope.","However, Human Race powerhouses could join forces with the Polunga Clan’s powerhouses to deal with Gula.","It was a good choice.","“The Holy Land must be visited!” Jian Wushuang shared his thoughts with Li Sheng.","He made it clear to him the importance of this mission.","If they succeeded, the candidacy of the Empress’s Holy Maiden would be secured. The inner trials were crucial.","The core area was basically a matter of charging in with strength.","They must seize this opportunity now.","Li Sheng nodded in agreement, highly approving.","At the same time, he admired Jian Wushuang’s loyalty.","Despite being abandoned by the Empress, he remained so faithful.","Protecting Jinchen goes without saying; they were originally husband and wife, naturally, they had to protect each other.","Now that his wife was dead, Jian Wushuang remained so loyal.","He could practically have a temple built for him.","Jian Wushuang himself thought so too.","He claimed it was for the Wanliu Divine Wood, but there was no need to risk it so much!","That time, he had staked his life.","If they succeeded this time, it wouldn’t be excessive for the Empress to come and kowtow to him.","After the Empress became the Holy Maiden, she would have to worship him.","But thinking about following Wu Li to sneak into the Wanyan, there would be quite a mess later.","Consider it balancing things out!","The two fought effortlessly.","Wu Li was in high spirits, ready for the slaughter.","With each swing of his sword, another head rolled, staining the sky crimson.","“Let these people witness the power of the first sword of the human race!” Wu Li held his wooden sword firmly, taking a deep breath.","A green breath escaped his lips, infusing the wooden sword with an intense energy, its blade glowing with newfound power.","The remaining three Fourth Tribulation experts exchanged glances, no longer daring to approach.","They hadn’t anticipated the overwhelming strength of the human Fourth Tribulation realm before them, comparable even to Fifth Tribulation realm experts.","“Bring it on!”","Wu Li smiled, shouting, “Come at me!”","Cutting down these Fourth Tribulation realm savage beasts was like cutting through dry","grass.","Instantly, they fell.","Clang!","Sheathing his wooden sword, he imitated Jian Wushuang, carrying it on his back, adopting the stance of a master. He turned to Jian Wushuang and asked calmly, “Do you need my help?”","Li Sheng was astonished. He had not expected Wu Li, who had once been so submissive in the Yue Kingdom, to become this powerful.","This return to the Yue Kingdom might very well see the Li family’s position replaced by the","Wu family.","For a moment, he was not satisfied with his own divine power.","He thought about gaining some benefits from this group task.","While others had made breakthroughs, he needed to as well.","Fifth Tribulation realm.","It wasn’t impossible.","Moreover, he had helped Jian Wushuang so much this time; he had to get some benefits first.","He would rely on him in the future!","For example, treasures like the primordial stones.","He had been envious when Jian Wushuang casually took tens of thousands of primordial","stones.","“Wushuang, your plan is perfect, but my current strength is too weak, I’m afraid...”","Before he could finish, Jian Wushuang understood his meaning.","With a wave of his hand, he sent a palm containing a staggering 500,000 primordial stones","into Li Sheng’s body.","“Oh, Wushuang, that’s not what I meant!” Li Sheng wanted to be polite, but when he saw the amount, he trembled and said, “Wushuang, you’ve given me a huge surprise today!”","500,000 primordial stones, it was difficult for a Five Tribulations realm expert to produce so","many.","For Li Sheng, even with the luck on his side during this holy meeting, it would be challenging","to obtain treasures of equivalent value.","Indeed, he had been given a tremendous advantage.","He had already gathered some of the treasures needed for the Fifth Tribulation.","What he lacked was primordial stones.","This time, he might have a chance to break through and become a Fifth Tribulation expert.","Once successful,","he could firmly claim the title of the top family in Yue Kingdom.","No matter how many future generations died, it wouldn’t matter.","There was plenty of time in the Fifth Tribulation realm.","He had enough time to cultivate even stronger successors.","And once the plan succeeded,","Jian Wushuang would take the credit.","Then, he would be second in merit.","By then, his name would shake the Ancient Wood Continent.","Those strongmen in the secret realms might not remember his kindness.","But the strongmen of the Sixteen Nations of Qingchao would definitely remember him, ‘Li","Sheng’!","The opportunity for fame was right in front of him.","500,000 primordial stones, Jian Wushuang didn’t care much about them.","If given, then so be it.","Compared to entering Wanliu, it was insignificant.","It wasn’t even worth a hair.","He glanced at Wu Li and said, “Don’t worry about me, go help Senior Jiada!”","Although he said this on the surface, he secretly transmitted to Wu Li not to go too far.","Later, Sabo would have to take Li Sheng away.","If Sabo was killed, Li Sheng would be in trouble.","If even a Fifth Tribulation expert fell, returning as a Fourth Tribulation expert wouldn’t be","good.","One mustn’t lose sight of the bigger picture.","Making Gula suspect Li Sheng.","Unfortunately, this time he overthought it.","Wu Li had just gone to help Jiada.","Sabo exploded.","His body directly expanded, his appearance changed from handsome to ugly, but his divine","power increased by 70,000 to 80,000.","Now Sabo had 800,000 divine power.","Just like the Whale Shark King back then.","Another Fifth Tribulation expert at the limit.","This time, Wu Li didn’t need to pretend to be Jiada.","Both of them couldn’t stop Sabo even if they exerted all their strength.","Jian Wushuang also understood that it was time to escape.","But he could only take two people at most.","And Jiada seemed to have no intention of leaving.","“Benefactor, take Danbao and go quickly, we’ll hold them off!” Jiada’s arms were broken,","blood continuously flowing from his mouth, extremely embarrassed, yet he still worried about Danbao’s safety.","Wu Li cursed inwardly and quickly transmitted to Jian Wushuang, “Don’t listen to him, take","me away quickly, I really can’t hold him back.”","“Don’t worry!” Jian Wushuang leisurely transmitted.","Sabot, who had the upper hand, said, “None of you can escape. Li Sheng, my friend, delay them for me, and I can deal with these two in three breaths!”"]},{"number":5857,"title":"Chapter 5857: Heading to the Holy Land","paragraphs":["Chapter 5857: Heading to the Holy Land","“No, no problem!” Li Sheng grinned wildly and began to erupt as well.","However, privately, he told Jian Wushuang to attack him without restraint.","It would be best to inflict a severe injury on him.","Otherwise, his foundation stone would not feel secure.","He had to be ruthless!","Jian Wushuang secretly admired this transformation. Li Sheng, who used to be so timid, had now become a true powerhouse.","And he was ruthless enough, not only towards others but also towards himself.","His future was boundless.","“Don’t speak too soon. First, try to withstand my super invincible whirlwind extreme annihilating strike!” Jian Wushuang drew out the Wanjie Sword directly.","Clang!","Cold light flickered.","Power shook the heavens!","Li Sheng hesitated for a moment, feeling somewhat uncertain.","But he still gritted his teeth and rushed forward, almost sticking his neck out to let Jian Wushuang strike.","Buzz!","A sword move was used, but he did not use the Starry Sky Chronicles.","Although Li Sheng had become stronger, his strength was still limited.","With a peak of 600,000 divine power, even if he swung his sword move, it wouldn’t necessarily kill Li Sheng.","He had to calculate carefully, aiming to wound him just right.","With this strike, he aimed to cripple Li Sheng without severing his hand.","Crash!","A huge sword shadow descended with tremendous force.","But it was all on the surface.","Even Sabo was stunned, not expecting a Fourth Tribulation realm to be so powerful.","Li Sheng’s strength had already amazed him.","That’s why he respected Li Sheng and treated him as a brother.","But Jian Wushuang’s strength was beyond his expectations.","With just one strike, Li Sheng lost half of his vitality.","He fell directly from the sky.","Wu Li saw Sabo hesitate for a moment, taking the opportunity to rush towards Li Sheng and shouted loudly, “I’ll hold him off for you, quickly go!”","Though he said so, he had already moved towards Jian Wushuang.","Sabo also became anxious, punching through Gada’s chest, completely disabling him.","With a flicker, he intended to chase after Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s divine power enveloped the treasures and Wu Li who was rushing towards him, and with a sudden flap of his wings, he ascended nine layers of heaven.","“One Thought Universe!”","Hum!","A complete universe descended.","“Three Quake Universe!”","The wings behind fully spread out, the first quake surged out a universe’s distance.","Three quakes done!","The trio could no longer sense Sabo’s presence.","“This?”","Sabo, standing still, gazed at the disappearing universe in the sky, his expression filled with astonishment.","People fled, and the Dragon Balls vanished.","All that remained was a powerless Jiada and the heavily injured Li Sheng.","“Sabo, brother, it’s my fault this time. I couldn’t hold up!” Li Sheng dragged his heavily wounded body as he walked over.","This time, even Gula couldn’t find fault with his performance.","Though Sabo felt infuriated, he was the strongest presence here. He couldn’t even catch up to Jian Wushuang’s speed just now. If Li Sheng intercepted him, it would be strange if he could","stop him.","“Never mind, I was careless this time. Let’s go back and report to the king!” Sabo enveloped","Li Sheng in divine power and swiftly headed towards the Polunga Clan’s tribe where Gula was","heading.","It was also the tribe that Zack was supporting.","However, the battle there wasn’t intense because Gula had intervened.","The strongest Zack was heavily injured with just one move.","The two Fifth Tribulation realm experts in the tribe were also dealt with by Gula’s two Fifth Tribulation Realm subordinates.","“King, the Dragon Balls have been found!”","With a thought, Gula summoned the Dragon Balls and casually threw them above the throne before sitting on it himself.","“Kill the rest, and wait for Sabo to return!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he sensed two auras approaching.","Shoo!","Sabo dragged Li Sheng in front of Gula and recounted what had just happened.","“Oh, the Polunga person holding the Dragon Balls must be from the previous tribe. Where should they go next?” Gula stroked his chin, squinting.","Seeing Zack lying on the ground, he said, “Polunga person, didn’t you say someone in the Holy Land could defeat me? Why don’t you stay with me and go to the Holy Land?”","“No way!” Zack was already in despair.","A million divine powers was too powerful.","He was no match at all.","Now, all he could do was wait for the Holy Land to gather all its strongmen to deal with Gula.","Gula pointed his finger, piercing Zack’s chest directly. What seemed like a casual blow actually destroyed Zack’s Origin Source and divine body completely.","“Let’s return to the camp first!” Gula pondered for a moment and decided to go back.","Now, there were fewer and fewer people around him, and the efficiency was too low.","But he had already sent a message to the Extreme North Icefield, and his subordinates there","were bringing more strongmen.","When the time came, they could strike those tribes together.","Then mobilize everyone to find the Holy Land.","After receiving the order, Sabo hesitated for a moment before asking, “Your Majesty, are you","waiting for Kinew and the others?”","“Correct!” Gula, seated on the throne, turned around, floating in the sky. The group, carrying","the Dragon Balls, left the destroyed tribe.","Sabo paused for a moment, then followed suit.","Thinking about the strength of Kinew and his group, he couldn’t help but sigh deeply.","Even the weakest among them could easily defeat him.","And Kinew himself possessed power comparable to the King’s.","If these people were to arrive at the Dragon God Continent,","this place would be desolate.","The camp mentioned by Gula was actually an ancient relic.","This place had a natural barrier.","Of course, it was of no use to him.","Li Sheng had been transported here initially and encountered Gula.","Returning to the resting place, he informed Gula about the loosening of his realm.","Unexpectedly, Gula was pleased and gave him many treasures to enhance his divine power.","This surprised Li Sheng.","At present, Gula was in need of people, and having one more Fifth Tribulation Realm expert would add to his strength.","After Li Sheng settled down, he informed Jian Wushuang of the specific situation here.","The Dragon God Continent, in the depths of the north marshes.","Jian Wushuang, accompanied by Wu Li and Danbao, leisurely traveled.","The three of them had been walking for an hour but had not yet reached the Holy Land","mentioned by Danbao.","Mainly because Danbao had never been to the Holy Land.","They could only rely on the map passed to him by Zack to find it.","While Jian Wushuang was guiding Danbao, he also pondered the situation on Gula’s side.","At the same time, he informed the Empress of his location.","This day passed too slowly. Moreover, despite fleeing so far, the distance between the Empress and him remained","unchanged.","“Little brother, with the way you’re leading, I thought you were going to sell us!” Wu Li joked","while tapping Danbao’s round head.","Although Danbao tried to remove Wu Li’s hand several times, Wu Li persistently placed it","back.","As if avenging the kick earlier.","Jian Wushuang was also a bit confused by the banter.","Just then, a breath suddenly came from the distance.","“It’s Elder Blu’s aura!” Danbao also sensed it.","Not only were they looking for the Holy Land, but the strong ones from the Holy Land were","also looking for them.","Jian Wushuang also sensed the other party’s aura.","Both sides teleported simultaneously.","And met by chance.","“Elder Blu!” Danbao jumped off the flying carpet and ran straight over."]},{"number":5858,"title":"Chapter 5858: Win-Win Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 5858: Win-Win Plan","Jian Wushuang also looked up to see the young and finely dressed member of the Polunga Clan.","Initially, upon hearing “Elder,” he had assumed it would be an old man.","Never did he expect someone so young, with such a powerful aura.","He must have been a strong cultivator at the Sixth Tribulation realm.","“Danbao!” Elder Blu’s voice was gentle as he placed his hand on Danbao’s head.","In an instant, he sensed everything Danbao had experienced that day.","Danbao’s eyes welled with tears as he looked up at Blu.","At this moment, he finally relaxed completely.","The tribe was wiped out in a single day.","He watched helplessly as the people who had saved him perished.","For a child like him, the blow was too much.","Blu gently patted Danbao’s head and said, “You’ve suffered!”","For a child who knew little of the world, the impact was indeed significant.","After comforting Danbao, Blu looked towards Jian Wushuang and Wu Li.","“Thank you both for protecting Danbao. Please follow me to the Holy Land. The Grand Elder is waiting for you!” Blu waved his hand, and a powerful divine force enveloped Jian Wushuang and Wu Li, transporting them directly to another space.","Jian Wushuang hadn’t even had time to react.","When they reappeared, they were at the foot of a massive mountain.","“Please come inside!” Blu gestured with his hand.","Jian Wushuang nodded and, with Wu Li, followed him up the mountain.","Once they ascended, they realized the gravity here was 10,000 times stronger.","Mere mortals couldn’t survive here.","At least one had to be an Immortal.","The 10,000-fold gravity here was incomparable to the gravity in those mundane worlds from years ago.","The gravity here was measured by the standards of spacetime.","Spacetime’s standard gravity was much stronger than that of material worlds.","Ten thousand times gravity was an ideal training ground for cultivation.","The closer to the peak, the stronger the gravity.","Danbao was already struggling beside them.","Blu explained, “The gravity on Dragon God Mountain is calculated in steps. Each step increases the standard gravity of spacetime by one fold.”","“One step, one fold!” Jian Wushuang looked up at the road leading to the mountaintop.","At least 100,000 steps led upwards.","That meant a gravity increase of 100,000-fold.","Even the Emperor couldn’t climb it.","It perfectly matched their divine power.","100,000-fold gravity equaled 100,000-fold divine body.","For the younger generation, it was a place of tempering.","But for him and Wu Li, it was just like walking normally.","There wasn’t much of a difference.","Danbao’s divine power was only 50,000; he couldn’t bear it halfway.","It was Elder Blu who enveloped Danbao with his own divine power, carrying him to the mountaintop in a single step.","Upon reaching the summit, Jian Wushuang noticed only one thing-a elliptical stone house, standing alone without any other structures.","It had to be said, the Holy Land of the Polunga Clan was extremely rudimentary.","Not much different from ordinary tribes.","One would expect the Holy Land to be vastly different from a tribe, but it turned out to be","worse.","“Benefactor, the Grand Chief requests your presence!” As Jian Wushuang and the others reached the mountaintop, a young Polunga person emerged from the house, bowing respectfully to him.","Jian Wushuang also nodded slightly in return, then led Wu Li inside.","Blu and Danbao followed suit.","Inside the room, the furnishings were even simpler.","There was only one massive throne.","Sitting above the throne was, of course, the Grand Elder of the Polunga Clan.","The Grand Elder’s size was also immense.","It was rumored that this Grand Elder was the sole descendant left behind by the Dragon God","before its death.","And the entire Polunga Clan was created by this Grand Elder.","He was an extraordinary figure.","However, this creator of the Polunga Clan was not skilled in combat.","His strength was only at the ordinary Tribulation level.","He might not have even passed the third Tribulation.","But his lifespan exceeded that of the seven-Tribulation level of the Human Clan.","Seeing such a living relic, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but bow respectfully, speaking with utmost deference, “Grand Elder of the Polunga Clan, Jian Wushuang of the Human Clan pays","his respects!”","“Human, thank you for saving Dan Bao and preserving our clan’s sacred object!” The Grand Elder’s voice was hoarse, and speaking seemed to drain him of energy.","He appeared very weak.","Seeing that it was difficult for the other party to speak, Jian Wushuang skipped the","pleasantries and directly stated the purpose of their visit.","Certainly. He began by exaggerating Gula’s strength, then delved into the secret of the human","race coming to this place.","This was entirely permissible; the Ancient Wood Sect had no rule against their members interacting with the powerful beings of the Infinite Great World.","He had expected the revelation of the secret of the Infinite Great World to elicit surprise from","the others.","However, apart from Danbao among the Polunga people present, everyone remained","remarkably nonchalant.","It seemed they had known for a long time.","And they seemed to know more about the human race than he did.","From the heavens to the earth, from the green grass to the sixteen nations – they were truly","knowledgeable!","But when it came to Gula, their knowledge was lacking.","At least, after he described Gula’s terror, no one refuted him.","The elder on the throne reminisced, “The ice demons you spoke of should come from the","extreme north ice field, originally sealed by the Dragon God. No wonder they came to seize","the Dragon Balls!”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang was also taken aback, not expecting this elder to be aware.","He also understood Gula’s origins.","No wonder he hadn’t found any information about Gula in the memories of those ancient","beasts.","It seemed the other party had just arrived in the Dragon God Continent as well.","Similar to him, they were outsiders.","But with Gula’s immense strength, why did the Ancient Wood Sect keep him here?","Why not expel him?","Gula’s usual state was a million divine power.","After transforming, he possessed the standard combat power of the Seventh Tribulation","realm.","Staying in the Infinite Great World was indeed a waste.","Unless the Ancient Wood Sect had other plans.","He wouldn’t know about that.","Just from this Holy Assembly of the Ancient Wood Continent, the overall strength of the","entire continent was actually quite average.","If it were because of Babidi, he could even take advantage of this opportunity to capture the Ancient Wood Sect’s lair.","Just a barely surviving Eighth Tribulation and several Seventh Tribulation Universe Masters.","The Seventh Tribulation realm Universe Master of the Ancient Wood Sect was not present, Iron-hearted Marquis remained neutral, and the newly promoted Queen Yun Zhi wouldn’t involve herself in the matters of the Ancient Wood Sect.","If he were Babidi Emperor, he would definitely bring people to the Ancient Wood Sect to","forcefully penetrate the Wanliu Willow Divine Tree.","Within the Wanliu lay abundant Life force.","It could be said to be infinite.","If Babidi obtained the Wanliu, he might be able to perfect the Scattered Tribulation method.","By then, unifying the nine major spacetimes would not be impossible.","The number of Scattered Tribulation experts was ten times more than that of the Universe","Masters.","Take the Ancient Wood Sect for example.","There were 80 Scattered Tribulation experts in the Seventh Tribulation realm, if not 100.","But there was only one Universe Master.","The situation was even more exaggerated for the Sixth Tribulation realm.","There were thousands of Scattered Tribulation experts, but only a few Universe Masters in the","Sixth Tribulation realm.","That was the foundation of an old-school power.","Let the Universe Masters fight, and then support a bunch of trash.","Emerging powers were better off; they had quite a few Universe Masters.","In this calculation, the human race was actually not as strong as those foreign experts on the","Savage Land Continent."]},{"number":5859,"title":"Chapter 5859: Hate Iron For Not Being Steel","paragraphs":["Chapter 5859: Hate Iron For Not Being Steel","Just like the strongest of the Polunga Clan, Elder Blu, whose strength surpassed even that of the Universe Master at the level of Sixth Tribulations.","After much deliberation, Jian Wushuang laid out the detailed plan.","Cooperation!","A win-win situation.","Of course, he couldn’t guarantee the return of the sacred object of the Polunga Clan.","But he was confident in protecting the people of the Polunga Clan.","Once the Empress arrived and he informed her of this matter, along with all the strong individuals of the human race, half of the success would be achieved.","Otherwise, Gula alone could defeat them all.","Of course, when he revealed this plan, he didn’t have much confidence.","Elder Blu standing by felt somewhat amused.","A youngster with a constant divine power of 400,000, yet he spoke of protecting their plan.","The Grand Elder on the throne, however, trusted Jian Wushuang greatly.","“Blu, instruct all the elders of the tribes to bring back the Dragon Balls to the Holy Land!” The Grand Elder ordered and took down a Dragon Ball from above the throne.","Currently, there were two Dragon Balls in the Holy Land.","One brought by Jian Wushuang and the other guarded by the Grand Elder.","In addition to the three Gula acquired.","Currently, there were four still outside.","They must be gathered in the Holy Land.","It was too dangerous outside.","This was a part of Jian Wushuang’s plan.","First, gather all the existing Dragon Balls together, then make the strong individuals of the human race wary.","Combined with the strength of the Polunga Clan itself.","The strong individuals of the human race could not refuse cooperation.","Actually, he didn’t have much confidence at first because he was just an Emperor.","Even with the help of the Empress’s influence, he couldn’t gather all the strong individuals of the human race together.","Some means must be employed.","He wouldn’t be polite to those so-called allies.","In just a short time of interaction, he would rather trust the strong individuals of the Polunga Clan than those of the human race.","“Grand Elder, rest assured, when Her Majesty arrives, she will surely rally all the human race to come together and cooperate with the noble strong individuals to defeat Gula!” Jian Wushuang was genuinely happy.","After all, planners didn’t need to participate in battle. They operated from behind the scenes.","Elder Blu, upon hearing the Grand Elder’s suggestion, didn’t hesitate for a moment and directly took out the communication crystal.","Jian Wushuang admired this.","Knowing that the other party was the strongest of the Polunga Clan, just by observing their demeanor, he was certain that they weren’t easy to deal with.","Originally, he thought the other party wouldn’t agree, and it would be a waste of breath.","But unexpectedly, they followed the Grand Elder’s words obediently.","Jian Wushuang admired this.","Strength doesn’t always equate to wisdom. A tribe needs strong individuals to thrive, but lasting prosperity requires wise leaders.","With the situation halfway successful, he relaxed a bit and gave a meaningful look to Wu Li beside him, his excitement unconcealed in his eyes.","Wu Li was naturally happy too.","Avoiding a fight was always preferable.","Right now, he just wanted the Empress to lead them to victory without a fight.","The two hadn’t been happy for long when trouble arose on Elder Blu’s side.","“Grand Elder, please have a look at this!” Blu’s expression was somewhat embarrassed as he handed the crystal ball to the Grand Elder.","Jian Wushuang and Wu Li also looked over, but as non-members of the Polunga Clan, they couldn’t see the image on the crystal ball.","The Grand Elder didn’t look at the crystal ball but instead placed his hand on it and then opened his eyes.","“The benefactors of the human race, is this the woman you refer to as your Empress?”","The Grand Elder of the Polunga Clan shook the crystal ball, and a figure appeared above it.","Wu Li nodded repeatedly upon seeing that elegant face.","“Yes, this is indeed our Empress. Her strength is no weaker than Elder Blu’s. Just wait until she-” Before Wu Li could finish his sentence, Jian Wushuang stopped him with a hand.","As Wu Li was about to ask why he was stopped, he noticed the red sphere hanging from the Empress’s waist with one hand and his face froze.","“Grand Elder, to be honest, I’m not very familiar with her either!” Jian Wushuang forced a smile and continued, “You know how it is!”","Suddenly, Blu’s divine power erupted, and he flashed behind the two, grabbing them each like little chicks and presenting them in front of the Grand Elder.","“You must not be disrespectful!”","The Grand Elder shook his head, but there was a hint of sadness in his eyes because their tribe","had just been completely destroyed.","It was the Empress as Jian Wushuang had referred to her.","This also meant the plan was shattered.","If the Polunga tribe was wiped out, cooperation would be impossible.","However, Jian Wushuang and Wu Li were innocent, and they had even saved Danbao.","“Elder Blu, I suspect they can communicate with the outside world. They cannot stay in the Holy Land!” Blu reminded, having long sensed that Jian Wushuang and Wu Li were not good","people.","He had been holding back from saying so.","Now the humans had begun slaughtering the Polunga tribe.","If it weren’t for him warning the tribe and being kept in the dark, the Dragon Balls would have been brought to the Holy Land, and whichever Empress came in would pose a threat to their","tribe.","After a long silence, the Elder’s voice rasped, “Two benefactors, here are some treasures. You can take them and leave. Consider it a token of gratitude from our Polunga tribe!”","This was a tactful way of saying: Take these treasures and scram. We’re even now, but next","time we meet, we’re enemies.","Wu Li was tempted by the treasures he saw.","But Jian Wushuang was unwilling to accept it!","Such a perfect plan, all ruined.","“Fengchen, you’ve misled me!” He was so angry he didn’t even bother with honorifics.","If only he had told the other party about the plan beforehand.","Now it had turned out like this.","Everything was over.","The treasures the Elder brought out meant nothing to him.","He didn’t even look at them.","He didn’t want them either.","He had reached the limit of Emperor.","It wasn’t the lack of treasures, but the lack of opportunity.","The opportunity to break through the Tribulation.","Right now, there was no time for cultivation, only waiting for the opportunity.","Gathering the nine Dragon Balls was one such opportunity.","He was doing it not only for Empress Fengchen but also for himself.","And now, it was all falling into place.","Everyone would perish together.","He could already foresee the future, not because of his mastery of time, but because it was an","ending anyone could see.","Gula and the Human Clan besieged the Polunga Clan.","They were fighting for the Dragon Balls.","After killing the Polunga Clan members, it would be a showdown between the two sides.","Among the Human Clan, the strongest was Empress Fengchen.","The only Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation realm. Empress Fengchen’s divine power alone amounted to one million.","She had just broken through to the peak of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","But even that wasn’t enough!","Gula’s strength soared after his transformation.","Empress Feng Chen couldn’t hold him back, let alone the rest of the weaklings.","In the end, Gula would emerge victorious.","The entire Human Clan would be defeated.","They wouldn’t be able to complete their mission, let alone think about the position of the","Holy Maiden. “The position of the Holy Maiden!” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","The previous Holy Maiden seemed to have been just a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation","realm.","Was this position of the Holy Maiden really that important?","Not necessarily!","The current group mission seemed more important than the position of the Holy Maiden in","every way.","This might be the most challenging mission in all the Sacred Gathering.","Seven stars.","Appearing for the first time."]},{"number":5860,"title":"Chapter 5860: Taking the Initiative to Stay","paragraphs":["Chapter 5860: Taking the Initiative to Stay","This was the first and perhaps the last mission involving the seven stars.","It led them to a situation they could have handled better.","But now, things had turned out like this.","“Elder Blu, forget about the reward. We’re not willing to leave. This time, I’m willing to stand","with the Polunga Clan!” Jian Wushuang directly presented the token and threw it to Blu.","He wasn’t going anywhere.","Leaving with the Empress would only end with Gula killing him sooner or later.","He might as well stay in the Holy Land to cultivate.","Doing nothing, he just wanted to see how chaotic the Dragon God Continent would become. However, Wu Li seemed hesitant.","His understanding of the Frost Demon Clan was only from Jian Wushuang’s words, so he didn’t think it was that extreme.","The tree spirit within him reminded him again at this moment, causing him to abandon the idea of leaving.","He also took out the token.","“Tsk tsk, the benefactor underestimates my Polunga people too much. Please take back the token. You can stay in the Holy Land for as long as you want. If any strong member of the Frost Demon Clan breaks through the Holy Land, I hope you can take Danbao and leave the Dragon God Continent, preferably taking him to the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands!”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly, not saying much, but his intention was clear.","As long as he could stand, he wouldn’t let Danbao lie down.","When it came to protecting people, he still had his ways.","Blu was also surprised this time. He hadn’t expected the Elder to let Jian Wushuang and Wu Li stay.","But he didn’t dare to disobey.","After thanking the Elder, Blu let Danbao lead the two of them down the peak.","On the way down the mountain, Wu Li directly asked, “Wushuang, do you have any plans?” “None!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t hide anything either. He truly had no plans anymore.","He had given up hope.","The Elder of the Polunga Clan could say such things just now, probably foreseeing something. Perhaps the Polunga Clan would perish, and the Human Clan would also meet its downfall.","At that time, they would have to flee again.","Wu Li, however, felt somewhat unwilling and unconcerned about the Danbao beside him. He spoke frankly, “Why don’t we go join that Gula? Li Sheng seems to be doing pretty well with him. If you refine some more conversion pills, we can join Gula together!”","His plan wasn’t too bad.","At least it made Jian Wushuang chuckle.","Joining Gula meant they would be useless after gathering the Dragon Balls.","They would be killed when they were no longer needed.","Even the astute Danbao chuckled.","Seeing this, Wu Li patted Danbao’s head and said, “What, are you betraying us too?”","“Don’t embarrass yourself. What Gula needs is people to find the Dragon Balls. If the Dragon Balls are all found, why would he need subordinates?” His rhetorical question directly countered Wu Li.","Danbao led the two of them to a small courtyard halfway up the mountain and said, “Benefactors, this is where you’ll stay. Whatever you need, just let me know. I’ll be living here during this time too.”","“This place is really nice!” Jian Wushuang pushed open the courtyard and was very satisfied with the arrangement.","The environment was impeccable, and the cultivation conditions were top-notch.","Near the cliff, not only was there a pavilion where the wind passed through, but also a hot spring.","Wu Li casually strolled into the pavilion, looked around, and nodded, saying, “Indeed, it’s quite suitable for retirement!”","This sentence was a reminder to Jian Wushuang.","Their goal was still Wanliu.","Although they were currently passive, they couldn’t just hide here without any plans!","Clearly, they wanted Jian Wushuang to come up with a plan.","“Danbao, you can just call me Jian Wushuang from now on, no need to call me benefactor. You don’t owe us anything!”","“Benefactor,” those two words were too grating.","Saving Danbao in the first place was Wu Li’s idea.","The reason for rescuing him was to inquire about the locations of other Dragon Balls from","him.","The thoughts were dirty enough, and now they wanted someone to call them benefactors all","the time.","Wu Li wasn’t ashamed, but he felt that he should be.","“Alright, Benefactor Jian Wushuang!” Danbao nodded.","Jian Wushuang sighed and casually said, “Do you have any alcohol in your Polunga Clan?”","“Yes, Elder Blu is good at refining it. I’ll go get some!” After saying this, Danbao ran out of","the courtyard.","Watching the disappearing figure, Wu Li silently marveled at the other’s agility. Knowing he wanted to have a private conversation with Wu Li, he directly left.","Splash!","Jian Wushuang reached behind and pulled out two jugs of fine wine, handing one to Wu Li. “You have wine, yet you sent Danbao to fetch more for you?” Wu Li took the jug, sniffing it","with surprise.","Jian Wushuang rolled his eyes, saying helplessly, “You wanted to hear my plan, didn’t you? I can’t just discuss it in front of the kid!”","“True!” Wu Li perked up instantly. Having a plan at least gave him some peace of mind.","Jian Wushuang casually stripped off his clothes and stepped into the hot spring. The moment","he entered, he felt the activation of divine power.","“Comfortable!” He leaned back against the edge, hands resting behind his head, taking another sip of the exquisite wine.","This was truly the most comfortable he had felt in a long time.","All day, it was just fighting and killing.","Never thought about taking a moment to relax.","At this point, Wu Li also removed his clothes and joined him in the spring.","“Ah!”","He closed his eyes in bliss, reclining opposite Jian Wushuang.","“So comfortable!”","For a while, they forgot all about discussing the plan.","The two of them relaxed in the hot spring, enjoying each other’s company, gradually drifting","off to sleep.","Danbao intentionally delayed a bit before entering.","But upon seeing Jian Wushuang and Wu Li sleeping peacefully in the hot spring, he decided","not to disturb them further.","After placing down the wine, he quietly left the courtyard.","During this nap, Jian Wushuang slept soundly, without a worry in the world.","He lay there for who knew how long, but by the time he opened his eyes, dusk had settled in.","Gazing at the myriad stars in the sky and seeing Wu Li still sound asleep, he didn’t see the","need to wake him.","Turning his head to glance at the direction of the house, where candlelight flickered,","presumably Dan Bao’s doing.","He rose gently, retrieving a loose robe and sat alone in the pavilion, sipping wine.","His identity token kept chiming.","Messages from the Empress and Li Sheng kept pouring in.","He felt no urgency whatsoever.","First, he glanced at the message from Li Sheng.","“Danger, danger, danger!”","“Kinew!”","Just a name.","But according to Li Sheng, Kinew was Gula’s strongest subordinate, a Special Life Form at the","Sixth Tribulation realm.","They came from the extreme north ice field.","In addition to Kinew, there were several Sixth Tribulation realm experts and hundreds of Fifth","Tribulation realm ones. That was nearly enough to make a party for the human race.","Indeed, it was very dangerous.","Even if his previous plan had succeeded, he might not have been a match.","Gula had too much of an advantage.","Now the entire Dragon God Continent was in chaos.","Countless powerful beings were engaged in battles.","The news from the Empress was simple.","It was about the Dragon Ball.","Later, news about the cooperation of the human race also came, prompting them to quickly","head to a gathering place of the human race after seeing the message.","The most important thing was to bring the Dragon Ball.","It seems they’ve already encountered Gula."]},{"number":5861,"title":"Chapter 5861: Lord of Hengmu","paragraphs":["Chapter 5861: Lord of Hengmu","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Initially, he thought that both of them would tacitly agree to first search for the Polunga Clan’s Holy Land.","Now, however, Gula felt his advantage was too significant; he didn’t even consider the Human Clan a threat.","Under his command, powerful individuals continuously slaughtered the Polunga Clan’s members, eliminating the Human Clan along with them.","Cooperating with the Polunga Clan would have been such a perfect arrangement.","But alas!","“Why didn’t you call me!” Wu Li complained as he woke up in the hot spring, causing the divine power to ripple and evaporate the water droplets on his body. He quickly put on some clothes and sat opposite Jian Wushuang, grabbing the drink on the table and taking a large gulp.","“Tell me, what’s on your mind!”","Wu Li cleared his throat and began to inquire about the plan discussed during the day.","He was actually more anxious than Jian Wushuang.","The pressure was increasing by the moment.","The treant within him felt the same.","Initially, they thought this Sacred Assembly would proceed like the previous ones.","But things started to change from the Roman River.","Encountering a Six Tribulation realm powerhouse was unexpected.","And it didn’t stop there.","Upon arriving at the Dragon God Continent, they encountered the first powerhouse of the Infinite Great World.","If they could quietly pass through the Dragon God Continent, it would have been acceptable.","However, the Ancient Wood Continent issued a collective mission, and its core conflicted directly with Gula.","Wu Li’s strength and trump cards were no longer sufficient.","Even now, at the Six Tribulation realm, they couldn’t shake the situation.","They had to rely on Jian Wushuang.","“My plan is simple: cultivate diligently and reach the Eighth Tribulation realm as soon as possible!” Jian Wushuang said as he gulped down strong liquor, sounding almost nonsensical.","The crucial part was that Wu Li actually believed him. He stared at Jian Wushuang earnestly and asked, “Are you planning to break through to the tribulation realm?”","Jian Wushuang was taken aback by the sincerity in Wu Li’s eyes, feeling a headache coming on.","“If you breakthrough now, there might be hope. But attempting to cross eight tribulations at once seems too risky. Why not aim for the Seventh Tribulation realm first? It’s safer!” Wu Li spoke as if it were all real.","He was almost convinced himself.","Jian Wushuang quickly interrupted him and explained, “Breaking through to the tribulation realm is not that easy. If it were, I would have done it already!”","However, he was certain of one thing: when he reached the Tribulation realm, crossing five Tribulations at once wouldn’t be a problem.","By then, he would have to find the others and return to the Qishen Temple together.","Reaching the Six Tribulation realm would be quite stable.","The condition was that after Fan Tianfeng returned, he could ascertain Mie Sheng’s strength.","He had digressed a bit.","Jian Wushuang shook his head to clear his mind and recounted everything about the Empress and Li Sheng to himself.","He asked Wu Li for ideas on how to deal with the situation.","“How about we run away?” Wu Li, now realizing the gravity of the situation, took the initiative to propose a method to enter Wanliu.","Jian Wushuang was pleasantly surprised by this unexpected suggestion.","Finally, he got some insight into entering Wanliu.","According to Wu Li, entering Wanliu required the life force, which was just one step.","More importantly, it required two cultivators to inject their Origin Source into Wanliu together, and both must possess Life force.","“How do you know there’s Life force in my Origin Source?” Jian Wushuang immediately grasped the key point and stood up.","This matter was too significant.","His Life force was an absolute secret in Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Even if the spacetime treasure was exposed, the matter of Life force couldn’t be disclosed.","Seeing his strong reaction, Wu Li quickly pulled him back to sit down and explained, “Don’t blame me for keeping it from you. Today, I’ll let you know something too. The elder treant within me is my teacher, you know that, but do you know his identity?”","“I don’t know!” Jian Wushuang shook his head, his ears perking up, waiting for Wu Li’s explanation.","Gulp!","At this moment, Wu Li calmed down. He took a sip of strong liquor to moisten his throat, then lowered his voice and said, “Remember when I mentioned the Lord of Hengmu?”","“Of course!” Jian Wushuang nodded.","It was because of one of Wu Li’s stories that he chose to cooperate with him.","His first entry point into Ancient Moon Spacetime was Wanliu.","Then, a series of events unfolded around Wanliu.","Entering Qingyun Gate to establish his identity, initially currying favor with Elder Muchen, then marrying in, and later going to the Shi Kingdom to refine the sword blank.","His strength was constantly skyrocketing.","Finally, he participated in the Sacred Assembly and came to the Infinite Great World.","Everything was laid out for Wanliu.","It was all because of a rumor that he dared to take such risks!","Wu Li was also deeply moved, so he chose to tell him some things.","“The treant is the Lord of Hengmu?” Jian Wushuang guessed what was happening and asked directly.","Wu Li nodded heavily and continued, “Moreover, my teacher almost reached the Eighth Tribulation realm back then!”","This was even more incredible than the rumors had suggested.","Moreover, the fact that the Lord of Hengmu was still alive was outrageous.","The rumors had claimed otherwise.","Through Wu Li’s explanations, he gradually understood.","Initially, the Lord of Hengmu, amidst the Wanliu Willows, obtained a treasure that could defy fate.","He had been cautious, never daring to reveal it, always suppressing his cultivation.","He feared being discovered.","But in the end, someone did find out.","The former Divine Wood King personally descended and severely injured the Lord of Hengmu, who was at the Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm.","Later, the Lord of Hengmu faked his death and encountered Wu Li, who was still an ordinary mortal at the time, and took refuge within Wu Li’s body.","And thus, the Wu family of Yue Kingdom came to be.","Compared to their two schemes, the Lord of Hengmu had already begun his layout countless eons ago.","And they were merely pawns.","“How extraordinary is this treasure?” Jian Wushuang’s voice was also hushed.","In his heart, he pondered, could it be a spacetime treasure?","It was quite possible.","Take, for example, his Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","The help it provided was almost boundless. Even at the level of Emperor, he didn’t need to cultivate. He could casually comprehend the Origin Source within those chess pieces, strengthen himself, and even devour those origins to enhance his own.","Honest introspection begged the question: if he were a bit more ordinary, just like an ordinary genius, could he reach the Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm with the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard alone?","This possibility still depended on luck to some extent.","The first True King, who once possessed the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, only reached the Half-Step Sixth Tribulation realm.","He was simply unlucky.","If it hadn’t been for Qishen and Mie Sheng preventing the destruction of the Moro Spacetime...","Perhaps!","The first True King could have ascended further.","But even so, there was still some gap compared to the Lord of Hengmu.","Half-Step Eight Tribulation realm.","Even when severely injured by Divine Wood King.","That treasure was also seized by Divine Wood King.","If it weren’t for Divine Wood King’s interference, perhaps the Lord of Hengmu could truly have become the Universe Master at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Wu Li lowered his voice once again, cautiously saying, “I don’t know much about the specific function of this treasure, but my teacher once told me that it can bestow Origin Source upon Scattered Tribulations, prolong their lives, and amplify their divine power!”"]},{"number":5862,"title":"Chapter 5862: Enemy Attack","paragraphs":["Chapter 5862: Enemy Attack","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“What!” Jian Wushuang exclaimed.","If this were true, it would be terrifying.","The Divine Wood King possessed such a treasure, yet always appeared weak to the outside world.","There must be some conspiracy, or perhaps the Divine Wood King himself couldn’t safeguard the treasure. Once exposed, he feared that the Universe Masters at the eighth tribulation level would come to seize it.","“Lower your voice, Jian Wushuang! Consider the bigger picture!” Wu Li hastily pulled him down, then continued, “This treasure only has an effect on Scattered Tribulations. My teacher controlled it for so long but couldn’t fully understand it. However, my teacher mentioned that if he had continued to possess that treasure, he might have broken through the Ninth Tribulation!”","Jian Wushuang was completely stunned this time.","The Ninth Tribulation!","The more they talked, the more unbelievable it sounded.","The Ancient Moon Spacetime, the only Ninth Tribulation level, belonged to that Celestial Maiden.","And she had fallen.","For such a long time, no one had been able to break through to the Ninth Tribulation level.","It wasn’t that he looked down on the Lord of Hengmu, he just had some doubts about Wu Li’s exaggeration.","Exaggeration to deceive him into getting involved.","The ninth tribulation level was a huge temptation for everyone.","Jian Wushuang was no exception.","The path to the Ancient Moon Spacetime was cut off.","But his path was not.","The Ancient Moon Spacetime was just a springboard for him to break through the nine major spacetimes.","With enough strength, he could just leave without a care.","He couldn’t stay in the Ancient Moon Spacetime forever.","He had also noticed its continuous weakening.","Perhaps at some point, the Celestial Maiden would play a trick and destroy the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime.","It would be better to leave early.","The premise was that he became a Universe Master and then gathered the people he brought along.","He couldn’t just leave on his own and ignore the others.","“The ninth tribulation level, forget it!” he shook his head with a bitter smile.","He had confidence in himself, and it was justified.","He wasn’t about to believe just because of something Wu Li said.","However, Wu Li’s expression turned serious as he spoke, “Jian Wushuang, do you not trust me?”","“I don’t,” he shook his head.","He had heard plenty about the Ancient Moon Spacetime from Weiss.","That guy was a god.","He didn’t easily trust the words of gods.","Why would he trust Wu Li?","Wu Li felt a bit embarrassed. He cleared his throat and continued, “If you don’t believe that, then how about this?”","With that, he took out a treasure from his mustard seed.","Though it was called a treasure, it was just a leaf.","“What’s this?” Jian Wushuang frowned, taking the leaf and examining it carefully. Then, he exclaimed in shock, “Could this be a Wanliu Leaf from the Wanliu Tree?”","Wu Li chuckled lightly and nodded.","Indeed, it was a leaf from the Wanliu Tree, plucked when the Lord of Hengmu left the tree.","He had acquired quite a few back then.","He had used some when he made his breakthrough, and now only this one remained, which he had to use to persuade Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang stared at the willow leaf, and as he observed the patterns on it, his eyes flickered.","He was immediately immersed in enlightenment.","This willow leaf carried the true essence of time.","It was the core of his breakthrough.","Mastering time!","As he looked at the leaf, his mind became as clear as a blank slate.","Recalling his understanding of time back then, it seemed utterly inadequate.","While spatial realms were mainly divided into stars, star seas, black holes, and the universe, the division of time was extremely profound.","Each had its own insights.","Everyone was different.","In this moment, he instantly grasped his own true understanding of time.","“I’ve made progress!” Jian Wushuang murmured. In this moment of trance, he had actually stepped into the Origin Source of time.","He was one step closer to breaking through the Tribulation realm.","He didn’t know the exact role of this Wanliu willow leaf, but it had allowed him to grasp the Origin Source of time.","It was definitely the most supreme treasure.","“How about it, do you believe now?” Wu Li said with a smile.","However, Jian Wushuang shook his head. This was just a beginning.","The other party didn’t even understand why the Ancient Moon Spacetime hadn’t produced the Ninth Tribulation Realm.","This willow leaf wasn’t something that could solve everything.","Wu Li became anxious and continued, “Jian Wushuang, I’ve said all I can. We came here for the Wanjie Tree, we can’t give up halfway!”","“I’m not backing out!”","Jian Wushuang also felt somewhat helpless.","If the other party was so anxious now, it might lead to a mistake.","He didn’t know that it wasn’t Wu Li who was in a hurry, but the treant.","That is, the Lord of Hengmu.","“Well then, what are we waiting for? Let’s get ready to leave,” Wu Li gestured with two fingers as if running.","Jian Wushuang hesitated for a moment. Now wasn’t the time to be at odds with the Empress.","Moreover, Wu Li’s suggestion wasn’t entirely unreasonable.","Since the other party was confident, he had been following Wu Li’s plan anyway. So why not go along with it now?","In the end, he gritted his teeth, finished the last sip of wine, and said firmly, “Let’s go!”","Both of them stood up simultaneously, preparing to inform Danbao that they were leaving.","But before they could even go inside to inform Danbao, Danbao had already come out.","“Are you two leaving?” Danbao widened his eyes, staring at them.","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “We’ve rested enough. We don’t want to trouble the nobles any longer.”","“Alright, I’ll report to the Grand Elder!” With that, Danbao turned to leave.","At this moment, Wu Li reminded him through voice transmission, “They might try to stop us. Shouldn’t we slip away quietly?”","This suggestion was directly vetoed by Jian Wushuang. This was the sacred land of the Polunga Clan; escaping would be a problem no matter what.","It was better to be honest; telling the truth was the best option.","Boom!","In the sky, a cloud dispersed, and the people below looked up.","Jian Wushuang and Wu Li were also surprised!","Danbao, who had been about to report to the Grand Elder, also froze in place.","Then, they heard the ancient bell of the Dragon God Mountain ringing, and the colors of the sky and earth changed.","The dazzling night sky full of stars instantly turned into daylight.","“This is?”","“Enemy attack!”","At that moment, not only Jian Wushuang and his companions reacted, but also the strengthened members of the Polunga Clan on Dragon God Mountain, who ascended into the air and reached the mountain’s summit.","They never imagined that the humans and Gula’s subordinates would locate this place so quickly.","And just as Jian Wushuang and his group were about to implement their plan, it was once again declared a failure.","This stroke of bad luck seemed to have hit them all in a single day.","“Let’s go to the summit to assess the situation first!” Jian Wushuang’s expression darkened, forced to change the plan on the fly.","He enveloped the elixirs with divine power, his wings fluttering behind him as he soared to the mountaintop.","Wu Li followed closely behind.","Upon reaching the summit, they discovered that several hundred members of the Polunga Clan had already gathered there.","Their expressions were grim, especially when they saw Jian Wushuang and Wu Li, distrust flickering in their eyes.","The attackers of the Holy Land were the humans and Gula’s subordinates.","For these combat-oriented members of the Polunga Clan to find the Holy Land so quickly, they immediately began to doubt Jian Wushuang and Wu Li.","It was only natural.","Jian Wushuang and Wu Li could only shrink into a corner, afraid to say a word."]},{"number":5863,"title":"Chapter 5863: Betrayed","paragraphs":["Chapter 5863: Betrayed","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This time, not only were they unlucky, but the Polunga Clan was also in a tough spot.","The strong warriors from the remaining tribes had just gathered, carrying the Dragon Balls, seeking refuge in the Holy Land to escape disaster, only to be discovered by the humans and Gula’s henchmen.","Now they were trapped directly in the Holy Land.","They couldn’t leave even if they wanted to.","Jian Wushuang and Wu Li didn’t dare to leave either.","The crucial point was that they could leave whenever they wanted!","Never mind whether the outsiders would spare them.","Even the strong warriors of the Polunga Clan wouldn’t let them go easily.","They had to stay put!","The strong warriors at the mountaintop kept gathering.","Jian Wushuang scanned with his telepathy and found that there were five of them just at the Sixth Tribulation realm.","Maybe they could really hold up.","As long as Gula didn’t personally intervene.","There shouldn’t be any problem with the first wave of attacks.","“Wushuang, how about we retreat a bit further?” Wu Li’s gaze wandered at this moment, and his figure kept moving backward.","Jian Wushuang looked up and noticed Elder Blu walking towards them.","He gently patted Wu Li’s shoulder, motioning for him to stay calm and not move, then took the initiative to walk over and said, “Elder Blu, feel free to command us if you need any help!”","“Great Elder, please come in for a discussion!” Elder Blu said calmly.","Danbao also walked out of the Grand Elder’s house at this time and nodded at him.","He turned to Wu Li with a gesture, then replied, “Good, we also have something to discuss with the Great Elder!”","Pulling Wu Li along, they entered the Great Elder’s house.","Upon entering, they found five other senior Polunga warriors present.","All at the peak of the Fifth Tribulation realm.","It seemed they came from external tribes.","Apart from them, there was one familiar face.","Zack!","Didn’t expect him to be alive.","From this perspective, the strength of the Polunga Clan was much stronger than that of the humans.","On the human side, there were quite a few strong warriors comparable to the Sixth Tribulation realm.","But only Empress had truly reached the Sixth Tribulation realm.","And there were only about a hundred people.","The Polunga Clan had five Sixth Tribulation realm warriors.","And dozens of Fifth Tribulation realm warriors.","With just the human side alone, they couldn’t break in.","Let’s see how powerful Gula’s subordinates are, as Li Sheng said.","There might actually be hope.","Upon seeing Jian Wushuang and Wu Li enter, the Grand Elder, worn out both physically and mentally, spoke, “Two benefactors, there’s something I hope you can tell me about the Polunga Clan!”","“Elder, please speak!” Jian Wushuang cut to the chase without beating around the bush.","This time, instead of speaking, the Grand Elder looked to one of the tribe elders who was also quite old.","That elder happened to be Elder Jones, the one Zack went to rescue. He paused before speaking up, “Please, two benefactors, share the information about the external experts with us. This would greatly assist us. If this time we can withstand the experts of the human race and Gula’s subordinates, the Grand Elder will personally see you off Dragon God Continent.”","“This?” Wu Li hesitated for a moment, his expression serious. “This seems a bit off. We saved people from your Polunga Clan, and we can promise not to harm your Polunga people, but betraying the human race... that’s a different matter.”","Jian Wushuang also hesitated.","Betrayal was one thing.","What he feared was closing off his own path.","Those people outside, from the human race, weren’t all good people.","Even if he betrayed them, even if he helped the Polunga Clan protect their homeland, he wouldn’t feel much psychological burden.","The only worry was if he ended up on the same boat as the Polunga Clan, and then the Polunga Clan was finished.","What would they do then?","This was a very real concern.","The Polunga Clan simply couldn’t withstand Gula.","He thought that the battle between the external experts of the human race and Gula’s subordinates would delay things.","But now that all the Dragon Balls from outside had arrived at the Polunga Holy Land, there wasn’t much left to fight for.","The silent cooperation between the two sides had already made things clear.","First, wipe out the Polunga Clan, and then determine the outcome.","“These fools!” Jian Wushuang cursed inwardly.","The experts of the human race probably hadn’t realized the strength of Gula’s experts yet.","They knew even less about the Frost Demon Clan.","They probably thought that with the Empress’s million divine powers, they could contend with Gula.","It was simply laughable.","Wu Li couldn’t make up his mind and looked at Jian Wushuang again.","“To be honest, my knowledge of the experts from the outside world is also limited. I only have some superficial understanding of the strength of some powerful individuals in certain kingdoms. The Grand Elder should be aware of this. I originally came from the Sixteen Kingdoms of the Qingchao!” Jian Wushuang decided to be straightforward.","He didn’t know much.","Just selling out the experts from the Sixteen Kingdoms would probably be enough.","The Qingchao Sixteen Kingdoms were established by a Universe Master of the eighth Tribulation realm.","Later, it was divided into sixteen kingdoms.","The Yongheng Kingdom had ceased to exist.","The forces of the SJhi Kingdom had been completely annihilated.","Only fourteen kingdoms remained.","Their strengths varied greatly.","After discarding Yue Kingdom and the daughter kingdom indebted to it, only twelve kingdoms were left.","Among these twelve kingdoms, the several strongest Universe Masters at the Fifth Tribulation realm were all accounted for.","Of course, such data on their combat prowess was merely surface-level.","Who knew how formidable their hidden cards might be?","“Is this all?” Elder Jones shook his head, sighing, “Well, it’s better than nothing.”","Having something was better than nothing!","However, Elder Blu, who followed along, didn’t share this sentiment.","As a Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation realm, he didn’t even bat an eye.","Jian Wushuang then shifted the conversation, mentioning Gula’s subordinates.","“Elders, the threat of the Sixteen Kingdoms may not be that formidable, but Gula’s subordinates include several Sixth Tribulation realm powerhouses, likely among the top in the Infinite Great World!” Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow, revealing the situation with Kinew.","This Sixth Tribulation Realm special lifeform had brought many strong individuals from the Far North Icefield to the Dragon God Continent.","This information had been relayed to him by Li Sheng.","Now, he passed it on to the Polunga Clan.","He felt somewhat sorry for Li Sheng.","Originally, there had been a plan for him, but now he had nothing.","Li Sheng also awkwardly became one of Gula’s subordinates, utterly useless without Jian Wushuang’s support.","The outcome was even more bleak.","What Jian Wushuang didn’t know was that Li Sheng was on the verge of reaching the Fifth Tribulation realm peak.","His future looked bright.","Even Gula admired him greatly.","Moreover, Kinew had promised to take Li Sheng to the Far North Icefield to become a Demon Saint.","Li Sheng was now torn about whether to join him.","The darkness wasn’t within Li Sheng but within Jian Wushuang and Wu Li.","These two were currently caught in the middle and feeling extremely uncomfortable.","“Kinew?” Elder Jones recalled something, his eyes trembling slightly. He then reported to the Grand Elder, “When Zack and I escaped, we once felt a terrifying aura comparable to Gula’s. It should be him, with a divine power of at least 900,000.”","Upon hearing this, Blu clenched his fists but remained silent.","900,000 divine power.","A peak Sixth Tribulation realm powerhouse.","Comparable to Tamu King.","With this level of strength, one could dominate any corner of the Infinite Great World."]},{"number":5864,"title":"Chapter 5864: Transformation of All Things","paragraphs":["Chapter 5864: Transformation of All Things","“Bru, you prepare your people for battle. Our two benefactors can leave whenever they wish, no hindrance. If help is needed, do not hesitate to ask!” The elder chief said, then closed his eyes.","Everyone bowed respectfully and exited the room.","Jian Wushuang and Wu Li followed behind.","They also walked out of the house together.","Just as they all turned away, the elder chief opened a slit of his eyes, staring at the backs of Jian Wushuang and Wu Li, murmuring to himself, “Is my lifespan truly bound to the fate of the Polunga Clan?”","The elder chief recalled a lesson left to him by the Dragon God in the past.","The fate of the Polunga Clan didn’t lie in the strength of future generations; it entirely rested upon him alone.","He couldn’t hold on much longer, originally estimating another 10,000 years of life.","But this crisis had caused a drastic reduction.","Less than a hundred years remained.","But now, the crisis facing the Polunga Clan couldn’t even last a year.","Time was running out.","Yet, there was still a glimmer of hope, but he dared not gamble.","If the lesson was true, and he perished, the Polunga Clan would be finished.","He had no choice but to gamble again.","Now, he could only assess the situation.","Outside the Dragon God Mountain.","The barrier had begun to loosen.","Blu, who maintained the great array of the Dragon God Mountain, wore a grim expression. Now, he had to make a choice.","To shrink the range of the barrier.","To shrink it to the peak of the Dragon God Mountain.","Then descend the mountain for battle.","Otherwise, even if it shrank further, it would be breached.","By then, he would still need to protect others, which wouldn’t be conducive to combat.","He could only take the initiative.","“Everyone, gather at the peak. I will control the barrier within the range of the peak, and then others will join me in facing the enemy!” Blu calmly instructed the other strong warriors to prepare for battle.","Then he himself controlled the formation and began to shrink the barrier.","Outside the mountain.","Human strongmen, led by Empress Fengchen, stood on the left.","Gula led his subordinates on the right.","“Tsk tsk, looks like we’re going to take the initiative. How interesting!” Gula stroked his chin, waiting for the spectacle to unfold.","Behind Gula stood Kinew, with a burly figure and two spiral horns on his head, though he himself was not of the Frost Demon Clan.","With arms crossed, he stood imposingly, disdain evident in his voice. “Your Majesty, why not let me go and slaughter those human strongmen first? Watching them is becoming tiresome!”","Li Sheng, standing further back, felt a chill run down his spine upon hearing this statement, simultaneously filled with worry.","He worried that the humans were finished.","If so, he truly couldn’t go back.","“No, there’s no need for that. Let’s conquer this place first, then we’ll see. We need to take it step by step!” Gula said, raising his hand and pointing, causing an extreme point to begin spreading out.","In an instant, it turned into a scorching sun.","The strongmen of the human side continued to attack the barrier incessantly.","Upon seeing Gula’s move, they began to retreat one after another.","Even the Empress frowned. Though she had reached the Sixth Tribulation realm and even completed the core task in one of the ruins, reaching the peak of the Sixth Tribulation realm, her divine power could barely reach a million under normal circumstances.","But currently, she only had 900,000.","It was nothing like Gula, who could easily gather a million divine power with a wave of his hand.","This made her extremely wary of Gula.","Besides Gula, there was also that Kinew, equally powerful.","In contrast, her side was too singular.","All of them were at the Fifth Tribulation realm, lacking top-tier combat power.","The black sun of divine power condensed by Gula grew stronger and stronger, reaching the threshold of a million divine power.","The barrier of Dragon God Mountain could withstand it.","But not for long.","At the mountaintop, Elder Blu also noticed it, hastening the contraction of the barrier to gather stronger defense.","“Destroy it!” Gula stood up, lightly lifting his finger, and threw the scorching black sun towards Dragon God Mountain.","With a crash!","Space was consumed by the burning, revealing the void.","The black sun continued to approach the barrier.","Dragon God Mountain trembled.","The entire Dragon God Mountain was a treasure, but it couldn’t withstand such a powerful","attack.","Buzz!","The black sun collided with the barrier, emitting strange sounds continuously.","Outsiders watched with curiosity, speculating whether this attack could break the barrier.","People from the Dragon God Mountain continued to gather divine power and inject it into the","barrier.","They assisted Blu in shrinking the barrier to the mountaintop.","Only then could they firmly withstand this strike.","“These Polunga Clan guys claim to be the number one group, right? But this barrier is too weak,” Wu Li complained while earnestly channeling his own divine power into the barrier.","Jian Wushuang also wanted to do the same, but his current amount of divine power wasn’t","quite enough.","Even with the power of the Beast God multiplied by five, he only had 600,000 divine power. On the field, even a casual Fifth Tribulation realm expert had 700,000 divine power. However, there were also many elite Fourth Tribulation realm experts among the Polunga","Clan.","Those who could stay in the Holy Land were all very powerful.","Even Fourth Tribulation realm experts had 600,000 divine power.","Jian Wushuang’s strength wasn’t considered particularly strong among these people.","Boom!","The sound of explosion resounded, and the terrifying power reached its peak.","Blu’s eyes flickered, and a golden light burst from his body, causing his cloak to flutter wildly.","With a roar, he single-handedly shrunk the barrier to the mountaintop.","“Hoo hoo!” Blu gasped for breath, evidently shrinking the barrier wasn’t easy.","Jian Wushuang frowned. He felt the other party was being overly cautious; even if the barrier","withstood the previous attack, it wouldn’t have broken.","Why waste their divine power?","What would they do when they went out to fight later?","Just now, he could feel Blu’s divine power reaching 900,000.","It was the Dragon God Mountain, and Blu was the number one combat force of the Polunga","Clan.","It must be maintained at its peak!","He wanted to rush up and help Blu restore his divine power.","Unfortunately, he couldn’t.","He could only smile bitterly.","Dan Bao stood at the back. Seeing Blu’s aura weaken significantly, he cautiously approached","and placed his hands on Blu’s body. A green light burst forth, and Blu’s divine power instantly","reached its peak.","The other Polunga Clan members didn’t find this unusual.","But both Jian Wushuang and Wu Li were astonished.","“Life?” Wu Li exclaimed in shock.","Jian Wushuang observed carefully and corrected, “It’s the divine power of All Things","transformed!”","“All Things transformed?” Cold light flashed in Wu Li’s eyes, and the treant within him began","to stir.","After Blu restored to his peak, he patted Danbao’s head, lowered his head to look at him, and said gently, “Thank you!”","When he raised his head again, a cold light flashed in his eyes.","“Everyone, we can guard the Dragon God Mountain and suppress all directions. Follow me","into battle!”","Blu waved his hand, and a formation appeared on the ground. Then he said, “Let’s go!”","Swish!","Dozens of people on the mountaintop left together.","When they appeared again, they were already at the foot of the mountain.","The fighting spirit made Jian Wushuang tremble.","At this moment, he wanted to join the Polunga Clan and descend the mountain to battle.","Seeing everyone leaving, Wu Li’s courage grew, and he dragged his fingers across the ground, asking, “Little Danbao, can you open this barrier?”"]},{"number":5865,"title":"Chapter 5865: Kill","paragraphs":["Chapter 5865: Kill","“Can’t do it. Only the Grand Elder and Elder Blu can open it!” Danbao shook his head. Jian Wushuang, however, walked toward the edge of the cliff, gazing outwards.","It was chaos.","With the barrier contracted, the outside world was no longer visible.","They could only perceive it through telepathy.","Unfortunately, they couldn’t witness this ultimate showdown.","As he lamented, Danbao took out the crystal ball common among the Polunga Clan and squatted down, staring at it.","This made both Wuli and him envious.","Noticing their gaze, Danbao spoke, “Benefactors, want to watch together?”","“We can see too?” Jian Wushuang asked in surprise.","They couldn’t see the images in the crystal ball; it seemed only the strong of the Polunga Clan could see the outside world through it.","But Danbao nodded firmly and affirmed, “Of course, you just need to infuse your telepathy into this crystal ball to see the battle outside.”","“That’s fantastic!” Wuli immediately stepped forward and infused his telepathy.","Jian Wushuang followed suit.","After infusing their telepathy, they indeed saw the outside scene.","It was incredibly miraculous, similar to the heavenly canopy.","Their gaze followed the crystal ball down to the mountain below.","Blu led the way, followed by over 30 Fifth Tribulation experts and hundreds of Fourth Tribulation experts.","Their opponents, however, had over 100 Fifth Tribulation experts and 7 Sixth Tribulation experts.","This isn’t even counting Gula.","Counting Gula, they might not withstand a single round.","Gula had no intention of joining the battle. He raised his head and chuckled, “This is truly interesting. Kinew, get your people ready for battle!”","After a moment’s thought, he added, “The rest of you, don’t interfere. It would be too boring otherwise.”","After saying this, he glanced at the strong individuals among the human race.","He wasn’t worried; the human race would send out more strong individuals.","Sure enough, when the Empress saw that Gula wasn’t joining the fight and instead had Kinew and the other 5 Sixth Tribulation Realm individuals step forward, she thought they were conserving their strength and naturally didn’t mobilize more forces.","“Yao Yue, you lead the charge this time!” the Empress turned to the Wolf King Yao Yue of the Celestial Wolf Clan and said.","The strong individuals of the Celestial Wolf Clan were momentarily stunned, but they had no other choice.","From the Sixteen Kingdoms of the Green Grass, four strong individuals emerged, forming a group of six at the Fifth Tribulation Realm and seventy-two at the Fourth Tribulation Realm. In the Hidden Realm, there were 36 at the Fifth Tribulation realm and 400 at the Fourth Tribulation realm.","This accounted for about a third of the human race’s strength.","It was similar to Gula’s side.","After all, apart from Kinew and his group of Sixth Tribulation realm individuals, there were only a dozen or so at the Fifth Tribulation Realm among Gula’s forces.","Their strength was like air.","This confrontation was just a test.","If possible, the Empress hoped that these individuals, along with Kinew and the Polunga Clan’s strong individuals, would perish together.","Then she and the remaining forces would have a chance to defeat Gula.","To become the ultimate victor.","But this idea was too idealistic.","Jian Wushuang, who was watching from the sidelines, breathed a sigh of relief when he saw that Gula didn’t directly intervene.","At the same time, he prayed in his heart that Elder Blu would replace the participating strong individuals. This might lead to internal discord among the human race before they confronted","Gula.","Because there weren’t many strong individuals from the Polunga Clan.","If they all perished, the remaining Dragon Balls would be within grasp.","Indeed, it was the moment for the human race and Gula to determine victory or defeat.","When the time came, they would witness another peak confrontation, with the potential to sway the outcome.","Jian Wushuang had already begun gathering his Qi, prepared to strike at any side at any moment.","Of course, he hoped the Human Race would emerge victorious.","That way, he could cooperate with them to ensure the safety of the remaining members of the Polunga Clan.","However, Wu Li didn’t share the same sentiment.","Observing the balance of power, he shook his head and sighed, “I think it would be better if the Elder handed over the Dragon Ball. That way, everyone could watch the Human Race","battle Gula.”","“You’re overthinking it!” Danbao retorted, “No one wants a neutral party to exist. Even if Gula seems indifferent to this battle, they wouldn’t allow any variables to disrupt it. Besides, the strong members of our Polunga Clan might not necessarily lose. We won’t let ourselves be ambushed and slaughtered!”","After speaking, he cast a disdainful glance at Wu Li.","Jian Wushuang shared the same disdain.","Disdaining Wu Li showed no hint of the dignity of a strong individual.","If everyone thought like that, there would be no conflict, and without conflict, there would be","no strong individuals.","Wouldn’t it be better if everyone just idled away under the Emperor’s rule?","“Let’s watch the situation first.”","The three of them sat around the crystal ball, unconsciously pulling out some fruit wine.","Wu Li felt something was missing, so he took out a leg of a wild beast from his mustard seed","and quickly set up a grill, putting the leg on it.","With a flick of his finger, a magical flame ignited.","At first, Jian Wushuang felt it was somewhat inappropriate, but the scent of the meat wafted","over, stirring his desire for divine consumption. So, he held back.","Seizing the opportunity, he took out a small, delicate bone knife and began to eat while","drinking.","The flesh and blood of the wild beast contained powerful divine power.","Unfortunately, his divine power couldn’t be further enhanced at the moment.","He could only savor this delicacy.","Danbao, smelling the aroma of the meat, looked at Jian Wushuang with embarrassment.","Understanding his unspoken thoughts, Jian Wushuang took out a small knife adorned with precious gems and passed it over.","Three of them drank wine, ate meat, and watched the brutal battles outside.","Down the mountain.","Terrifying divine powers erupted one after another.","A battle was about to break out!","Blu stared at Gula, then glanced at the Empress of the human race, transmitting his voice to","the people behind him, “This is an opportunity. We need to act fast, quickly deal with these","people, there’s a chance!”","Although not of the wise Polunga Clan, Blu possessed exceptional combat talent.","The enemy employed the worst strategy.","Indeed, this was their chance.","They just needed to seize the moment before the opponents could react, erupt in an instant,","and kill or seriously injure all the opponents who joined the battle.","There was no time to delay.","Delaying would lead to being caught in a protracted battle.","The people behind nodded silently.","The plan had been made.","On the other hand, the strong individuals from the human race and the Kinew Tribe appeared","relaxed.","Kinew flexed his wrist and spoke, “Leave the strongest one to me, the rest you guys can","handle yourselves!”","“That skinny one, leave it to me!”","“I’ll deal with the fat one!”","They seemed to be dividing the prey among themselves.","The strong individuals from the human race couldn’t help but feel relieved upon hearing this.","If they could take out all the Sixth Tribulation realm experts, then the remaining Fifth","Tribulation realm ones would not pose much of a threat.","Yao Yue of the Celestial Wolf Clan was the strongest, accompanied by over 40 Fifth Tribulation realm experts, while the Polunga side had only 30-something Fifth Tribulation","realm experts.","Some of them had to be allocated to deal with the Sixth Tribulation realm experts.","Leaving less than 20.","The human race, however, had twice the number of people.","And each one of them was a Universe Master, with stable combat power.","The advantage was with the human race.","Blu also sensed Kinew’s fighting spirit and immediately shouted, leading the charge!","“Kill!”","The people behind him followed suit.","“Kill! Kill! Kill!”","The shouts shook Dragon God Mountain."]},{"number":5866,"title":"Chapter 5866 Miserable","paragraphs":["Chapter 5866 Miserable","Kinew led his group, intercepting several Sixth Tribulation realm powerhouses led by Elder Blu, opting to engage them in mid-air combat.","Meanwhile, those of the Fifth Tribulation realm were entangled below, mingling with those of the Fourth Tribulation realm.","The battle had barely begun, yet it was already chaotic.","Although the human side had many strong warriors, they lacked any cohesive strategy.","It was essentially every man for himself.","Individual skirmishes broke out.","The strong warriors of the kingdoms huddled together for warmth.","However, the experts from the secret realms were neither united nor familiar with each other, thus had to fight separately.","This gave the Polunga Clan a significant advantage.","Elder Jones and Zack shuttled back and forth, each attracting over ten Fifth Tribulation realm powerhouses.","This also eased the pressure on the other members of the Polunga Clan.","Both Elder Jones and Zack were of the Fifth Tribulation realm, with divine power of only about 750,000 each.","They were no match for dozens of Fifth Tribulation realm Universe Masters.","But they persisted.","They held on until Blu erupted.","The central battle, however, raged in the sky.","Blu faced off against Kinew.","While the four Holy Sons of the Polunga Clan held off the five Sixth Tribulation experts brought by Kinew.","The core battle circle was currently evenly matched.","The fight between Kinew and Blu had only just begun, and victory was not forthcoming so quickly.","Furthermore, Kinew had not yet unleashed his full strength, toying with Blu the entire time.","“Haha, I thought your strength was decent, but it turns out you’re so weak!”","Kinew dodged Blu’s punch, kicked him in the chest, sending him crashing into the melee of Fifth Tribulation realm fighters below.","However, that kick fell right into Blu’s trap.","As Blu fell among the human warriors, he extended his hand and, from top to bottom, executed a deep push, instantly killing several Fifth Tribulation realm powerhouses.","Observing Blu’s actions from the sky, Kinew remained unperturbed by his opponent’s tactics.","However, not wanting to waste time, he leisurely descended to actively seek out Blu.","Meanwhile, Zack and Elder Jones had attracted dozens of Fifth Tribulation realm Universe Masters behind them and had arrived by Blu’s side.","The three nodded to each other.","Blu’s hands emitted countless light waves, directly attacking the approaching Fifth Tribulation realm Universe Masters.","Boom! Boom! Boom!!!","The losses on the side of the Human Race were catastrophic in an instant.","Even the Empress furrowed her brow.","However, she wasn’t planning to send any more reinforcements.","Because she had already noticed that Gula didn’t care about this battle at all.","Moreover, Kinew and the others had been mocking the strong warriors of the Polunga Clan.","Since that was the case, she decided to let them have their fun.","It would be best if they all ended up in ruins together.","“You coward, can you only bully the weaklings of the Fifth Tribulation Realm?” Kinew dove down to the ground.","He intercepted Elder Blu’s attack.","With a lift of his hand, he easily deflected the divine power waves sent by Blu.","“If I don’t sweep away these small fries, I have no interest in fighting you!” Blu sneered coldly and swiftly increased his speed to create distance once again.","He began to slaughter the Fifth Tribulation Realm warriors on the side of the Secret Realm.","The strong warriors of the four major kingdoms had already retreated to the outermost edges, fearing being involved.","Kinew missed again, his expression turning cold as he attempted to kill a few warriors of the Polunga Clan, only to find that they were all hiding behind Elder Blu.","This greatly infuriated him; they were looking down on him.","They were actually avoiding the battle!","“Since that’s the case, then let me lend you a hand!” Kinew bared his fangs and looked towards the Fifth Tribulation Realm warriors around him. He extended two fingers, raised them suddenly, and a terrifying power instantly swept through the surroundings.","Whether they were strong warriors from the Human Race or the Polunga Clan, they all turned into powder.","Even the Dragon God Mountain cracked open halfway.","The three spectators on the mountaintop hurriedly picked up the wine jug on the ground, fearing it would spill.","“Ready to take me on now?” Kinew extended his hand, his expression cold and stern.","Elder Blu hadn’t expected his opponent to be so ruthless, launching a relentless assault without discrimination.","The Empress watched the scene unfold, merely taking a deep breath without uttering a word.","For her, it was nothing new.","She had sacrificed much to become the Holy Maiden.","This time, she couldn’t afford to lose.","No matter how many died, it couldn’t be helped.","And the powerful figures from the kingdoms behind her, or the experts from the secret realms, were also watching coldly.","Most of the Human race’s strong participants had joined the battle, leaving none behind.","With no one left below, who would speak for them now?","It would be best if they all perished.","The Human race’s strong on the field were also unlucky; without the protection of the Sixth Tribulation realm, they were slaughtered like lambs.","Having finished bullying, Blu was about to join in, too.","“Thanks!” Blu’s lips curled into a smile as he soared into the air.","Currently, most of the Sixth Tribulation realm on the ground belonged to their Polunga Clan.","If they didn’t step up, Kinew would soon target their Polunga Clan’s Sixth Tribulation realm experts.","Seeing this, Kinew also soared into the sky, ready to clash with Blu once more.","Elder Jones and Zack, on the other hand, wore grim expressions as they surrounded the Human race’s Sixth Tribulation realm experts.","Currently, the advantage was theirs.","The Human race side now only had seven or eight Sixth Tribulation realm experts left.","Without the Empress’s command, they couldn’t retreat.","If they retreated, the Empress would probably kill them.","“If only we had known, why bother attending this feast of slaughter!”","Some of the Sixth Tribulation realm experts had already despaired.","The massacre of this Holy Maiden Assembly had only just begun.","Scenes of entire teams being wiped out, which were rare in the past, were now happening one after another.","The powerful Sixth Tribulation realm experts of the Polunga Clan, with a huge advantage, chose to engage in one-on-one combat to delay some of the Human race’s Sixth Tribulation realm Universe Masters.","The rest went to surround and kill the remaining Human race’s Sixth Tribulation realm Universe Masters.","The efficiency was extremely high.","In just the time it takes for an incense stick to burn, more than forty Universe Masters from the Human race side were all slain.","The Fourth Tribulation Realm Universe Masters met the same fate.","It was tragic!","Apart from Jian Wushuang and Wu Li, who were still fighting, there were also those old folks from the Ancient Wood Sect’s Holy Land watching.","Seeing all the experts from their kingdoms or secret realms falling, these scattered Tribulation experts were furious.","They all blamed the Yuè Kingdom.","The Yuè Kingdom’s Seventh Tribulation realm Patriarch, however, kept his eyes tightly shut.","He had grown accustomed to being scolded.","Li Sheng had transformed into a savage beast and was scolded once.","Jian Wushuang had joined the Polunga Clan and was scolded once again.","Now, it was Empress Fengchen’s turn to watch her subordinates go to their deaths without batting an eye.","Every time, it was their Yuè Kingdom stirring up trouble.","Although they were scolded, deep down, they were secretly pleased.","“It would be best if I died.","If I were to die, it better be clean.","Only Fengchen remained.","Even if the mission couldn’t be completed, the position of the Holy Maiden would undoubtedly fall into Fengchen’s hands.","Surprisingly, that’s exactly what the Empress was thinking right now.","Of course, this was just the worst-case scenario.","She still wanted to defeat Gula with her own strength and complete this mission.","To become the Holy Maiden once again.","It didn’t matter how many strong individuals from the Human Clan died; it had nothing to do with her.","She wasn’t worried about being troubled by external forces.","She was already the Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm now.","And she was at the peak of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","Although she hadn’t reached the level of the half-step Seventh Tribulation realm yet, once she went out and became the Holy Maiden, she would soon reach that level.”"]},{"number":5867,"title":"Chapter 5867: Fierce Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 5867: Fierce Battle","When the scattered tribulations arrive, will they still fear them?","They were the future generation of Seventh Tribulation Universe Masters.","The Ancient Wood Sect will also be preserved.","Now, those who have died are all worthy.","With success, 10,000 bones wither!","The battle below has already ended.","The strong of the Polunga Clan, at minimal cost, have slain all the experts of the Fifth Tribulation realm and the Fourth Tribulations Realm.","Now, only watching remains.","Waiting for Blu’s eruption.","The battle in mid-air is particularly intense.","The four great holy sons of Dragon God Mountain are engaged in a back-and-forth battle with Kinew’s subordinates.","All of them possess over 800,000 divine powers.","For a moment, victory or defeat cannot be discerned.","It still depends on Blu.","Blu is the core.","Kinew is the same.","Currently, in their battle, Kinew is slightly gaining the upper hand.","Kinew, with 900,000 divine power, is facing off against Blu, who has 890,000 divine power.","Both of them are great masters of divine power.","They are not using any treasures.","Simply exchanging blows with fists and feet, as well as waves of divine power, causing the heavens and earth to lose color.","Boom!","After the two collide again, they each step back, creating distance, looking for the next opportunity to strike.","“Hoo!” After catching his breath, Kinew loudly says, “That was exhilarating! It’s been so long since I’ve encountered such a formidable opponent. I really don’t want to settle things with you so quickly!”","Blu sneers, glancing at the people below, his voice cold, “I really want to see how powerful your divine power is, whether it’s as formidable as I imagine.”","“Haha!” Kinew laughs.","With both hands clenched, he roars, and his divine power directly breaks through 900,000.","“Then let me tell you, my divine power is 930,000!”","Kinew begins to erupt, the veins on his forehead bulging, and his divine power begins to soar. The later it gets, the more difficult it becomes for divine power to increase each time.","Often, a difference of 10,000 or 20,000 can determine the outcome.","As Kinew continues to erupt, he truly reaches a divine power 930,000.","The Empress took a deep breath.","She had anticipated Kinew’s strength, but she hadn’t expected it to reach 930,000.","Even Gula was excited, loudly praising, “Kinew, your progress is remarkable!”","“Great King, watch closely. Once I have slain him, I will deal with the rest!” Kinew, after completely unleashing his power, became even more relaxed.","In midair, he made a series of strange movements.","Below, Gula’s face reddened, murmuring softly, “Here we go again!”","Seeing the opponent’s outburst, Elder Blu’s expression changed. Kinew’s divine power exceeded his expectations.","But!","930,000 did not mean he couldn’t be defeated.","“Ah!”","Elder Blu clenched his fist, shouting angrily and his divine power began to surge.","“Ha!”","The white skin behind him was shattered.","His divine power directly reached 900,000.","Kinew remained calm, commenting, “900,000, not bad at all. If you weren’t from the Polunga Clan, you could have joined my Kinew Special Forces!”","Just as he finished speaking, he noticed that Elder Blu’s divine power had reached 910,000.","“You still have reserves, but 910,000 should be your limit.” Kinew casually evaluated.","However, Elder Blu’s lips curled upwards, roaring once again, and his divine power unexpectedly surged by 20,000.","Reaching 930,000.","This already equaled Kinew’s.","Kinew felt a bit panicked.","He hadn’t expected his opponent to be this powerful.","And the crucial point was that Elder Blu’s aura was still rising.","“940,000!” Kinew’s face changed drastically.","“950,000!”","The onlookers below also exclaimed in shock.","The Empress’s face changed color.","On the mountaintop, Wu Li was even more fascinated. Seeing Elder Blu erupt with 950,000 divine power, firmly suppressing Kinew, he happily pulled Danbao to celebrate together.","As long as the strong warriors of the Polunga Clan could hold their ground, the two of them","could escape.","Seeing Elder Blu’s divine power erupt, naturally filled him with joy.","“How about it, are you satisfied with the 950,000 divine power?” Blu moved his neck slightly","and smirked, a flash brought him directly behind Kinew.","His arm gently raised, then an elbow struck Kinew’s neck.","Kinew’s mind sank, just as he came to clarity, wanting to counterattack, only to find Blu’s","figure nowhere to be seen.","“I’m right here!” Blu appeared in front of Kinew again, seemingly out of nowhere, and with a headbutt, sent Kinew flying tens of thousands of feet away.","Blu wasn’t in a hurry to deal with Kinew. After repelling him, he effortlessly joined the battle","with the Four Great Holy Sons.","Once he entered the fray, it was a slaughter.","Below, Gula grew anxious. “Quick, stop him!”","Kinew desperately rushed back.","But Blu had already dealt with a Sixth Tribulation Realm powerhouse.","950,000 against over 800,000 divine power of the Sixth Tribulation Realm was","overwhelming.","Now the Four Great Holy Sons were evenly matched against the six Tribulation Realm","members of Kinew’s special forces.","Completely balanced.","But Blu had a significant advantage against Kinew.","“Now it’s time to end this battle!” Blu’s eyes revealed a murderous intent.","With his right hand gripping his left arm, he began to distance his divine power.","At his fingertips, a power that could not be shaken had already formed.","Gula below hurriedly reminded, “Quick, dodge!”","But it was already too late!","Blu pointed his finger at Kinew and shouted, “Demon Light Kill Waves!”","A beam of light instantly shot out.","Kinew’s figure froze for a moment, trying to dodge but couldn’t escape.","Because the Demon Light Kill Waves could lock onto him, leaving no room for escape!","He could only block with both arms in front of his chest.","Boom!","The divine power condensed in this beam exceeded 950,000.","It reached 980,000.","This was Blu’s limit.","And it was his ultimate move.","Enough to kill Kinew instantly.","Just when everyone thought Kinew was doomed.","As Kinew blocked with both arms in front, a imperceptible smile crossed his face.","This detail was noticed by Jian Wushuang.","“Not good, it’s a trap!”","Just as Jian Wushuang finished speaking, a change occurred.","After the light beam pierced through Kinew’s chest, Kinew disappeared.","Elder Blu was also startled.","This was his strongest skill, impossible to evade.","As he was surprised, the beam of light suddenly changed direction, heading towards Blu.","“How is this possible!” Blu exclaimed.","This attack was supposed to track the enemy.","Now it was coming towards him, which meant Kinew was behind him.","When he tried to turn around, he found himself restrained from behind by Kinew.","Kinew’s arms were like a cage, firmly binding Blu.","“Haha, you’re going to die by your own skill!” Kinew sneered coldly. “And I am the ultimate","victor!”","With Blu blocking in front, the attacks he received would indeed be significantly reduced.","Blu panicked as well.","He knew his ultimate skill very well.","If he took such a hit, he would be severely injured if not dead.","If he were seriously injured, with only the Four Great Holy Sons left, they would be unable to","stop Gula.","But Kinew had him locked down, and he couldn’t break free.","“Ah!!!”","At the last moment, Blu roared in anger, and his divine power surged once again.","Golden light shimmered all over his body.","And he broke free from Kinew’s grasp directly."]},{"number":5868,"title":"Chapter 5868: Dead?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5868: Dead?","Below, Gula narrowed his eyes. In the instant Elder Blu erupted, his divine power approached a million.","This couldn’t be ignored.","Gula’s eyes narrowed, directly immobilizing Blu in mid-air, rendering him unable to move.","Although it was just a moment.","But Kinew reacted faster, once again locking down Blu.","Just as Blu’s eruption occurred, it instantly subsided.","However, it still greatly shocked Kinew.","The terrifying divine power just now was almost over a million.","Thinking about this, there was a moment of fear.","But this time, Blu was completely finished.","A beam of light surged, piercing Blu’s chest directly, shattering his divine body, collapsing his Origin Source.","Only a breath remained.","Kinew, who had Blu locked down, didn’t fare any better. This time, his chest was pierced again, not a residual image but a real blow.","Even though the light beam weakened after passing through Blu, Kinew’s own divine power was nowhere near as strong as Blu’s.","So his situation was similar to Blu’s, both severely injured.","But he had a trick up his sleeve.","Reaching into his mustard seed, he retrieved a fruit and gulped it down.","His divine power continued to rise.","While Blu had already fallen.","Jones and Zack on the ground hurried forward to help but were directly injured and pushed back by Gula’s stare.","The Empress’s eyes also flickered.","She had hoped Blu would defeat Kinew and then provoke Gula to intervene.","Now Gula had intervened, but not completely.","It seemed she needed to lend a hand!","Whoosh!","The Empress, Fengchen, flashed and appeared in mid-air.","Kinew, seeing Fengchen behind him, was startled, trying to retreat hastily.","But his body involuntarily trembled, unable to move.","Empress Fengchen, with a flick of her red lips and a blink of her icy eyes, left only a corpse in front of her when she opened them again.","Kinew, with a divine power of up to 920,000, died instantly.","Although injured, he could recover to over 800,000 divine power.","But he died just like that.","At the mountaintop, Jian Wushuang stared at the crystal ball, his eyes trembling.","He hadn’t even seen clearly when the Empress made her move.","Kinew was annihilated.","“You shall accompany him in death!” The Empress pointed her finger at her waist, lightly tapping to immobilize the four Sixth Tribulations realm beings.","The four Holy Sons of the Polunga Clan were surprised when the Empress made a move against Kinew and his people, but they didn’t hesitate.","They immediately took action.","Without any hesitation, they slew all four of Kinew’s subordinates.","Then, one by one, they descended to the ground and stood before Elder Blu.","Gula furrowed his brow, casting a glance at the few worthless individuals behind him, then looked up at the sky.","“This game shouldn’t end so soon!”","At that moment, Gula stood up for the first time and stepped down from the throne. Despite his small and frail figure, Gula was undoubtedly the strongest presence in the field. A sudden surge of energy shook the entire Dragon God Mountain.","Jian Wushuang, who was watching from the mountaintop, turned pale. He hurriedly said to Danbao, “Quick, bring Blu back. The Empress of the human race won’t be able to withstand Gula. Bring Blu back to restore his divine power and let him join the battle again!”","Danbao hesitated for a moment, but he thought Jian Wushuang’s words made sense. He then relayed the message to Blu and the others.","The powerful members of the Polunga Clan at the foot of the mountain also understood the terror of Gula. They were no match for him at all.","Taking advantage of Blu’s partial recovery, they quickly activated the formation of the Dragon God Mountain and sent Blu back.","Whoosh!","A circular black hole appeared in mid-air, and Blu’s body leaped into it.","With blood still staining his lips, Blu fell to the ground, and Danbao rushed forward to help","him recover.","But Blu’s injuries were too severe to heal quickly.","Jian Wushuang could only feel anxious as he looked at the crystal ball.","The remaining strong members of the Polunga Clan should also return.","Staying here would only mean death.","Gula personally entered the fray!","The Empress was also prepared to fight.","The two strongest figures confronted each other.","The Empress stood in mid-air, hands on her hips, staring at Gula, while secretly","communicating with the strong members of the human race.","When she engaged Gula, the other strong members of the human race would take the opportunity to kill all of Gula’s remaining subordinates.","Not a single one would be spared.","And they would snatch the Dragon Balls as well.","They couldn’t let those people freeload around!","Gula flexed his wrist and calmly said, “Shall we begin?”","“Anytime!” The Empress suddenly retreated, sleeves flicking, and thousands of crimson","threads flew out.","The red sleeves completely surrounded Gula.","Trapped in a cocoon.","“Attack!”","The dozens of fifth-stage realm strongmen from the human race surged forward like a","torrent, directly charging towards Gula’s remaining forces.","Only a dozen or so Fifth Tribulation strongmen remained who could hold back the human","army.","Li Sheng was in a panic, desperately wanting to shout out loud to show that they were on the","same side.","But as the words reached his lips, he realized he looked like a wild beast.","Speaking out wouldn’t make anyone believe him. Even if they did believe, nobody would hold","back.","He decided to unleash his divine power and prepare to escape.","The remaining followers of Gula, especially Sabo after his transformation, could withstand","for a while.","But the rest were powerless to resist and were quickly surrounded and overwhelmed. Though Gula was enveloped, he could still sense the commotion below.","With a sudden force, he broke free from his restraints and saw countless people below trying","to snatch his Dragon Balls, which made him furious.","He wanted to intervene to stop those Universe Masters of the human race.","But the Empress wasn’t going to let him go.","Her sleeves attacked once again, this time with her own universe treasure, fully mastered at","the Sixth Tribulation level.","Even with Gula’s immense divine power, breaking through quickly was impossible.","Both sides struggled with their divine power.","The Empress’s divine power quickly reached 990,000, but breaking a million was not so easy.","Gula’s divine power, on the other hand, remained around a million.","For a moment, they were deadlocked.","Meanwhile, the battle below was nearing its end.","Li Sheng, desperate to save his life, grabbed a Dragon Ball and fled without trembling like the","others.","He wanted to run to the Empress’s side and inform her of his identity.","Gula, however, mistook Li Sheng’s action as protecting the Dragon Ball and greatly admired","it.","His divine power erupted again, skyrocketing from 1.08 million, directly pushing away the Empress and snatching Li Sheng.","“After I deal with these people, I’ll come back to settle the score with you!” Gula’s eyes","flashed with killing intent.","The Empress, pushed back, was extremely shocked by Gula’s divine power, which could erupt","to 1.08 million.","If that was Gula’s strongest divine power, she might still have hope.","The human Universe Masters below, who were still fighting over the Dragon Balls, were","stunned when they saw Gula charging towards them.","They cursed the Empress for being useless and unable to stop Gula, yet still insisting on","letting them fight for the Dragon Balls.","Feng Chen no longer cared about those people. Without even glancing at them, he turned to look at the several Sixth Tribulation strongmen of the Polunga Clan.","Gula, with Li Sheng in tow, approached the human Universe Masters with a dark expression on","his face."]},{"number":5869,"title":"Chapter 5869: Joining Forces","paragraphs":["Chapter 5869: Joining Forces","“Even you lowlifes dare to snatch my treasures!” Gula roared, sending the crowd back with sheer force.","But it didn’t end there. With a swift movement, he appeared in front of a fifth-tribulation realm expert holding a Dragon Ball, crushing their skull with a claw and tossing the Dragon Ball to Li Sheng.","Li Sheng caught it steadily.","Again, another fifth-tribulation realm Universe Master fell to Gula’s hands.","The rest stood frozen, paralyzed with fear.","There was no strength left for resistance.","If they all attacked together, they might all be annihilated by Gula.","“This holy gathering, I have no hope at all. It’s time to give up!”","This thought echoed in everyone’s mind.","Fourth Tribulation experts began to retreat and flee for their lives.","Despite Gula’s rage, he had no intention of letting any of them escape.","Launching into the air, he pointed his fingers and shot out beams of light, each capable of instantly killing a Fifth Tribulation expert.","In the blink of an eye, tens of thousands of beams of light filled the sky.","Everyone present was targeted for annihilation.","Meanwhile, Li Sheng was surrounded by four Dragon Balls.","But his eyes were fixed on the corpses littering the ground.","Gula clenched his fist lightly, coughed dryly, and muttered, “Filthy creatures!”","The sight of the corpses made him extremely uncomfortable. With a wave of his hand, a powerful storm erupted, instantly leveling everything within thousands of miles.","The corpses vanished without a trace!","It was a scene that shook the heart.","Unfortunately, there were few human experts left on the scene.","The Empress paid no mind to this, currently persuading the strong members of the Polunga Clan to cooperate.","Jian Wushuang and Wu Li were not present, but they would have been stunned if they were. Only Li Sheng witnessed everything firsthand, with his own eyes.","Although he didn’t particularly care about the fate of these people, witnessing so many powerful individuals being slaughtered by Gula left him trembling with fear.","At the same time, he felt a sense of relief.","He was grateful that he had transformed into a savage beast.","The next time he saw Jian Wushuang, bowing his head a few times in deference would be considered courteous.","He was determined to express his gratitude properly.","Thinking about it, despite spending so much time among the human race, he hadn’t reaped as","much benefit in a month as he did by becoming a savage beast.","Perhaps it was because in the face of such a great opportunity, everyone had a chance.","This opportunity had allowed him to reach the peak of the Fifth Tribulation.","Even though he had become a savage beast, he never regretted it.","“Gula, sir!”","Li Sheng bowed deeply, having completely become a lackey of the human race.","As Gula passed by Li Sheng, heading towards the direction of the Empress and the strong members of the Polunga Clan, he spoke as he passed Li Sheng, “Keep an eye on the Dragon Balls. Once I’ve killed these people, I promise to help you break into the Sixth Tribulation realm!”","As soon as these words left Gula’s mouth, Li Sheng’s expression changed several times.","“Help you break into the Sixth Tribulation realm!”","These words echoed in Li Sheng’s ears repeatedly.","The Sixth Tribulation realm!","He was still a Universe Master.","That meant being a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","In the Ancient Wood Continent, they were all prominent figures.","He could even establish a secret realm, allowing his family to relocate there and become regional rulers.","A Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","Wherever he went, he would be highly regarded.","He could even venture into dangerous secret realms to gradually solidify his own strength and strive towards the Seventh Tribulation realm.","The temptation was too great for Li Sheng.","He had to consider whether this was the greatest opportunity of his life.","Once missed, he might regret it for the rest of his life.","“Sixth Tribulation realm!” Li Sheng murmured.","It was a realm he had never dared to imagine.","Before entering the Infinite Great World, the most arrogant thing he had said in the Li family was that he could rank in the top three among the Fourth Tribulation realm experts of Yue","Kingdom.","However, there weren’t many Universe Masters in the Fourth Tribulation realm from the Kingdom of Yue to begin with.","Ranked in the top three was nothing to boast about.","In the blink of an eye, he witnessed dozens of Universe Masters in the fifth Tribulation realm","fall, along with hundreds, even thousands, in the Fourth Tribulation realm.","Here, those in the Fourth Tribulation realm were like weeds, while those in the Fifth Tribulation realm were mere ants.","Even those in the Sixth Tribulation realm couldn’t sway the course of the battle.","Everything that happened today indeed exceeded his previous experiences and","understanding.","This couldn’t help but cause a slight change in his mood.","Seeing Gula steadily approaching, the Empress furrowed her brow.","She still couldn’t persuade the Polunga Clan’s members to strengthen their forces.","They could only fight separately.","“What a bunch of fools!” The Empress didn’t want to confront Gula directly in order to","preserve her divine power, especially when alone.","With a flicker, she attempted to rush towards Dragon God Mountain.","But Gula preempted her, blocking the Empress’s path.","“In such a hurry, where do you think you’re going?”","His speed surpassed everyone’s mental abilities once again.","It was impossible to even see clearly.","At the mountaintop, Jian Wushuang anxiously asked, “Is it not ready yet?”","The Empress wouldn’t stand a chance against Gula alone.","If she fell, the remaining people wouldn’t have much hope either.","There might not even be a chance for him and Wu Li to escape.","Blu must join forces with the Empress to confront Gula.","That’s the only hope.","If necessary, he could use the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation and launch a surprise","attack on Gula.","And he still had a trick up his sleeve, “Li Sheng”.","But he didn’t know that Li Sheng had already gone mad.","He was immersed in delusions about the Sixth Tribulation realm.","“Whew!”","Danbao sat directly on the ground, while Blu’s aura reached its peak.","But judging from Danbao’s complexion, he must have reached his limit.","His life force couldn’t be compared.","But being able to restore a Sixth Tribulation divine power to a super powerhouse with a strength of 950,000 was quite remarkable.","If this were to be revealed, regardless of the faction, he would be an esteemed guest.","It’s no wonder the Grand Elder and the elders of the Holy Land valued Danbao so much. Moreover, it was once said that if the Holy Land were to fall, he would take Danbao and flee. It seems that Danbao also harbored some significant secrets. “Quick, those outside can’t hold on much longer!” Jian Wushuang glanced at the crystal ball and then turned to Blu, saying, “There’s a chance of winning if you join forces with the","Human Empress!”","In reality, he knew best whether they would win or not. Without Gula’s transformation, he had a divine power of 1.08 million.","Now, with Blu and the Empress teaming up, there was indeed a slight chance of winning.","But they definitely couldn’t win against Gula after his transformation.","But if they didn’t join forces, they would only await death.","Blu also looked at the crystal ball, but he had no intention of cooperating with the Empress!","“Prepare to escape while you can!”","His gaze shifted, and he glanced at the house where the Grand Elder was located, a surge of","fighting spirit rising once again.","With those words, he disappeared from where he stood.","And when he reappeared, he was already at the foot of the mountain.","The battle between the Empress and Gula continued.","But Gula, who was fighting, seemed extremely relaxed.","After all, there was still some gap between the two sides. After Blu appeared, he didn’t waste any time and went straight for Gula.","Although the Empress had also killed members of the Polunga Clan, her biggest opponent","now was Gula.","Dealing with Gula first, and then dealing with the Empress, would not be too late.","“Haha, just in time! If you hadn’t come out, I might have fallen asleep!”","Gula yawned, standing in mid-air with one hand on his hip, scanning the two with a slight","smirk, then suddenly dashed out."]},{"number":5870,"title":"Chapter 5870: Trump Card Revealed","paragraphs":["Chapter 5870: Trump Card Revealed","The speed was simply beyond comprehension.","The Empress’s divine power, though slightly stronger than Elder Blu’s, struggled to withstand the onslaught.","But even at his peak, Elder Blu could only muster up to 950,000 divine power, a far cry from Gula’s 1.08 million.","They were utterly overwhelmed from the start.","With just one punch, Gula sent Elder Blu plummeting from the sky.","Then, he turned towards the Empress and, missing his initial kick, seamlessly transitioned into a palm strike.","Boom!","The Empress also fell from the sky.","“Too weak!” Gula shook his head as he descended from the heavens.","Elder Blu rose again and charged.","The Empress also approached from another direction.","But their joint assault was in vain.","Gula leaped up, spreading his arms and unleashing two powerful shockwaves that sent Elder","Blu and the Empress flying back thousands of yards, crashing into the mountains.","Other strong members of the Polunga Clan wanted to intervene but found themselves powerless.","The Four Holy Princes only possessed just over 800,000 power each.","Rushing in would only lead to their demise.","Elder Jones stepped forward, his face dark, and addressed the four Holy Sons, “It’s time to use our last resort!”","The four Holy Sons were taken aback, but when they looked at Gula, they fell silent.","On the mountaintop,","Jian Wushuang glimpsed the conversation among Elder Jones and the others through a crystal ball but couldn’t hear their words.","He asked, “Danbao, what are they doing? Planning a strategy?”","“I think they’re planning to flee. What else can they do? They’re getting crushed. It’s better to flee early and give the Dragon Ball to Gula!” Wu Li shook his head, sighing.","Danbao ignored Wu Li and turned to Jian Wushuang, explaining, “Elder Jones might resort to the strongest secret technique of our Polunga Clan.”","“The strongest secret technique!” Jian Wushuang and Wu Li exclaimed simultaneously, “What’s the strongest secret technique?”","“The Fusion Technique!” Danbao stood up, glanced at the Elder’s house, then continued, “The Fusion Technique that creates the Super Polunga Warrior!”","A Super Warrior!","Danbao’s explanation left Jian Wushuang shocked to the core!","The Fusion Art of the Polunga Clan was exceptionally unique.","Because the entire Polunga Clan’s bloodline originated from the Great Elder.","They could actually merge.","For example, when a wise Polunga person merges with a combat-oriented one, a super warrior with both wisdom and combat prowess is born.","Elder Blu’s immense strength stemmed from such a fusion.","“Fusion technique!” Jian Wushuang muttered softly.","This reminded him of the Mountain Lords of the Qishen Temple.","Shan Jun, Gu Jun, Mo Jun.","Originally manifestations of the Dao of the Qishen.","Later, Shan Jun further differentiated into Heart Demon, Ten-Thousand Demon, Wind Demon, Blood Demon.","They could differentiate and merge again.","That’s why Mie Sheng led them on this path.","Once merged again, they could regain their peak.","Just the Mo Jun alone was at the level of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","Mo, Gu, and Shan combined as one.","Even without the Qishen’s peak strength, they probably had the top combat power of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Qishen of old was even a Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm.","Even capable of matching an Eighth Tribulation realm.","Devouring a Dao was the peak path of the Qishen.","Just like Jian Wushuang’s Sword Dao.","Could it be that ordinary?","“I hope there will be miracles!” Jian Wushuang focused again on the fight below the mountain.","The Empress and Elder Blu had already suffered considerable injuries.","If this continued, death was inevitable.","On the side of the four Holy Sons, they were surrounded in the center by dozens of Fifth Tribulation realm experts and hundreds of Fourth Tribulation realm strongmen.","Elder Jones closed his eyes slightly and said calmly, “Let’s begin!”","Buzz!","Hundreds of auras began to converge.","A majestic aura suddenly burst forth.","In the distance, Gula paused for a moment, then turned to look at those strong Polunga Clan","members, sneering.","“Any more surprises?”","Originally prepared to strike, upon finding that the Polunga Clan still had tricks up their sleeves, he no longer rushed, casually dispatching the joint attack of Elder Blu and the Empress.","Then he charged towards the four Holy Sons.","Fusion required time, so when they saw Gula coming, they were in a dilemma.","Once interrupted, all their previous efforts would be in vain.","On the mountaintop, Jian Wushuang suddenly stood up and urgently called out to the elder in","the house, “Quickly teleport me out!”","Though the elder was inside the house, he could still see the situation below through the","crystal ball.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s request to go down voluntarily, he hesitated.","But there was no other way now, so he complied.","Jian Wushuang had barely stood up when he appeared at the foot of the mountain.","The gathered aura around him was already enough for him to unleash the Super Eternal","Ancient Transformation.","“Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!” Jian Wushuang clenched his fist, and his figure suddenly burst forth, his divine power soaring directly to 800,000.","Seeing Jian Wushuang suddenly appear, Gula was also startled.","He glanced up at the mountain peak, understanding what had happened.","“Still some daredevils left!” Gula sneered coldly.","He could tell that Jian Wushuang only had a mere 800,000 divine power, which was nothing to","worry about.","But the barrier above the peak was a bit troublesome.","And it could teleport.","To prevent anyone from escaping with the Dragon Balls, Gula gathered a dark red beam in his","hands and aimed it at the barrier on the mountain peak.","Boom!","The divine power of this strike definitely exceeded 1 million.","Jian Wushuang was also startled.","Seeing Gula attacking the barrier, he didn’t rush to intervene.","He was buying time for the four Holy Sons of the Polunga Clan behind him.","He was also waiting for Blu and the Empress to arrive.","Then they could deal with Gula together.","From a distance, Li Sheng saw Jian Wushuang appear and even burst out with 800,000 divine","power.","He was also greatly shocked.","He didn’t know that Gula could transform.","Now seeing the outbreak from the Polunga Clan’s side again and Jian Wushuang rushing out,","he felt a bit anxious for a moment.","Wu Li on the mountaintop discovered that Jian Wushuang, after transforming, actually had 800,000 divine power, which greatly shocked him!","He originally thought that this time, they could surpass Jian Wushuang.","But unexpectedly, they were still outmatched.","“Jian Wushuang!” The Empress, rushing over, saw Jian Wushuang and her eyes trembled.","Jian Wushuang also looked at her, his gaze like water, with some resentment.","He blamed the Empress for abandoning them.","Leaving without a word, leaving him and Jinchen behind.","All the strong from the Yue Kingdom fell.","This was more like a microcosm because all the Universe Masters who followed the Empress","had also fallen.","Now, among the human race, only three and a half remained.","The half was Li Sheng, who had turned into a wild beast.","When they came, they were all fine.","But now, they were all gone.","Those who were still alive had unbelievably good luck.","At the moment of seeing the Empress, words were on the tip of their tongues, but they","couldn’t say them.","This feeling was very uncomfortable.","Blu also arrived at this time.","The three of them surrounded Gula.","“You flies!” Gula, blocked by them, was somewhat annoyed.","With just one glance, he forced the three of them back and attacked the barrier again.","This time, Blu stepped forward and began to burn his own divine power."]},{"number":5871,"title":"Chapter 5871: Leave It to Me!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5871: Leave It to Me!","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed as he transmitted, “Elder Blu, how much time do you need for that previous move?”","Blu, with his burning divine body, had accumulated a million divine power.","If he were to execute that previous move again, he might catch Gula off guard.","Gula’s transformation also required some time. If he could slay Gula while he transformed, it would be a significant advantage.","“Three breaths!”","Blu braced himself with both hands against Gula’s punch and, as he retreated, glanced at Jian Wushuang.","He understood Jian Wushuang’s intention.","To directly end Gula.","Adding fuel to the fight would be courting death against Gula.","Even if the four Holy Sons managed to produce a flower, it wouldn’t be of much use.","Four Sixth Tribulation realm experts, no matter how strong, were merely four more Blus. Perhaps they could withstand the current Gula.","But they would definitely not be able to withstand Gula after his transformation.","Clang!","Jian Wushuang drew the Wanjie Sword directly, calmly stating, “I’ll handle these three breaths!”","He glanced back at the Empress, whose divine power was already becoming unstable. Whether she could be relied upon was a question.","So, he had to withstand these three breaths on his own.","“Gula, your opponent now is me!” Jian Wushuang held the sword horizontally, his wings flaring behind him.","His speed was now on par with Gula’s.","This greatly shocked Gula!","It was impossible to dodge that sword now, and he felt a bit flustered.","He hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang’s speed to be this fast.","Jian Wushuang only had eight hundred thousand divine power, which Gula naturally didn’t take seriously.","But now his speed suddenly caught up, making Gula worried that Jian Wushuang’s divine power might also skyrocket suddenly.","However, after feeling the power of that sword, he breathed a sigh of relief.","“I thought your speed matched your divine power!” Gula held the Wanjie Sword with one hand, and with a shake of his divine power, he directly knocked Jian Wushuang away.","As Jian Wushuang was knocked back, his figure became unstable, and his speed slowed.","At this moment, Gula flashed forward. With both hands behind him, he delivered a hammer blow, and the sharp spiral horn pierced directly through Jian Wushuang’s chest.","Puff!","Blood trickled down his chest plate as Jian Wushuang’s divine body ruptured.","The gap was just too wide.","Although he had unleashed the super ancient transformation, boosting his divine power to eight hundred thousand and doubling his Origin Source power, he was still far from being an Emperor.","His life force churned madly, trying to heal his injuries, but the consumption outweighed the recovery.","With a fierce shake of Gula’s head, Jian Wushuang was thrown from the sky to the ground. Boom!","Jian Wushuang’s fall created a massive crater upon impact.","The injury to his chest was severe, penetrating even the Origin Source Universe.","No matter how fast his Life power recovered, instant healing was impossible.","That was the difference.","If they were of the same level, or if the opponent was just slightly stronger, he wouldn’t be in such a sorry state.","But facing Gula, a super powerhouse with a million divine power, he had no means.","“Two breaths!” Jian Wushuang chuckled self-deprecatingly, unable to move his body. This time, he really had no tricks left.","He turned his head towards the direction of the Empress, mentally pleading, “Hold him off, give Elder Blu a moment to breathe, we still have a chance to win!”","The Empress trembled, her divine body already cracking, the two breaths of respite were for gathering Qi.","Now, with some Qi gathered, it became unstable again.","And Jian Wushuang was on the brink of falling.","“Little guy!” The Empress was also moved.","This time, the position of the Saintess was already hers.","Actually, there was no need to muddy the waters anymore.","Even if she didn’t complete the mission and missed the position of the Holy Maiden, her participation in the Sacred Assembly this time was rewarding enough.","From the Half-Step Sixth Tribulation realm to the pinnacle of the Sixth Tribulation realm, the many sacrifices she made were worth it.","Why push it further?","Moreover, there was no need to save someone who was on the brink of death like Jian","Wushuang.","It would be better to seize this opportunity to escape.","Seeing the Empress hesitating from afar, Li Sheng, who transformed into a Polunga, was","frantic.","If Jian Wushuang died, he wouldn’t be able to revert to the Human race.","With all the Human powerhouse killed by Gula, he wouldn’t be able to return to the Sixteen","Kingdoms.","What would be the point of becoming a Sixth Tribulation realm in this Infinite Great World","then?","He couldn’t just watch Jian Wushuang die.","The same went for Wu Li on the mountaintop.","Now Jian Wushuang was about to die, and his plan to enter Wanliu was also ruined.","“I’ve said it before, don’t go, don’t go!” Wu Li shook his head, pulled out a three-foot wooden sword, glanced at the house of the Great Elder, and his aura suddenly changed. Just as Wu Li was about to make a move, something happened on the Empress’s side. Instead of heading towards Gula, she rushed towards Li Sheng.","“Great King, save me!” Li Sheng shouted and directly threw out the Dragon Ball.","This was their plan with the Empress.","To use the Dragon Ball to distract Gula.","Hearing Gula’s shout, he paused and turned to look at the Empress’s position.","He had to stop!","“Damn it, you maggots have thoroughly angered me!” Gula clenched his fists, no longer","wanting to play around.","The Empress had just rushed to Li Sheng’s side but was overwhelmed by Gula’s aura.","The colors in the sky began to distort.","Gula’s divine power also began to fluctuate continuously.","Jian Wushuang at the bottom of the pit took the opportunity to roll over and leap towards a","distance, loudly reminding, “Watch out for his transformation!”","“Kid, you actually know who I am!” Gula’s expression was extremely embarrassed, this was a","sign of his transformation.","What he didn’t expect was that a human kid actually knew he could transform.","As far as he knew, there were no Frost Demon Clan members outside.","Jian Wushuang, who had escaped to a distance, finally breathed a sigh of relief at this","moment.","A strand of Thought power had been on Elder Blu all along, and the opponent’s ultimate move","had already formed.","Now it was just waiting for an opportunity.","“Frost Demon Clan!” Jian Wushuang took the opportunity to speak, “Gula, I’ve killed a","member of the Frost Demon Clan before, and he looks a lot like you!”","This sentence was somewhat provocative.","But Gula didn’t care about it.","Although the strong members of the Frost Demon Clan were rare, they were not as united as","the Polunga Clan.","Whether they lived or died had nothing to do with him.","What he cared about was that someone knew his trump card.","This made him very unhappy.","Originally, he had wanted to show off in front of these people.","But now it was all ruined.","“Since you know, then let you be the first one I kill after transforming!” Gula’s figure shook,","and his divine power soared again.","However, Jian Wushuang turned to Blu and said, “It’s now!”","Buzz!","A pillar of light surrounded by black aura shot into the sky, Blu exerted all his divine power,","and with the last bit of strength, he roared, “Demon-piercing Light Kills Pol!”","Boom!","This pillar of air was like a rainbow piercing the sun.","It instantly rushed towards Gula.","Gula, who was still preparing to transform, turned his head to look, but it was already in front","of him. The blood vessels in his eyes burst, and he exclaimed, “What!”"]},{"number":5872,"title":"Chapter 5872: Tier 2 Gula","paragraphs":["Chapter 5872: Tier 2 Gula","He had completely disregarded Elder Blu.","His focus was entirely on Jian Wushuang, wanting to know how Jian Wushuang knew he would transform.","It was precisely at that moment that Jian Wushuang deliberately drew his attention.","And now it seemed to have succeeded.","The power of Mo Guanguang’s attack this time had exceeded a million divine powers.","A full 1.05 million.","Even if it couldn’t kill Gula, it could severely injure him.","Injure him to the point where he couldn’t transform anymore.","Then they could win.","The pillar of light covered Gula’s body, rushing towards the distant mountains.","Gula’s physical body within the light wave was directly shattered, and his divine body was gradually disappearing.","Completely passed through Gula, without a trace of excess.","The light wave that passed through Gula fell into the distant mountains, erupting with a strong aura, then bursting apart.","Boom!","A powerful airflow followed, Jian Wushuang raised his hand to shield his eyes.","But he could still feel four strong auras behind him.","It was the Four Great Holy Sons.","“Good, they’re all gathered together!” Jian Wushuang’s face lit up, turning to the Four Great Holy Sons and said, “Now, let’s give Gula another blow!”","The damage just now was not enough to make Gula fall.","They must take advantage of this opportunity to strike again, and not hesitate.","The Four Great Sacred Sons had absorbed hundreds of strong members of the Polunga Clan, and now each of them had reached about a million divine powers, comparable to the Empress and Elder Blu.","Buzz!","The four of them rose into the air together, exerting their power, unleashing countless light waves, each with about a million divine power, although not as powerful as Elder Blu’s just","now.","But the quantity was astonishing.","In just a breath’s time, tens of thousands of strikes were made.","Half of the entire Dragon God Continent was destroyed in an instant.","The Origin Source of the Infinite Great World was almost completely exhausted.","Jian Wushuang finally realized.","On the Ancient Wood Continent, they were simply not prepared for battles at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","The Hun Tian, with just one big move, directly destroyed the Yongheng Kingdom.","That was just one example.","The Four Great Holy Sons, with their frenzied attacks, nearly destroyed the entire Infinite Great World, which was quite normal.","Anyway, it wasn’t their own home, so Jian Wushuang didn’t care, but rather hoped for more strength.","The Four Great Holy Sons almost exerted all their power, not daring to be careless at all.","It took almost the time it takes to burn an incense stick.","Jian Wushuang’s Thought power had been paying attention all along, and at the same time, he approached Blu and took out some divine power fruits from the mustard seed, handing them to him.","“Eat them quickly, and send me back to the mountaintop!”","Blu swallowed the divine power fruits, restoring some divine power, and directly sent Jian Wushuang back to the mountaintop with a handprint.","Back on the mountaintop, Jian Wushuang finally dared to breathe a sigh of relief. “Benefactor, let me restore you!” Danbao walked over, actively wanting to restore some divine power to Jian Wushuang.","But Jian Wushuang waved his hand and said, “I’ve already recovered!”","“So fast?” Wu Li came over at this time, but his aura had already returned to normal.","“Any slower, and I would have died down there!”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “Let’s wait for the outcome. If Gula is still alive, we’ll leave!”","With that said, he began to gather his energy again.","He had returned to his normal state now.","For escape, he could only use the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation and then shuttle through with the Three Quake Universe.","“Even in this state, can he still survive?” Wu Li pointed to the crystal ball, where the","bottomless pits were visible.","Jian Wushuang’s face was pale, and he honestly said, “I can still sense Gula’s aura. He’s not","that easy to kill. It depends on whether he can still transform.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he saw a small black dot rising from the deep pit.","Looking closely, it was indeed Gula.","The people below the mountain were dumbfounded.","Gula slowly rose from the deep pit to the sky, but his body was in tatters.","He had lost all four limbs, and his chest had many holes.","There were still a few holes on his face.","For the first time, his divine power dropped from 1.08 million to 800,000.","For Gula, this was already a serious injury.","Any heavier, and he would have almost no combat power left.","“You ants actually managed to injure me!”","“You all deserve to die!”","Gula’s figure shook, and the rotten wounds began to heal, gradually transforming into perfect","shapes.","Snap!","He landed on the ground and stepped towards Elder Blu.","The four Holy Sons moved forward together to block Gula.","“Since it’s like this, let me show you how powerful I am after transforming!” Gula sneered,","fists clenched as his divine power erupted violently.","A golden light burst forth instantly.","The violent divine power began to rise.","Jian Wushuang on the mountaintop already knew that this time, it was truly over.","“Let’s go!”","Jian Wushuang had also condensed his breath to perfection at this moment.","He could unleash the Super Ancient Transformation at any time.","Since Gula hadn’t completely transformed yet and his speed could still rival the opponent’s,","they should hurry and escape with everyone!","Wu Li, who had been thinking about leaving early, naturally felt joyful.","“We’ve been waiting for this moment, but when we leave, let’s bring Danbao with us. He can","restore our divine power, which is a great help!”","Actually, Wu Li didn’t need to say it; he would bring Danbao along anyway.","But this sentence unexpectedly came from Wu Li’s mouth, which puzzled him.","Earlier, Wu Li didn’t care about others’ deaths at all.","But now he actively wanted to bring Danbao along.","He must have discovered something.","He didn’t rush to expose it, but he didn’t immediately agree either. Instead, he looked at","Danbao and said, “Danbao, do you want to come with us?”","“I...” Danbao lowered his head, hesitating as he clutched his clothes.","It was normal to hesitate.","After all, this was the Holy Land.","And leaving here would result in the destruction of the Holy Land and the demise of all his","people.","That was inevitable.","He was just a child; how much could he understand?","Jian Wushuang also understood his concerns, so he said, “If you’re uncertain, why don’t you","ask the Grand Elder?”","“Okay!”","Danbao nodded and ran into the house.","Jian Wushuang looked at the crystal ball again.","Below the mountain.","Gula was reborn amidst the bursting golden light.","As the golden light faded, a familiar figure appeared.","Just like the ancient temple Jian Wushuang had seen before.","After transforming, Gula’s figure was several times larger than before, and his divine power","had surged significantly.","“One million...” Jian Wushuang found it difficult to comprehend.","With a furrowed brow, he pondered how to escape next.","He knew there was a teleportation array on the mountain.","But the distance it could teleport was limited.","He still needed to use the Three Quake Universe.","Wu Li stated, “1.3 million!”","The tree person inside him informed Wu Li of Gula’s divine power.","1.3 million divine power.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t surprised to hear this!","That was normal.","Before transforming, he had 1.08 million.","After transforming, possessing 1.3 million, it wasn’t as powerful as he had imagined.","This level of divine power was considered high-tier among those at the Seventh Tribulation","realm.","He had witnessed Dylan’s explosion before.","His divine power reached 1.8 million.","The upper limit of the Seventh Tribulation realm was too high.","1 million was just the beginning."]},{"number":5873,"title":"Chapter 5873: Stimulating Potential","paragraphs":["Chapter 5873: Stimulating Potential","Just like Hun Tian, was indeed in the Seventh Tribulation realm.","However, his divine power was terrifyingly immense, potentially reaching a minimum of 3 million.","He was the strongest Seventh Tribulation realm existence in the entire Ancient Wood Continent.","Even in the Universe Dao Arena, few dared to challenge him.","Currently, his avatars were unable to sense anything, overwhelmed by the frequent battles in the Infinite Great World.","He had no time to spare for external matters.","Dealing with the greatest threat, Gula, seemed impossible, leaving him little concern for anything else.","The people below the mountain were doomed.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t bear to look at them anymore.","The Empress couldn’t escape even if she tried.","He had no intention of dealing with her, maybe just bringing along two people.","Even if he could take three, the Empress wouldn’t be considered.","She had completely lost her mind, consumed by a desire for strength at any cost.","She would betray them eventually.","What was the point?","“Benefactor, Elder Blu requests your presence!” Danbao emerged from Elder Blu’s room, calling out to Jian Wushuang and Wu Li.","Though time was short, it was better to meet if Elder Blu wished.","There might be some last wishes or legacies to be left behind.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t interested in treasures, but opportunities couldn’t be ignored.","Perhaps Elder Blu could provide them with some chances.","Wu Li, on the other hand, wanted everything and dragged Jian Wushuang into the room.","Upon entering, they felt a sense of impending death in the air, signaling Elder Blu’s deteriorating health.","Even if Gula didn’t act, Elder Blu wouldn’t survive much longer.","“Hmm?” It was only then that Jian Wushuang noticed Danbao’s aura had unexpectedly grown stronger, reaching the level of an ordinary Tribulation Realm cultivator.","This was quite surprising; it seemed Elder Blu had provided Danbao with some treasure to enhance his strength.","Seeing them enter, Elder Blu mustered some strength and spoke, “Humans, Gula’s power is indeed as formidable as you’ve described.”","“Um, Elder Blu, if you have something to say, please hurry. We don’t have much time,” Wu Li interjected anxiously.","The Grand Elder paused for a moment, then spoke directly, “There are some things I can’t say directly. Take a look at this jade slip. If you feel there’s hope for yourselves, there’s no need to rush to leave!”","“A jade slip!” Jian Wushuang found a small jade slip and didn’t understand what the Grand Elder meant.","After channeling his psychic energy into the jade slip, Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“The Dragon Balls can be used like this?” He looked up at the Grand Elder, somewhat incredulous.","At this moment, Wu Li was also curious. He quickly dodged the jade slip and was stunned when he saw its contents.","The content was straightforward.","Gather nine Dragon Balls to allow the Grand Elder to unleash a power that can reverse the rules.","This power reverses the supreme rules.","Not to mention Wu Li, Jian Wushuang had never heard of it either.","For a moment, they were uncertain.","Reversing the rules.","Unlocking potential!","Simple words, yet containing so much.","Wu Li spoke up, “How far can this potential be unlocked?”","His focus was always on his own greatest benefit.","But he didn’t consider the authenticity of this.","Even if the potential was unlocked.","Could it still double their combat power?","Jian Wushuang didn’t think so.","If it were that powerful, why hadn’t they done it earlier?","The Grand Elder’s eyelids trembled, and he said unsteadily, “The unlocked potential is the Origin Source within oneself. The stronger the potential of the Origin Source, the stronger the unleashed combat power. The Origin Source of my Polunga Clan is too weak, so I’ve always...” Just now, he had unlocked the potential for Danbao with one Dragon Ball.","That was the only thing he could do.","He hoped the last member of the clan would become stronger and have the ability to protect themselves.","At the same time, they should also have their own value.","This way, they wouldn’t be abandoned.","Danbao’s eyes were filled with tears as he said, “Grand Elder, even with just one Dragon Ball, you’ll shorten your lifespan considerably. If all nine Dragon Balls are used together, you’ll","perish.”","“Silly child, my time is almost up. Even if Gula doesn’t kill me, I won’t last much longer!” The Grand Elder lowered his head and looked at Danbao with indulgence.","It was only now that Wu Li realized Danbao’s aura had become much stronger than before. Although his divine power had not increased much, his Origin Source had become much","stronger.","Danbao was never a combatant type to begin with, so increasing divine power was useless. With a stronger Origin Source, he would definitely be able to help others recover divine power","faster.","“Wushuang, why don’t I go and try first?” Wu Li looked at Jian Wushuang, apparently wanting","to see his opinion.","Jian Wushuang didn’t stop him and casually said, “If you feel you still have potential, go","ahead and try!”","He was already a perfect Emperor now. If he unleashed more potential, he was afraid he might","overexert himself.","So he didn’t think much of it and didn’t have any expectations.","Wu Li happily walked over.","His divine power was at its peak, 700,000.","It could be considered half a step into the Fifth Tribulation realm.","From being at the Half-Step Fourth Tribulation realm before, now, there was a significant","advancement.","Would igniting his potential again allow Wu Li to undergo another tribulation right where he","stood?","Jian Wushuang waited to see Wu Li’s embarrassment.","The Elder held up a Dragon Ball with one hand and placed the other on Wu Li’s forehead.","Buzz!","A surge of power erupted.","Then, accompanied by a dragon roar, a golden light burst from Wu Li’s body.","The powerful force of rules descended from the sky, startling Jian Wushuang.","“Reversing the rules!” he muttered, unbelievingly, “Could it be true that he’s going to undergo the Tribulation right here!”","The Tribulation in the void condensed.","But because of the power within the Dragon Ball, it began to dissipate.","Wu Li was overjoyed.","He hadn’t expected this surprise to come so suddenly.","He had undergone the Tribulation for nothing.","There were no signs at all.","The Elder released his hand, his complexion once again becoming grim.","Apparently, he didn’t have much life left; he was now in a dying state.","“Human, with my current life, I can only help you elevate with one Dragon Ball at most!”","The Elder also felt he might have exaggerated his earlier words.","Using nine Dragon Balls together to boost potential would cost too much lifespan.","He hadn’t even tried it.","But in his opinion, the potential unleashed by one Dragon Ball was almost enough.","Wu Li, at the Half-Step Fifth Tribulation realm, suddenly transformed into the Half-Step","Sixth Tribulation realm.","This was extremely absurd.","Initially, Wu Li’s dream was the Fifth Tribulation realm.","Now, even before entering the Wanyan Divine Wood, he reached the Half-Step Sixth","Tribulation realm.","“Unparalleled brother, it’s really damn useful. I feel like I can take on Gula now!” After the surge of his origin, the tree people within him helped him convert all the power of the Origin","Source of All Things into divine power .","This meant his divine power had surged.","And he had reached the Half-Step Sixth Tribulation realm.","He could now crazily consume divine power treasures to enhance his own divine power.","Thinking of this, Wu Li shamelessly reached out to the Elder for treasures."]},{"number":5874,"title":"Chapter 5874: Exposing the Power of Life","paragraphs":["Chapter 5874: Exposing the Power of Life","They cleaned up everything, leaving nothing behind.","“Alright, that’s enough. Tidy up, we’re getting ready to leave!” He remained unmoved; he knew his own situation best.","As Wu Li elevated his divine power, he nodded vigorously, but deep down, there was still some reluctance.","There were still four Dragon Balls here, and just one use had already elevated him so much.","So, if he were to use four Dragon Balls for elevation, wouldn’t he be able to reach the Sixth Tribulation realm?","But the thought of Elder Blu having only one breath left dampened his spirits.","It seemed he wouldn’t have this opportunity again.","He could only sigh inwardly.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to unleash the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, a voice echoed in his mind!","“You went to the Little Wanliu for the purpose of breaking through the Tribulation realm, didn’t you? Now this opportunity is right in front of you, why not seize it?”","This voice came from his original universe.","And in his original universe, there was only one person.","“Whis!” Jian Wushuang sucked in a cold breath.","He thought the other party wouldn’t care about him, but he didn’t expect to be reminded at this moment.","In the Origin Source Universe.","Above Tianqing Mountain.","Whis lounged on a huge recliner, basking in the sun, while directing the humanoid life forms he had created to arrange a huge mansion.","Despite spending so much time arranging it, it still hadn’t reached his satisfaction.","Hearing Jian Wushuang dare to question him, he said calmly, “If you don’t believe me, you can leave at any time!”","“I believe you!” Jian Wushuang nodded frantically.","Since Whis had spoken, how could he not believe it?","After all, the other party was a god!","However, since potential was being tapped, it should be maximized.","The nine Dragon Balls must be together.","There were still four outside, so he could figure out a way to get them.","If he could really reach the Tribulation realm, he wouldn’t need Elder Blu’s help; he could transcend five Tribulation realms at once.","Would he still fear Gula then?","A mere 1.3 million divine power.","Once he broke through to the Tribulation realm, he wouldn’t need to use divine power; he could beat Gula with swordsmanship alone.","Origin Source divine power!","The most powerful was still the Origin Source.","“What’s wrong?” Wu Li asked as he saw Jian Wushuang standing still, anxious that something might happen again.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and said, “We’re not leaving!”","“Have you thought it through?” Elder Blu was also delighted.","He could see that Jian Wushuang’s potential was boundless.","Although only one Dragon Ball had been used, it could still make Jian Wushuang’s strength multiply.","“Elder Blu, I’ve thought it through, but I want to use nine Dragon Balls to tap into my potential!”","“Nine Balls!”","Not only was Elder Blu stunned, but Wu Li also exclaimed, “Brother Wushuang, don’t joke around. Where can you find the conditions for that now?”","Even if they went out and snatched the remaining four Dragon Balls, the Grand Elder’s remaining lifespan wouldn’t be enough for him to squander!","“I’m confident!” Despite their disbelief, Jian Wushuang was extremely confident.","It’s just the power of Life!","He had plenty of it.","At this point, he didn’t care whether he exposed it or not.","As long as he could reach the Tribulation realm.","Everything was worth it.","Moreover, he had created the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Once he reached the Tribulation realm, he would be able to quickly reach the Fifth Tribulation","realm.","Using the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, his combat power would be at least comparable to the Seventh Tribulation realm.","There was another point.","That is, his Origin Source Universe could be accommodated within his divine body.","In this way, it was like carrying a mobile Dao Arena.","His combat power would also skyrocket.","Killing Gula was not a problem, and even if he went out, he was confident in preserving his life.","Once he reached the Universe Master, his Three Quake Universe would dominate the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Except for the Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation realm, no one could catch up with","him.","He still had this confidence.","As long as he was given time, after devouring Dong Jun’s bones, his basic divine power could quickly exceed 1 million.","At that time, when he used the full-powered Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, he didn’t dare to imagine how powerful he would become.","At this moment, Wu Li stepped forward to ruin his parade, “Brother, this matter is not something you can control just because you want to. There are some things you simply can’t","control!”","“What about this?” Jian Wushuang directly plunged deep into his palm, using his mental power to mobilize the power of Life within his body, which instantly gathered in his palm.","This scene directly stunned everyone.","Wu Li’s eyes lit up, and the treant inside him almost came out.","“The power of Life!” Danbao also exclaimed.","At the same time, he thought of the treasure inside his body.","He could transform divine power and Life with the power of All Things because of a treasure.","But Jian Wushuang’s power of Life was the purest innate Life.","The Grand Elder’s murky eyes, when seeing the power of Life, also revealed a faint glimmer.","This glimmer continued to enlarge.","Jian Wushuang approached Elder Blu and directly infused the power of Life into his body.","Elder Blu of the Polunga Clan, upon receiving that surge of Life force, began to slowly","transform from his aged and weary state.","Previously, he couldn’t even open his eyelids.","Now, he could actually stand up.","It was nothing short of a miracle of Life!","“Wushuang, you must be out of your mind!”","Wu Li reacted at this moment, pointing towards the sky.","The meaning was clear.","Everything they were doing here could be clearly seen by the outside experts.","This round’s Sacred Gathering... it was doomed.","Countless Scattered Tribulation experts would rush over soon.","Even those at the Eighth Tribulation realm would meet their fate.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t care, saying, “We’ll meet the enemy head-on and face whatever","comes!”","“Courageous!” Elder Blu, standing up, looked towards Jian Wushuang and said, “With the Life power you’ve given me, it’s enough to unleash your potential with the nine Dragon Balls. Now I see, you’re actually at the level of Emperor, truly remarkable!”","“It’s nothing!” Jian Wushuang became even more audacious, saying casually, “Only when I reach the Tribulation realm can we reverse this crisis. By then, there’s no need to flee. I’ll also give you, Elder Blu, the power of Life to ensure the eternal prosperity of the Polunga Clan.”","“I believe in your potential too!” Elder Blu of the Polunga Clan now had the same confidence","as Jian Wushuang.","Wu Li stood by, unsure of what to do.","Running away depended on strength.","Without Jian Wushuang, how could he escape?","“Wu Li!” Jian Wushuang’s expression turned serious as he looked at him and said, “And the","senior inside you, from now on, every word I say is sworn by the highest rules. As long as you","all wholeheartedly help me, I will surely repay your kindness in the future!” This time, he gave them a glimpse of his bottom line.","As long as they helped him resolve this matter, everything would be beneficial in the future.","No matter what the treant’s plan was, or what his identity was.","He would spare no effort.","Helping the other party achieve their goal.","They could pick treasures first.","As long as they helped him this time.","Wu Li’s eyes flickered, swallowing hard, torn in his heart, while also waiting for the treant to","tell him what to do.","He couldn’t make the decision on his own.","Strength was one aspect, but experience was another.","“Agree to him!”"]},{"number":5875,"title":"Chapter 5875: Shocking All Sides","paragraphs":["Chapter 5875: Shocking All Sides","Wu Li’s eyes flickered, nodding in agreement.","A smile instantly spread across his face as he approached Jian Wushuang, patting his chest, “We’re on the same side. Even without your words, I would still stand by you!”","Though somewhat insincere, the sentiment was comforting.","In truth, Wu Li deferred to the treant because of his own lack of strength. Even at the Half- Step Sixth Tribulation realm, his divine power could only burst to around eight hundred thousand, a meager amount. This divine power was practically useless outside.","For the upcoming mission to seize the Dragon Balls, he would need the support of the treant.","“Thanks!” Jian Wushuang expressed genuine gratitude this time.","Wu Li had intended to pat him on the shoulder, but thought better of it. His hand hovered awkwardly before patting the air, “It’s nothing!”","“How long do you need me to hold out?” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, already sending a message to Li Sheng.","Seizing the Dragon Balls would happen swiftly, but breaking through required preparation.","The Grand Elder understood the risks involved. He paused before speaking, “I’ve already communicated with Elder Blu. As long as you can hold out for the time it takes an incense stick to burn, Blu will fuse with the Four Great Holy Sons, becoming the strongest warrior in our clan!”","“An incense stick’s worth of time!” Wu Li clenched his teeth but ultimately agreed.","Everything was in place.","“Let’s begin then!” Jian Wushuang immediately activated the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, placing a hand on Wu Li’s shoulder. He then turned to the Grand Elder, “Please teleport me out.”","“I’m going too!” Danbao spoke up at this moment.","Jian Wushuang had initially wanted to object, but considering Danbao’s ability to quickly restore their divine power, he saw her as an asset.","He wouldn’t be able to help others regain their divine power later, especially when facing Gula.","Seizing the Dragon Balls would undoubtedly provoke Gula’s wrath.","Speed was crucial.","Time was running out for him.","Outside forces would undoubtedly take notice of him soon.","In fact, it was much like what Wu Li had mentioned.","The entire Ancient Wood Holy Land was in chaos now.","Dozens of scattered experts at the Seventh Tribulation Realm had already entered negotiations with the Ancient Wood Sect.","It was termed negotiations, but in reality, it was coercion.","They demanded that the Ancient Wood Sect transport them to the Infinite Great World.","Things had escalated to this point.","Even with the personal arrival of the Divine Wood King, it was futile.","However, if these individuals knew that the current Divine Wood King could still unleash peak strength, they might not have dared to cause such a commotion.","“Regardless of anything, the Sacred Assembly has not concluded yet. No one is allowed to enter, that’s the rule set by the Divine Wood King, and no one can break it!”","“Hmph!”","A Seventh Tribulation realm powerhouse from within a hidden realm stepped forward, loudly declaring, “You say we can’t enter, so we can’t? Who knows how many of your own people you’ve sent in!”","Other Seventh Tribulation realm powerhouses also joined in the clamor.","The head of the Ancient Wood Sect was in an unfortunate situation.","The major players were nowhere to be seen, leaving him, a minor figure, to handle everything outside!","Although he held the position of sect head, he only managed trivial matters.","The real important affairs were managed by those supreme elders.","And there was also the Divine Wood King.","Now, these people had disappeared without a trace.","Leaving him to fend off all by himself.","“These old folks!”","The madness of the scattered experts.","The silence of the Universe Master.","Tonghe Sword Immortal and Shi Kingdom sat together, but now, apart from Li Xing, all the","Shi Kingdom experts had gone to find the head of the Ancient Wood Sect.","Even the Patriarch of the Yue Kingdom took the lead.","He was the son-in-law of the Yue Kingdom, after all.","Outwardly, he stood for justice.","“Aren’t you going to join the fun, Elder Li?” Tonghe Sword Immortal looked at Li Xing, surprised that he hadn’t gone. Though Li Xing’s vitality was still vigorous, it was wise to plan","ahead.","Li Xing grasped the pendant in his hand, smiling, “I prefer being passive. Being too proactive","isn’t good!”","Of course, it also depended on who he was being proactive with.","They were well aware of Jian Wushuang’s potential.","Things weren’t as simple as they appeared.","There would definitely be Eighth Tribulation realm figures involved.","This wasn’t the time to be impatient.","In the sacred grounds of the Ancient Wood Sect, four out of the ten Seventh Tribulation realm experts under Babidi’s command had arrived.","“It’s quite something,” remarked one of the four, all of whom recognized Jian Wushuang.","Now, it all depended on Emperor Babidi’s intentions.","Within the chaotic void streams, the cosmic boat drifted aimlessly.","Inside the cabin, Babidi had long received the news.","He had already surrounded Jian Wushuang’s clone with his men.","However, Jian Wushuang’s clone was currently devoid of any consciousness, as if completely","severed.","“Lord Babidi, why don’t we just head straight to the Ancient Wood Sect and capture his true body?” suggested Dylan, his gaze ice-cold as he stared at Jian Wushuang.","The others, due to Babidi’s secret technique, no longer thirsted as much for the power of Life.","Moreover, they had learned that Jian Wushuang’s Life force had not fluctuated much.","Babidi’s claw scratched his chin, clearly pondering something.","Compared to Jian Wushuang, his plans were more crucial.","The reason he valued Jian Wushuang was because of Mie Sheng.","Only Life could defeat Mie Sheng.","If he wanted to use Jian Wushuang to defeat Mie Sheng, he had to first control Jian Wushuang.","Unfortunately, he was somewhat losing control now.","He had considered the Holy Land of the Ancient Wood Sect.","There was also that Wanliu Tree, containing something even he couldn’t fathom.","But inside was a key artifact related to resurrection secrets.","Resurrection!","That was Babidi’s alias for the secret technique.","It was also his grandest plan.","Babidi had experienced much in the Starry Sky, understanding that this world had gods.","Only those gods could stand above all.","The Tribulation Realm was but a joke.","Even the Ninth Tribulation could fall.","Babidi aimed to use the Nine Tribulations of the nine great spacetimes to achieve his path to","godhood.","This plan was even crazier than Mie Sheng’s.","But now he had the capital for it.","“Chi Jiuxiao, it’s time for you to move!” Babidi raised his eyelids, revealing his swirling eyes,","gleaming with cold light.","The Ancient Wood Sect!","Soon it became the core of the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime.","And all of this was because of Jian Wushuang’s exposed Life force.","In the Infinite Great World.","Jian Wushuang and his group had already begun their actions.","At the same time, above the Infinite Great World, in the core of the formation array, dozens of","super experts were jointly destroying the core of the formation array.","The formation array was established by the Ancient Wood Sect.","Now they were dismantling it themselves.","It just took a bit of time.","To enter the Infinite Great World, it would still take at least a day.","As long as they could hold off those Seventh Tribulation realm existences outside, they would","be able to gain control of Jian Wushuang first.","“Who set up this formation array back then?” asked an elder wearing a green high hat.","The crowd paused for a moment, then explained, “It was set up by the Seventh Elder!”","“Old Seven!” The elder in the high hat fell silent for a moment, then continued to destroy the core of the formation array."]},{"number":5876,"title":"Chapter 5876: I Must Win This Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 5876: I Must Win This Time","The elderly man with the high crown was none other than the founder of the Ancient Wood Continent.","In the beginning, the Ancient Wood Continent was still a wilderness, but he led the Eight Star Sect and the Ancient Wood Faction to open up a vast territory.","He was also the most powerful figure in the Ancient Wood Continent.","“Hmph, this time I will definitely capture you!” The Divine Wood King treaded the void, gazing greedily at the core area of the wilderness, where the Ten Thousand Willows stood.","The power of primordial life emerged once again.","In the eyes of the Divine Wood King, it was definitely related to the Ten Thousand Willows. Capturing Jian Wushuang was equivalent to unlocking the Ten Thousand Willows.","Countless powerful beings observed and speculated.","But Jian Wushuang was completely unaware.","Although he was mentally prepared.","But this time, the opponent he was about to face.","Was unprecedentedly powerful.","On the peak of Dragon God Mountain.","Jian Wushuang stood side by side with Wu Li.","“This time, I must win!” He clenched his fists.","Coming to the Ancient Moon Spacetime, he aimed to become a Tribulation Realm expert and master the universe.","He had to win.","Wu Li took a deep breath, but the divine power on his body began to change. That terrifying divine power did not belong to him, but was controlled by the treant within his divine body.","“Although I shouldn’t ask, I still want to say, even if you go through five Tribulations at once, but there is no universe here, you can’t just create one again, can you?”","For ordinary people, this was indeed a big problem.","The original universes gestating in spacetime all had their quantities.","But now, there were no original universes left.","They could only refine the universe themselves.","This would take a very long time.","There was no time for that now.","Jian Wushuang had already exposed a lot this time, so he might as well not conceal anything anymore. He turned to Wu Li and explained, “I have a way. In a short time, I can condense my own primordial universe and rapidly increase my divine power. As long as I successfully break through, I can reach the Tribulation Realm in half a day!”","He was brimming with confidence.","Wu Li didn’t say anything more. He directly unleashed the divine power infused into him by the treant, causing his aura to surge.","“Move!”","With a splash, the two of them disappeared in an instant.","When they reappeared, Wu Li was standing in front of Gula, wielding a sword in one hand.","Transformed, Gula’s divine power soared to 1.3 million.","The Empress lay severely injured on the ground, her life hanging by a thread.","Elder Blu and the four Holy Sons, joining forces, couldn’t withstand a single punch from Gula. Despair crept over them.","But unexpectedly, someone dared to descend from the peak at this moment.","“Hurry, get out of here!” Elder Blu’s urgency was palpable.","This wasn’t part of the Elder’s original plan at all.","Originally, the Elder’s plan was for them to hold out. If victory seemed possible, that would naturally be the best outcome.","If victory was impossible, then they would have to rely on Jian Wushuang to escape with Danbao.","But now, it seemed they had already lost.","Wu Li’s face was ashen, but a faint smile appeared on his lips as he spoke, “The outcome is still uncertain; we still have hope!”","“You won’t last even the time it takes to burn an incense stick!” Elder Blu shook his head.","The Elder had just communicated to him, urging them to proceed with the final fusion. But Elder Blu needed too much time.","Unless Gula just stood there waiting for him, it would be impossible to successfully fuse.","He couldn’t rely on Wu Li alone!","After Wu Li’s breakthrough, his divine power exceeded 800,000, reaching the strength of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","But compared to Gula...","It was like a drop in the ocean.","A mantis trying to stop a chariot, overestimating its own strength.","“Let me show you my true strength!” Wu Li’s voice dropped as his divine power surged once","more.","His face contorted in discomfort.","This was the strain on his divine body.","The accumulation of that violent divine power was too much.","It wasn’t even his own divine power, and now, using it, the backlash against him was","immense.","But the treant had told him, as long as there was a breath left, whether it was Danbao or Jian Wushuang, they could restore him to his peak.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t be fighting so desperately.","Even Gula was taken aback by the person before him. Initially unconcerned, he began to feel unsettled as he sensed Wu Li’s divine power skyrocketing to a million in an instant.","“You guys are really troublesome!” Gula frowned and immediately charged towards Wu Li.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang, hidden in the void, took action.","He swiftly arrived by Li Sheng’s side.","“Sorry about this!” Jian Wushuang smirked evilly, then with a single wave of his hand, he directly took away the four Dragon Balls beside Li Sheng.","Li Sheng gritted his teeth but ultimately didn’t make a move, just watched as Jian Wushuang took the Dragon Balls and left.","Gula, who had just charged halfway, sensed a strong fluctuation of energy behind him and knew something was wrong.","Seeing the disappearance of the Dragon Balls beside Li Sheng, he flew into a complete rage.","Jian Wushuang, hidden in the void, was shaken out by that surge of energy.","“You insignificant ant, I’ll kill you first!” Gula’s divine power continued to surge as he leaped forward towards Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang immediately shouted towards the mountaintop, “It’s now!”","Swish!","Boom!","Gula’s fist struck a remnant shadow, while Jian Wushuang had already left.","Before he could react, Wu Li rushed over.","“Three-foot Wooden Sword, capable of cutting through the heavens!”","The wooden sword swept from the depths of the void, piercing through space, causing the","entire Infinite Great World to tremble.","At this moment, Wu Li’s divine power soared to 1.3 million.","Gula was stunned, quickly trying to deflect with his hands, but as soon as his hands touched","the blade, his divine power began to decline continuously.","The void shattered, space was pierced.","The power of this sword was not something Gula could intercept.","Wu Li struck again, several swords slashing out, and the divine power he consumed was","continuously restored by the treant.","He was the only opponent that made Gula feel pressured, something that had never happened","before.","Far away, Elder Blu and the others had already begun to merge.","Feeling Wu Li’s aura, they were also deeply shocked.","This time!","They might really win.","And they might not even need Jian Wushuang to win.","The Grand Elder also paid attention to this battle.","Equally incredulous.","He couldn’t see through Jian Wushuang.","Nor could he see through Wu Li.","In his view, Wu Li’s potential was not that strong.","Perhaps in this lifetime, he wouldn’t surpass the Fifth Tribulation realm.","But under the current outbreak, Wu Li’s future had already begun to change.","The Fifth Tribulations realm had turned from a peak to a starting point for Wu Li.","This was the current change in Wu Li.","Swish!","The space trembled as Jian Wushuang, carrying the four Dragon Balls, arrived in front of the","Grand Elder.","“Let’s begin!” He placed the Dragon Balls down, merging them with the five Dragon Balls","beside the Grand Elder.","Nine Dragon Balls were assembled.","Before starting, the Grand Elder took a final look at the situation outside and reminded, “Don’t feel pressured, this time Wu Li and Blu might be able to handle Gula!”","“That’s for the best!” Jian Wushuang nodded.","He hoped Wu Li and Blu would succeed.","Then he wouldn’t have much to worry about.","Buzz!","The Grand Elder didn’t say anything more, directly channeling his own Thought power into","the Dragon Balls, bursting out with a powerful aura that shattered the house and flew into the","sky.","The rules of heaven and earth were instantly cut off.","The outside world could no longer see what was happening here."]},{"number":5877,"title":"Chapter 5877: Breaking through to the Tribulation Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 5877: Breaking through to the Tribulation Realm","Jian Wushuang found himself involuntarily floating up.","His divine power and Origin Source began to surge continuously.","Without the constraints of supreme rules, he had no limits to his realm.","He could cultivate madly.","“Tribulation!” Jian Wushuang looked up at the sky and then said solemnly, “As long as I intercept the Law Rules immediately, I must bear this Tribulation.”","Originally, according to Elder Blu’s plan, he didn’t need to deal with the first difficulty of the Tribulation realm. But now, he felt it unnecessary.","The clouds gathering in the sky shattered and condensed, brewing an extremely dangerous Tribulation.","The gods like the Divine Wood King, who were destroying the core of the Infinite Great World, were stunned.","Suddenly, they found they couldn’t break the formation.","The entire Infinite Great World was isolated from the outside world.","“It’s that old guy!”","Divine Wood’s expression was difficult.","He thought of Elder Kinew of the Polunga Clan.","The Infinite Great World was the most special among the worlds suppressed by the Ancient Wood Sect.","The reason for choosing the Infinite Great World for the Sacred Assembly was actually another conspiracy.","Otherwise, they wouldn’t have let Gula cause chaos.","They would have dealt with Gula long ago.","Although the Scattered Tribulation powerhouses couldn’t come in, it didn’t matter if they destroyed the formation for so many Universe Masters.","The Ancient Wood Sect had hidden motives, so they didn’t go to rescue.","Instead, they added fuel to the fire.","Their goal was not the cultivators but Gula!","If someone could really defeat Gula, that would be fine.","The real goal was the nine Dragon Balls to open a treasure land.","That treasure land was related to Wanliu.","It was all a trap from the beginning, interconnected.","Anyone could take the position of the Holy Maiden, but the opportunity Wanliu had to open was only once.","As for why they didn’t gather the Dragon Balls themselves, it was related to the oath within the Dragon Balls.","The Dragon God made a vow in the beginning.","Only the elder of the Polunga Clan could unlock it.","Gula was just a decoy.","What they wanted was for the Polunga Clan’s elder to personally unlock the nine Dragon Balls. Regardless of the purpose.","It would still lead to some treasure trove.","Only the appearance of Jian Wushuang disrupted the Ancient Wood Sect’s plans.","Now, it could be considered a double blessing.","In the eyes of the Divine Wood King, both benefits were related to Wanliu.","Now, he was sure to obtain it.","Isolated from the supreme Law Rules.","That meant the Dragon Balls were working.","Unfortunately, they had not yet entered the Infinite Great World.","This unsettled the Divine Wood King somewhat.","He felt a threat slowly approaching.","This threat, he thought, was in the Infinite Great World.","But that was not the case.","This threat came from Babidi.","It arrived at just the right time.","Perfectly delaying Jian Wushuang. The deviation of fate had arrived.","Dragon God Mountain.","Jian Wushuang hovered in the air, facing the first challenge.","This was the difficulty of breaking through the Tribulation Realm.","It was also a Tribulation!","“Do you really not need to intervene?” The elder below hesitated, feeling it was not the time to show heroism.","He felt Jian Wushuang didn’t need to confront it head-on at all.","Facing this challenge, Jian Wushuang’s expression remained calm, feeling no threat, and said calmly, “I must take on this challenge, or else I won’t be able to grasp time.”","“Time!”","The elder was stunned.","Although he didn’t understand, he knew it was related to Jian Wushuang’s breakthrough in","strength.","And that was enough.","Jian Wushuang looked up at the gathering clouds in the sky.","His eyes like ripples, gazing past, the clouds dispersed.","In their place descended a grand light.","Directly enveloping him.","The Law Rules of time also descended rapidly.","This challenge for Jian Wushuang was as simple as drinking water.","The clouds in the sky disappeared.","The isolated supreme Law Rules descended once again.","The outside world could once again see the situation below.","The Divine Wood King and others happened to see Jian Wushuang in the sky.","“This kid, attempting to break through the Tribulation Realm?”","“He must be out of his mind. Doesn’t he fear Gula’s interference by now?”","Divine Wood King first glanced at Elder Blu of the Polunga Clan, then turned his gaze to Gula, speaking, “Gula has been intercepted. Investigate whether this Wu Li is related to Hengmu.”","The surprises kept piling up.","The Everwood, seemingly entangled in this conflict.","The treasures obtained from the Everwood back then had rekindled his ambitions.","And he gained the confidence to confront the nine-star sect and the Ancient Moon Sect anew.","A real man wouldn’t bow down to anyone.","In the Holy Land of Ancient Wood, those Seventh Tribulation realm powerhouses still causing trouble were already planning a strong assault.","They were now just waiting for a powerhouse of the Eighth Tribulation realm to lead them. The Eighth Tribulation realm ancestor of the Shi Kingdom would soon descend. Meanwhile, Scattered Tribulation powerhouses from various major forces were also rushing","over.","The Ancient Wood Sect wouldn’t be able to deceive them anymore when they arrived.","While waiting, they also kept a close eye on Jian Wushuang.","After a brief pause, seeing Jian Wushuang attempting to break through the Tribulation Realm","again, they were all stunned.","Apparently, these people couldn’t understand Jian Wushuang’s actions?","“Does this kid think that becoming a Tribulation Realm expert can defeat Gula?”","“These geniuses always think they can match everything. Just wait, he’ll soon despair!”","These Seventh Tribulation realm big shots each had divine powers exceeding 1 million.","They didn’t even bother to consider Jian Wushuang.","Although they had previously seen Jian Wushuang explosively release 800,000 divine power in an instant, they believed that power didn’t belong to Jian Wushuang.","Otherwise, why would he need to gather energy in advance, with a time limit?","Even if he broke through to the Tribulation Realm, so what?","They didn’t believe Jian Wushuang could boost his divine power to a million in such a short","time.","Not to mention how many treasures he would need.","Just talking about this time, it was already too late.","Behind these people, Lian Xing kept an eye on Jian Wushuang breaking through the","Tribulation Realm, whispering, “Kid, you have too many secrets on you. I hope you can","survive this crisis.”","Unlike other scattered powerhouses, although Lian Xing had known Jian Wushuang for a short","time, he understood Jian Wushuang’s strength the most.","Brilliant time and time again.","Jian Wushuang was like the brightest star in the night sky.","Perhaps he would become a shooting star.","Maybe he would become the eternal sun and moon!","Regardless, he still believed in Jian Wushuang.","He didn’t take action against Jian Wushuang just because of the power of Life.","If he needed this Life force, he only needed to say a word, and someone would provide it.","If Jian Wushuang could survive this crisis.","The same goes for him.","If he needed it, Jian Wushuang would also provide it.","So, there was no need to wade into this muddy water.","Just watch.","Maybe Jian Wushuang would once again amaze everyone.","Jian Wushuang, who was breaking through the Tribulation Realm, wasn’t thinking about","these things.","He was fully immersed in the rules of time.","Becoming one with time.","At the same time, he left the imprint of the supreme Law Rules on his body.","The Great Dao of Time had already taken shape.","He had already stepped into it.","In the Moro Spacetime, or the spacetime of the original universe.","He was already in the Tribulation Realm.","It’s just that he was in the Ancient Moon Spacetime now."]},{"number":5878,"title":"Chapter 5878: Tribulation","paragraphs":["Chapter 5878: Tribulation","They didn’t realize anything unusual about the Emperor.","It seemed like the only change was a slight increase in the limits of their Origin Source and","divine power.","The Tribulation Realm was straightforward; the most crucial aspect remained the","condensation of the universe.","“One Thought Universe!”","Buzz!","This time, the universe directly enveloped the entire Infinite Great World.","The magnitude of this movement silenced even the Scattered Tribulation experts outside.","“He’s become the Universe Master directly?”","“It’s impossible. Condensing the universe isn’t that easy. Even if he transcended three Tribulations at once, condensing the universe without experiencing any Tribulations, this is different from the rules of Ancient Moon Spacetime!”","The head of the Ancient Wood Sect also watched Jian Wushuang’s breakthrough.","At this moment, he loudly reminded everyone, “Perhaps Jian Wushuang isn’t a practitioner of Ancient Moon Spacetime at all!”","This statement awakened everyone.","“You must have investigated his background. But I’ve checked the reversal of time. Jian Wushuang is a reincarnated individual, yet he has never mentioned memories of his past life. Moreover, in all of Ancient Moon Spacetime, there probably isn’t another Emperor who has reached his level.”","The Emperor’s divine power reached hundreds of thousands, whether from the river of history or the contemporary Ancient Moon Sect.","None could rival Jian Wushuang.","After the head of the Ancient Wood Sect spoke, it indeed seemed to be the case.","They speculated that Jian Wushuang might come from one of the other eight major spacetimes.","Among the nine major spacetimes, Ancient Moon Spacetime was the weakest.","The Emperors here couldn’t compare.","In other spacetimes, there might be figures like Jian Wushuang.","An Emperor who could rival the Fifth Tribulation realm.","Some even suspected Jian Wushuang came from the Starry Sky.","The more they guessed, the more elaborate the theories became.","They all felt Jian Wushuang’s identity was not simple.","If they didn’t act now, perhaps some important figure would come and take Jian Wushuang away.","Treating reincarnation as an ordeal was truly a challenge to the imagination of these experts. The more they speculated, the more extravagant their ideas became.","They never imagined that such a reversal of Law Rules Emperor like Jian Wushuang could appear downstream.","Within the boundless world.","The universe of One Thought expanded completely.","It continued to expand.","Until it enveloped the entire Infinite Great World within it.","Its diameter was much larger than the Origin Source Universe of a Sixth Tribulation Universe Master.","So the outsiders, the strong ones, were so shocked.","This was also why he would do so after using the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Otherwise, his universe would have been at the complete level, the same size as a Fifth Tribulation Universe Master.","But after using the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, it was different.","The Super Eternal Ancient Transformation was initially meant to amplify the Origin Source. It’s just that his divine power was elevated to a higher limit because of the blood-colored","aura.","During the Emperor period, his divine power surpassed the Origin Source’s strength.","So he always calculated his own strength based on divine power.","But it was different when he became the Universe Master.","This time, his Origin Source would completely surpass divine power.","And with the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, the amplification of the Origin Source could reach a hundredfold.","Amplifying divine power was only fiftyfold.","“The first tribulation!”","His aura shook, and at this moment, his Origin Source was already at the peak of the Fifth Tribulation realm.","This was even before crossing the Tribulation.","The highest Law Rule’s Tribulation fell directly into the universe.","But it was like a drop of water falling into the cosmic sea.","Insignificant!","The strong ones who were watching him were quite normal at this time.","They were not surprised this time.","They felt that Jian Wushuang would have no problem even crossing the five Tribulations.","This was only the first Tribulation.","But when they waited for the first Tribulation to pass, the increase in Jian Wushuang’s Origin","Source stunned everyone.","Jian Wushuang himself couldn’t help trembling.","That violent power kept surging and rising.","“Ah!!!!”","He roared with his head raised high, and the One Thought Universe once again became more","tangible.","The Origin Source continued to expand.","Unfortunately, this space was limited. Otherwise, his Origin Source Universe could have","expanded further.","After the baptism of the supreme Law Rules, the number of black holes in the Origin Source Universe surged again.","Every Tribulation strengthened the Origin Source.","The Tribulation for his divine body was as easy as scratching an itch, causing no harm but rather boosting his fundamental divine power, making him quite comfortable.","His fundamental divine power reached 450,000, an increase of 50,000 from before. It was","already quite impressive.","“Second Tribulation!”","Jian Wushuang focused all his thoughts on his Origin Source Universe, paying little attention","to the Tribulation, which posed no significant threat, similar to the first one.","He passed through it effortlessly.","The Origin Source Universe became slightly more real once again, and the number of black","holes multiplied.","“It seems that the perfection of the universe as I perceived it when I was Emperor is different","after the tribulation.”","He initially thought his Origin Source Universe wouldn’t change anymore, but it continued to expand and strengthen.","Now it had doubled in size, with a whopping twenty thousand black holes.","“Third Tribulation!”","This time, his universe would become a true one, marking his attainment of the title of","Universe Master.","He was incredibly excited.","Coming to the Ancient Moon Spacetime was all for the sake of becoming the Universe Master,","and now he was about to achieve that goal.","He was more excited than anyone else.","“Come forth!”","“Witness it with me!”","He raised his hand, welcoming the third Tribulation.","Although the external observers were making a lot of noise, some even ridiculing Jian","Wushuang, saying that even if he became the Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation, he would still be besieged and robbed by a group of powerful beings, deep down they envied him","greatly.","Why was Jian Wushuang so powerful?","Initially, they saw him as a senior to juniors, but seeing Jian Wushuang continuously growing stronger, they began to feel jealous as he approached them.","They lamented their own fate of being stuck at the Scattered Tribulation level without the chance for advancement, yet they witnessed Jian Wushuang’s steady progress.","“The third Tribulation has begun. As long as he summons the condensed universe into reality,","this lad will be the Universe Master!”","“Damn, he’s really lucky! How could he have condensed such a perfect universe ahead of","time? He’s hit the jackpot!”","“Hmph, still just a shooting star!”","Many people continued to mock him, oblivious to the fact that within Jian Wushuang’s Origin","Source Universe stood a truly super existence capable of ending the nine great spacetimes.","Origin Source Universe.","Tianqing Mountain!","Weiss stood in front of his manor, holding a scepter in one hand and the other behind his","back, watching Jian Wushuang’s Tribulation.","“Hmm, it’s not so easy to pull back such a large universe into reality!” Weiss chuckled lightly.","Buzz!","The third Tribulation descended.","Jian Wushuang thought there might be some difference, but when it fell upon him, he felt no","change at all.","“What’s this?”","The Origin Source Universe began to shake, but ultimately, it merely doubled the number of black holes in the universe to around 50,000.","His fundamental divine power also increased to 600,000, but this wasn’t the crucial point.","The crucial point was that his universe hadn’t become real!","“How is this possible?”","Jian Wushuang panicked immediately.","The external experts, first surprised, then began to evaluate with gestures and comments."]},{"number":5879,"title":"Chapter 5879: Fortunately, I Have You","paragraphs":["Chapter 5879: Fortunately, I Have You","“Ha-ha, I knew it. He’s defying the heavens so much that even the heavens want to claim him. Now, isn’t this a surprise!”","“Hmph, the universe can’t coalesce into reality; it’s just a bubble!”","A senior at the Seventh Tribulation realm looked rather pleased, with a touch of sarcasm. “But you can’t put it that way. Jian Wushuang is still the first emperor in the entire river of time and space. Even if he can’t become the master of the universe, becoming a Scattered Tribulation realm is still a good choice. He possesses the innate power of Life, which can sustain his peak state indefinitely.”","“So, does that mean he’s become a Special Life Form?”","“No, no, Special Life Form don’t need to undergo tribulations!”","“Haha-”","Within the Infinite Great World, however, Jian Wushuang felt a chill in his heart.","The elder of the Polunga Clan found it hard to believe as well.","Although he didn’t know much about the master of the universe, he still had some common","sense.","Seeing Jian Wushuang undergo three tribulations but fail to turn the universe into reality... He understood that it might be a failure.","At the foot of Dragon God Mountain, Gula hadn’t yet noticed what had happened on the mountain.","He only felt as if the Infinite Great World had changed its colors a bit, but he didn’t sense anything particularly unusual.","Instead, he felt excited about his battle with Wu Li.","However, Wu Li’s divine power was steadily declining.","“Blu, it’s been the time for an incense stick, and you still haven’t integrated properly?”","Wu Li couldn’t hold on any longer.","The divine power given to him by the treant had plummeted to 1.2 million. He was no longer a match for Gula but still had to hold him off to prevent him from causing trouble for Blu.","The fusion on Blu’s side had reached a critical moment.","Without answering Wu Li, Blu just stared at him firmly.","“I’ll give you ten breaths!” Wu Li endured the backlash and forcefully increased his divine power again.","The treant kept injecting divine power as well, or else Wu Li would have been finished long ago.","The injected divine power was completely different from his own triggered divine power.","It was no longer distinguishable as innate or acquired.","It was like a dry well being flooded with the waters of a river.","How could he not feel uncomfortable?","His divine body was almost ruined by the treant.","“You can still increase?” Gula noticed that Wu Li’s divine power had risen again by another level, feeling somewhat surprised. It had risen back to 1.3 million this time.","He no longer found it amusing but rather harbored some fear towards Wu Li.","With a single hand gathering energy, a beam of light burst out, and his figure followed the light, rushing towards Wu Li.","He suddenly wanted to end the battle quickly because Blu was still in the process of fusion. If something unexpected happened and these people turned the tables, it wouldn’t be good.","Though the waves surged before him, once Gula made up his mind, he was determined that the person he wanted to defeat must die!","Wu Li was caught off guard by the sudden attack.","He hastily wielded his sword to cut through the light waves condensed with divine power.","But by the time Gula reached him, his hand was already in front of Wu Li, and the condensed light waves struck Wu Li’s face at close range.","Boom!","Wu Li’s body was sent rapidly backwards by the impact.","The divine power he had just gathered began to waver once again.","Meanwhile, Gula’s divine power kept rising steadily.","It had already reached 1.35 million.","Now Wu Li fully understood Jian Wushuang’s words.","The transformation of the Frost Demon Clan after transformation was indeed remarkable.","As Wu Li’s figure retreated, Gula appeared in front of him in advance, directly blocking his body that was being pushed back with a punch.","This punch directly caused cracks to appear in Wu Li’s divine body.","The gathered divine power began to rapidly diminish.","“I will make you die in nine breaths, and you won’t even last until the tenth!” Gula sneered, his arm directly gripping Wu Li’s neck while his other hand continued to pound Wu Li’s back.","Wu Li couldn’t even cough up blood.","A hole was gouged out of his chest.","While his physical body was fine and could quickly recover even with a hole, if his divine body","had a hole, it would be over.","It was like someone sealing his dried-up well.","The divine power began to decrease directly.","It couldn’t even be maintained at a million anymore.","“It’s over!” Wu Li whispered to himself.","Even the treant was panicking at this moment.","“They hadn’t expected things to escalate to this level.","“We can only use that move!” The treant’s voice echoed in Wu Li’s mind.","Wu Li gritted his teeth, knowing that there was no other choice now.","If he didn’t use that move, he would die.","The loss would only be a treasure.","If he hesitated, he would lose two lives.","One body, two lives!","If they were finished, Elder Blu would also be finished, and Dragon God Mountain would","disappear.","Jian Wushuang?","Thinking of Jian Wushuang, Wu Li hesitated for a moment.","It had been such a long time, he felt Jian Wushuang should be close to a breakthrough.","“Let’s do it!”","The aura on Wu Li’s body instantly transformed, and a phantom descended from the sky.","Flakes of willow leaves drifted, divine power boundless!","Hum!","A sound of the resonance of heaven and earth rang out.","Shaking the entire Infinite Great World.","“Gula, let this frog at the bottom of the well see the true terror of this world!”","After Wu Li finished speaking, his figure quickly rose.","But there was a sapling left behind in the spot where he originally stood.","That sapling was growing continuously.","A surge of life force was also erupting.","That was the life force released by the treant.","Causing that sapling to continuously grow.","A single blade of grass.","It could cut through the sun, moon, and stars, and it could also give birth to the universe.","Buzz!","In the blink of an eye, the sapling transformed into a towering giant tree.","Within a breath’s time, he reached the realm of Tribulation.","Within three breaths, his divine power surpassed a million.","That terrifying divine power continued to surge.","“What is this?” Gula didn’t dare to be careless, hastily retreating.","But it was as if he had entered a maze, unable to escape the encirclement of the willow fluff.","The giant willow grew.","Divine power gathered to 1.4 million.","Countless willow fluffs began to envelop Gula.","Gula also felt the terrifying divine power.","“I must not!”","A 1.4 million divine power, enough to severely injure him.","He couldn’t afford to confront it head-on.","Despite his speed, he couldn’t break free from the restraint.","The sapling grew into a giant willow, merging with the illusion. After completely binding Gula, it emitted a world-shaking sound. Boom! The entire Dragon God Great World turned into ruins.","The Dragon God Mountain only had its peak remaining.","Below was a bottomless pit.","Gula’s figure also vanished.","“Huff, huff!” Wu Li gasped for breath, devoid of any strength.","Once his breath steadied, Danbao hurried towards Wu Li.","Seeing Danbao approaching, Wu Li smiled and spoke, “Thank goodness for you, otherwise, I","would have suffered a huge loss this time!”","He patted Danbao’s round head and chuckled.","Danbao’s hand could only reach Wu Li’s knee, so he grabbed Wu Li’s thigh to start healing his","injuries."]},{"number":5880,"title":"Chapter 5880: I Can Win","paragraphs":["Chapter 5880: I Can Win","A warm current flowed in.","Not only was Wu Li restored, but the treant also sensed a familiar aura. When he looked towards the alchemy treasure, there was a hint of greed in his eyes.","At that moment, Danbao’s expression froze. Suddenly, he felt as if someone’s eyes were fixed on him, and those eyes exuded a terrifying aura.","“Ah!” Danbao was startled and stepped back, pointing at Wu Li.","Wu Li, however, was puzzled. He didn’t know what the treant was thinking, nor why Danbao was retreating. And judging from Danbao’s pale face, he must have seen something.","Just as Wu Li was about to turn around to look, a beam of light pierced through his chest at lightning speed.","The beam of light, following through Wu Li’s chest, rushed towards Danbao.","At that moment, Blu completely transformed into a super warrior of the Polunga Clan.","With a flick of his toe, he appeared directly in front of Danbao and forcefully blocked the beam of light with a raised hand, deflecting it away.","As Wu Li slowly turned around, his figure descending, he saw the figure behind him.","“Gula!”","The opponent was still alive.","But he also had some injuries.","His tail was severed.","Standing on the only peak, Gula pointed at the falling Wu Li with resentment. “Damn humans, I’ll kill you all!”","Once again, several beams of light burst from his fingertips, rushing towards Wu Li.","However, Blu had no intention of watching.","With another flash of his figure, he rescued the falling Wu Li, and casually deflected Gula’s attacks with a raised hand.","“Take him back to the mountain, leave this to me!” Blu glanced sideways at Gula, then handed the unconscious Wu Li to Danbao.","Wu Li, now awake, was out of breath.","He was barely holding on.","One slight mistake could lead to his demise.","Even after being restored, he still needed to go to the peak of the Dragon God Mountain within the barrier.","Danbao supported Wu Li’s massive body and reminded, “Elder Blu, be careful!”","“Got it!” Blu nodded, then added another instruction.","“Tell the Grand Elder not to make any unnecessary sacrifices. I can win this battle!”","Blu’s voice was full of vigor, showing absolute confidence.","Danbao nodded without saying much, and returned to the peak of the Dragon God Mountain through the barrier.","Upon returning, he found Jian Wushuang sitting desolately on a fallen piece of rubble.","The Grand Elder stood by, also looking forlorn.","“What happened?” Danbao gently placed Wu Li down and looked at Jian Wushuang.","Seeing Jian Wushuang not responding, he looked at the Grand Elder.","The Grand Elder gestured not to speak, pointing at Wu Li, indicating that he should first heal Wu Li’s injuries.","He approached Jian Wushuang, saying, “Perhaps some things are just as destined by heaven.” “But I don’t believe that!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","The Elder of the Polunga Clan, however, revealed a wise look and continued, “Do you believe then, that there are gods in this world?”","This question woke Jian Wushuang up.","He still had Weiss!","After crossing three tribulations, he couldn’t grasp the universe.","He could ask Weiss about this.","“I believe!” He seemed to regain his confidence and stood up directly.","The Elder chuckled, “The Dragon God, he was a god. He once told me that if I fell, the Polunga Clan would perish, but I didn’t believe it!”","At the end of his words, he awkwardly froze, not knowing how to explain to the other party. After a moment of thought, he patted the Elder’s shoulder and reminded him, “Actually, you don’t have to die. You don’t need to stimulate your potential now, and if you really don’t want to live, you might as well merge with Blu. This way, you won’t die, and Blu will become stronger!”","“Merge!”","One sentence awakened the dreamer!","This time it was the Elder’s turn to contemplate life.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t have this leisurely time; he leaped to his own universe of thought. Tianqing Mountain.","Summit.","“Weiss!”","“You’re just thinking of me now? It seems I don’t have much of a place in your heart!” Weiss chuckled, covering his mouth.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t have time to joke with him. He hurriedly asked, “I’m already at the Third Tribulation realm, but I can’t grasp the universe. Where did I go wrong?”","“It’s simple!” To let Jian Wushuang know how powerful he was, Weiss revealed a little.","With a wave of his staff, a miniature Starry Sky condensed.","Jian Wushuang was startled.","“Simply put, you were too hasty, eager to perfect the universe. But such a perfected universe is just wishful thinking, not the true universe, which prevented you from understanding the essence of the universe!”","Weiss pointed at the evolving universe in the Starry Sky and continued, “But you’re lucky. Being able to draw a perfect universe on a piece of paper has actually helped you now!”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Now he couldn’t even condense a real universe, so how could this be considered helping him?","Was he supposed to use the One Thought Universe from now on?","Turning a piece of paper into a Dao Arena.","That would become the joke of the entire spacetime.","He couldn’t afford to lose face like that.","And he couldn’t let Teacher Xuan Yi lose face either.","In this state, he was going to see Master Xuan Yi.","Wasn’t that embarrassing himself!","“Since you can’t grasp the universe at the Third Tribulation, then go through a few more Tribulations. When your strength is a bit stronger, you’ll be able to grasp the universe when it","matches your original universe!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered with surprise. “Cross more tribulations?”","But now he couldn’t sense the supreme rules anymore. How could he cross the tribulations","then?","Immediately, he voiced his dilemma. Upon hearing this, Weiss chuckled lightly and said,","“This is even simpler!”","“Simpler?”","Jian Wushuang’s forehead sweated a drop, feeling that Weiss was boasting even more than","him.","If the supreme Law Rules were simple, everyone would have reached the Ninth Tribulation","realm.","How could something like this be simple?","But before he could dwell on this statement, layers of Tribulation clouds condensed once","again in the sky.","This time, he truly believed.","“This is possible?”","He raised his head to glance at the Tribulation clouds in the sky, then looked at Weiss.","Even the supreme Law Rules could be controlled.","This was the true god.","Now, even if Weiss asked him to cross the Ninth Tribulation, he would believe it.","It was too terrifying.","Even the supreme Law Rules could be controlled.","“A true god!”","Jian Wushuang raised his thumb and leaped up, beginning to face the Fourth Tribulation.","Outside, the strong ones noticed the Tribulation clouds condensing once again, all stunned. They couldn’t see Weiss’s existence, so naturally, they had no idea what was happening. They only saw Jian Wushuang, looking desolate, talking with Elder Blu of the Polunga Clan for a few moments, then brimming with confidence.","Returning to his own One Thought Universe, it took only a moment to trigger the Fourth","Tribulation.","But Jian Wushuang hadn’t even grasped the true universe, so how could he start crossing","Tribulations?","Everyone found it hard to believe.","Around the heavenly canopy, not a single Tribulation realm expert spoke.","Just now, they were convinced that Jian Wushuang was finished.","But now, they could only watch him cross the Fourth Tribulation.","At this moment, someone couldn’t accept it and said, “Let’s wait and see. Going against the","supreme Law Rules, the Fourth Tribulation will definitely be extraordinary. Maybe he’ll","perish without a trace.”"]},{"number":5881,"title":"Chapter 5881: No Pressure","paragraphs":["Chapter 5881: No Pressure","“Shut your crow mouth!” Many people glared fiercely.","What good would it do them if Jian Wushuang died?","It’s only if he didn’t die and became a useless Jian Wushuang that it would benefit them.","If Jian Wushuang died, it would be as painful as if their own father had died.","After all, they all relied on Jian Wushuang’s innate Life power.","Even Lian Xing and Sword Immortal Tonghe, became excited when they saw Jian Wushuang preparing to undergo Tribulation again.","“Kid, I knew you could do it!” Lian Xing clenched his fist, his eyes shining with excitement.","Although Tonghe’s relationship with Jian Wushuang was not particularly close, being fellow sword cultivators, they had a bond.","In the blink of an eye, the current Jian Wushuang could already rival him.","The Universe Master at the Half-Step Seventh Tribulation realm, with a divine power of over a million, was almost comparable to Gula before his transformation.","Now, even in his Fourth Tribulation, Jian Wushuang’s basic divine power had reached 700,000.","The Fourth Tribulation passed in an instant.","What remained was the ultimate Tribulation.","Everyone was sweating profusely for him.","They hoped he would successfully overcome it.","Still, many worried that Jian Wushuang might not make it through, fearing their own doom.","The Fourth Tribulation descended with a roar.","It was fundamentally different from the previous three Tribulations.","This time, Jian Wushuang could keenly feel the immense ‘Tribulation’.","It was like a iceberg falling into his universe sea.","Still insignificant!","Jian Wushuang had been somewhat worried originally, but now it seemed manageable.","“The Fourth Tribulation realm!” he clenched his fist, trying to manipulate the Origin Source Universe, but found it somewhat difficult.","This was only the Thought power universe.","As Weiss had said, it was just a piece of paper.","But he couldn’t even manipulate that piece of paper.","Let alone turning it into a real universe.","“Prepare for the Fifth Tribulation!” Weiss looked up at Jian Wushuang and nodded.","The supreme Law Rules operated again, gathering the Fifth Tribulation.","In the external Ancient Wood Holy Land.","“It seems like there’s not much pressure!”","At this point, many people breathed a sigh of relief.","“If he has already passed the Fourth Tribulation and still can’t grasp the real universe, it seems he’s going to face the Fifth Tribulation!”","“As expected, his strength has increased quite rapidly!”","Everyone nodded in agreement.","Fortunately, they were able to deal with Jian Wushuang’s current strength.","Jian Wushuang returned to his normal state, with only 700,000 divine power.","Naturally, those outside experts wouldn’t pay much attention to him.","But when Jian Wushuang unleashed the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, his divine power reached 1.4 million.","This level of power was enough to make ordinary Seventh Tribulation experts wary. At 700,000 basic divine power, Jian Wushuang had not reached his limit.","Even without absorbing any divine treasures, he already had such high basic divine power. Once he swallowed Dong Jun’s bones, his basic divine power would easily surpass a million. Now wasn’t the time for him to calculate his own strength; his goal was the Fifth Tribulation. After passing through this one, he hoped to successfully control the universe.","Buzz!","“Let’s begin!”","His aura suddenly surged.","The Tribulation was the first to arrive.","With 700,000 divine power, facing the Fifth Tribulation wasn’t too difficult.","But the pressure was already mounting.","A Fourth Tribulation expert with 700,000 divine power was comparable to a Fifth Tribulation","expert.","Passing the Fifth Tribulation was normal, but the Sixth Tribulation wouldn’t be easy.","The supreme Tribulation, the fourth one, had caused the black holes in his Origin Source Universe to increase to over 70,000.","This time, it would probably reach 100,000.","The newly emerged tribulation descended from the sky.","Directly converging into his Origin Source Universe.","This time, the feeling it gave him.","Wasn’t like an object falling into the ocean of the universe.","Instead, it felt like a disturbance gathering in the cosmic sea.","Jian Wushuang began to take it seriously.","“This power is actually encroaching!” he was suddenly furious.","Only he had the right to devour others; how dare this force come to devour him.","This force needed to be taught a lesson.","He directly approached the core of the storm.","He could clearly feel the storm absorbing the power within his Origin Source Universe.","With his hands outstretched, if he couldn’t control the power of the entire universe, could he not control these over 70,000 black holes?","Buzz!","The power of over 70,000 black holes converged onto his body.","A hum emanated from Jian Wushuang’s primordial.","His current primordial power was no longer comparable to a Seventh Tribulation expert.","It had reached the level of an Eighth Tribulation expert.","This is because Ancient Moon Spacetime operates primarily on divine power.","If we were to compare it to the previous Moro Spacetime.","The primal source power he possesses now is equivalent to the seventh tribulation realm, no","problem.","The power of seventy thousand black holes erupted with an unprecedented aura.","Directly dispersing the entire storm.","Forcefully dispersing the impending highest tribulation.","Whether it was the powerful observers from the outside world or the elders of Dragon God","Mountain, they were all extremely shocked.","The outside world was even more stirred up.","They could see that Jian Wushuang could even transcend five Tribulations, but they never","expected him to force the fifth highest Tribulation to collapse.","This is the power that destroys the highest rules!","It’s simply unbelievable.","Even Weiss couldn’t help but show a surprised expression, muttering softly to himself, “It","seems I didn’t choose the wrong person, he has the talent for destruction!”","Only Jian Wushuang himself felt that this was quite normal.","It wasn’t a big deal.","The Fifth Tribulation was never something he cared about.","He just wanted to quickly grasp the universe.","After the Fifth Tribulation.","The number of his black holes directly soared to one hundred thousand.","One universe, one hundred thousand black holes.","If ten thousand create a perfect universe, birthing a super universe.","Then a universe condensed from one hundred thousand black holes is the ultimate universe.","It has reached the limit of Law Rule expression.","Perhaps even the god who established the Law Rules couldn’t imagine that future generations","could surpass the Law Rules.","From the beginning, there were 100,000 heavens!","This is a truth understood since his weakness.","Now he has once again confirmed what is the limit and what is surpassing the Law Rules.","Swish!","With a slight raise of his hand, he could effortlessly manipulate the fluctuations of the One","Thought Universe.","The previous One Thought Universe was dead, unable to move at all.","But now, it could move however he pleased.","“Let me see your true appearance!” He condensed the Origin Source, starting to evolve the","One Thought Universe, transforming it into a real universe.","Buzz!","Clang!","Jian Wushuang froze.","“Another failure?”","Would this ever end?","Even at the Fifth Tribulation realm, he couldn’t control his own universe.","He was on the brink of collapse.","The external powerhouses were similarly close to breaking down.","“It’s already the Fifth Tribulation, and this kid still can’t control the universe. Does he have to","wait until the Ninth Tribulation?”","“Gloomy prediction. If it really comes to the ninth Tribulation, we might as well just headbutt","a wall.”","“At the Fifth Tribulation realm, with 800,000 divine power, I still have the upper hand!” Some Seventh Tribulation realm experts consoled themselves.","But some Seventh Tribulation realm experts began to face reality.","Emperor Jian Wushuang could unleash 800,000 divine power.","It didn’t matter where that power came from.","If it could still erupt.","Doubling it now would make it 1.6 million.","The Seventh Tribulation realm experts gathered here were not ordinary people.","Their divine power exceeded 1.5 million, and there were even super experts with over two million divine power."]},{"number":5882,"title":"Chapter 5882: I Can Summon the Ninth Calamity for You","paragraphs":["Chapter 5882: I Can Summon the Ninth Calamity for You","But their divine powers were dead.","Jian Wushuang, however, remained alive.","He continued to grow stronger.","If he was already this powerful without mastering the universe, then mastering it would make him unstoppable.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang frowned, uncertain of what to do next.","He glanced down at Weiss.","Weiss nodded at him, loudly reminding, “As long as you have confidence, I can help you through the ninth tribulation!”","These words sent shivers down his spine, and he hastily waved his hand, “No, no, once is enough!”","He had his limits too.","He could only endure up to the sixth tribulation; he didn’t have the strength to push further.","Enduring five Tribulations at once was his bottom line.","His limit was the Sixth Tribulation.","“Then let’s begin!” Weiss extended his scepter, pointing it towards the sky, and the tribulation clouds gathered once again.","Jian Wushuang also began to take it seriously.","Taking advantage of this brief moment, he quickly swallowed all the divine treasures in his mustard seed space.","His origin had been at its limit all along, unable to improve.","Each tribulation caused his origin to undergo a transformation, making him even stronger, faster than the improvement brought by devouring treasures.","But the increase in divine power was indeed minimal.","Now, his base divine power had reached 800,000.","At the level of Ffith Tribulation, 800,000 divine power was considered peak, even a limit, in the eyes of ordinary people.","But in his eyes, it was like not having had a satisfying meal.","After quickly devouring all the divine treasures, except for Dong Jun’s bones, obtained from the Infinite Great World, he realized that he had only gained a few hundred divine powers.","It seemed those treasures were just trash.","To endure the Sixth Tribulation, he needed at least 800,000 divine power.","To pass it safely, he needed to increase his divine power further.","Buzz!","“Beast God’s power!”","“Triple!”","His divine power began to soar, instantly exceeding one million.","The origin of the Beast God Weapon also reached the level of Fifth Tribulations after a single refinement.","Now, he could unleash five times the power of the Beast God without even wearing armor. However, he felt that a million divine power were enough to deal with the Sixth Tribulation.","If a million divine powers couldn’t get him through the Sixth Tribulation, then that would be truly absurd.","Buzz!","The Tribulation pierced through his divine body, leaving him severely injured.","It was the first time he had been injured during his Tribulation crossing.","His life force surged, and in an instant, he restored himself to peak condition.","The tribulation was successfully overcome.","The strong ones outside breathed a sigh of relief.","Seeing once again that innate Life power, these individuals became even more frenzied.","“The most crucial is still the sixth supreme Tribulation. Although he has enough primordial stones, it depends on how he can stimulate his Origin Source. Without the amplification of the original universe, the pressure on him is immense!”","From the initial cold words to the current encouragement, they were like Jian Wushuang, crossing from the first Tribulation to the sixth.","Each of them had a solemn expression.","Silently chanting, “Pass! Pass! Pass!”","“Pass!”","“Pass!”","For a moment, low voices echoed, audible throughout the entire Holy Land.","Even Divine Wood King and others who were destroying the source of the array in the Infinite Great World were anxious.","They feared that Jian Wushuang might not be able to pass and become a cripple.","Now Jian Wushuang was also someone who carried high hopes.","Facing the Sixth Tribulation, his confidence was high.","Buzz!","In the universe, countless forces gathered.","In an instant, the One Thought Universe paper was blasted with several holes.","The Sixth Tribulation was indeed not simple.","This time, he truly felt the terror of the supreme rules.","As long as it was a Tribulation realm, no matter how powerful, it would be suppressed by the","Supreme Law Rules.","No one could avoid it.","One celestial maiden fell under the great tribulation of Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Only the gods could break free from such constraints.","“Come on!”","Jian Wushuang spread his hands, although lacking the amplification of a real universe.","But he had the amplification of One Thought Universe.","It also significantly boosted his strength.","Manipulating the entire One Thought Universe to deal with the Sixth Tribulation.","It was also his trial of success or failure.","The gathering storm traversed every corner of the universe.","The wings behind him kept trembling, rescuing his universe everywhere.","The primordial stone kept depleting, used to restore the One Thought Universe.","But his universe was too vast.","It was ten times larger than a normal peak universe of the Fifth Tribulation realm.","The consumption of primordial stones was also greater.","Fortunately, the current universe was condensed with Thought power, and he could also use","thought power to repair it.","Boom!","Another secret realm began to collapse.","It was still Tianqing Mountain, the most important place in his universe.","Ves was on it.","He was rescuing below while Ves was sunbathing and drinking wine on top.","They formed a stark contrast.","There was nothing he could do; that was the difference.","Who made his strength insufficient!","The water disaster of the Sixth Tribulation turned the Origin Source Universe into a sea.","There wasn’t even a piece of land left.","Only the floating five major secret realms!","100,000 black holes, just five major secret realms.","Obviously, it was not enough. This Tribulation tested the support of his universe.","If this Tribulation couldn’t be sustained, how could more powerful life be nurtured? It might","as well die.","“No, I can’t handle it alone!” Jian Wushuang shook his head, well aware of the current","situation.","1 person couldn’t do it, then 10,000 could.","He still had avatars.","With his extremely powerful power of All Things, he could nurture countless avatars!","Swish!","One divided into two, two into four, four into eight!","In just a moment, tens of thousands of avatars appeared, rushing around to rescue in an","instant.","Stabilizing each black hole and fixing the connected timelines.","This was to open up the universe’s time.","The chaos of space was because of time.","As long as time and space were stabilized.","Then there wouldn’t be much of a problem.","The time Jian Wushuang was building now was not like comprehending time in the past.","It was to establish time belonging to his Origin Source Universe.","This was completely different.","“This world needs light!”","Jian Wushuang pointed, and the huge sun at the center of the universe instantly extinguished.","Only in utter darkness could the existence of light be confirmed.","Swish!","The world changed from white to black.","Then again from black to white.","Yin and yang had formed, leaving only everything else.","While avatars stabilized time and space.","What he needed to do was to completely construct his universe.","The five major secret realms were elevated simultaneously.","With Tianqing Mountain as the core.","In an instant, the entire universe was completely stabilized.","The water disaster of the Sixth Tribulation was also easily resolved.","At this moment, his universe became even more real.","“Whew!”","A heavy breath made Jian Wushuang’s expression change.","He could feel the breath from the universe.","The first life was about to be born.","In his universe, Jian Wushuang was omnipotent and omniscient.","With a flicker, he had already reached the depths of the sea.","He witnessed a trace of the power of Life, condensing into a strand of plant-like life with","vitality.","The first life was a special one.","Not a group capable of reproduction.","This was normal.","If he were to create a group capable of reproduction now, it would also be difficult for him.","However, the appearance of Special Life Form meant that his universe was becoming real."]},{"number":5883,"title":"Chapter 5883: Universe Formation","paragraphs":["Chapter 5883: Universe Formation","He had also become the Universe Master he had long dreamed of.","“Sixth Tribulation realm!” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath. He had achieved it.","Buzz!","Raising his hand into a fist, within his own Dao Arena, the amplification of his origin power reached its peak.","The core of his swordsmanship erupted with countless sword cries.","That power, capable of toppling mountains and draining seas, was enough to slay those at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Now he himself wasn’t clear on just how powerful his combat strength truly was!","“It’s time to go out and settle everything!”","“Universe Master Jian Wushuang!”","The external experts also felt the pressure emanating from Jian Wushuang.","“His divine power is clearly only at 800,000. How is it that just now, with a clench of his fist, the strength he displayed could make even me feel fearful?”","“That’s his Origin Source!”","Soon, some Seventh Tribulation realm powerhouses noticed the uniqueness of Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source.","Origin power surpassed divine power.","A hundred thousand black holes.","Even the peak universe of the Qishen Temple probably had only a hundred thousand black holes.","The crucial point was that the Qishen Temple primarily cultivated Spacetime Origin Source.","Not divine power.","In the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Even the Universe Masters at the Eighth Tribulation realm probably didn’t have a hundred thousand black holes within their Origin Source Universes.","In terms of origin alone, Jian Wushuang could already overlook the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime.","But in terms of divine power, he still had a long way to go.","With one force breaking myriad Law Rules Laws.","His Origin Source power might match the top experts of the Seventh Tribulation realm in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Converted into divine power, it would be over 1.5 million.","Of course, that was just his usual state.","Once he unleashed the Super Ancient Transformation, coupled with the blessing of his origin universe, things became unpredictable.","“Elder Blu, please use the Dragon Balls to shield the external sky, no need to shield the Supreme Rules!” Jian Wushuang landed on the peak of Dragon God Mountain.","His entire demeanor and aura underwent a tremendous change.","Elder Blu could no longer see through Jian Wushuang, only able to discern that his divine power was only 800,000.","But as for the recently enhanced origin, he had no idea.","“That’s simple!” Elder Blu once again activated the nine Dragon Balls to isolate the Infinite Great World.","Jian Wushuang raised his hand, and with a thought in his palm, the vast universe began to contract.","From encompassing the entire Infinite Great World to shrinking to the size of a palm, it happened in an instant.","Watching his own Origin Source Universe, a smile crept onto Jian Wushuang’s lips.","After waiting for too long, he had finally achieved it.","Back when he was mastering the Dao, he used to gaze up at the Starry Sky, still yearning to become the Universe Master.","Now, he had accomplished it.","And not just any Universe Master, but one at the level of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","He was getting closer to his goal.","Remembering the promise his teacher made to meet again in the future, Jian Wushuang felt it was nearing fruition.","Moreover, he was no longer afraid of Mie Sheng.","It was time to return and eradicate Mie Sheng.","Everything was happening quickly.","He had thought he would have to unlock the Wanliu Willow to break through the Tribulation realm, but it happened much sooner than expected.","Grasping his palm, the Origin Source Universe entered his body.","“You can actually contain your own universe?” Elder Blu was immensely shocked.","Though not a Universe Master himself, he knew from inherited memories that only those at","the Eighth Tribulation realm could contain their own universe.","Jian Wushuang achieved it at the Sixth Tribulation realm.","It was simply unbelievable.","No wonder he had been able to block all attempts to peer into the Infinite Great World from the outside.","Otherwise, the commotion caused would have been even greater, potentially exposing his trump card.","Jian Wushuang pleaded with Elder Blu, “Elder Blu, please keep this matter secret!”","After all, it was a trump card that couldn’t be easily revealed.","“Naturally,” Elder Blu nodded. However, his appearance grew even more haggard. His hand controlling the Dragon Ball trembled. His Life force was no longer sufficient.","“Elder Blu!” Jian Wushuang looked at the sage before him, feeling a sense of admiration.","This time, being able to advance to the Tribulation realm ahead of schedule and even reaching the Sixth Tribulation realm was all thanks to Elder Blu, who was now struggling with","his Life power.","Thankfully, Jian Wushuang had the Life power to assist Elder Blu’s recovery.","But when he approached to offer help, Elder Blu shook his head.","“It’s no use. My lifespan has come to an end. No amount of life force can sustain me. This is","my end,” Elder Blu shook his head, stopping Jian Wushuang from helping.","Jian Wushuang opened his mouth to say something but thought better of it.","Perhaps it was truly the end of the road.","Continuing to live had become meaningless.","With his will extinguished, what was the point of a living body?","Outside, when the Infinite Great World was once again shielded, many thought Jian Wushuang","was preparing to undergo the seventh tribulation.","When Elder Blu removed the shield and saw Jian Wushuang had successfully broken through,","they all breathed a sigh of relief.","Jian Wushuang, at the Sixth Tribulation realm, no longer held an advantage in one-on-one","battles.","Even the Seventh Tribulation realm seemed out of reach.","At that point, perhaps only the Universe Master at the Eighth Tribulation realm could capture","Jian Wushuang.","“The first person in history to cross six Tribulations!” The eyes of those observing flickered with excitement. They recalled the words they had exchanged with Jian Wushuang, surprised at how quickly they were being proven true.","It had only been a few years, yet Jian Wushuang had already reached the sixth tribulation realm. Now, even if someone claimed he could reach the eighth tribulation realm, many","would believe it.","He continued to astonish everyone time and time again, seemingly achieving the impossible","effortlessly.","Many at the seventh tribulation realm were now starting to plan their own advancement.","“Ahem, let me remind everyone!” a powerful Seventh Tribulation realm expert spoke up. “Jian Wushuang may possess the power of Life, but it’s his own. We cannot demand it from him; we must offer something of equal value in exchange.”","“Yeah, I agree. When we go in later, let’s talk nicely and negotiate properly. This is the honor","of our Ancient Wood Continent. I believe this friend will give us some face!”","“Exactly!” Many changed their stance, no longer intending to besiege Jian Wushuang but instead","preparing to negotiate for the exchange of life power.","Of course, there were also some radicals among them who didn’t want to pay but still desired","Life power. For them, the only option was to seize it.","Outside the Infinite Great World’s formation, the strong of the Ancient Wood Continent","hesitated, but Ancient Wood King remained steadfast in his beliefs.","To him, even at the sixth tribulation realm, Jian Wushuang was no match. There was no need","for reasoning with the weak; only strength mattered.","Within the Infinite Great World, Jian Wushuang broke through the Sixth Tribulation realm in just three hours, not even half a day.","“It’s time to deal with Gula!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes sparkled as he nodded at the Elder Blu.","Before the Elder Blu could teleport him away, Jian Wushuang rushed through the Dragon God’s barrier. The barrier, capable of withstanding a million divine powers, was as fragile as","paper to him.","Swish!","Arriving at the foot of the mountain, he found no ground to stand on. Wu Li, restored, joined the battle once more. Elder Blu transformed into a super warrior, with a divine power reaching a staggering 1.4 million.","Together, they besieged Gula, unexpectedly gaining the upper hand."]},{"number":5884,"title":"Chapter 5884: Intense Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 5884: Intense Battle","It seems he’s not needed anymore!","Jian Wushuang concealed himself in the depths of the void, where no one could find him.","Only the strong from the outside world could perceive his presence.","This was due to the formation array; once the array was broken by the Divine Wood King, he could leave without much hindrance, even if Eighth Tribulation realm experts came.","Currently, Gula’s divine power had stabilized at 1.45 million.","When he just transformed, it was only 1.3 million.","Now, he was growing stronger with each battle.","The three of them fought relentlessly, reaching a point of complete immersion.","Each bore numerous wounds.","“Haha, he can’t hold on any longer!” Wu Li’s three-foot sword, with a chaotic slash, directly cleaved Gula’s body in half.","Elder Blu pursued the upper body while Wu Li pursued the lower.","The two of them coordinated their attacks seamlessly.","Wu Li’s swordsmanship became increasingly exquisite, and his divine power remained stable, thanks to Danbao.","With the healing from Danbao, Wu Li wasn’t afraid of backlash, experiencing the might of a million divine powers.","Yet, as he continued to battle, he found that the external divine power was also being absorbed by him continuously.","Although he was still in the Fifth Tribulation realm, his divine power had reached an astonishing million.","Combined with the divine power injected by the tree people, his divine power could now maintain at over 1.3 million, reaching the power of a Seventh Tribulation realm.","Below them, in the pitch-black abyss, there was still a figure.","Jian Wushuang spotted the figure and swiftly moved behind them.","“Brother Li Sheng!”","The figure was indeed Li Sheng.","The Empress had vanished, but her aura lingered; she must have fled.","Only Li Sheng dared to stay, knowing that regardless of the outcome, he would benefit.","He was also the most anxious observer.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s voice startled him.","He turned around, relieved to see Jian Wushuang but immediately anxious again. “Why aren’t you helping? Gula still has some hidden cards. Seize the opportunity to deal with him!”","“Hidden cards?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled, asking, “Hasn’t he already transformed completely? What else could he have?”","If there were indeed hidden cards, why would Gula endure being surrounded by Elder Blu and Wu Li, refusing to unleash them? It had been three hours already. What kind of hidden cards could make Gula endure such a situation?","Li Sheng sighed. “This is what Kinew told me. Gula’s true strength far exceeds this. His peak divine power exceeds 1.5 million, but now it’s stuck at 1.45 million. He must be planning something or needs time to gather his breath.”","“Over 1.5 million!” Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow, then said calmly, “No rush!”","His life force exposed, the strong from the outside world all had their eyes on him, yet he remained unruffled.","Especially facing someone like Gula.","He was still waiting for the other party to give him a surprise.","It was about the secret of the nine Dragon Balls.","Gula sought the Dragon Balls in search of a treasure trove.","He was very interested in this.","So there was no hurry to make a move.","Another reason was that he had no intention of giving up on Wanliu.","Wanliu was significant.","Its value was even greater.","In the past, when his strength was insufficient, he had to sneak in, but now that his strength","was enough, there was no reason to give up.","This was a super realm that tempted all the strong.","Having reached the Universe Master level, he needed more treasures.","To pass the Seventh Tribulation, he needed primordial stones.","He didn’t have a single one.","There were also some auxiliary treasures.","All of these needed to be gathered.","His current origin had already illuminated the first universe in the Starry Sky.","Subsequently, he needed to continue illuminating other universes.","He knew his limit, which was 100,000 black holes.","According to this scale, he needed to construct the second universe.","Until the entire spacetime was illuminated.","Even the Starry Sky.","The path was already laid out; he couldn’t just not walk it!","No matter how many people wanted to walk it, they couldn’t get out of this path.","And then there was divine power.","The skeleton of Dongjun, he had already been brewing it in the original universe.","Until now, he realized that the aura left on the skeleton of Dongjun was that of an Eighth Tribulation realm.","In the Starry Sky, the leader of the human race.","The Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Slain by Mie Sheng.","Speaking of which, he was still his disciple’s disciple.","This grudge also had to be settled with Mie Sheng.","Back then, he was given fish to eat.","Now he had to repay it with his own life.","It was somewhat regrettable.","He didn’t know how his disciples were doing now.","They might have fallen already!","After all, the span was too great.","Mie Sheng fell from the Starry Sky to here, and no one knew how long it had been.","But no matter how long it had been.","The divine power on the skeleton was extremely rich.","He had just merged now and felt the surging of divine power throughout his body.","In just an instant, his divine power increased by ten thousand.","The foundational divine power kept rising.","Fortunately, his divine body was extraordinary enough.","The fusion process was also quite swift.","According to the standards of absorption, only about 20 percent could be taken.","Yet, this could effortlessly allow his foundational divine power to reach a million.","And even more.","“After an hour!” Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged, addressing Li Sheng, “If you wish to leave,","I can take you to see the Empress, or wait until everything is over, and I will personally escort","you away, ensuring the eternal prosperity of the Li family!”","Li Sheng swallowed nervously, a hint of desolation in his eyes.","He hoped to hear Jian Wushuang offer him some grand opportunity.","But considering Jian Wushuang’s previous struggles for survival, he didn’t dare to expect","much.","So instead of asking, he replied calmly, “I don’t care anymore. I just want to return to my human identity and go back to Yue Kingdom to take care of my family!”","“Why?” Jian Wushuang was momentarily puzzled, then continued, “Don’t you have confidence anymore?”","Currently, Li Sheng was at the peak of the Fifth Tribulation realm.","Upon returning to Yue Kingdom, apart from the Empress, he would be the second Universe","Master.","Plus, after this Sacred Assembly, the number of Universe Masters in the entire Ancient Wood Continent had halved.","At this point, Li Sheng could join some major powers or actively enter the Ancient Wood Sect,","and he would fare quite well.","There was still hope for reaching the Sixth Tribulation realm.","“Jian Wushuang, all the opportunities I’ve had this time are all thanks to you!” Li Sheng took","a deep breath and admitted, “Without you, I might have died at the hands of Sangmo.”","Back then, at the Roman River.","The Empress left them behind.","Leaving Li Sheng as the only Fourth Tribulation Universe Master.","Without Jian Wushuang, he wouldn’t have survived.","Let alone the good luck that followed.","His subsequent fortune was also related to his transformation into a savage beast.","If he hadn’t transformed into a savage beast, how could he have survived in the Roman River?","That was a question in itself, let alone reaching the shore and encountering such","opportunities.","Seeing Li Sheng, Jian Wushuang felt like he was seeing those ordinary, mediocre Universe","Masters.","Compared to those Universe Masters, Li Sheng’s luck was indeed exceptional.","One could say he was heaven-chosen.","So many Fifth Tribulation Universe Masters had fallen, yet Li Sheng was still alive.","And he even became a Fifth Tribulation Universe Master.","“Take this, inside are pills for transforming back into a human!” Jian Wushuang tossed a mustard seed to Li Sheng as he approached."]},{"number":5885,"title":"Chapter 5885: Li Sheng’s Shock","paragraphs":["Chapter 5885: Li Sheng’s Shock","In the past encounter, he remembered it well.","Naturally, he wouldn’t mistreat the other party.","He didn’t know what promises Gula had made to Li Sheng.","But these were the only things he could do to help.","In the future, becoming a super powerhouse could ensure the Li family’s legacy continued.","It could also ensure Li Sheng’s survival.","After catching the mustard seed, Li Sheng didn’t rush to use the transformation pill, instead casually storing it within himself.","But when he inspected it with his mental power, he was startled.","“This?” He looked towards Jian Wushuang, somewhat incredulous.","Jian Wushuang, however, nodded calmly and said, “Don’t be surprised. It’s for you, but keep it quiet.”","He pointed upward with his hand, indicating someone was watching them.","The external powerhouses were still keeping an eye on them.","If they found out he had given Li Sheng the power of life, it might harm him instead.","“Not enough, ask me anytime!”","Since the power of life was now known to everyone, he wouldn’t hesitate anymore.","Li Sheng, however, was unaware.","He thought Jian Wushuang had just pulled out some magic, so he nodded quickly.","Those powers of life were useless for now, but they would be invaluable after becoming scattered tribulation.","After giving instructions, Jian Wushuang closed his eyes and began absorbing Dongjun’s bones to enhance his own divine power.","The external battles continued.","Gula indeed had a problem.","His aura kept rising.","He grew stronger as the battle progressed.","His divine power was now at one million four hundred and seventy thousand.","Wu Li and Bru also felt something was amiss.","“Don’t worry. At his rate of improvement, it won’t be long before Wushuang becomes the","ruler of the universe, and then we won’t need to worry!” Wu Li reassured Bru, but he himself had no confidence.","Just afraid they couldn’t hold out.","“Still more than two hours!”","Bru thought the Elder was still activating the Dragon Ball, so he didn’t dare to inquire through telepathy.","He could only focus on fighting.","Though Gula grew stronger as the battle went on, he didn’t show signs of going all out, instead trying to buy time.","By this point, Gula had realized.","His opponents were all skilled in various techniques.","From starting with less than a million divine power to now everyone having over a million divine power.","It had left him numb.","And somewhat afraid.","Afraid that if pushed too hard, Bru and Wu Li would erupt again.","So, he planned to gather energy and end the battle with one final wave.","The concept of gathering Qi isn’t about amassing a greater divine power, but rather accumulating enough Qi to prepare for the second transformation.","The first transformation took him from 1 million to now over 1.4 million.","However, for the second transformation, his divine power needs to reach 500,000 before he can execute it.","So, he needs to stall.","Once the second transformation occurs, his divine power will be sufficient to crush everyone, and he won’t need to fear anything.","Moreover, he’s already decided that once the transformation is complete, he’ll swiftly kill these people, without hesitation.","No more being careless.","“Just wait!” Gula gritted his teeth; his body was already in ruins.","This was only the first time someone had pushed him to this extent.","Even during the ancient barbaric era, those powerful beasts of the Seventh Tribulation realm hadn’t pushed him this far.","Buzz!","Gula’s divine power had already reached 1.49 million.","Wu Li, shaken off, his divine body beginning to crack.","Blu rushed to Wu Li’s side, helping him withstand Gula.","“Quick, go to Danbao!”","Wu Li nodded.","They could handle such intense battles with ease because of Danbao’s presence.","As long as Danbao was alive, they could repeatedly restore themselves to their peak.","On Jian Wushuang’s side, sensing Wu Li’s declining divine power, he was just about to strike when he noticed Danbao had already begun restoring Wu Li’s divine power.","This made his lips twitch as he continued to enhance his own divine power.","“One million!”","Now his foundational divine power had reached one million.","Only half of Dong Jun’s skeleton remained.","According to his estimation, he could still increase it by another 200,000.","However, the further he progressed, the slower his divine body enhancement became, even with divine power-like treasures supplying endlessly, it still couldn’t rapidly increase.","It was said to take an hour, but in his own Origin Source Universe, time was accelerated to a","million times.","Almost 100,000 years had passed.","And he increased by 200,000, mainly because the divine power in Dong Jun’s skeleton was so pure, requiring minimal conversion for absorption.","If he were to use some treasures, it would probably take even longer, and be even slower.","“Phew!”","After absorbing 1 million units of divine power, he attempted to absorb more, but found the","process painfully slow.","The current threat from the outside world wasn’t the ancient Gula anymore.","It was those ancient Scattered Tribulation.","Initially, he hadn’t paid much attention to the Godwood King.","But after learning from Wu Li that the Godwood King had been consistently showing signs of","weakness, he couldn’t afford to be careless.","Now, he had to consider how to deal with the Eighth Tribulation realm.","A million units of divine power seemed sufficient.","Even at the Sixth Tribulation realm, one could harness 1 million units of divine power.","It was nearly at the limit.","The Empress herself had only possessed this much divine power initially.","Breaking that limit wasn’t impossible for him, but it would require some fortuitous","circumstances, like the power of that crimson blood.","“If I were to unleash the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, my divine power would be 2","million!” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath.","One shouldn’t judge people solely on surface appearances.","His base divine power was only 1 million, but that wasn’t his true strength.","Without mentioning the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, he could effortlessly utilize","five times the power with the Beast God’s strength alone.","One increase meant 100,000 more units of power.","So, five times meant 500,000 more.","His current combat prowess could be divided into five tiers.","The first tier was his regular divine power.","The second tier was when he used the Beast God’s strength.","The third tier was his regular Origin Source Sword Dao.","The fourth tier was when he unleashed the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","The fifth tier was the Super Ancient Transformation combined with the blessing of the Origin","Source Universe.","At that point, he would be at his strongest.","With such a significant increase in strength, he also needed to make some adjustments to his","fighting style.","After all, he was currently in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","He would rely more on divine power in combat.","Even the classification of his combat prowess would be compared using divine power.","Just like his Origin Source Swordsmanship.","Now, he could even utilize the third sword move.","“Reincarnation Sword!”","He hadn’t displayed the full power of this sword yet.","But the first two sword moves had become stronger due to the formidable power of the","source.","His current Life Sword could reach a combat power of 2 million divine units.","The Death Sword was nearly the same.","And the third sword move wielded a power generated from the opposition of the first two.","One could imagine its immense strength.","So, in future encounters, he would have to be a bit more cautious.","He couldn’t go all out at the sight of an opponent.","The more he revealed, the more he would become a target.","Although he hadn’t planned to stay long in the Ancient Moon Space, he still needed to be","cautious.","There were interactions among the Nine Core Spacetimes.","Leaving the Ancient Moon Space didn’t mean he wouldn’t visit other spacetimes.","These nine core spaces would accompany him for a long time.","Moreover, there were still some tricky things in the Ancient Moon Spacetime waiting for him","to solve.","Like gathering the original ten individuals.","This task was not easy.","For now, he had to focus on self-preservation."]},{"number":5886,"title":"Chapter 5886: The Strong Usually Appear Last","paragraphs":["Chapter 5886: The Strong Usually Appear Last","It was also a headache.","Taking it step by step.","Phew!","Exhaling a breath, Jian Wushuang slowly stood up, standing shoulder to shoulder with Li Sheng, and reminded, “Get ready to switch, Gula’s doomsday has arrived!”","“I thought you would keep watching!” Li Sheng was somewhat surprised.","He couldn’t see through Jian Wushuang before, and he still couldn’t now.","He just felt that Jian Wushuang’s temperament had undergone some kind of change.","Jian Wushuang shrugged indifferently and said, “Don’t you know? The strong always appear last. Get ready to witness it!”","With that said, his figure flashed and he was in front of Gula.","The power of the Beast God also operated wildly, and the divine power instantly reached 1.5 million.","“Five times the power of the Beast God!”","Raising his hand, he directly punched Gula’s face, causing it to cave in.","Boom!","Gula’s figure was like a falling meteor, sliding backward and falling into the deepest abyss below.","Wu Li and Blu both rejoiced when they saw him.","“Wushuang, you finally broke through!”","Both of them breathed a sigh of relief.","Especially Wu Li, he knew that Jian Wushuang had a move that could double his divine power.","This doubling was not a doubling of combat power.","It was a doubling of divine power.","Originally from a base divine power of 400,000, it directly soared to 800,000.","His aura and hair turned blue.","Wu Li saw it very clearly.","As for the current dark red aura, he knew it was a prehistoric cosmic treasure stimulated by Jian Wushuang, which unleashed divine power.","Just by using the prehistoric Universe Treasure, the divine power reached 1.5 million.","If he used that move, his divine power could probably reach 2 million.","Wu Li’s speculation was indeed accurate.","Now Gula was completely finished.","“Thank you for your hard work!” Jian Wushuang turned to Wu Li and Bru, casually throwing out two clusters of Life power.","They directly entered their bodies.","Bru’s eyes showed shock, and the already withered divine power instantly returned to its peak.","Faster than the recovery speed of Danbao.","Wu Li was even more surprised.","He was more sensitive to the Life power.","Feeling that Life power, his eyes almost popped out.","“Wushuang, did you just pull out the Wanliu?” Wu Li said incredulously.","In his opinion, this kind of innate Life force only existed in the Wanliu.","“No, this is the Life force belonging to me, Jian Wushuang!” Turning back to the deep pit where Gula fell, he gathered huge Life force in his hands, aimed at the pit, and released a huge light wave containing Life force.","This blow shattered the core Origin Source of the entire boundless world.","His power now could indeed destroy the entire Infinite Great World.","Wu Li saw such a massive surge of Life force and exclaimed, “This is too wasteful! How about you let me have some too, and I’ll go wipe out Gula!”","“This request is the first of its kind for me!” He felt somewhat speechless. If he told Wu Li that within that surge of power just now, there was not only Life force but also a hint of Death energy, he wouldn’t have made such a statement.","Those traces of Death energy were derived through reverse deduction using Life force.","Though they were somewhat inferior to the innate death energy of extinction.","However, when integrated into Life force, the resulting reversal power was incredibly potent.","Wu Li, with a thick skin, leaned in excitedly and said, “You wouldn’t have actually mastered life force, would you?”","Initially, when he saw Jian Wushuang’s ignorance of life force, he had some doubts.","Now, hearing Jian Wushuang voluntarily mention it, he started to believe it somewhat.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t initially so sensitive to Life force.","Primarily because it was his first time leaving the Qishen Temple.","He only had to deal with Mie Shen, as a person, targeted against him in the Qishen Temple.","He had no defenses against anyone else.","It wasn’t until he arrived in the Ancient Moon Space that he realized how sensitive Life force","was.","Only then did he absorb the Life force within Jueyun Sword.","At that time, Wu Li did indeed have doubts, but unfortunately, the treant had not yet","recovered.","Later, when he did recover, the treant couldn’t see through Jian Wushuang, so there was no","further speculation.","Until now, with Jian Wushuang no longer concealing it.","They confirmed that someone had truly mastered innate Life force.","With this, opening the Wanliu would be too simple.","By killing Gula, they could head straight to Wanliu without all the twists and turns.","“What, are you going to deal with Gula?” Jian Wushuang stepped aside, letting Wu Li step","forward.","Wu Li quickly waved his hand and said, “Forget it, I’ll spare him this time. You just broke through the Ninth and came to spar with Gula!”","1.5 million divine power.","Neither Blu nor they could handle it alone.","Only Jian Wushuang could kill Gula alone.","At this point, Li Sheng had also transformed into a human.","He figured out that Jian Wushuang had already reached the level of the Universe Master, so","killing Gula wasn’t a problem.","There was no need to stand on the sidelines anymore.","Once Jian Wushuang killed Gula, he could leave with him.","Blu also noticed Li Sheng at this time, his eyes filled with anger.","“Li Sheng, I’ll point you in the right direction. The Emperor fled towards the southeast gathering point. If you go now, you might catch up!” Wu Li hurriedly provided a way out for Li","Sheng.","Otherwise, after dealing with Gula, Elder Blu would turn his sights on Li Sheng.","Both sides offered assistance to him and Jian Wushuang.","But there were differing priorities.","Clearly, they cared more about the strength of the Polunga Clan.","Moreover, there was something in Danbao’s body that the tree people desired.","Standing at a distance, Li Sheng clasped his fists, aware of his awkward situation.","That’s how it was with undercover agents.","Even if their true faces were revealed, acceptance was difficult.","Furthermore, he had killed quite a few members of the Polunga Clan.","Staying here was awkward.","So, he turned and headed back the way he came.","Now that the Dragon God Continent was destroyed,","there were no savage beasts to obstruct him.","He could head straight to the Roman River, where he was more familiar.","Without Tamu King, those Fifth Tribulation realm savage beasts couldn’t threaten him.","He could easily find the Empress in peace.","And then leave the Infinite Great World with the Empress.","Regardless of whether she had become a saint, this time he considered it a success.","There was also Jian Wushuang’s promise.","A worry-free lifetime sounded quite nice.","The Sixth Tribulation realm wasn’t that simple. Watching Li Sheng disappear, Wu Li couldn’t help but sigh inwardly at his good luck.","“Gula, are you not coming out yet?” Jian Wushuang shouted into the abyss below. “If you","don’t come out soon, I’ll come down.”","With that said, he plunged directly into the abyss.","The opponent’s divine power was at 1.5 million, similar to what Li Sheng had mentioned.","With true divine power at 1.5 million, one couldn’t expect to win just by dragging things out!","Swish!","Entering the pitch-black abyss, he relied on his telekinesis to sense Gula at the deepest point.","He formed hand seals and continuously released his divine power from within.","He wanted to force Gula out.","“You’re quite interesting!” Jian Wushuang shook his head, letting his divine power return to","its normal state.","But he drew the Wanjie Sword.","Since the opponent wouldn’t come out, then let the battle be settled in the abyss!","Clang!","The Wanjie Sword was drawn, its cold light illuminating the entire abyss."]},{"number":5887,"title":"Chapter 5887: Can’t Even Withstand a Single Blow","paragraphs":["Chapter 5887: Can’t Even Withstand a Single Blow","He also caught sight of Gula below.","At this moment, Gula’s divine body had shrunk into a mass, surrounded by a black halo.","“What’s this?” He was somewhat surprised to see this scene.","It seemed to be related to the transformation of the Frost Demon Clan, and having witnessed","two members of the Frost Demon Clan, he had gained some experience.","He hadn’t expected Gula to be capable of transformation as well.","“Can’t let this stand!”","The Wanjie Sword instantly slashed out.","Although it was just a casual strike, its power surpassed even 1.5 million divine power attacks.","In an instant, myriad swords descended.","This was enough to slay Gula in its current state.","But just as the sword shadows were about to fall, a golden light burst forth.","The compacted Gula instantly spread out his arms.","A roar from ancient demons directly shattered the abyss.","Countless massive crusts began to fall.","“You managed to transform successfully after all!” Jian Wushuang shook his head and flashed out of the abyss.","Since that was the case, he’d await the opponent’s emergence for a battle!","Boom!","The abyss collapsed.","Wu Li saw Jian Wushuang emerge, and his telekinesis also sensed Gula’s transformation.","“How did he get stronger again?”","Elder Blu was equally surprised; the two of them were scared stiff.","Seeing Gula become stronger again, they looked palely at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang shrugged indifferently, “No big deal, there’s no need to be so afraid!”","His words had just finished when a golden light burst out from the buried abyss. Directly toward his direction.","Hum!","Divine power soared directly to 1.6 million.","Employing six times the power of the Beast God.","He directly held back the golden light with both hands.","After blocking it, he realized that within the golden light was none other than the transformed Gula.","All golden, even the spiral horns on its head were gone.","Boom!","Jian Wushuang only felt a numbness in his hands as he released his grip, and Gula used its round head to directly bump into his chest.","“You!” His divine power surged again, and his hands went up to block once more, forcefully throwing Gula out.","This time, Gula didn’t look as miserable as before, its figure just paused and stopped.","A pair of sinister eyes scanned them.","With a clench of his fists, the entire Infinite Great World trembled, and the scattered rubble below began to fly uncontrollably towards the sky.","This force had already disrupted the gravity brought by the origin.","“You are truly fortunate!” Gula stood with one hand on his hip, pointing at Jian Wushuang and the others, saying, “To witness my ultimate state, it is the greatest luck of your lives!”","Wu Li’s legs trembled as he watched, unable to believe it. “Since you are so powerful, why didn’t you transform earlier?”","“Transforming earlier wouldn’t be fun. I want you to experience the taste of victory turning into hell right after!” Gula sneered, completely forgetting his intention to transform earlier. Originally, he had planned to quickly end the battle.","But once he started talking, he couldn’t hold back.","Mainly, he wanted Jian Wushuang and the others to despair.","“Now, my divine power is 1.8 million. Who else can stop me!” Gula erupted once again, directly forcing Jian Wushuang and the others back.","Incredibly arrogant.","...","“You’re rejoicing too soon!” Jian Wushuang shook his head, drawing the Wanjie Sword from its sheath, recalling the scene of slaying Gula’s subordinates.","It seemed another showdown was imminent.","Seeing Jian Wushuang draw his sword, Gula sneered, “Are you going crazy? Don’t worry, this time I’ll be quick, and you’ll be able to meet those humans down below soon enough!”","From the depths of the abyss, he could see that Jian Wushuang’s divine power was at most one million six hundred thousand, not even a threat to him.","He thought Jian Wushuang was bluffing.","“The one going crazy is you!” Jian Wushuang slowly raised his hand, and the origin within the ice-blue blade of his sword erupted.","The origin within the Wanjie Sword instantly surged to the level of the Sixth Tribulation","realm.","The Sword of Death condensed instantly.","The immense aura shook everyone.","Even the external Seventh Tribulation realm powerhouses were extremely surprised!","This one sword could slay most of the Seventh Tribulation Realm scattered powerhouses.","After all, when converted into divine power, it was a whopping 2 million.","It was already the peak state of the top Seventh Tribulation realm.","Not every Seventh Scattered Tribulation powerhouse was as powerful as Hun Tian.","Gula’s eye sockets burst, unable to believe it.","He couldn’t believe he was losing.","He couldn’t believe Jian Wushuang would be so powerful.","“How is this possible? How can you be so strong?” Gula kept retreating, unwilling to accept","this outcome.","After battling fiercely, he had finally transformed into his ultimate form.","His divine power reached 1.8 million.","He could have easily won.","“Hehe...” Gula fell into a frenzy, not waiting for Jian Wushuang to act, he flew madly towards","the sky, ascending to the very top of the Infinite Great World.","Above was the boundary of the formation.","That boundary, even the Divine Wood King would find it difficult to break.","Of course, that’s because Divine Wood King was in hiding.","If he didn’t conceal his divine power, it could be broken in the time it takes an incense stick to","burn.","As for Gula, with his divine power of only 1.8 million, who knows how much time it would take","to break through.","But Jian Wushuang wouldn’t give him that chance.","Buzz!","With the boundary above his head, gritting his teeth, Gula suddenly turned his head and looked down at Jian Wushuang and the others.","The black sword shadows bursting from the icy cold blades were already rushing towards","them.","There was no escape.","“Then let’s die together!” Gula clenched his fists, his body suddenly expanding by a circle, his divine power once again greatly increased on a large scale, almost reaching 1.9 million. Releasing his fists, he randomly condensed the divine power from his entire body between his","hands.","A huge dark red sphere formed in his hands.","This was his strongest blow.","Even if he couldn’t stop the sword shadows, he would destroy this Infinite Great World.","Destroying the Origin Source, all life would disappear.","“Hah!” Gula exerted all his strength to throw the dark red sun towards Jian Wushuang.","The black sword shadows pierced through the dark red sun and hit Gula’s divine body.","Crackle!","Gula’s divine body shattered like a mirror in an instant.","But there was still a faint breath remaining.","Jian Wushuang below didn’t care about Gula, but instead faced the dark red sun.","His aura also began to change.","From the white power of the origin, it instantly transformed into the blue power of the starry","sky.","“Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","He suddenly leaped up, as he approached the dark red sun, he kicked upwards, directly","slamming the giant dark red sun that Gula was proud of away.","It happened to hit the remaining breath of Gula.","The breath instantly turned into dust in the dark red divine power.","And the dark red sun, crashed into the boundary.","Boom!","As if the entire sky was about to collapse!","At the core of the formation in the Infinite Great World, many elders of Ancient Wood Sect","revealed expressions of disbelief.","That blow just now, even for them, would have been difficult to withstand."]},{"number":5888,"title":"Chapter 5888: Gula’s End","paragraphs":["Chapter 5888: Gula’s End","Jian Wushuang effortlessly deflected the attack.","His strength surpassed many in the group.","The nine Grand Elders of the Ancient Wood Sect each possessed 2 million divine power.","Even the ordinary elders wielded over 1.5 and a half million divine power.","For instance, the sect leader of the Ancient Wood Sect had almost the same divine power as Gula.","Unfortunately, he wasn’t a Grand Elder, merely a puppet within the sect.","Though he seemed influential on the surface, he had no real authority.","This time, they didn’t seek help from that sect leader.","Instead, they left him to face the formidable opponents alone.","Such internal conflicts were inevitable even within the eight-star sects.","After all, resources were limited.","Someone had to make sacrifices!","The external powerhouses were now thoroughly divided.","Initially, they thought Jian Wushuang was on par with them.","But now, it seemed he had far surpassed them.","In an instant, two factions emerged.","The peacemakers, led by Lian Xing, sought cooperation with Jian Wushuang to exchange treasures for life force.","As long as the terms were reasonable.","The radicals, centered around the Lord of the Celestial Wolves within the Celestial Wolf Secret Realm, were rallying various independent cultivators and the Scattered Seventh Tribulation experts in the realm, preparing to seize Jian Wushuang.","They were still envisioning Jian Wushuang’s limits.","Thinking that his recent outburst wasn’t fueled by his own strength.","If they were to buy it, not only would they be reluctant, but they also lacked the financial means.","So, they had no choice but to resort to theft.","The Ancient Wood Sect, on the other hand, wouldn’t give up without a fight.","They aimed to stop everyone and capture Jian Wushuang alone.","Only three hours remained until they entered the Infinite Great World.","Dragon God Mountain.","Despite completely eradicating Gula, Jian Wushuang didn’t feel much joy.","He landed on the peak of Dragon God Mountain.","The pill treasure was currently restoring the divine powers of Wu Li and Elder Blu.","They were quite content.","Gula was dead.","Everything had come to an end.","But things were never that simple.","Gula’s death came with a price.","He had exposed his Life force.","The external powerhouses were still clueless about how to discuss him.","The core Origin Source of the Infinite Great World’s array formation, it could be sensed that","the power within was continuously weakening.","Once destroyed, countless powerful beings would surge in.","Including Eighth Tribulation experts.","Jian Wushuang looked at Danbao and the others, feeling reluctant to speak up.","At the same time, he was also calculating how not to involve these people.","Seeing Wu Li, who had restored his peak strength, so conflicted, he calmly stepped forward, patting his shoulder and saying, “Brother Wushuang, you’re already so powerful, why still wear a worried look? If there’s something bothering you, speak up. We’ve all faced Gula together; there’s nothing we haven’t seen.”","“Gula!” Jian Wushuang shook his head. What they were about to face was not just one Gula, but a group of them, and even stronger enemies than Gula.","Elder Blu also glanced over at this moment. He understood the array formation of the Infinite Great World the best. It was the Dragon God who went to destroy the array formation, drawing the arrival of super experts from the Ancient Wood Sect.","And not just one.","According to the inherited memories, there were nine super experts.","They besieged the Dragon God, eventually leaving him heavily injured and fallen.","Leaving behind the Polunga Clan.","After the fall of the Dragon God, the core origin of the array formation of the Infinite Great World became even stronger.","The super experts of the Ancient Wood Sect never appeared again.","Now, with the core origin becoming weaker and weaker, it indicated that someone outside was destroying it.","If the array formation’s core was destroyed, then the Infinite Great World would be just like any other barbaric world, freely accessible.","The Elder of the Polunga Clan understood this point very well, thus grasping the gravity of the current crisis.","Jian Wushuang also glanced over at this moment, and the Elder nodded.","“Well, I won’t hide it from everyone anymore. Since our human experts arrived in the Infinite Great World, we’ve actually been under surveillance. I exposed my Life power, so those Scattered Tribulation experts from outside will definitely come looking for me. You should all be aware of how crazy those Scattered Tribulation experts from the outside can be when it comes to Life force!”","Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth, then looked at Danbao.","There was also the Origin Source within his body for restoring divine power, so Danbao would","also be hunted down.","And then, the remaining Elder and Blu wouldn’t be able to escape either.","As for Wu Li.","He was supposed to enter Wanliu.","Naturally, it was impossible to leave everyone behind and go alone.","Wu Li hesitated for a moment, unsure of what to say. “Everyone, time is running out!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Currently, it was not a dead end.","Wu Li was going to Wanliu.","So everyone could go together.","Enter the Wanliu Divine Tree together.","If necessary, they could just not come out.","Wait until their strength is enough before leaving.","Wu Li was currently at the half-step sixth tribulation realm.","Going to Wanliu, as long as luck wasn’t too bad.","Breaking through the Sixth Tribulation realm wouldn’t be a problem.","Having not been in the Infinite Great World for long, Wu Li had already broken through two","Tribulations.","The Wanliu Divine Tree ranked in the top three super secrets of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Even the Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters couldn’t enter.","The opportunities inside couldn’t be simple.","The former Lord Hengmu, with mediocre aptitude, entered Wanliu and shortly after became a","Half-Step Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","Wu Li had a good foundation, with the help of Lord Hengmu, he was naturally much stronger","than Hengmu himself.","It’s hard to say how high his achievements will be.","Reaching the state of Hengmu should be no problem. Furthermore, as long as he became a Seventh Tribulation Universe Master.","After coming out, he would have the strength to contend with the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Of course, except for the Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters.","But most of the Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters were not in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","There was no need to worry about that.","There were no problems on Wu Li’s side.","It’s just the three members of the Polunga Clan...","Jian Wushuang felt guilty about this.","He was able to reach the sixth tribulation realm quickly.","Apart from his own reasons, the most important thing was the help of the Polunga Clan’s","Elder Blu.","And Wu Li, along with Blu and even Danbao, were desperately blocking outside.","This kindness must not be forgotten.","So he hesitated.","The Elder Blu didn’t have much time left.","And now they still had to flee with him.","Although Blu’s strength was good, it was only at the level of an ordinary Seventh Tribulation","realm.","As for Danbao, let alone.","Almost in the subsequent battles, he had no combat power.","This group of people would face a group of Seventh Tribulation experts.","Once something went wrong, it would be too late to regret.","After hearing this, Blu’s eyes flickered, but he didn’t flinch.","Danbao was the same.","It was Wu Li whose face turned completely dark.","Originally, he thought that once Jian Wushuang reached the level of Universe Master,","everything would be stable this time.","But as soon as he sent Gula away, he triggered the pursuit of the entire Ancient Wood","Continent’s Seventh Tribulation experts.","Of course, there were benefits too. Jian Wushuang had boundless Life force, and it was innate","Life force. There was no problem with entering Wanliu.","And Jian Wushuang’s innate life force was of great use to Lord Hengmu’s plan.","Wu Li’s mentality was in line with that of Lord Hengmu.","He fully trusted Lord Hengmu."]},{"number":5889,"title":"Chapter 5889: Entrusting","paragraphs":["Chapter 5889: Entrusting","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As long as the Lord Hengmu nodded, they could face any danger, no matter how great.","Just like back when he was still the Universe Master at the Third Tribulation realm, he dared to pull Emperor Jian Wushuang along to draw the attention of Wanliu.","Thinking back, he was still a bit naive at that time.","He imagined everything too well.","If everything went smoothly with the Sacred Assembly.","They would probably still be struggling here.","It’s a long way to go to enter Wanliu.","Now everything is speeding up.","Their strength is continuously skyrocketing.","Fortune is instantly descending upon them.","They enjoy the fortune but also face danger.","There’s one more thing Wu Li just discovered.","Since following Jian Wushuang, he has never lacked opportunities.","Although dangerous, they managed to resolve it every time.","He hasn’t felt this way in a long time.","Adventuring through life and death with a good friend.","Continuously growing stronger amidst opportunities.","It’s inherently interesting.","The path of the strong is no longer lonely.","“Hey, I thought it was something serious!” Wu Li waved his hand and said, “Isn’t it just a bunch of old folks rushing into coffins? As long as they come, we’ll deal with them!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t speak, just glanced at the Elder Blu.","As long as the Elder Blu agreed with a nod.","Now he would let Wu Li lead them to Wanliu.","Before the external powerhouses enter this place, they need to reach Wanliu Divine Wood.","Now that he’s the Universe Master, with the speed of displaying the Three Quake Universe, he can suppress all those at the Seven Tribulations realm.","Even the Divine Wood King would find it challenging to compare notes with him.","Moreover, now that he had become the Universe Master, he could exhibit the Three Quake Universe technique and conceal his aura while carrying several people along with him. He had absolutely no worries.","It all depends on whether the Elder Blu is willing to leave the homeland where he once lived!","Turning his head, the entire Dragon God Continent has turned into an abyss, which is somewhat embarrassing.","Where is there still a homeland here?","It’s simply barren.","The Infinite Great World might be completely plunged into the chaos of spacetime.","At this point, it has already been tortured into ruins by battles.","Staying here, there’s no way to survive.","The memories of a lifetime slowly passed through the mind of the Elder Blu.","Exhausted, he stood up from the throne and came to Blu and Danbao.","Placing his hands on their shoulders, then exerting a bit of force, he mobilized the last bit of strength to transfer the power of the Dragon Balls to the two.","Blu and Danbao both looked up at the Elder Blu, with astonishment and reluctance in their eyes.","“Elder, what are you doing?” Blu seemed to see the Elder Blu’s decision from his eyes, but he couldn’t bear to ask.","Though young, Danbao understood as well.","The Elder Blu would soon leave them.","“Two benefactors!” The Elder looked at Jian Wushuang and Wu Li, respectfully clasping his fists towards them.","Wu Li could take it, but Jian Wushuang couldn’t bear it. He quickly stepped forward to help Elder Blu up and said, “Elder, just say what you need, you’ve been kind to me, as long as Jian Wushuang can do it, I will definitely not hold back!”","“This is my homeland, but in the face of those powerful outsiders, I had to leave. Before you depart, I want to entrust Blu and Danbao to you. I don’t expect them to restore our Polunga Clan, but I hope they can survive and leave alive. Wherever they go, as long as they are alive, it’s enough.”","The words of the Elder were sincere.","Jian Wushuang had already planned to take them with him. Even if the Elder didn’t say it, he would still do it.","“Elder, you don’t need to be so polite. Entering Wanliu, there’s no need for quotas anyway, and I have a connection with this little Danbao. Rest assured, if the outside world can’t accommodate your Polunga Clan, I will open up a world for your Polunga Clan within Wanliu!” Wu Li said, smiling at Danbao again.","Although his words were somewhat grand, they were not entirely impossible.","If the outside world didn’t work, settling them in the Wanliu Divine Wood was also a solution.","“Thank you!” The Elder bowed once again.","Jian Wushuang wanted to help, but was stopped by Blu.","“No need!” Blu insisted repeatedly, leaving Jian Wushuang no choice but to give in.","Feeling the weakness of the Infinite Great World Formation, the Elder wasted no time and made the final decision.","Integration!","He fused his remaining divine body, flesh, and wisdom, giving them to Blu.","Helping Blu become a complete Polunga warrior.","It could even be said that he became a complete second-generation Dragon God.","As for Danbao, the Elder knew that there was some treasure inside Danbao, a treasure from within Wanliu.","But he didn’t say it explicitly, instead, he told Jian Wushuang alone.","As long as one’s eyes weren’t blind, they could see that Wu Li had been eyeing the treasure within Danbao’s body.","Jian Wushuang could sense it, though he hadn’t yet approached Wu Li or inquired about the identity of the Eternal Wood Master.","Such a thing was entirely plausible.","He wouldn’t forget the Elder’s trust.","Buzz!","A streak of light descended from the sky.","Jian Wushuang and his companions began their journey once again.","With bodies weary from their efforts, they headed towards the extreme north icefield, awaiting the disappearance of the formation barrier to leave the Infinite Great World.","They aimed for the Wanliu Willow Divine Tree.","The Elder had completely assimilated with Blu.","However, he left behind only his power, his consciousness permanently gone.","Blu had achieved peak combat strength.","A perfect member of the Polunga Clan.","One could even say he was a complete Dragon God.","A true dragon at the pinnacle of the Seventh Tribulation Realm.","His normal divine power was two million.","This left Wu Li speechless.","He no longer focused on the elixirs.","The journey from the Dragon God Continent to the extreme north icefield usually took several years.","Yet Jian Wushuang arrived at the edge of the barrier in just an hour.","Now they waited for the formation to dissipate.","Before disappearing, the Elder used a dragon pearl to isolate them from the outside world.","Now, the outside world couldn’t see them at all.","Thus, they had no fear of being ambushed at the barrier.","Once the outside world realized they were gone, everyone panicked.","The Godwood King was no exception.","Ever since Jian Wushuang entered the Infinite Great World, someone had been watching him.","They knew Jian Wushuang could conceal his aura to the extreme, something ordinary people couldn’t detect.","But the Divine Wood King was different. Aside from his strength, the treasure within the Divine Wood King’s body could lock onto Jian Wushuang’s Life force.","In his view, Jian Wushuang couldn’t escape his grasp.","Yet now he was completely cut off.","How could he not panic?","“All of you, spread out! Head to the edge of the Infinite Great World immediately. Hold onto these tokens. If they start flashing, it means Jian Wushuang’s location has been transmitted to me!” The Divine Wood King distributed some tokens to the crowd.","Without any hesitation, the 9 Grand Elders and 18 Core Elders took the tokens and headed directly to the edge of the Infinite Great World.","More than 20?Seventh Tribulation realm powerhouses joined forces, making the entire boundary of the Infinite Great World impassable.","All to block Jian Wushuang’s escape route.","After everyone left, the Divine Wood King isolated the space here completely.","Having made all necessary preparations, his aura began to change."]},{"number":5890,"title":"Chapter 5890: Doomsday of the Ancient Wood Sect","paragraphs":["Chapter 5890: Doomsday of the Ancient Wood Sect","A power that could make all Seventh Tribulation realm tremble burst forth.","The already dilapidated core of the formation couldn’t help but tremble before him.","Boom!","With a palm strike from the Divine Wood King, countless vines also appeared on his body, rushing into the origin, beginning to wreak havoc.","If there were knowledgeable experts present, they would surely recognize that the vines on the Divine Wood King’s body were the same as the vines that Elder Muchen possessed back then.","However, the vine of the Divine Wood King was at the level of the eighth tribulation realm. The eighth tribulation realm was equivalent to the strength of an Eighth Tribulation expert. No wonder it made everyone back off.","Divine Wood King had been feigning weakness all along.","In addition to the vine, the Life force within his divine body was also constantly erupting.","It was enough to supply his divine power attacks.","With a casual palm, he could shock and kill those at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","The current Divine Wood King was much stronger than his peak.","He could now contend with the Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","After several attacks, the Origin Source of the formation’s core was completely damaged.","The entire appearance of the Infinite Great World was revealed.","A primitive aura immediately surged through the sky.","This commotion.","Instantly stunned the Seventh Tribulation experts in the Holy Land of the Ancient Wood Sect. “What are you still looking at? These self-righteous fellows of the Ancient Wood Sect have already entered ahead of time, Jian Wushuang has disappeared, maybe he’s already been captured by the Ancient Wood Sect’s experts. Shouldn’t we destroy the Holy Land of the Ancient Wood Sect together?”","The Lord of the Celestial Wolves was originally the leader of the werewolf tribe in the wilderness.","He was also a bellicose character.","He set the pace now.","The radical faction he led quickly reached a consensus.","The head of the Ancient Wood Sect was completely dumbfounded.","This was rebellion!","Now, in the entire Holy Land of the Ancient Wood Sect, he was the only Seventh Tribulation expert.","How could he stop this?","“At this moment, do you still want to be the Sect Master of the Ancient Wood Sect, Jiangmenshen?” The divine power of the Lord of the Celestial Wolves was not weaker than that of Jiang Menshen, the head of the Ancient Wood Sect, in the slightest.","Stepping forward, he stood directly before Jiang Menshen.","Yet before the Lord of the Celestial Wolves could even make a move, Jiang Menshen landed a punch on him, sending him crashing out of the Ancient Wood Holy Land.","It left everyone dumbfounded.","In truth, it was entirely unnecessary.","All he needed to do was flee, seize control of the formation, which would have trapped them for some time, then inform Divine Wood King.","But Jiang Menshen had no intention of doing so, because Babidi had already informed him.","In several hours, they would arrive at the Ancient Wood Sect.","And he added one more thing – today, the Ancient Wood Sect would be expelled.","This was the chance Jiang Menshen had been waiting for.","He had long grown tired of the Ancient Wood Sect.","Now that everyone was going down together, he had another place to go.","It was a sort of revenge for his pent-up grievances.","“These greedy bastards!”","Exiting the holy land, Jiang Menshen headed straight for the treasure trove of the Ancient Wood Sect.","He cursed Divine Wood King and the elders for their greed.","Yet here he was, voluntarily entering the treasure trove of the Ancient Wood Sect, beginning to plunder its riches.","After all, the Ancient Wood Sect was about to fall.","These treasures were too tempting to resist.","Though he had little power within the Ancient Wood Sect, he still had the authority to distribute these treasures.","He plundered them all, packing up everything within his reach, and then left in large strides.","The guards who were supposed to watch over the place wanted to inquire, but seeing Jiang Menshen’s grim expression, they retreated.","Not only did he plunder the treasure trove of the Ancient Wood Sect, but he also destroyed the sect’s ancestral tombs.","Many Seventh Tribulation realm powerhouses were sealed inside, devoid of life.","It was expected to be a grave sin, likely to attract a lot of karmic retribution.","But unexpectedly, his moral halo increased by several feet.","It seemed the Seventh Tribulation realm powerhouses buried inside weren’t exactly saints.","Robbing the treasure trove and destroying the ancestral tombs – it was all done in one go.","The Holy Land of the Ancient Wood Sect was now in ruins.","What was once the magnificent Ancient Wood Sect now saw bloodshed all day long.","Most of its disciples were nearly wiped out.","If Empress Fengchen learned that the Ancient Wood Sect she had painstakingly tried to enter","was on the verge of destruction, one could only wonder what she would think.","On the other hand, Divine Wood King was already in pursuit of Jian Wushuang, paying no attention to the matters of the Ancient Wood Sect.","Why was the Ancient Wood Sect able to become an eight-star sect?","It was simply because of his presence.","As long as he existed, the Ancient Wood Sect would not perish.","Conversely, if he were to disappear, then the Ancient Wood Sect would cease to exist.","Over the years, that old fellow from the Shi Kingdom had been keeping an eye on him.","And the Flame God had been pressing down on him as well.","Sooner or later, he would cut down both of them.","The Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouse from the Daughter Kingdom had threatened him","back then, leading to her downfall.","Few people knew about this matter, perhaps only a handful.","He, Divine Wood King, would never allow other powerhouses to threaten him in the Ancient Wood Continent nor would he allow anyone to dare to covet his Wanliu Divine Tree. “These little thieves. Indeed, they’re attracting the attention of Wanjie. And you, Hengmu, it’s just perfect. I’ll completely deal with you this time, and my treasure will also be intact!” Divine Wood King’s speed surged, crossing the entire Infinite Great World in the span of an incense stick’s time, heading towards the world where the Wanliu Divine Tree was located. The position of the Infinite Great World was connected to the world of the Wanliu Divine Tree.","They had just discovered Jian Wushuang’s whereabouts, which was the Wanliu Divine Tree, after the destruction of the Ancient Wood Sect’s Holy Land.","With the leaders of the Sixteen Kingdoms led by Lian Xing and the experts from the secret realm led by the Celestial Wolves descending into the Infinite Great World, they didn’t know where Jian Wushuang had gone.","At this moment, they didn’t know where to search.","They could only follow the experts of the Ancient Wood Sect and head towards the Wanliu","Divine Realm.","If they couldn’t find him on their own, they would follow the experts of the Ancient Wood","Sect.","That way, they wouldn’t lose track!","The experts from both sides advanced towards the Wanliu Divine Realm together.","At the same time, in the upper part of the Ancient Wood Continent, a huge cosmic ship","appeared, heading towards the Ancient Wood Sect.","Inside the cabin...","“The Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouse from the Shi Kingdom didn’t go?” Babidi was somewhat surprised after receiving the communication from the Seventh Tribulation powerhouse from the Shi Kingdom.","But then he thought about it and understood. The Eighth Tribulation realm ancestor of the Shi Kingdom was actually the weakest Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouse. Without the assistance of the Flame God, he wouldn’t dare to contend with the Divine Wood","King.","Even if the Divine Wood King had been showing weakness all along, he wouldn’t dare to go. Now, the Flame God mainly focused on its avatars and was heading towards the spacetime of","the Qishen Temple.","There was no movement on its side.","“Qishen Temple, Mie Sheng!” Babidi shook his head disdainfully.","This conflicted with his plan, and he didn’t want to waste time bothering with Mie Sheng.","Moreover, now that the main body of Jian Wushuang, who had been staying by his side, had","disappeared, he no longer had a way to control Mie Sheng.","The resurrection plan had reached a critical moment.","Originally, he was supposed to visit the Wuhua Secret Realm, but unexpectedly, there was","trouble on the Wanliu side first.","Jian Wushuang’s main body had concealed it from him, intending to unlock the Wanliu.","How could he agree to that?"]},{"number":5891,"title":"Chapter 5891: Path of God","paragraphs":["Chapter 5891: Path of God","“Chi Jiuxiao!”","“Here!”","Chi Jiuxiao, with his reddish skin, emerged from his own cave and stood behind Babidi, his expression respectful.","Chi Jiuxiao’s appearance made everyone involuntarily step back.","Even Hun Tian did the same.","The oppressive feeling was something they couldn’t bear.","It was so powerful it suffocated.","“As soon as you encounter anyone daring to resist, just smash them with one punch, don’t hold back!” Babidi was very concerned about Wanliu, naturally, he wouldn’t hold back at all.","He glanced back at Hun Tian and the others, his eyes flickering.","Everyone instantly understood and nodded frantically.","Babidi was very satisfied; he longed for this lofty feeling immensely.","He was far from reaching the peak.","When he became a god after the tribulation, the path to resurrection would also be his path to divinity.","Resurrection!","It wasn’t just Babidi seeking this path.","Wu Li, who followed Jian Wushuang, was also contemplating.","To be precise, it was Lord Hengmu who was thinking.","Their goals were the same.","Both were striving for the path to divinity.","In the Ancient Moon Spacetime, such powerful figures in the tribulation realm.","Were all aiming for the Ninth Tribulation realm.","This was putting the cart before the horse.","Even if they reached the Ninth Tribulation realm, what then?","They would still be mere martial artists.","Only by becoming gods could they break free from cultivation and truly roam the world.","The Wanliu Divine Realm.","Was also a domain of the gods.","But the god here was a willow tree.","A single willow tree, yet it was one of the top three super secrets in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","The secrets within it had caused many powerful beings to perish.","Now, someone had stepped into this place again.","Jian Wushuang!","After the barrier of the Infinite Great World shattered, he instantly rushed towards this place.","The speed of the Three Quake Universe was only slightly weaker than that of the peak Divine Wood King.","So they were still the first powerful beings to arrive here.","“How much further do we need to go?” Jian Wushuang looked at Wu Li.","They had already reached the outskirts of the Wanliu Divine Realm.","They had encountered many obstacles along the way, but with Elder Blu, a peak Seventh Tribulation realm powerhouse, they didn’t need Jian Wushuang to intervene; he could smooth everything out.","So there weren’t too many twists and turns.","But the deeper they went, the stronger the obstacles became.","Until now, no one had entered Wanliu solely relying on sheer strength.","Not even the Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation realm could achieve it.","It was relatively easy on the periphery, where they could travel at a normal pace.","But once they reached the interior, progress became painstakingly slow.","Everywhere the rules seemed to be cut off.","Who knew what kind of monsters might appear?","Wanliu was teeming with vitality.","Naturally, it would give rise to many ethnic groups.","These groups had to cultivate within the Wanliu Divine Realm and could never leave in their lifetime.","Although they couldn’t leave, their strength was much stronger than the groups outside.","After all, they were niche groups.","Their strength, although decent, was still dangerous after entering.","Wu Li was feeling a bit desolate at this point. Lord Hengmu within him was using that treasure to find the exit he had left from initially.","Following that exit, they could re-enter.","This was also a contingency plan left behind.","Originally planning to re-enter Wanliu after reaching the Eighth Tribulation realm.","But that plan was ultimately thwarted by Divine Wood King.","The treasure had its core component taken away, and they almost perished.","“Don’t worry, it’s nearby. I need some time!” Wu Li’s voice changed directly, this was Lord","Hengmu speaking.","Wu Li wanted to explain but was directly interrupted by Jian Wushuang.","There was no time for explanations now, only action.","“Go first, to the southeast, and find a spirit field!” The voice of Lord Hengmu rang out again.","With a slight sense of his Thought power, Jian Wushuang discovered the spirit field in the southeast direction and led everyone there with a flash.","This spirit field had definitely existed for over a million epochs, and no one had ever harvested from it.","If it weren’t for the urgency of time, Jian Wushuang would have harvested this spirit field no","matter what.","The size of this spirit field, if harvested and sold, could fetch millions of primordial stones.","Now that he had become a Universe Master, he would need primordial stones for future cultivation and tribulations.","This stuff was extinct even in the Qishen Temple.","In any case, he had to prepare more.","An ordinary Sixth Tribulation cultivator would only have thousands of stones in an epoch.","He wasn’t ordinary; his Origin Source Universe was countless times stronger than those Universe Masters in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Sword Immortal Tonghe alone could nurture tens of thousands within a single era.","Let alone him.","According to his estimation, in one era, there were at least millions to start with.","But he didn’t have time to lay eggs!","And there weren’t many powerhouses who survived by nurturing primordial stones on their","own.","They all competed for opportunities, fought for treasures.","Jian Wushuang was no exception.","He had even less time.","A bunch of things awaited him to solve later.","There was no time to nurture primordial stones here.","Especially now.","He could even abandon millions of primordial stones just now.","Just as he stopped, Lord Hengmu urged him to head towards the spirit spring in the","southwest.","Arriving at the spirit spring, he became even more intrigued.","If any of these spirit springs were completely moved, they could be sold for tens of millions of","primordial stones.","Among the outskirts of the Wanyan Divine Domain, there were probably not many treasures","that could compare to this spirit spring.","But before he could make up his mind, the voice of Lord Hengmu sounded again.","He was to go to another place.","Just as he was about to leave decisively, Weiss from the Origin Source Universe forcibly","stopped him.","Jian Wushuang panicked for a moment and hurriedly said, “Lord Weiss, now is not the time for jokes. There is a large group of powerhouses chasing me. Please stop fooling around!” “Don’t worry, I won’t let you suffer!” Weiss, on the top of Tianqing Mountain, enjoyed various delicacies while leisurely chatting with Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang almost collapsed.","In the end, Weiss made him move this Dragon Spring into his own Origin Source Universe. “You’re already a god, why do you care about such treasures?” Jian Wushuang began to doubt","Weiss’s identity again.","He acknowledged his strength.","But for this treasure, it was just tens of millions of primordial stones.","What did it matter to a god?","Wasn’t it something he could easily conjure?","He still couldn’t forget when Weiss summoned the Supreme Tribulation.","The shock at that time was just like now when Weiss asked for the spirit spring. “Haha, the ones conjured by oneself and the innate spirit springs are not the same in texture.","I’m going to use this spirit spring to brew wine. After it’s done, I’ll send you a portion!” Weiss chuckled lightly with his hand over his mouth.","Jian Wushuang had no choice but to, amidst everyone’s astonishment, rush down to the spirit","spring alone and move the entire valley carrying the spirit spring into his own Origin Source","Universe.","Lord Hengmu, who witnessed this scene, was almost driven insane, loudly reminding, “Stop","taking this kind of rubbish. When we get to the Wanliu Divine Tree, you can have as much as","you want!”","Jian Wushuang, upon hearing this statement, agreed very much, but all of this was not his","intention!","Weiss on Tianqing Mountain was somewhat angry upon hearing this.","Daring to doubt his judgment.","He must be punished!"]},{"number":5892,"title":"Chapter 5892: Commanding the Law Rules","paragraphs":["Chapter 5892: Commanding the Law Rules","“Um...” Weiss pondered for a moment, then addressed the air, “I’ll punish you by halving your luck for today!”","The words were followed by divine decree.","After these words were spoken, the sky immediately darkened.","Jian Wushuang had just absorbed the spirit spring into his own origin universe when he noticed a group of black crows in the distance, led by a crowned figure.","“Let’s go!” Without daring to think much, he instantly pulled everyone and fled.","Little did he know, all of this was because of a remark from Lord Hengmu.","Upon the careful consideration of Weiss atop Tianqing Mountain, punishing Lord Hengmu would also affect Jian Wushuang, the laborer.","So the punishment was revoked.","Rising from his chair and stretching lazily, Weiss arrived at the mountain range he had moved into.","Finding the spirit spring, he pointed his finger, causing the spring to undergo a","transformation.","The divine power contained in the spring was at least a hundred times stronger than before.","Its value had also increased a hundredfold.","Turning stone into gold!","“This place has potential!”","To Weiss, this spirit spring was extraordinary.","It was just that Jian Wushuang and his companions didn’t recognize its worth.","Because the potential of the spring was immense.","After his intervention, it changed instantly.","If it were an ordinary spirit spring, turning it into gold would only increase its value several times.","“In appreciation for your hard work, I’ll help you once!”","Weiss’s words left Jian Wushuang stunned.","Was he offering him a benefit now?","But he didn’t have the leisure to pursue it at the moment.","Returning to the location mentioned by Lord Hengmu, he couldn’t help but ask, “Are you sure you remember correctly? We’ve almost circled back!”","This remark made Lord Hengmu lose confidence.","For a moment, he hesitated.","“It’s impossible, I remember it very clearly. We probably need a few more landmarks to find it. Don’t worry!”","Jian Wushuang could only comply.","After all, he had no other leads!","But just as he was about to head to the next treasure site, his body once again lost control. “What’s happening?”","He was about to ask Weiss what was going on when he realized that the scenery around him had changed.","Upon seeing this familiar valley, Lord Hengmu exclaimed in delight, “We’ve found it, it’s right here!”","He was surprised and asked, “How do you know about this place?”","This question caught Jian Wushuang off guard.","But if he were to say that it was Weiss who knew about it, perhaps the other party wouldn’t believe him either.","So he chose to be vague.","Lord Hengmu didn’t press further either. The immediate priority was to activate the Wanliu Divine Tree.","After glancing at the giant willow tree in the core area of the divine realm, he led everyone into the valley.","After Jian Wushuang landed on the ground, he also noticed the difference in this place.","There were many carvings here.","It seemed like someone had lived here.","Following Lord Hengmu, they walked towards the depths of the valley.","The carvings along the way became more and more numerous.","The things carved seemed to be totems of a tribe.","Jian Wushuang had never seen them before, but they should be related to the tribes inside the","divine tree.","The Wanliu Divine Tree possessed innate life.","They could also regard the Wanliu Divine Tree as a Universe Master.","And it was a Universe Master above the Eighth Tribulation.","In such a universe with innate life, the internal world structure and tribes must be","extraordinary.","Jian Wushuang followed behind Wu Li, observing as they walked.","“Are these totems all carved by Senior Hengmu?” Halfway through, he couldn’t help but ask.","Just the ones he saw surpassed a hundred tribes.","Only those who had lived inside the internal universe of the Wanliu Divine Tree for a long","time could record them so delicately.","And only Lord Hengmu knew about this place.","So it must have been him who carved them.","But what Jian Wushuang didn’t expect was that Lord Hengmu did not carve this place.","“No need to be surprised. I’m not the first practitioner to enter the Wanliu Divine Tree. When I left this place back then, I was as surprised as you are now. There are definitely others who can enter the Wanliu Divine Tree. It’s just that they don’t reveal themselves like I do!” The voice of Lord Hengmu came from Wu Li.","Jian Wushuang nodded, though deep down, he was certain he didn’t believe it.","If indeed others had entered the Wanliu, how could there be not even a single piece of news?","And after so many years, hardly anyone knew anything about Wanliu.","Lord Hengmu must be concealing a lot from them.","As they delved deeper, the statues grew larger and more lifelike, exuding divine power from","above.","The onlookers were cautious.","Jian Wushuang grew increasingly puzzled.","Why hadn’t anyone discovered these lifelike statues with divine power after all these years?","Although the Wanliu Divine Realm had always been sealed by the Ancient Wood Sect, the people of the sect must have found a way in, right?","They could roam the periphery and even reach the innermost edges.","Why hadn’t they discovered this place?","Or perhaps they had known all along but couldn’t enter from here!","With this thought, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered, but he didn’t ask further. Their group passed through the group of statues and entered a huge lava cave. The place was unusually damp, with water seeping from the cracks in the rocks. “We’re here!” Lord Hengmu’s voice rang out, and everyone halted.","Wu Li was at the forefront and thus had the clearest view.","Ahead of them was an altar.","The altar looked similar to those outside but was empty inside, devoid of anything.","Jian Wushuang stepped forward, looked around, and asked, “Senior Hengmu, does this altar","require the power of Life to open?”","At the bottom of the altar, he sensed a familiar aura, the very essence of Life.","It seemed this was the entrance mentioned by Lord Hengmu.","Now, numerous strong figures from the outside world were rushing towards this place.","“They didn’t have much time.","They had to quickly open the altar.","And then enter the universe of the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Lord Hengmu emerged directly from Wu Li’s body, not as an illusion, but as a real body.","It was a corporeal form derived from the branches of the Wanliu Divine Tree. Approaching the altar, he casually took out some incense, inserted them into the censer in front of the altar, bowed a couple of times.","Then turned to the crowd and said, “As Jian Wushuang mentioned, this place is the passage to enter the Wanliu Divine Tree. The switch to open the entrance is also special, requiring innate life force. I believe you all understand what innate life force is. It’s the life force bestowed by the source of time and space and the primordial universe, accompanying you since birth.”","In fact, there was one thing Lord Hengmu didn’t mention. The life in the secret realm comes from the source of time and space.","The life in the primordial universe comes from the Origin Source of the primordial universe.","But there is another kind of life that comes from the Origin Source Universe of cultivators.","This kind of life is postnatal.","It doesn’t possess innate life force.","After some thought, it seemed that among these people, it appeared that they were all innate","life forms."]},{"number":5893,"title":"Chapter 5893: Where Did the Power of Life Go?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5893: Where Did the Power of Life Go?","Wu Li and Lord Hengmu both hailed from the original universe or the Sixteen Kingdoms of Qingchao.","In that continent of the Sixteen Kingdoms, bathed in the radiance of Spacetime Origin Source, naturally resided innate life.","The Infinite Great World was also a realm of primordial nature, belonging to the Spacetime Origin Source.","As for Jian Wushuang, his prowess needed no mention.","He wielded the power of innate life.","During his time at the Qishen Temple, several big shots of the Giant God Clan had remarked that such ability was rarely seen even in the Starry Sky.","Upon arriving in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, up to now, only among the Wanliu Willows, was there the power of innate life.","One could imagine how extraordinary this power was.","“Elder, we all understand this. Let’s get started quickly. Divine Wood King has already led his people to the Wanliu Divine Realm. It’s feared that it won’t be long before he descends!” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but urge.","Though he had successfully crossed his tribulation, reaching the Sixth Tribulation realm, he still lacked the confidence to contend with a powerhouse of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","And Divine Wood King had been concealing his strength all along; he might well be a peak powerhouse of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Once he arrived, he could annihilate them in an instant.","He currently had no trump cards to confront an Eighth Tribulation realm.","Seeing this, Lord Hengmu didn’t waste any words either. With a single hand clench, he gathered some innate Life force in his palm.","“Follow my lead. As long as we have sufficient innate Life force, we can open the altar!” Lord Hengmu said and began continuously infusing Life force into the altar.","Jian Wushuang followed suit.","This was too simple for him.","After becoming the Universe Master, his Life force was much stronger than before.","Even resurrecting an Eighth Tribulation realm expert from near death to their peak was no problem.","Reaching in with one hand, a grand green column of air condensed and directly converged at the base of the altar.","Beside him, Lord Hengmu was astonished; his own bit of Life force was insufficient compared to Jian Wushuang’s.","Deep down, he couldn’t help but sigh. If not for Divine Wood King snatching away that","treasure, his Life force could have been as formidable as Jian Wushuang’s.","After obtaining that treasure, Divine Wood King never lacked Life force again.","However, the treasure wasn’t complete.","The Life force it could gather was also not innate Life force.","It wasn’t enough to open the altar.","This was also the reason why he wanted to capture Jian Wushuang.","Capturing Jian Wushuang was like unlocking the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Once they obtained the Wanliu Divine Tree, they would control the complete innate Life force.","So ultimately, the path they would take would lead to resurrection.","Lord Hengmu was no exception.","Although he possessed the incomplete treasure and had scarce Life force, he was the most crucial part, able to condense the innate Life force.","Entering Wanliu was not for the treasure.","Resurrection!","This was the greatest demand of the Scattered Tribulation.","Babidi, Divine Wood King, and Lord Hengmu.","The goal of the three parties was the method of resurrection within the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Only Jian Wushuang and those Scattered Tribulations in the Seventh Tribulation realm were after the treasure.","Speaking of those Scattered Tribulations, they also pursued Life force.","But they didn’t dare to think so big, to dare to think of resurrection.","In the end, only Jian Wushuang remained pure in pursuit, solely for the treasure.","Jian Wushuang continuously gathered Life force.","His Thought power followed those Life power, wanting to enter the bottom of the altar.","But it was mercilessly blocked.","Originally, he wanted to see where these Life forces went.","In the altar, putting in Life power could open and unlock the Wanliu Divine Tree.","So where did this Life force go?","Although it was for the treasure, Jian Wushuang, who had become the Universe Master, didn’t have such a strong demand for the opportunities and treasures within the Wanliu Divine Tree.","He was more interested in knowing what secrets the Wanliu held.","To the extent that it could be ranked alongside the Ancient Moon Ruins and the Wuhua Secret Realm as the three strongest secrets of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","All of them were places ordinary people couldn’t enter.","Of the first two major secrets, the Ancient Moon Ruins would occasionally yield some strange objects, some of which were useful.","The Wuhua Secret Realm, however, didn’t have any particularly important treasures, and it","was stingy.","Few people could bring out treasures from the Wuhua Secret Realm.","The Wanliu Divine Tree was different.","Because it was occupied by the Ancient Wood Faction in the Ancient Wood Continent.","Moreover, one couldn’t enter, and the peripheral treasures were valuable but also dangerous.","What attracted people the most was the Life force.","This attraction was the greatest.","Therefore, the Wanliu Divine Tree’s reputation resounded throughout the nine great","spacetimes.","Even groups of Eighth Tribulation realm Universe Masters came to forcibly enter, but unfortunately, they were directly isolated by the prohibition power upon reaching the inner","circle.","It was like being in an isolated paradise.","There was no power absorption inside, and they almost starved to death.","After coming out, they didn’t dare to enter again.","They were afraid of being trapped and dying.","At first, some people suspected that the Ancient Wood Faction could secretly enter, but later, with the miserable departure of several Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters, no one doubted","it anymore.","The Ancient Wood Sect had always kept the periphery of the Wanliu Divine Wood sealed off.","There had been no movements.","Every time the position of the Holy Maiden was up for election, they would open the Divine Realm once, but only at the very edge.","To think that to reach the Holy Maiden of the Ancient Wood Sect, one needed to enter the","Wanliu Divine Wood.","Jian Wushuang’s thoughts were stirred.","According to the temperament of the Divine Wood King, the position of the Holy Maiden was","probably also a prelude to opening the Wanyan.","Unfortunately, after so many years, they had not succeeded.","The innate Life force, how could it be so easy?","The gathered Life force kept entering the bottom of the altar.","But the entire altar showed no change.","The incense that Lord Hengmu had just lit went out.","In the time of an incense stick burning, his Life force was enough to revive someone on the","brink of death in the Eighth Tribulation realm.","So much Life force, yet there was no reaction.","How could Wu Li have dared to say such words back then?","He couldn’t help but turn his head to look at Lord Hengmu, unmistakably filled with doubt.","Lord Hengmu paused for a moment, then explained, “I don’t know either. According to my","initial calculations, it should have been enough long ago.”","“Senior Hengmu, this wasn’t your first time entering, was it?” Jian Wushuang was now very","suspicious.","When Lord Hengmu first entered, it definitely wasn’t here.","Otherwise, how much Life force would have been needed to irrigate it?","Moreover, when Lord Hengmu entered, he was only at the Third Tribulation realm.","That bit of strength, what could it have done?","Back then, those who believed in this statement were simply ignorant.","They didn’t delve deeper.","In that particular era, indeed, countless strong individuals poured into the Wanliu Divine","Wood.","It was also at that time that an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master paved the way.","That’s why they could safely follow.","This part made sense.","But how they entered the inner part, how could that be explained?","Jian Wushuang couldn’t believe this explanation.","Seeing Jian Wushuang beginning to doubt himself, Lord Hengmu hurriedly sighed,","“Wushuang, why don’t you hold on a bit longer? Trust me, entering the Wanliu Divine Wood must be from here, otherwise, there’s no way.”","The Life force Jian Wushuang gathered continued to flow incessantly into those statues along","the bottom of the altar."]},{"number":5894,"title":"Chapter 5894: Falling Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 5894: Falling Out","Because he had been staring at the altar all along, neither he nor Lord Hengmu sensed anything amiss.","It was Danbao who first noticed something amiss and hastily shouted to the two of them, “Those statues seem to be moving!”","“What?” This time, he didn’t hesitate. He immediately halted the Life power he had gathered in his hands and dashed outside.","The statues outside had already changed positions.","It seemed they had indeed moved just now.","Seeing this, Lord Hengmu grew anxious and hurriedly urged, “Don’t worry about those statues. We’re almost there. Even if they come to life, it doesn’t matter. As long as we enter before they fully awaken, we’ll be fine!”","The more Lord Hengmu urged, the less anxious Jian Wushuang became.","This only made Lord Hengmu even more agitated.","He quickly beckoned Wu Li over to persuade him.","“Brother Wushuang, now is not the time to be stubborn. If the Divine Wood King and his people arrive later, we’re done for!” Wu Li urged earnestly.","However, Jian Wushuang remained unmoved. He turned his head slowly towards Wu Li and asked, “What has Lord Hengmu promised you?”","This question caught Wu Li off guard.","Lord Hengmu was his master. Back when he was just an ordinary person, he stumbled upon a branch and thus embarked on the path of cultivation.","Everything Lord Hengmu had promised him back then had been fulfilled.","The Wu family had flourished.","He himself had become an immortal .","Later, he established the Wu family and became its patriarch.","Until he reached the level of Universe Master.","His dream had long been realized.","Now, it was just a matter of repaying kindness, and he also wanted to ascend further.","Wu Li didn’t know much about Lord Hengmu’s plan. But ever since he became a Universe Master, Lord Hengmu had often talked to him about the Ten Thousand Willow Godwood.","This matter had taken root in his heart long ago.","Not entering the Ten Thousand Willows would leave a regret in his life.","Now, being asked by Jian Wushuang, he was indeed caught off guard.","“I!” Wu Li glanced at Lord Hengmu, then back at Jian Wushuang, and said firmly, “Of course, it’s to become stronger. Jian Wushuang, we’re not kids anymore. There’s no need to dwell on too much. As long as we enter the Ten Thousand Willows Godwood, my master will definitely not let you down!”","Given the choice between Jian Wushuang and Lord Hengmu, Wu Li would undoubtedly choose the latter.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t surprised to hear such words.","But such words had been spoken since the ordinary days.","Now, Jian Wushuang heard them like air.","If there hadn’t been any changes here, he might have believed some of it.","But now, before entering the Wanliu Divine Tree, such things were happening.","The carvings outside were coming back to life.","With formidable strength.","How could this not worry Jian Wushuang?","What if his Life power didn’t open the passage to the Wanliu Divine Tree?","But instead revived these statues?","That would be foolish.","Who knew what these carvings would become after being revived.","On both sides of the altar and above, there were at least seven to eight Tribulation Realm","auras.","If all of them came alive, it would be detrimental to them. Before Divine Wood King arrived, he would meet his end on the spot.","So, he dared not continue to infuse Life power into the altar.","Unless Lord Hengmu could give a reason.","Or explain the current situation.","There was no trace of a passage, not even a sign.","Instead, the carvings began to revive.","“Hengmu, if you swear now on your life to take me into the Wanliu Willows and not harm us, I","will continue to infuse Life power. Otherwise, forget about it!” Jian Wushuang felt the","pressure from afar and knew that delaying wouldn’t do any good.","They could only choose to avoid the risk.","So, Lord Hengmu made this vow.","He could tell that Lord Hengmu’s current state was not weak, he was at the Scattered Tribulation stage.","In terms of divine power, he had at least two million.","If he were still an Emperor, he would probably be arbitrarily controlled by the other party.","The oath Wu Li laid down back then was aimed at Wu Li.","He had not made any oath with Lord Hengmu.","Seeing this, Wu Li also turned to look at Lord Hengmu and respectfully said, “Master, why not make an oath first to reassure Jian Wushuang and the others!”","“You shut up!” Lord Hengmu shouted angrily.","This angry shout startled Wu Li.","He didn’t know why Lord Hengmu was so angry.","“It’s all because of you, you troublemaker. You insisted on helping Jian Wushuang through his tribulation. If he hadn’t succeeded, would I still need to beg you like this?” Lord Hengmu no longer concealed his anger, his figure suddenly changed, his originally green tree-like body turned into a dark red tree bark armor.","His aura kept rising, and this aura was no longer the power of Life, but a terrifying power of","destruction.","After seeing this scene, Wu Li found it unbelievable.","The difference between him and his previous master was too great.","For a moment, he couldn’t accept it at all.","“It’s finally revealed your true colors. You’re unwilling to make two simple oaths. I’m afraid you never intended to take us into Wanliu, and this place isn’t the passage to Wanliu, is it?”","Jian Wushuang sneered.","Moreover, Lord Hengmu didn’t even discuss it, he just turned hostile directly, probably also eyeing his attention and the treasures inside Danbao’s body.","Thinking of Wu Li’s confession in front of the Elder Blu, Jian Wushuang felt disgusted.","Wu Li hesitated and leaned towards Jian Wushuang, but all he received was cold eyes.","Blu and Danbao must believe in Jian Wushuang.","Lord Hengmu sneered and said, “I originally wanted to use you again, but I didn’t expect you","to figure it out so quickly. Then I’ll just send you on your way!”","“Such arrogance!” Blu stepped forward immediately, his aura surged, and his two million","divine powers erupted directly.","Jian Wushuang also directly displayed the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, ready to","make a move at any time.","The plan of the Wanliu Divine Tree became a joke from now on.","“Hengmu, do you think that reviving a few small fries will allow you to control us?”","He drew out the Wanjie Sword, and the terrifying power of the Starry Sky soared suddenly.","This power made everyone shiver with fear.","“Oh really?” Lord Hengmu waved his hand and shouted angrily, “Zuo Yehui!”","Boom!","The mountain began to shake.","Jian Wushuang turned his head to look at the carving on the left side of the altar.","The dark green stone shell on the carving began to fall off, and a terrifying savage beast began","to revive.","“Not good, retreat!” Jian Wushuang grabbed Danbao and Blu and rushed out of the mountain.","With a flash, they arrived above the valley.","At this moment, Divine Wood King and others also arrived.","Seeing Jian Wushuang and the others fleeing, Divine Wood King was not surprised, he just","said indifferently, “Where do you think you’re escaping to?”","Jian Wushuang also saw Divine Wood King and the others."]},{"number":5895,"title":"Chapter 5895: Divine Wood King","paragraphs":["Chapter 5895: Divine Wood King","The nine Grand Elders each possessed 2 million units of divine power.","The eighteen Core Elders, on the other hand, had around 1.8 million divine power.","Even without considering Divine Wood King, these individuals alone were formidable enough to give them a hard time if they were to be besieged.","Things were truly dire now.","If only he had known, he wouldn’t have fled, but rather confronted Lord Hengmu directly.","He had underestimated everything.","He thought that even if Lord Hengmu wasn’t that capable, he could still lead them into the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Then, whatever schemes arose, they could still escape.","But who could have imagined that after discussing the plan for so long, it would end up being a joke?","Lord Hengmu had no intention of leading them into the Wanliu at all.","Or perhaps, it was genuinely impossible to enter the Wanliu.","Perhaps Lord Hengmu only used this opportunity to come here as a pretext for his revival.","They had all been played.","“Divine Wood King, Lord Hengmu is right below us, he’s about to enter the Wanliu Divine Tree, why don’t you stop him?” Jian Wushuang still wanted to use Lord Hengmu’s plan to deceive Divine Wood King.","Since there was enmity between Divine Wood King and Lord Hengmu, he must have been aware of Lord Hengmu’s entry into the Wanliu.","It would be perfect to let the two of them fight first.","But as soon as he said it, it only drew laughter from Divine Wood King.","He looked at him as if he were a fool.","“I’ve has guarded the Wanliu for countless eons, and this is the first time I’ve heard such a ridiculous thing!”","Divine Wood King gestured for a few of the supreme elders behind him to go and take a look, then he turned to Jian Wushuang and said, “Don’t bring up such childish matters to deceive me. Entering the Wanliu isn’t as simple as you think. You possess the complete power of innate life, yet you’re still so naive. Why collaborate with that waste of space, Lord Hengmu, instead of coming to me?”","“Come to you!” Jian Wushuang thought to himself, “That would only lead to a quicker death.”","He wanted to roll his eyes, but he didn’t dare.","The other party had just exposed his plan in an instant.","Just as Divine Wood King said.","Having guarded the Wanliu for countless eons, no one knew the Wanliu Divine Tree better than him.","It couldn’t be as simple as Lord Hengmu had described.","Just enter and that’s it.","Who did they take the Wanliu for?","Divine Wood King had been guarding the Wanliu for so many years; he probably had thoroughly explored the outskirts.","This place probably knew as well.","If they really could enter from here, he would have already done so.","It required the power of innate life, and if necessary, a blood sacrifice would suffice.","Although it required a significant amount, the Ancient Wood Sect controlled so many wild worlds.","If they pooled their resources, they could manage.","Why didn’t they do that?","Jian Wushuang cursed his own foolishness; he should have thought of it before entering.","Back then, he might have had hope if he had fled.","But now!","It was much more difficult.","“Jian Wushuang, there are two paths before you now. First, follow me back to the Ancient Wood Sect, and I can make you the sect leader, equal to me. Second, take down Lord Hengmu, help me recover a treasure, and I’ll take you into the Wanliu. There’s only one chance; you need to think carefully before you answer!”","Divine Wood King transmitted his message to him.","It meant that neither of these things was meant to be known to outsiders.","And both of these choices required siding with the Divine Wood King.","Wasn’t that equivalent to having no choice at all?","Jian Wushuang was torn!","At this moment, Divine Wood King spoke again, loudly, “Even without you, I can achieve the second option, but it will take some time. You’ve only wasted a continuous stream of Life power. I suggest you choose the latter, and I can swear an oath to ensure your safety. You can walk sideways on the Ancient Wood Continent!”","An oath!","This time, Jian Wushuang was intrigued.","By expending some Life power, he could enter the Wanliu Willows.","Wasn’t this the same as Hengmu’s previous plan?","It was just some Life force, which meant nothing to him.","And it could also guarantee his safety.","This condition sounded much stronger than Hengmu’s.","Moreover, the words of Divine Wood King were convincing.","Just as he was about to agree, a tremendous aura erupted from the valley below.","Boom!","After a loud noise,","The several elders of the Ancient Wood Sect who had entered the valley earlier all returned in","a sorry state.","Following them was a terrifying savage beast.","“Zuo Yehui!” Jian Wushuang and Divine Wood King said the name simultaneously.","This was the statue that had just been revived by Lord Hengmu.","Divine Wood King turned to Jian Wushuang and hurriedly asked, “How much Life force did","you inject into the altar?”","This question stumped him.","For a moment, he couldn’t calculate how much!","He could only vaguely say, “It’s enough to revive a dying Eighth Tribulation realm!”","“You’re quite daring. Haven’t you noticed anything suspicious about this place?” Divine","Wood King admired Jian Wushuang’s courage.","He had long noticed something odd about this place.","It happened after Lord Hengmu left the Wanliu Willow Divine Tree.","These statues were originally living beings.","And they were the life within the Wanliu Divine Tree.","They were brought out by Lord Hengmu.","After bringing them out, Lord Hengmu used the altar to absorb all the Life force of these","savage beasts into his own body.","That’s why these powerful savage beasts turned into statues.","Now, Lord Hengmu’s plan was not to enter the Wanliu Divine Tree but to revive these statues","and seek revenge on Divine Wood King.","Divine Wood King was also wary of this point. He immediately asked, “Has You Yebai and that","monk also been revived?”","“Not yet!” Jian Wushuang thought for a moment.","One carving on each side of the altar.","On top of the altar, there was also a bare-chested wooden monk.","These two remained motionless.","Seeing the expression of Divine Wood King, it was evident that he was wary of these statues.","“Fortunately, it’s just a Zuo Yehui. I can handle it. If the You Yebai and that old monk were also revived, you would be in big trouble. It seems your Life force is indeed extraordinary. You managed to revive Zuo Yehui in such a short time!” Divine Wood King’s complexion eased a bit, not forgetting to praise Jian Wushuang’s Life force.","Zuo Yehui rose into the air, but after floating in mid-air, he transformed into a human form, dressed in gray, with a stony face. With a roll of his eyes, he finally revealed a trace of white eyeballs, scanning everyone and stopping on Divine Wood King.","“Have you been spying on us all these years?”","Divine Wood King nodded and said indifferently, “Indeed, you guys who were dug out of the","Wanliu Willows must be kept an eye on. Otherwise, if you cause any trouble, it wouldn’t be","easy for me to deal with!”","“Do you think it can end now?” Zuo Yehui’s figure shook, instantly appearing in front of","Divine Wood King.","He started attacking halfway through his words.","No wonder Divine Wood King had them retreat first.","The two’s confrontation was intense.","Fortunately, this was a divine realm. Otherwise, one blow could destroy everything here.","But even so, half the valley was still destroyed."]},{"number":5896,"title":"Chapter 5896: Two Choices","paragraphs":["Chapter 5896: Two Choices","“Zuo Yehui, I know you. You followed Hengmu out in the beginning. He betrayed you like this, yet you still help him so fervently, why?” Divine Wood King restrained his divine power, facing Zuo Yehui on equal footing.","He wanted to persuade the other party.","But Zuo Yehui remained silent like a puppet, only focusing on his attack.","Divine Wood King noticed something suspicious, seeming to understand.","“It seems like you’ve already been controlled by that guy Hengmu. There’s no need to talk further!” Divine Wood King suddenly exploded, punching Zuo Yehui into the valley.","His divine power erupted at that moment.","The immense force shook the Divine Realm.","With clenched fists, Divine Wood King shouted angrily, his divine power reaching a terrifying level.","“I’ve endured for so many years. I wonder if you can handle what comes next!” Divine Wood King glanced down at the valley, then disappeared from the spot.","Soon after, the valley below erupted with violent fluctuations.","Jian Wushuang stood in the air, watching with awe.","The outburst from Divine Wood King, the power in that moment, felt comparable to Chi Jiuxiao.","It was too powerful.","Definitely the peak strength of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Zuo Yehui’s strength was not bad either. Even after transforming into his true form, he could contend with Divine Wood King.","But he had always been at a disadvantage; in a death match, Zuo Yehui was certainly not Divine Wood King’s match.","But resolving the battle quickly was impossible.","This made him consider whether he should seize the opportunity to escape?","He looked around.","27 Seventh Tribulation realm experts surrounded him.","9 of them had divine power exceeding 2 million.","These people were obviously on guard against him.","If he dared to escape now, even if these people couldn’t stop him, Divine Wood King would probably arrive first.","Then it wouldn’t be a spectator sport like now.","He might end up sealed.","He couldn’t gamble anymore.","Perhaps now wasn’t the time; there might be more powerful beings arriving soon.","The more people there were, the greater his chances.","He communicated with Elder Blu and Danbao beside him, reassuring them, then quietly waited for the situation to change.","The battle in the valley continued.","But the presence of Lord Hengmu was nowhere to be seen.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed as he thought of the altar.","The Life force of Lord Hengmu was scarce but almost infinite.","With sufficient time, he could revive You Yenbai and the old monk mentioned by Divine Wood King.","If these two were revived, even Divine Wood King might not be their match.","He hesitated whether to remind Divine Wood King.","If he did, Divine Wood King might cause trouble for Lord Hengmu, leading to his demise.","He chose to abide by the conditions set by Divine Wood King.","If he didn’t remind Divine Wood King and let the other two revive, Divine Wood King would be defeated.","He could then seize the opportunity to escape.","However, he feared releasing more terrifying beings, which could truly change the situation in Ancient Moon Spacetime.","But maybe a change wouldn’t be so bad.","He could just leave and go to another spacetime or return directly to Qishen Temple.","The journey was long, giving him ample time for cultivation.","Perhaps it was better to disregard the affairs here and let them unfold as they may.","After all, wasn’t there still the Ancient Moon Sect?","The nine-star sect.","It was led by an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master, the most powerful one at the pinnacle of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Bringing the Origin Source Universe directly, suppressing these matters wouldn’t be an issue. But then he realized that perhaps all external news had been sealed off by now.","The Ancient Wood Sect surely didn’t want outsiders to know of their existence, or else all the powerful beings from the heavens and the earth would flood in.","By then, the advantage wouldn’t lie with the Ancient Wood Sect anymore.","Currently, it was best to close the door and endure any beatings that came their way.","“Babidi, why don’t you come?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","Ironically, now he hoped Babidi would come.","The more chaotic, the better.","Babidi was creating the path of resurrection, and he also needed the Life force.","Within the Wanliu Willow Divine Tree, there was an endless supply of Life force.","In the valley, Divine Wood King erupted completely, directly suppressing and assaulting Zuo Yehui.","His divine power kept soaring while Zuo Yehui reached his limit, being a top-tier force in the Eighth Tribulation realm. His divine power reached a staggering 8 million, yet he was still being brutally beaten by Divine Wood King.","Fortunately, his divine body was strong enough to withstand it.","Within the mountain, in front of the altar, Lord Hengmu paid no attention to the external battles and continued to infuse his Life force into the altar.","Next to him stood Wu Li.","Wu Li’s eyes were dull as he stared at the wooden monk above the altar.","His eyes had glazed over.","The Lord of Hengmu had no time to deal with Wu Li.","In his view, Wu Li’s value had already been exhausted.","The master-disciple relationship ended here.","If in the future he could successfully seek revenge, kill Divine Wood King, and retrieve the","treasure.","And then reach the peak again.","Then he would give Wu Li some benefits.","But there was no time to consider that now.","Buzz!","The statue on the right side of the altar began to tremble.","The Lord of Hengmu exclaimed excitedly, “You Yenbai, awaken!”","Zuo Yehui, You Yenbai.","Once these two great warlords were revived.","They would already be able to rival Divine Wood King.","Next, he could fully focus on reviving that wooden monk.","Once the monk was revived, he could win.","For now, he could only say he had won half the battle.","After the statue of You Yenbai trembled, like Zuo Yehui, it began to shed its stone shell.","Finally revealing its true form.","“Hurry, go out and help Zuo Yehui, withstand Divine Wood King!” the Lord of Hengmu","ordered directly.","You Yenbai didn’t hesitate either, answering with a voice as wooden as a puppet before","flashing out of the mountain.","Boom!","Directly smashing through the wall, rushing out of the mountain.","This startled the Lord of Hengmu.","As he looked up, he saw the figure of Divine Wood King.","But it had already been intercepted by You Yenbai.","Zuo Yehui and You Yenbai, the two great warlords, were simultaneously battling Divine Wood","King.","Completely blocking Divine Wood King.","Divine Wood King also noticed the altar and the Lord of Hengmu.","He thought the Lord of Hengmu had long since escaped, but didn’t expect him to still be here.","His heart suddenly panicked!","“You also control the innate Life force?” Divine Wood King couldn’t believe it.","He clearly obtained the most core treasure.","How come what he controlled wasn’t the innate Life force?","The Lord of Hengmu sneered, turning his head to continue injecting Life force.","But it was because of this gap that he noticed Wu Li’s expression.","Following that direction, he looked up at the figure above the altar.","Not looking would have been better; this look startled him.","There was no wooden monk above the altar at this moment, but a real monk lying there.","A shabby and dirty old monk.","Originally, the old monk was just staring at Wu Li.","When he noticed the Lord of Hengmu looking at him, he turned his gaze back, looking at the","Lord of Hengmu.","“Little guy, surprised, aren’t you?” The old monk jumped down from above, stood in front of","the Lord of Hengmu, casually scratched his ear with his dirty claws, wore a smiling face, but with a casual punch, directly blasted the Lord of Hengmu out of the mountain. Then he walked towards Wu Li in a carefree manner."]},{"number":5897,"title":"Chapter 5897: Wu Li’s Father","paragraphs":["Chapter 5897: Wu Li’s Father","Wu Li returned to reality from his stupor, but now he felt even more dazed, rooted to the spot, afraid to move.","The old monk was unpredictable in his emotions but terrifying in his strength.","Approaching Wu Li, his grimy arm wrapped around Wu Li’s neck, he spoke, “Kid, no, wait, you’re not a kid anymore. I see you’re quite exceptional. Do you want to follow me from now -on?”","“You’re right!” Wu Li couldn’t even catch his breath, only able to nod frantically.","He believed everything the old monk said.","“Don’t be afraid. Your bones are extraordinary. I sincerely consider you my son. Don’t disappoint me!”","The old monk forcefully pulled Wu Li out of the mountain.","Lord Hengmu also rose, utterly shocked.","“How is this possible? I had already controlled him, why would he still attack me?”","He couldn’t comprehend it at all.","After bringing these guys out of the Wanliu Willows, he turned them into statues with the altar and enslaved them with secret techniques.","They were to be revived when needed in the future!","But why were they revived now, all fine except for the old monk who was uncontrollable? And he even attacked him.","Seeing the old monk holding onto Wu Li, he instantly understood.","There was no movement during their revival.","It seemed like the secret technique had gone wrong.","Regretting his past decisions, he blamed everything on Wu Li.","He shouldn’t have chosen someone from the Wanliu Willows as his disciple.","Now, because of Wu Li alone, he lost everything.","“Hengmu, you’ve raised my adopted son well, so I’ve decided to let you die a little later!” The old monk spoke crazily.","But Wu Li caught the key point in his words.","“My son?”","“Who the hell is your son?”","Though he dared not say it aloud, he complained inwardly.","Then he carefully recalled his mundane mortal life.","Born into a mundane family, with a carpenter father, none of his ancestors had been monks.","No matter how he calculated it, it all seemed like nonsense.","But the old monk didn’t care.","He turned to Wu Li and said, “Do you not believe me?”","Wu Li nodded and shook his head.","If he were really given such an almighty father, he should be happy!","With that in mind, he directly addressed him as father.","“Father above, please accept my bow!”","Hearing Wu Li’s words, the old monk was delighted and slapped him on the head.","Wu Li, a Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulations, couldn’t withstand it and fell downwards.","At the same time, he cursed inwardly; this father figure might not be a good person.","Seeing this, the old monk apologized, saying, “Sorry, I’ve just been revived, still not good at controlling my strength!”","Then he followed suit, fishing Wu Li out again.","Seeing Wu Li half-dead, the old monk scratched his crotch and, in a flash, produced a small black sphere.","Wu Li, half-conscious, wanted to die at the sight of it.","He hurriedly stopped the old monk’s actions.","But he couldn’t match the old monk’s strength.","So, he could only keep his mouth shut, refusing to eat it.","“Be obedient, or your old man will get angry!” The old monk glared, almost scaring Wu Li to death. Reluctantly, he opened his mouth.","Seeing this, the old monk said, “That’s more like it. From now on, I’m your father. If anyone bullies you, you tell them my name!”","“Okay...”","Wu Li wasn’t sure if he was responding to the old monk or answering the question of whether he had swallowed the black ball himself.","It felt like something was stuck in his throat.","His speech became somewhat awkward.","...","Once that thing transformed into a gentle force and entered his origin, his expression lit up","with joy.","A force from the highest Law Rules began to condense within his Origin Source.","The same scene unfolded in the Yue Kingdom.","Only the Wu Family within the Yue Kingdom was involved.","Wu Li’s Origin Source Universe was right here.","But it was in the air.","Corresponding to the ground.","In his Origin Source Universe, Tribulations began to gather.","This was the sixth Tribulation.","Just because of a black sphere, he unexpectedly began to undergo Tribulation.","Just a black sphere could instantly make him undergo Tribulation.","At this moment, he really wanted to eat another black sphere.","Even if it was squeezed from the old monk’s pants, he would still eat it.","This sixth Tribulation came so easily.","And it passed quite effortlessly.","Whether it was the Supreme Tribulation or the Tribulation on his body.","Wu Li, with a divine power of 1 million, easily accepted it.","Some were lucky, some were unlucky.","Like the Lord of Hengmu.","Although he controlled Zuo Yehui and You Yenbai, the two great war beasts.","Unfortunately, he hadn’t completely taken down the old monk, which was still","disadvantageous for him.","Divine Wood King was entangled with the two great war beasts.","Lord Hengmu could only face the old monk alone.","The battle in the valley slowed down after the old monk appeared.","Divine Wood King looked somewhat embarrassed. He could deal with the two great war beasts, but after the old monk appeared, the situation became somewhat uncontrollable.","“Oh, why stop fighting?” The old monk casually sat on a pile of rubble, while Wu Li obediently stood behind him.","Jian Wushuang in the sky could see clearly.","He never imagined that Wu Li’s identity would be so complicated.","From a pawn, he instantly became a key figure in controlling the situation.","Sometimes, luck is just so miraculous.","There were just constant transformations.","Buzz!","After receiving orders from Lord Hengmu, the two great war beasts stopped and transformed","into human forms, standing behind Lord Hengmu one after another.","“You old thing, I shouldn’t have saved you back then!” Lord Hengmu was frustrated and","regretted not leaving the old monk in the Wanliu Willow Realm back then, let alone treating","Wu Li as a pawn.","Divine Wood King, because he obtained the treasure brought out by Lord Hengmu and investigated for these years, also had a rough understanding of this matter.","Originally thought that the old monk was with Lord Hengmu, now it seemed that the old","monk was not under Hengmu’s control at all.","This was advantageous for him.","It’s much better than letting Lord Hengmu dominate alone.","Especially seeing that the two were still not in harmony, it was even better.","“The air outside is good, finally let this old man escape from inside, no one should ever try to control me again in the future!” The old monk slowly stood up, and his breath suddenly burst","out.","That powerful divine power vaguely surpassed even Divine Wood King.","The people in the air were also startled.","Especially Blu and Danbao.","They didn’t know much about the outside world.","They didn’t expect to encounter someone much stronger than Gula just after leaving the","Infinite Great World with Jian Wushuang.","For a moment, they were a bit bewildered.","Jian Wushuang was the same."]},{"number":5898,"title":"Chapter 5898: Dao Guardian","paragraphs":["Chapter 5898: Dao Guardian","He wanted to enter the Wanliu Willow to challenge the Tribulation realm.","Now, after becoming the Universe Master, he didn’t actually yearn for the Wanliu Willow Divine Tree that much.","Mainly because of Jiang Shang.","He wanted to see what secrets were hidden within the Wanliu Willow.","But now, things had changed.","Lord Hengmu had turned hostile, so he wasn’t prepared to enter the Wanliu Willow again.","Instead, it was Divine Wood King who pointed him towards a different path.","He was initially tempted, but given the current circumstances, he no longer desired to enter the Wanliu Willow.","Not to mention the two powerful beasts by Lord Hengmu’s side.","Let alone that old monk, Wu Li’s father.","His divine power surpassed even the peak Divine Wood King by a thread.","He truly didn’t have the confidence to contend with these old guys.","At least not now.","Perhaps if he advanced further, there might still be a chance.","Now, it all depended on what these big shots were planning!","Anyway, he couldn’t reverse the current situation.","As the ruler of the Ancient Wood Continent, Divine Wood King exuded the aura of a natural king. Regardless of how powerful the old monk was or how eccentric his personality, it didn’t matter.","After assessing the current situation, he took the initiative to step forward.","“Since you all claim to have escaped from within the Wanliu Willow, you probably have no interest in it anymore. Why don’t I send you away to see the sights of the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands? Isn’t that wonderful?” He addressed this to the old monk and the two great beasts, excluding Lord Hengmu.","Lord Hengmu had to stay.","This was his bottom line.","Except for the two great beasts who might obstruct, the old monk probably wouldn’t intervene.","As expected, it played out just as he had anticipated.","The old monk chuckled, “Hehe, you talk sweetly, kid. I like it and I agree! I won’t set foot in the Wanliu Willow again!”","The term ‘kid’ was particularly grating.","It irked Divine Wood King.","He was the first Eighth Tribulation powerhouse of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Even the first-generation Pope of the Ancient Moon Sect had no right to address him so casually.","If it weren’t for the bigger picture, he would have smashed the old monk’s teeth in.","Didn’t they realize he had more power than that!","He indeed possessed the peak strength of his former glory.","But his peak now surpassed his peak back then.","Who didn’t have a few cards up their sleeves?","Understanding the other’s character, Divine Wood King decided to endure it.","Moreover, there were still matters he could make use of from the old monk.","“Since Dao Friend also thinks the same, why don’t we join forces? If I slaughter Lord Hengmu,","it will also free the other two friends!” After Divine Wood King finished, he looked towards Zuo Yehui and You Yenbai.","These two great beasts were troublesome.","Difficult to defeat.","If Lord Hengmu relied on the two great beasts to escape, it would be challenging for him to pursue.","The old monk nodded again and agreed, “You’re right, everything you said is right!”","With that said, Lord Hengmu chuckled.","He understood the old monk the best.","The more he said so, the less likely they would cooperate.","“Divine Wood King, you really think too simplistically. Do you even know the true identity of this old monk?” Lord Hengmu couldn’t help but sneer, “He’s a guardian of the Dao, a guardian of the force of Life. If I’m not mistaken, you’ve tied Jian Wushuang. Do you think this old guy will cooperate with you?”","Lord Hengmu couldn’t contain his laughter, clutching his stomach.","He thought Divine Wood King was both foolish and naive.","Jian Wushuang in the sky heard this and couldn’t help but feel delighted.","He had originally thought Wu Li had lucked out finding a father figure.","But it turned out his luck was even better, as he had just stumbled upon a Dao Guardian for","free.","This luck finally smiled upon him.","He had witnessed the old monk’s strength with his own eyes.","He was definitely a peak expert of the Eighth Tribulation.","With this person guarding him, he could traverse the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime","unimpeded.","He didn’t need to bother with Wanliu anymore!","He could just return home directly, go back to Qishen Temple, deal with Mie Sheng, it was all just a matter of time.","No matter how many tricks Mie Sheng had up his sleeve, how powerful he was.","In the face of a peak expert of the Eighth Tribulation realm, what could he amount to?","Wu Li, behind the old monk, was also stunned when he heard the truth, then he looked towards Jian Wushuang in the sky.","He had thought he had latched onto a big shot, but he hadn’t expected this big shot to be Jian Wushuang’s Dao Guardian, which left a bitter taste in his mouth.","But being alive was enough.","And now he had become the Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm, which was","already quite satisfying.","He had no more interest in Wanliu.","For a moment.","The only one still entangled with Wanliu on the scene was Divine Wood King, and the treasure","inside Lord Hengmu’s body.","That wasn’t even the main concern.","The key issue was that now it seemed like even Jian Wushuang couldn’t be handled.","The old monk slowly rose into the air, pointing at Lord Hengmu and saying, “You brat, you’re","quite right!”","Then, in a flash, he appeared beside Jian Wushuang, waving his hand to send the 9 Grand Elders of the Ancient Wood Sect and the 18 Core Elders flying, completely separating them from Jian Wushuang and the others.","It was at this moment that the old monk’s expression became serious, his aura calm as he walked towards Jian Wushuang through the air.","Behind Jian Wushuang, Danbao was a little afraid, and Elder Blu stood directly in front of","Danbao.","The two of them found it hard to understand what these people were saying.","They just felt the old monk’s aura threatening them, so they were a bit panicked.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s face was full of joy, unable to contain his happiness.","He noticed that Elder Blu and Danbao were somewhat flustered, so he quickly reached out to comfort them, saying, “Don’t be afraid, we’re all on the same side now, we’ve got someone to","rely on!”","After finishing speaking, he approached the old monk voluntarily. Although he knew the other party was his Dao Guardian, he still maintained respect for the powerful.","Lord Hengmu in the valley was somewhat displeased, but this was the reality, and he could","only accept it.","He had thought that having the old monk under control would make things easier, but it turned out that Jian Wushuang had obtained a Guardian for free, causing trouble for himself. He also possessed innate Life force, so why wouldn’t the old monk become his Guardian? Thinking back to when he left Wanliu, the other party had looked down on him in every way. Later on, he trapped the old monk, the two great war beasts, and thousands of strong individuals from Wanliu here.","Then he employed the secret technique of soul enslavement.","Controlling these people.","Wanting them to be his Guardians.","Now the plan was halfway successful.","Only the old monk remained uncontrolled; the rest had no issues.","It could be considered a gain.","On the side of the Divine Wood King, things were awkward.","Losing Jian Wushuang meant that there was little hope upon entering Wanliu.","He could only rely on the incomplete treasure left on Lord Hengmu’s body to boost his own","strength again.","However, this also meant that he lost the opportunity to ascend step by step.","Otherwise, why would he go to such lengths to plan in Wanliu?","The treasures and opportunities within Wanliu.","Nobody outside knew what they were.","Divine Wood King also learned some information from the treasures of Lord Hengmu.","Within the Wanliu Divine Tree, there was a path.","That path was the path to godhood.","It transcended the Tribulation realm, beyond the control of the highest Law Rules.","It was the true god in spacetime.","Stronger than the Ninth Tribulation realm.","Escaping spacetime from then on.","Above all beings. What a pity!"]},{"number":5899,"title":"Chapter 5899: Embarrassed Jian Wushuang","paragraphs":["Chapter 5899: Embarrassed Jian Wushuang","Divine Wood King gazed at the sky, where Jian Wushuang and the old monk were about to meet, murmuring to himself, “Perhaps this is fate.”","Jian Wushuang’s power was undeniable to all who witnessed it. He now possessed the innate power of Life.","Having such a chance must surely be the favor of the highest order of Law Rules.","With such heaven-defying opportunities, how could there not be a Guardian?","The eyes of everyone were filled with envy and jealousy as they looked at the two figures intersecting in the sky.","Jian Wushuang’s mouth almost curved into a smile as he reached out towards the old monk, who reciprocated the gesture, grinning.","But just as the two were about to meet, Jian Wushuang froze in place.","The old monk, in a subtle maneuver, bypassed him and walked towards Danbao and Elder Blu.","This scene surprised everyone greatly.","They thought the old monk was joking.","How could he bypass Jian Wushuang and go to Danbao?","A descendant of the Dragon God?","How could he possibly be related to the Guardian of the power of Life?","Elder Blu was also nervous, but he could tell from the old monk’s eyes that there was no malice, so he slowly stepped aside.","Danbao looked at the old monk, his gaze innocent, unsure of what to say.","“Old...” The old monk stood before Danbao, first wiping his somewhat dirty paws, then taking Danbao’s hands.","He was about to speak, but the word ‘old’ hung on his lips.","However, remembering someone’s instructions, he immediately changed his tone, saying, “Elder, humble monk, greetings to the young master!”","Such a polite address stunned everyone. Was this the same carefree monk from before?","All eyes converged on Danbao, completely forgetting Jian Wushuang.","Poor Jian Wushuang stood awkwardly in the air, wishing he could find a hole to crawl into.","Why did all the good things have to pass him by?","At this moment, Wu Li soared into the air and arrived opposite Jian Wushuang. Finally seeing a familiar face, he wanted to approach to ease the embarrassment.","But to his surprise, Wu Li, grinning, also bypassed him and headed towards Danbao.","“Oh, this is quite a situation! Turns out we’re all on the same side, little Danbao!” Wu Li said, wanting to get closer.","But before he could reach Danbao, the old monk slapped him away.","Fortunately, the old monk controlled his strength, and Wu Li only ended up with a swollen half of his face, without any serious injury.","If the old monk had truly intended harm, that slap could have killed a Seventh Tribulation expert.","After being slapped away, Wu Li dared not approach again, feeling a bit aggrieved as he covered his face.","“Hmph, worthless riffraff!” Jian Wushuang snorted coldly.","Seizing the opportunity, he relaxed a bit, turned around, looked at Danbao, and cast a glance at Elder Blu.","He was signaling that everything was fine.","Although initially bewildered, Danbao gradually understood the situation through some transmissions from the old monk.","After nodding blankly, Danbao respectfully bowed to the old monk.","The old monk quickly returned the gesture, saying, “Young master, please, I cannot accept your respect!”","Seeing the old monk’s reluctance, Danbao had no choice but to stand up.","“Master, just call me Danbao from now on. Let me introduce you. This is Elder Blu, the perfect warrior of my Polunga Clan, and my benefactor, Jian Wushuang!” Danbao gestured towards Blu and then looked at Jian Wushuang.","The old monk first smiled at Blu, then turned his gaze to Jian Wushuang, but there was a hint of killing intent in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang, who had intended to step forward, could only remain in place.","“Danbao is fortunate to meet you, Master!” Jian Wushuang politely returned the gesture.","But deep down, he felt extremely uncomfortable.","Why did he become Danbao’s Guardian?","He was the one who possessed the purest Life force.","Why someone else and not him?","Just as he was pondering this in his heart.","The old monk’s voice turned cold. “Jian Wushuang, are you now wondering why, despite mastering the purest innate Life power, you were defeated by someone else?”","“Umm?” Jian Wushuang was caught off guard. He couldn’t possibly be asked to defend himself in front of so many people.","If he denied it, no one would believe him.","And he had indeed been pondering it just now.","If he admitted it, wouldn’t it mean he couldn’t bear the loss?","Danbao also felt that the old monk’s words were somewhat aggressive and quickly tugged at the old monk’s sleeve.","When the old monk looked at Danbao, his expression softened, and he reassured, “Young master, rest assured, he is your benefactor, just as he is mine. I naturally won’t make things difficult. It’s just that his doubts, if not resolved, will be detrimental to him.”","Jian Wushuang cleared his throat. Since the old monk had spoken like this, he could only","admit it.","It wasn’t embarrassing.","A gentleman is frank and open.","If you have something, you might as well say it.","“Elder, I do have some doubts. I know that Danbao possesses the natural power of All Things within him, which can also be transformed into Life force. But compared to me, there is obviously a big difference. You are the Guardian of Life force. Why did you choose Danbao?”","As those words were spoken, the others also soared into the air, eager to hear what was going","on.","Lord Hengmu couldn’t help but feel a bit embarrassed.","He hadn’t expected the old monk to become the Guardian of Danbao.","At the same time, a speculation arose in his mind. However, he didn’t want to acknowledge it.","As for Divine Wood King, it was fine.","As long as he wasn’t Jian Wushuang’s Guardian, there was still a possibility for him to enter","the Wanliu.","This turned out to be advantageous for him.","Moreover, he was curious why they didn’t choose the more outstanding Jian Wushuang but","opted for an obscure figure.","An ordinary Tribulation realm cultivator.","The fact that he could control innate Life force and transform it into Life energy was indeed","remarkable.","However, compared to Jian Wushuang’s innate Life force, it was still lacking.","The old monk, seeing that everyone was present, also spoke up.","“You’re thinking along the right lines. After all, in this world, it’s survival of the fittest. Only","the strong can dominate everything. However, this is just your perspective, not the ultimate","Law Rule!”","These words shook everyone.","The mindset of the strong!","The dominion of the strong! Wasn’t that the way it should be?","Under the ultimate Law Rule, didn’t the strong survive?","Seeing everyone’s puzzled expressions, the old monk spoke again, “I used to think just like you, seeing the weak as ants and the strong as the rulers of the world. But later, I encountered an extraordinary being who could manipulate the ultimate Law Rule. He is a true god, and it","was he who enlightened me, showing me the essence of the world.”","The essence!","Once again, everyone took a deep breath.","“The Tribulation of the ultimate Law Rule is clear to all, but who truly understands it? For the","weak and the strong, the Tribulation makes no difference. This is the fairness of the ultimate Law Rule. In the eyes of the ultimate Law Rule, there is no survival of the fittest. That whole concept is just an excuse for the wicked deeds of mortals!”","This time, everyone’s eyes widened in astonishment."]},{"number":5900,"title":"Chapter 5900: Weiss Appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 5900: Weiss Appears","The excuse of mortals.","The law of the jungle, it ceased to exist.","Indeed, it stunned them all.","“Jian Wushuang, ask yourself, having mastered the power of Life, have you done any good deeds?”","This question brought Jian Wushuang to his senses.","So that’s it!","He had mastered the power of Life, only thinking of making himself stronger, never caring about the lives of the weak.","In other words, his mastery of the power of Life was nothing but a waste.","Just because of his strength, he ultimately couldn’t catch the eye of the gods.","“I haven’t!” His mood suddenly became somewhat despondent, shaking his head slowly. The old monk’s expression changed slightly, saying calmly, “That’s right. I see no hope in you. In my divination, only Danbao remains. That’s why you lost. Your power of Life does not come from the grace of the gods, but from stolen strength. In short, you are not worthy of wielding the power of Life!”","“Yeah!” Jian Wushuang sighed inwardly.","He indeed was not worthy of wielding the power of Life.","When he first gained the power of Life, he would restrain himself from killing.","But later on, he found that he couldn’t change at all.","Moreover, he never saw the power of Life as the end; he still wanted to devour the power of Death of Mie Sheng.","To merge with the power of Reincarnation.","The old monk would be blind if he chosen him.","After some explanation, everyone understood.","Even Divine Wood King was dumbfounded.","His ideals collapsed instantly.","He wanted to become a god, only to find that he couldn’t even step over the threshold.","But it’s not too late to change now.","Divine Wood King still felt somewhat unwilling.","Lord Hengmu was fine; he hadn’t thought about these things. He just wanted to refine that treasure completely and become a Ninth Tribulation realm; that would be enough. God!","He never thought about that.","Jian Wushuang was the same.","He hadn’t thought about these things.","Although feeling somewhat despondent, being scolded by others.","But upon reflection, there was no reason to argue back.","Danbao also looked at Jian Wushuang blankly, always believing that Jian Wushuang was a good person.","The fact that Jian Wushuang and Wu Li saved him.","Even the Elder Blu entrusted him to Jian Wushuang before passing away.","Seeing Jian Wushuang being criticized, feeling a bit lost, he also stepped forward to comfort him.","“I’m fine, but congratulations to you. With such a senior protecting the way, the Great Elder in the spirit of heaven would be very happy if he knew. Don’t let the Great Elder down!” Jian Wushuang patted Danbao’s head and sincerely blessed.","They thought that things had come to this point, and they had heard the grand scheme from the gods.","But unexpectedly, a startling laughter diverted everyone’s attention upwards.","Under the shining sun, high above, there was a young man with strange attire and white hair standing tall, descending slowly.","There was no trace of aura on him.","If it weren’t for that laughter, no one would have noticed someone descending.","Currently, there were two peak-level experts of the Eighth Tribulation realm present.","Even if the Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulations realm came, they would notice.","Yet, they didn’t notice the person before them.","Under the sunlight, he landed in the center of the crowd.","Everyone was stunned.","Jian Wushuang was especially jaw-dropped.","The newcomer was none other than Weiss from the Nine Tribulations Tower.","Or perhaps from his Origin Source Universe.","“How did you come out?” Jian Wushuang widened his eyes, pointing at Weiss!","He originally thought Weiss could only exist within him.","He didn’t expect him to come out.","Upon seeing Jian Wushuang, Weiss covered his mouth and noticed the familiar laughter again.","The crowd was puzzled.","Only Jian Wushuang knew Weiss’s identity.","Elder Blu stared at Weiss’s attire and the absence of any aura on him, his face suddenly","changing.","This was similar to when he encountered a true god years ago, devoid of any aura.","Except, the person back then was a chubby fellow.","The person before him was tall, with a sturdy build, neither fat nor thin.","“Of course, I can come out. After all you’ve said so much, if I don’t come out, I’ll suffocate!”","Weiss said indifferently.","Jian Wushuang also realized upon seeing Weiss.","The other party was also a god.","If Weiss could take notice of him, then perhaps there was still hope for him.","He wasn’t just a mortal abandoned by the supreme Law Rules.","Weiss seemed to sense his thoughts, glanced at the crowd, then looked at Elder Blu unfriendly, saying, “The spiel you just gave, was it told to you by a blue fat guy?”","This sentence startled Elder Blu.","A blue fat guy.","That was a god.","“I did receive such information from a Senior. Do you know him?” Elder Blu couldn’t believe","it.","He actually encountered a god.","And it seemed like he knew the one who had advised him years ago.","Weiss nodded upon hearing this, then spoke, “That’s right, it should be the King of the Northern Spacetime. Only he would be so bored as to pay attention to mortals.”","“The North Realm King!”","What was that?","Jian Wushuang was equally puzzled.","Moreover, hearing about the Northern Spacetime, did that mean the Starry Sky around here","was divided into east, west, south, and north?","He had thought the River of Time was just one, with many tributaries.","It seemed what he saw wasn’t necessarily true.","At this moment, Weiss turned to Jian Wushuang, his tone serious, “Originally, I didn’t want to come out, but that old monk’s words are indeed too one-sided, misinterpreting our original","intentions. Now, I need to correct it!”","Finishing his words, he took out a very ancient book.","“Now, I represent... well, I represent some gods from your Northern Spacetime. Let me make it clear to you: the path to godhood is not singular. There are gods of Life, gods of Death, and gods of All Things. The positions of gods are limited, and there are many ways to succeed. Survival of the fittest may not work for the gods of Life, but for the gods of Death, it’s different. Of course, it’s not about slaughtering the righteous path; everything follows the Rule Law of cause and effect. Whether you believe in fate or not, the position of a god is there.","To succeed, you need a price and opportunities!”","Weiss directly said a lot, leaving everyone bewildered.","In short, he was refuting the old monk’s words.","Of course, some of what he said was right.","For example, the god of Life indeed requires great love.","This point couldn’t be refuted.","As Weiss said, there are gods of Life just as there are gods of Death.","So, the standards of gods are not singular.","This was the most beneficial thing Jian Wushuang heard for himself.","He felt happy in his heart.","At least the road ahead wasn’t completely blocked.","Up to now, he had only glimpsed a corner of this world.","The endless Starry Sky, the River of Time surrounding it.","And the mysterious gods that couldn’t be spoken of.","Him!","Where was he now on this journey?","And how far was it from what Teacher Xuan Yi spoke of as the future?","But along this journey, what he learned from Teacher Xuan Yi was called perseverance."]}]);
